      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0024": {
    "title": "齐本达尔_音乐厅 Chippendale",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "丹陶Nostalgic Rose系列最受欢迎的品种之一，几乎仅次于奥古斯塔·露易丝2005年推出，纪念英国洛可可/新古典主义家具设计师Thomas Chippendale个人觉得这是市面上该色系的顶级品种，所以再炒炒冷饭（在整理Dominique Massad近年用tea-noisette重新加强了耐热和抗病性的一系列品种，又是个大帖，今天就发点简单的）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_06432f55215d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "先把丑话说在前头：跟很多德系品种一样，这款是晚熟品种，第一年基本一季（尤其是牙签扦插苗的情况），而且第一第二年花都不怎么香，到植株成熟后，香气才会达到真正水平，花径也会达到10-12cm，也绝对不是一季花！！！这款不是藤！！！只是缺光就会徒长。没有全日照条件请绕道"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0bc8189cc58f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2f7eef6b6361.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8eb873aa2538.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9142d1059a51.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这些是我2019年的实拍说个我不太喜欢的点：这款的花瓣很厚很硬，所以实物花朵有种僵硬感，虽然照片上看不出来。不过正因为花瓣又厚又硬，这款花很耐雨耐晒，绝不是奥斯丁那种。"
      },
      {
        "t": "齐本达尔和怀旧乡愁、奥古斯塔露易丝一样，也是丹陶当切花卖的品种，所以花朵寿命绝对不用担心的（如果你感觉花散得特别快或者焦了请检查有没有保持土壤湿润或者根系有没有出问题）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4e9c52411d7c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款真的很流行，所以你会发现这楼里图大多都是高清的；而马萨德的一些品种别说高清图，能找到图就不错了丹陶给这款香气评级是4/52013年获新西兰月季竞赛最芳香月季奖香型是芒果+桃子我闻到的实物算是中等水果甜香（比朱丽叶那种强一档，比亚伯差一档），也有很多声音说不香，应该是植株还没成熟的原因"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a7b54da118f9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_64bdc2dde93c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a44666f9bc50.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花色受温度和环境影响较大，高温强光下会褪成并不难看的杏黄-杏粉色标准花花径10-12cm，花瓣100枚以上；夏花花径基本上打对折，花型维持不变花朵打开很慢，观赏期相当长"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_07e0a8d04589.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "枝叶茂密青翠，非常漂亮"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6fa355f5a88f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ff8517db2291.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花叶搭配效果很和谐抗病方面丹陶给的抗黑斑和抗白粉都是3/4，在通风和光照充足环境基本不用打药，种植反馈提及都是说不生病（这里我想提一下，丹陶的抗病评级大体是很靠谱的；有人说奥古斯塔露易丝黑斑严重，很可能是因为买的扦插苗，而奥古斯塔这个品种自生根不适应土质导致了缺素，而且很有可能是缺钙——建议出现这种情况测试下基质的PH，是酸性的话施用熟石灰/草木灰看看情况是否会改善）有时会开出茶花的感觉"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f1167a332d99.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "分枝性好，植株可以控制在70-100cm，相当适合盆栽"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_50744ffdbf81.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "齐本达尔的株型可塑性相当强，取决于修剪方式：冬天剪到30-40cm的话得到的就是这样的低矮灌丛效果"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b4a8b0974393.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b24c8ed4937f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_88c55fb6e352.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_59179a35f378.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "或者留向上的强枝长度，回剪侧向的枝条，打造这样的150cm左右花柱效果"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_53f6969d1d97.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a0a12537e1ca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "或者干脆不剪，几年内可以长成这样花量爆炸的180cm左右自然灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8f5d73375e35.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_11aed9ae50cb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这里再提醒一句，对于本世纪推出的大部分品种来说，修剪只是塑形手段而已，不要把它想的有多神奇，好像自己没养好剪一剪就能解决问题似的；尤其不要重剪！！！！！！！重剪这个行为早就应该被淘汰了，对现在的品种而言影响寿命长势花量，有百弊无一利。"
      },
      {
        "t": "作为树月效果也很不错"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8fcfd2d0a69b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ca8c2ecc7f6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_279fb70fb615.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶的这个系列真的精品，株型控制上比科尔德斯和梅昂绝大部分品种好太多了，和奥古斯塔、怀旧乡愁一样，齐本达尔的株型效果规矩又不僵硬，各种风格的庭院和园林都可以适应"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3292e069b8eb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_44a62f4f5c78.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2c48b716a250.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e9c1a0c8d8c8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "近距离欣赏下这多变的花色和结实的花瓣"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e52fe74ac50a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_61260f6a25f8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_030089e5c821.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cec79048ced4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_452a6fd1488d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "适合气候区5b-9b，黄淮到江南可以放心种（不要问我9b以外能不能种，因为我不知道）总结：非常全能的一款精品优点：抗病、花朵持久/耐晒/耐雨、强香、大花、花色丰富多变、株型好、叶片漂亮、长势强健、应用范围广泛缺点：晚熟注意：不耐阴"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e6470156f49e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_72eb48e456a1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd35b6f7f3b2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_10b1364b80c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_806cb3a2c997.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_13acc41a0b33.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "托马斯·齐本达尔的一些设计作品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_33c277fbbcbf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6ecb9eda40ba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9ee2046ef3f4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c73085eb6ec9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1e1c35e7a611.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴尔巴德2020日本特供新品之Pavlova强香1.8*1.2m8cm花径貌似不是非常抗病"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_05c9df918c35.jpg"
