      {
        "t": "还以为是国内马马'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "老马的审美一直非常给力，就是他喜欢用奥奥，香气一直有挥之不去的没药还有一个常见问题是开花性，有些品种好到爆，有些又极其拉胯，非全日照环境一定要慎之又慎。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0050": {
    "title": "Élodie Gossuin 艾洛迪·戈苏安",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "多米尼克·马萨德的这款作品致敬了2001年“法国小姐”同名选美冠军，由吉洛于2008年推出。正如选美大赛会综合考虑脸蛋、身材和涵养，艾洛迪·戈苏安是一款花朵、植株气质和长势抗性都上乘的佳作。然而，因为吉洛家的尚塔尔·梅里厄珠玉在前，艾洛迪·戈苏安一直没有太流行，连高清图都很难找，所以特别感谢@Narizen @耳东1986的海角 @鲨鱼辣椒👹👹👹 友情提供图片'>>>>"
      },
      {
        "t": "@是柠檬呗▫▫ ：株型"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_489065ebca3b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1461ce2376da.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fda7e6906be8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "艾洛迪戈苏安说白了就一个明显缺陷——不耐阴它需要完全的露天无遮挡环境才能保证株型不走形她的花朵平均花径8cm，半开时有优雅的小波浪边，打开后宛如轻盈的芭蕾舞裙，仔细看花瓣的质感，是和园艺王子一样的丝绢质地'>，色彩有微妙的渐变，仿佛泛着银光，每个细节都精致动人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8a021ebbdc0b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_37162e26106b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_07ef70e9f5cc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55cbb28099ea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd4c8032e956.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "小型花序开花纤长而又直挺的花梗，宛如美人天鹅一般的颈项花朵缓缓打开，散发出茶月季、茉莉、香草、柑橘、桃子、柠檬混合的复杂花果香气"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d3a2caea92a2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6f24eac7d471.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fd3cfcfb7aec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3fb6ea241afb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵持久耐开，瓶插时间也有5-6天"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_82daf133c61a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d2bf3d1beaca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_060933eed878.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "保证全日照，她的株型就是80-100cm*60cm的优美自然式灌丛，效果不亚于任何奥斯丁品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d59b47498af6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f2261d10cc7b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_60763d9cbc2a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2b0b79b08029.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "抗性、长势、耐热、耐雨、开花性根据各方面的反馈都很不错平时即便偶尔黑斑或者白粉也没什么大碍，但是完全不打药可能扛不过长期高温高湿的天气牙签苗可能第一年营养生长为主，介意的慎入"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6be930aed0d7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_139da2afede2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6531fdcefef4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b868437aa8f7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9125157ff018.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e939fe1001e4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_193e7e52e545.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "有全日照条件的话，我觉得这款属于粉色系中非常值得入手的品种，株型不大，作为盆栽欣赏或者庭院应用效果都很棒，更可以作为家用切花。就算是纯论颜值，我觉得这款都是中粉色系里前五的品种'>吉洛/马萨德的品种真的很合我品味，尚塔尔梅里厄、艾洛迪戈苏安、安索菲比克我都觉得花美的不得了，他家品种的花有种法国其他两家没有的精巧感，难怪日本人会特别喜欢>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_88870edd0523.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_374490e61261.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03af210a9793.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bd93f3d8104c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_38a63381034d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd872380db3f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "马萨德的全日照吃亏"
      },
      {
        "t": "|･ω･｀)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fd5195dca041.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "'>'>'>喜欢这样的"
      },
      {
        "t": "哪家有卖？"
      },
      {
        "t": "诶呀，这个真宙同款歪曲叶，估计亲本之一是遗产亲本应该是遗产×某个怒赛特系杂交后代"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5cc77d692707.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "埃洛迪戈苏安 @耳东1986的海角 的原帖"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款的资料真的不多，春天的时候我在一个论坛上看到一个园艺人提到这个名字还特意去搜了下，一看球形花我的菜呀，可图真的寥寥无几。"
      },
      {
        "t": "感觉这特别适合华北地区，阳光好。德国很可能都搞不定。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1490d14e0dff.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也不八一下本人，这位美女不但漂亮，最牛的是生了两次龙凤胎！"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6b52d1cef01f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "@耳东1986的海角 的艾洛迪株型图高清版"
      },
      {
        "t": "入手'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "俺有，座标渐江靠上海，会轻微白粉黑斑，不会光杆！死不了！"
      },
      {
        "t": "法国小姐会黑斑……坐标安徽。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0189c03389f7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "正儿八经是这个颜色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_93a2be5f68fc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d4cebbd7dd7.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0051": {
    "title": "Xavier de Fraissinette",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5a9c95dc7515.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "多米尼克·马萨德作品，由吉洛公司2009年致敬法国珠宝设计师Xavier de Fraissinette之名推出"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_84aeece71d74.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本尊的一些作品："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ed68ee8d8de9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_75f786527eea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c7e5038f90d3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "RB给出了很不错的评价：点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "光照充足条件下株型仅80*80cm，小巧可爱，很适合盆栽"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵耐雨淋，而且无论在枝头还是瓶插都非常持久，国内实测凉爽天气下一朵花可以在枝头开20天"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e211e7947674.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_402d0d246501.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_76c83ffdb8d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "挺精巧的花"
      },
      {
        "t": "精致的8cm中型花朵外层白色，花心颜色随气温和种植环境不同在橙红、杏粉到杏黄之间变化强烈的没药调甜香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c2f59d5d2ca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c60b2ad49be7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_47b79a1592cb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4cc0d802f211.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4a7a9b6698f4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_028404eb05fa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d31be6cb453e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cbd6756e5fb8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5021f61a6249.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9ff5e98562e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵成大花序开放花量和复花性都很出色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4e0846a2a566.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8eb74e726c29.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_63cc6d42e164.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4678b247c9f9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bdd9e03e4d36.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eb9ec5ccc2c9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4de187509640.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_131b60b0838a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6e2767deba3c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "马萨德的作品真的颜值一流'>相比梅昂与戴尔巴德还有科尔德斯，我还是喜欢他的作品（没有踩一捧一的意思）"
      },
      {
        "t": "我有牵绊了"
      },
      {
        "t": "其实是因为青莲居的小苗一直断货所以没有'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "植株长势健壮，抗病官方和RB都给的优秀，但是有些照片可以看到叶片轻微感染黑斑"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_785a98e54971.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8d37c62d3a21.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ff595eadf262.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3186b4bb46d5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ea27cfa3b241.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c1e7dfaea205.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2a196e293011.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "需注意：- 要求全日照，和马萨德很多品种一样，缺光会徒长到2m左右- 植株耐热，开花性不受高温影响，但是高温下花会开成小菊花- 甜没药香气不是人人都能接受"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_950836f3feba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "另外，嫌弃保罗博古斯个子太大的可以选这款，这款像是一个香气更强、抗黑斑提升的小巧版保罗博古斯'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "真的好美，马萨德的月季真是别致的精美。ddd老师，太爱看你的帖子了，对我而言是打开了新世界的大门！"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个很牵绊，我去年秋入的牵绊小苗，开春之前比较僵，目前长笋长脚芽了，花期真的很长。"
      },
      {
        "t": "所以它叫什么名字呀'>琥珀？"
      },
      {
        "t": "虹越的资料都不校对的吗？两张图株型大小完全两回事？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_988b336d7d8b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4721458a13de.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "除了夏天的小菊花有点让人绝望以外真的很满意，当然如果你种过真宙就不会觉得他菊花了，因为他俩夏花的菊程度差不多'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "我选择了牵绊"
      },
      {
        "t": "有牵绊了 不过还是有一丢丢想买'> 马萨德做这个色系太诱人了"
      },
      {
        "t": "喜欢，不买"
      },
      {
        "t": "这花这么可爱"
      },
      {
        "t": "早上七点到下午三点有太阳能养不？怕徒马萨德的很少买"
      },
      {
        "t": "喜欢，不买，种不下了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f92c9ea9ce7e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e378ce4e1900.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0052": {
    "title": "Notre Dame du Rosaire 玫瑰经圣母",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "有人说看到这款的花，加上它散发的可口香味，就忍不住想一口吃了它>>>"
      },
      {
        "t": "吉洛的Generosa系列，2009年法国推出。多米尼克马萨德热烈的变色和撞色风格在玫瑰经圣母身上发挥到了极致："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_37fe9504e5f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d3a6e24d81e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_baea1f85e7f3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_59b323ffa917.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2299b5e43be5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": ">官网把这款的颜色描述为\"系列中不寻常的\"——花瓣背面粉白色带金花心橙红色带金花瓣正面外缘橙粉色或玫粉色"
      },
      {
        "t": "玫瑰经圣母花型忠于Generosa系列的复古风，但是得益于它的现代基因，能以花序的形式，大量开出芬芳的花朵；特别提及的一点是玫瑰经圣母的花朵，无论在植株上还是瓶插，都非常持久，很适合作为复古风情的切花使用"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73b32e46cc0c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f6d84c6080f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dff48af0ab7c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1ffdd11678b6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7867492b254a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款可以对标丹陶的名作齐本达尔/音乐厅，花色、花香、花量、花朵寿命任何一方面都不输，相比较齐本达尔严肃正经的标准法国蔷薇式花朵，玫瑰经圣母的不规则翻卷的花瓣散发着随性烂漫的法式风情花径8-12cm，中等到强烈的丁香+柑橘香气成株大小80-120cm*70cm叶片半哑光，冬季不太冷的地区可以保持常绿，终年不落叶要求全日照"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d52cbb7fb5f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_53c3e66327af.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c25a2e117a88.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "全日照下疏朗有致的优美庭院花树效果："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d574d0ecf2c2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_07b7ecba8d0d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bd0213835b84.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "RB上的评论：\"其他品种春天都感染了白粉病，但它没有。香味出色。花朵打开过程中会不断变色。花朵很持久。全日照种植环境。\"\"不停地开花，种在全日照环境。\"\"颜色，花型，香气都不寻常。明亮、复杂、难以理解、富有魅力。第一朵花就征服了我。在半阴环境也表现很好。每一朵花都是一个惊喜！5分\"\"出色的品种！！令我愉悦的香气，闻起来像丁香和柑橘。生长迅速。\"\"种下第一年，惊喜！强水果香。不生病。枝干强健，叶片闪亮，优雅。\"\"第二年。灌丛株型非常和谐。\"\"奢华的10-12cm大花，大波浪花型类似奥古斯塔露易丝，每个花序有5-7朵花。灌丛分枝性好，第二年就长到大概1m高。花朵不会焦。香气浓郁，水果调。\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a1e7762bf413.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9ce5b4e74d96.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_274cb40b7cde.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bdaa0deff4dc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a8fa3be361ee.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_37a920ac5858.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "官方描述这款非常健康，Rosebook的抗白粉也给了3/3，但是从这个花色也可以看出来，作为异味蔷薇的后裔，在比较恶劣的环境下不打药会明显黑斑"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f734555370cd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_99bac0916fc5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_17416c45a117.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_74362aa230bd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b514a2651343.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "最后还是那句话：追求耐热耐开的庭院品种，不妨多尝试吉洛/马萨德的品种。目前为止反馈还没有在耐开耐热方面翻车的，而且全日照下株型普遍很好"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1ddf1674be23.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_44ee5a40e92e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6a3b420f8115.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其次就是梅昂和戴尔巴德，不过这两家有部分品种用了奥斯丁系做亲本（比如波莱罗，娜爱玛）所以这方面可能欠一点一般来说，正儿八经的HT*HT后代都是可以扛高温强光的，一般平均水准就是二十几度时一周，高温时3天。这次梅昂的新品丽滨也顺利通过了五月初的高温考验，入手的应该都有体会如果用了奥斯丁亲本，那结果可能取决于当时筛选的标准，比如都是HT*HT*格拉汗托马斯的三姐妹里，目前的反馈莉娜雷诺和梅昂小姐就很耐热耐开，夏琳有人说一般。"
      },
      {
        "t": "姐妹品种：劳朗·卡布罗尔https://tieba.baidu.com/p/7085371676光之所https://tieba.baidu.com/p/7044480956齐本达尔/音乐厅https://tieba.baidu.com/p/7061145997"
      },
      {
        "t": "@gongyp1978小苗初花，确实很吸睛，一堆花中一眼就能看到他，第三张凑近了拍不知怎么偏红了一点"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_381ff018a9ef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_12dc745b6be7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_76aa05159da9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4537690dccd9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "@淡淡C"
      },
      {
        "t": "去年买的玫瑰圣母经，今年开得还不错，株型紧凑，暴晒一天后有点焦"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_291c01882be8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_235ca9c18aba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e1d5a3ae5679.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_34fed0e3c7b8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_746408e0c39d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "滁州小顽童发几张艾米丽图片"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_39e973f13e97.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bd7426ed5377.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bf9b758dc7f9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_14e202b8c52c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "姐妹品种Emilien Guillot 艾米利恩·吉洛"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e318a03e9145.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "马萨德的对国内除了需要全日照的问题还有什么？到底为什么没有一个不火的"
      },
      {
        "t": "太塑料了"
      },
      {
        "t": "入手了，等开花，跟着3d不会错！！！"
      },
      {
        "t": "鲑鱼粉很美的说"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款超级美。马萨德家的颜色真绝！"
      },
      {
        "t": "吉洛有没有月季园啊…"
      },
      {
        "t": "路过再顶一顶，这货僵苗了"
      },
      {
        "t": "小苗也开多头 很强劲的样子 可惜不香 花持久"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5bfbb0cb71df.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_885aaf839fc3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "小童工在帮忙浇水 他旁边那颗就是玫瑰圣母经"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8add1771bc51.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "接受不了这种类型的花看起来不舒服，我家也有个类似的老品种看起来总是觉得难看无奈家人们喜欢"
      },
      {
        "t": "我种了看明年春天表现"
      },
      {
        "t": "抗病、生长旺盛，我对她有信心了'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "我的这颗强笋1米多了，还是没开花"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0053": {
    "title": "Madame Paule Massad 宝拉·马萨德夫人",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "多米尼克·马萨德献给自己母亲宝拉·马萨德（吉洛家第一代育种人Pierre Guillot孙女）的品种多米尼克·马萨德本人推荐\"适合炎热气候\"的品种吉洛官网极少数标着\"适合半阴\"的品种>>"
      },
      {
        "t": "亲本Tea-Noisette品种Madame Bérard 贝拉尔夫人 * 奥斯丁系格拉汗托马斯母本贝拉尔夫人的身世非常显赫：Madame Falcot * 第戎荣耀Madame Falcot是茶月季始祖Safrano的籽播选育后代，大名鼎鼎的第戎荣耀双亲则是更大名鼎鼎的黄铜芙蓉和忆马美逊算下来，贝拉尔夫人的血统十分单纯："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_844c973f6f43.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "非常重的淡黄香水血统，其次麝香蔷薇血统，耐炎热是必然的，而且这种血统比较纯的都比一般的现代品种抗病能查到的资料显示多米尼克马萨德用贝拉尔夫人得到了两款作品，一款是与科尔德斯的洋红色F系品种Magenta得到的灰色品种Griselis/Quai des Brumes 阴郁百合/雾码头，另一款就是宝拉马萨德夫人阴郁百合/雾码头"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5e75144e793d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "市面上流通的茶月季Adam 亚当很可能其实就是贝拉尔夫人贝拉尔夫人的实际种植评价非常高，长势强健，复花快，大花，花色变化丰富，几乎无刺，抗病性好，还可育，在美国南部和澳大利亚的湿热气候下表现都非常好"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_71cffb0c9a06.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_722fcb390136.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_91f90219283a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5254bfd87312.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "贝拉尔夫人花朵还有强烈的茶香花色的变化细腻动人松散的花型是典型的茶月季风情"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d19d5928ec80.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "成熟植株250-300cm*150-250cm，可以作为藤本应用："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_52f2de5cc41a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也可以养成直立的大型灌木花树：无论哪种培养方式，花量都很盛大壮观"
      },
      {
        "t": "宝拉马萨德夫人的父本格拉汗托马斯不需要再多说了吧：马萨德估计是看中格拉汗托马斯身上的法国蔷薇血统，想利用它使贝拉尔夫人的花型更符合当下主流审美一些，果然在后代宝拉马萨德夫人上做到了：宝拉马萨德夫人的标准花花瓣不再是茶月季式的反卷，花心也不再是茶月季式的螺旋心，而是变为欧洲蔷薇典型的内扣花瓣和纽扣联心然而，她又继承了母本贝拉尔夫人的10cm大花和强香，不过香型变为苹果+葡萄柚果香按照吉洛官网说法，这款会飘香："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d6588d0448de.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9e88078d908c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_84a3fd02b668.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c80b06b4ec0f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2ac9116a7dd2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "小花序开花，继承了双亲的优秀花量继承了母本的优秀复花性和优美的颜色渐变"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d61e2c4a48d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6eac74e843e7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9a453118e6c2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "同时极好地继承了老式茶月季的弱柳扶风的气质'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_faa27ba4c621.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_27f0d6fd08a9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8ef583cdabcc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6c5a3546595d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de48792d2c3f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "比较难得的是，这款耐半阴。吉洛官网标注的适合种植环境就是\"半阴\"，都没标注\"全日照\"，可见确实比较耐阴，而且过强的日照可能会损害花色而多米尼克马萨德本人评价这款原话：It's a very good rose for hot climate. ——非常适合炎热气候的品种成熟植株150cm*120cm 大型灌木，长势好，分枝多，株型很丰满"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_17eeb77833e3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0be18e5ac748.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_267cf6d35f0b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f8a30cfbcb54.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_065145ea92ee.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "至于抗病性，本身亲本托马斯的抗病就还可以，贝拉尔夫人的抗病很不错实际种植反馈说宝拉马萨德夫人在其他品种白粉黑斑锈病齐发的时候都不怎么生病，但是搜图也可以搜到她明显感染白粉或者黑斑的图，综合起来，对宝拉马萨德夫人的抗病评价大概是\"还不错\"，不打药也许会生病（取决于种植环境），但不会太严重就能看到的资料而言，宝拉马萨德夫人是一款不可多得的耐热+耐阴+复花勤快+古典大花+浓香+抗病过得去的品种其实有没有发现，这款1997年就推出的品种和奥斯丁的新品艾米丽勃朗特&福爱撞脸，甚至和科尔德斯的托比亚之花撞脸，但这几款的血系应该不太一样， 也许这款对于炎热地区而言是更好的选择"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9b107b541c1a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d79441e21ccf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9d7520e12cf2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_914b10984421.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8c19b6a792c9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c4a391a62ff6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "高温下宝拉·玛萨德夫人的花会变这样："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_859bbe1eaf9f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5a1e4cd884b7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也不失观赏性'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "最后一张很乖巧的株型照'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a9566988ad92.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "哪里有卖"
      },
      {
        "t": "夏琳也是格拉汗托马斯的后代，也是惊人的大花多头"
      },
      {
        "t": "托马斯可以考虑用什么取代。"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个必须要入手一棵，我的糖"
      },
      {
        "t": "南方有地花友福音"
      },
      {
        "t": "@Echoce"
      },
      {
        "t": "好好看啊"
      },
      {
        "t": "茶月季诶～"
      },
      {
        "t": "贝拉尔夫人耐半阴不 好漂亮"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个亚当？怎么是粉色 灌木"
      },
      {
        "t": "带夫人俩字的没有丑货，这是为什么"
      },
      {
        "t": "没有卖，太伤心了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_75a551bfa2e1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2021了 还是没有卖啊！！"
      },
      {
        "t": "太惨了，还是没得卖"
      },
      {
        "t": "入手'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "都2022年了，还没有卖"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0054": {
    "title": "Ladurée 拉杜丽",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03f47b1c7d4b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "在吉洛家预定了这款'>通常我选品种都会很理性地看各地的评价，但是，虽然这款在俄罗斯和日本都有不少负评（当然也有不少好评），还是经不住这样锦缎一样华丽的花瓣质感、大胆的橙红和红莓色撞色、以及吉洛家数一数二的香气这几点的诱惑'> 有时候还是要跟着自己感觉走"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0464bf85d4ed.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1448aa4c15c1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3db7de80b651.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "名字拉杜丽 Ladurée 来自法国老牌精品甜品品牌，它家的马卡龙尤其出名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aadeb05b0e8f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_74dc4edc4dc5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_df37b4aa1376.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0da997e27351.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c47dcad6a757.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_172b4fa76b07.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ba4e4d6c7369.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd24c68aa9f3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "作为色彩大师多米尼克·马萨德的作品，有着一系列他的典型风格（杂交麝香的花序、自然开张的株型、丰盛的花量）官方株高1m，株型半球型灌丛，从俄罗斯的照片来看确实是这个效果："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e49a671a5975.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cda910420d4a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_224726c3d6dc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_32d11fab9ac6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_898ddc3fcdec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "要求严格全日照，不然就会变成下面这位日本网友家这样："
      },
      {
        "t": "缺光徒长会严重影响开花性官方给出的复花是\"非常勤\"，但是日本那边就给了个\"返咲\"（2/5），和日照不足脱不开关系"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f23a5792ddeb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7a7e8620f276.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d5ce82365d15.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a83fab335f79.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3773b504e0fe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "太华丽了'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "官方 花径8cm 香气 3/3 满分不管它其他方面有多么褒贬不一，大家对它的香气是一致好评：切开的葡萄柚+树莓+香草，就像精致甜品的味道"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_869b5b5bc343.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7780b6229805.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9ece96edbd9e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d6c868b6c775.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dc697f24af0d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b13c0ea1709b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de926739a0cf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f75257b59c36.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6af312d29c94.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这种艳而不妖的配色也很少见'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2a77b5453054.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8a92500e262c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fe13d0760707.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_736368791664.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我会把它种在一年2800日照的全日照环境碱性土里看看表现如何"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f1a7f4f7d827.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01eb5a03e17c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_44ef2d8ffacf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cfc9dbc407f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b8b5f06e4dc9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c99369604dc1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0a45f9e1420c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "春天买了一堆马萨德就没买它"
      },
      {
        "t": "大多数花友没戏，全日照"
      },
      {
        "t": "颜色挺好的，光杆了"
      },
      {
        "t": "花型花色戳不中我的点"
      },
      {
        "t": "全日照不大可能"
      },
      {
        "t": "我这就去买'>'>'>这堆图才有购买欲望"
      },
      {
        "t": "像不像玫昂小姐？"
      },
      {
        "t": "同样很喜欢这款的色彩变化，马萨德的品种我就留了这个，还有夏奈尔，后者的香气是我种过的马萨德品种里最好的"
      },
      {
        "t": "感觉很飘逸'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "吉洛家的色彩确实是一流的'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "极度懒花，和美少女是一档"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个的香气确实非常好，颜色也漂亮，让人一看就心情好的那种。"
      }
    ]
  },
