  "rose_0067": {
    "title": "科普下吉洛复古系列Generosa中由吉洛本家育成的品种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_09e0a9ba69a9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其实很简单，你上他们网站找到Dénomination variétale（品种注册名）那一项，GUI打头的就是吉洛育成的，MAS打头的就是马萨德育成的，JAC打头的就是美国Jackson & Perkins公司育成的"
      },
      {
        "t": "尚塔尔·托马斯/玉玲珑 GUIchatho"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3d41948095ed.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f2b670af6dee.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a1f219e6cf1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Salma Es-Said GUIsaless这是个强香中型藤本"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eaece7dbc99d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Chantal Baudron GUIchabau超强香灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_45f92d53f8a9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c7453bf7de48.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "难得第一排'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "Ingrid Bétancourt GUI1004淡香，灌木，不过耐半阴"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_999a3ba3eb30.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eca03fec00e7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花园之友 GUIlladjar淡香，灌木，10cm大花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_13b2ac3b4f4b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d8f63eefc664.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eb1b071fadd5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "安-索菲·比克 GUIgro1"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_41fd853754aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_06386cde5be8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Charlotte de Turckheim GUI1610强香灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4ffa2d0258d4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c84f91e71826.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Michel Jonasz GUI2509淡香灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd1b3dbb50c2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9c0baa7b18b1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d910c3343289.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Antoine de Caunes GUIande中香，灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_476d5fb1a849.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_981a54846efa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_51eae945a74b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_87e9b1a81b0c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_453c068d47d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "La Roche-Guyon GUIlarog淡香灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f6496295e463.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "感觉很多脸看起来都有种古典华丽HP的感觉'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "吉洛本家的似乎耐阴品种更多"
      },
      {
        "t": "Valérie de Montgolfier淡香灌木其实这个我觉得不应该归在Generosa系列"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6ca4ae982c4b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cb7b675c47da.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Lorenzo Weisman GUIlorwei淡香灌木"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c1ad2d022364.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "可以看到，吉洛本家人也不是完全吃白饭靠着马萨德的，虽然这些品种在国内除了玉玲珑和比克外基本nbcs，有的在法国都停产了"
      },
      {
        "t": "两者的风格其实也有区别，吉洛的风格总体更保守复古，他采访中说过，育种思路就是现代月季x古老月季，从成品来看，大概就是HT x 他家那些历史HP，至于玉玲珑，很可能是HT x P系，别忘了吉洛家不但是HT开创者和众多Tea和HP育成者，也是Polyantha系列的开创者"
      },
      {
        "t": "吉洛不是就吉洛一号'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "期待回春。hp我喜欢。"
      },
      {
        "t": "荷兰那家网站有这些品种吗？"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0068": {
    "title": "粉香映叶花羞日——Sonia Rykiel 索尼娅·里基尔",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "不是奥斯丁系，胜似奥斯丁系的名门之后"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5e5c8ef11204.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_60de8a29a548.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eaacf0cee829.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "多米尼克马萨德育成，致敬法国著名时尚设计师索尼娅里基尔1995年作为Guillot的Generosa系列奠基种之一推出母本：亚伯拉罕达比父本：格拉汗托马斯这两个亲本的素质摆在那，后代选育出来的品种上限绝不会差，大卫奥斯丁本人也绝对尝试过这个组合，却没得到一个成功的品种；反倒是马萨德捷足先登，所以育种真要有一点幸运眷顾啊索尼娅里基尔是一个比较有个性的品种，令不少人又爱又恨；我看到好些人说自己手里几十甚至上百种月季里最爱的就是她——确实，能把亚伯和托马斯的大部分优点继承到一身，做到这点就够吸引人了。吉洛官方宣传照是这样的："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aef0df973d27.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "很符合他们那边只喜欢打开状态的审美其实这款的花型就是亚伯和托马斯的中和，比较变化多端，但典型情况是这样的：最初的包子形态很像亚伯"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a43ddde65d08.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6bbe48acf9c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1f30a371c1a8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8ed4d70fe82a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但受托马斯那边的基因影响，打开后容易出现五分花型："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_af7f8330d0ad.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bf5117eba48a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_68b3bcd9548d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "单花花径10cm左右，也是亚伯和托马斯的中间值"
      },
      {
        "t": "索尼娅里基尔最吸引人的特点应该是她的芳香，不但非常浓烈，而且香型被实际种植者形容为\"精致得如同昂贵的高级香水\"、\"令人沉醉无法自拔\"具体香调是茶月季混合树莓、香蕉、梨、蜂蜜香气这个倒也不意外，亚伯的后代经常具有浓香，托马斯虽然本身香气不出众，但后代中出现极香品种的概率很大"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_22ad27d92f65.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cac16931896a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_21787b12af66.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2165cb86f098.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3a68e3b0f991.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f49030e59bb2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_35fae1f283d1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "（同样继承了亚伯的微妙色彩变化，实际应该比照片还动人）"
      },
      {
        "t": "索尼娅里基尔在全日照下表现为约1.5m*1.5m的灌丛，株型圆润丰满又不失飘逸："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d992ff94fc38.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "当然，跟她的两个亲本一样，在温暖地区或者半阴条件下很容易长到3m左右作为藤本应用："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_66ce6e206b90.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8dad072c05ef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其实这种略微徒长造成的的纤细飘逸感也非常美丽，这款在日本很流行，照片基本都是作为藤本应用，花墙、廊架、花柱都可以胜任"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8b75aedcfbac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3a28673d115e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ded90d3405b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_04effdfdcd27.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "开花花序像父本托马斯，一个花序可以很多花："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bd5ee6aeaad2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_43788b05f6bf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_53a91077cb01.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_84e5a1a3da14.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "而开花习性类似母本亚伯，不是春季一次性爆发式开一大波后零星复花，而是生长季始终有花不断开放，但绝对数量没那么多下面几张是俄罗斯网友作为灌木培养的索尼娅里基尔，可以看到花量和整体效果也非常不错"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6b13d8dc10b0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "刚刚忘了说，索尼娅里基尔的叶子都是香的"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bc6e3b63ffda.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b6d1b8eea208.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款并不畏惧高温，即便在35度左右仍然正常生长开花，几乎能不间断地提供芬芳美丽的切花（这里有几张很像康斯坦茨，不是吗）至于花朵能维持多久，我翻了HMF、Rosebook和houzz的很多评论，没有人提这款的花很持久，也没有人提很不持久，有个人说经常剪下来瓶插，那么瓶插时间也不会太短；姑且就认为是亚伯和托马斯的平均值，春秋4-5天好了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1842e9237b45.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8de1b10deb1e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8657f0189ec2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "为何说这是一款令人又爱又恨的品种呢？上面贴了RB的评论区，太多了所以不一一翻译，总体还是赞誉的占绝大多数，称赞的点有：- 香气：\"超赞，非常强\"\"精巧、令人忘记呼吸的芳香，像昂贵的香水\"\"优美的芳香\"\"神奇的浓香\"- 花朵：\"每朵花都是最精致的礼物\"\"花型优美\"\"天堂一般的美貌\"- 株型：\"和谐的灌丛\"批评的点主要是花朵会垂头，茎干支撑不住花朵而伏地，成为一个巨大的八爪鱼（如下）："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_40181dad23b6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但相关评论也提到，到第三第四年，随着植株成熟，花朵垂头和枝干伏地现象都会大大减轻（这点和马萨德许多品种一样）。那么在此之前的解决办法呢？1. 把四散的枝条捆起来，使总体直立2. 直接上支撑，当藤本培养RB和HMF的评论都提到这款不怎么生病，但是houzz有个评论说容易黑斑——也正常，毕竟两个亲本抗病都不咋的，这款也不会特别抗病。另一个评论提到了解决的方法：索尼娅里基尔需要控制氮肥、增加钾肥和钙肥的使用，并且保持水分充足，这样就不容易得黑斑，而且垂头、倒伏的现象也会大大减轻另外一个评论提到他的索尼娅在PH=8的碱性土里颜色很淡（下图）把ph调回中性以后花色就正常了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_04d1f7546113.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "所以，这款栽培上还是要花点功夫，特别是打算当作灌木养的话。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55a2c5b7d434.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3f46e173838a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3eb6f23ee6c4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b25bbe37a708.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款也是目前Generosa系列里流行度较高的一款，在美国、俄罗斯、日本都有不少人种，品质上不会有太大问题；算不上完美的品种，不过瑕不掩瑜，很有特点——能被人称为\"上百个品种里的最爱\"，不可能是四平八稳的品种。吉洛官方仍旧标的需要全日照，应该是对于保持灌木株型而言；我觉得如果就打算按藤本培养的话，4-6小时直射光的半阴环境应该可以，毕竟两个亲本都比较耐阴，所以这款也列入年末绿化带备选我个人很喜欢这款，否则也不会贴这么多图。毕竟这个花型花色+浓香+不错的开花性实在很吸引人，抗病什么的应该也都还过得去。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6016e2d97d11.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_91b11b081cda.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_90604ee7cb2f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f778a26506e4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f2f069209b2b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_204b67a6c1ac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b698220c5505.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "介绍这么多品种也是为了让新入坑的人多些选择白色系不是只有婚礼之路和珍妮莫罗粉色包子花藤本也不只有自由精神毕竟当年我也是被坑害过的，入了一堆鸡肋品种（比如自由精神和真宙）和弱鸡日月，现在弱鸡死得差不多了，鸡肋还顽强地留着，又狠不下心拔了换更心仪的品种，很恼火"
      },
      {
        "t": "阿弥陀佛"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0069": {
    "title": "耐热天后——安-索菲·碧克 Anne-Sophie Pic",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "感谢@超级奶爸8805 的安利，让我知道了这么一款超级耐热的优秀品种。其实早就想推这款，无奈一直找不到足够的高清图来展现她真正的美，直到现在总算找足了具体的测评（浙江炎夏的表现）可以移步超级奶爸的介绍贴，里面也有大量的美图，本帖就算一个综合的总结和介绍。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a658b9c9d0ed.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f9164b92e86b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "安-索菲·碧克是法国唯一的米其林三星级女大厨，吉洛公司为致敬她，在2013年将一款新品以她的名字命名，这就是安-索菲·碧克："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_abc386e89570.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "她也属于吉洛的复古月季Generosa系列。那么我当时开这个系列介绍贴的时候为什么都没提到这么品种呢？还有因为吉洛家的宣传照总是能成功避开品种的卖点。他家官方宣传照是这样的："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fd497e18290c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b2803e689f66.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9d93ada29cd1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "说\"平平无奇\"已经算是好听的了。而这款实际可以开成这样："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_437b163b3d3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这样富丽雍容的花型、细腻的颜色渐变、优雅的波浪边还有美人尖，官方宣传图居然可以全部照没了"
      },
      {
        "t": "本种最大的优点就是耐热。吧友实际种植总结的品种特点：矮壮，丰花，夏季暴晒不休眠，花耐热，不摊微卷，颜色多变，粉色为主，花朵有淡金色条纹（斑），香味跟瑞典网红几乎一样。浙江八月份酷暑下优美的花型能维持一周以上。呆湾和俄罗斯的实际种植者都确认这款的花型、花朵大小、花瓣数几乎不受夏季高温影响，即便是炎夏也旺盛生长并开出高品质的夏花。花朵打开非常慢，凋谢也非常慢，所以观赏时间可以维持很久。花朵很难被晒褪色。植株一波一波开花，由于花朵寿命长，生长季基本一直有花在植株上。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8cd6ad04f6c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1dee9b710fa9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0be437d1e2bb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_48f4d461a134.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6333bfaf5523.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1a527e87a42f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_702156b0d6ca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这是呆湾网友的实拍，可以看到初开花瓣底部有明显的金色调，非常漂亮。花朵到后期会变成浅紫色。花朵中型大小，春花9cm左右，夏花7-8cm。"
      },
      {
        "t": "俄罗斯实际种植图，虽然拍得很随意，但是可以关注下株型和丰花程度："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73660252e7ae.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_297fbe731f3c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e3a56cebb31c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本款的株型比较圆润，成熟植株80-100cm*80-100cm，庭院地栽或者盆栽都合适。"
      },
      {
        "t": "继续俄罗斯网友图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_54151627c925.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a713338863f9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_611699de546c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f3385f033162.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "香味方面，吉洛给的是浓香，但是其他多方都是温和的香气，香型是茶月季香气。花朵耐雨程度中等，淋雨后可能会出现一些小损伤，但花型可以维持，不会变形，不会烂掉。"
      },
      {
        "t": "另一位呆湾网友的图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2ce0d9b4d066.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3cf13673fcb9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b2d41dbb0c92.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6911c3c920b0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a366968f1187.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9d0c170abadf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "因为花朵非常重瓣，花量又大，雨后可能会垂，但也不是直接伏地那种。本款抗病性良好，抗黑斑，非常抗白粉。"
      },
      {
        "t": "下面是日本网友的图这张上花色的渐变和背面的淡金色非常明显"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3defcfaa41a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_74099d171cdb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_483fe3d3762c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这是开到很后期状态了，也一点都不难看"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96c665318e32.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9252ece17773.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "继续日本的美图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_548d3ede59e1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6b9c77c51a44.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_79b14793cc2b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这张的最下面两朵已经是褪色快凋谢状态了 可见花型维持得多好"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d5f19e9b4206.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_52fcef8bad4e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款长势也很强壮。总之，应该算是炎夏地区的福音品种了"
      },
      {
        "t": "反馈一个:广东南阳台（立夏到立秋晒不到），大盆养，大半年都僵苗，株型很差，分枝很少，花开得少（别的月季品种不会）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0070": {
    "title": "花团锦簇·扇子 Ventilo",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "作者: dddaccord它的花特别配“花团”这两个字'>之前不明白冷门的要死的吉洛家怎么会出了一款在国内还算有点人气的作品，在吧里也收获不少好评，今天仔细看了下资料才发现，这款真的是投阳台党所好'>还是想说吉洛的Generosa系列，比奥斯丁系更适合南方地区，而且很多品种综合素质非常高又很有特点，列例如前阵子介绍的安-索菲·碧克、艾米利恩·吉洛等等，因为营销太差被埋没实在可惜了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_702d4e195e4d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_63843cd79ad2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "先说缺陷，这款的缺点之一是长得慢而且长不高，成熟植株80cm*60cm，这就很限制它在庭院中的应用；而且这个高度大概3年才能达到，因为它小苗开花就很勤，花径又大（10-12cm），大量的养分消耗在开花上，所以往往出现这样的画风："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_77d75fff7b31.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也许有人觉得这是优点，但这种失调的比例对我来说是不可接受的，对于庭院造景来说也是灾难。缺陷二是成年植株株型也不咋的，整体比较凌乱"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_faf90295e33d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_13a4183a996a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "缺陷三，和很多花瓣多的大花品种一样，淋雨后容易打不开可见如果是只为看花的阳台栽培，这三个缺陷都算不上缺陷'>那么剩下的优点就显得更突出了"
      },
      {
        "t": "扇子的优点很多，一个个来说一个比较个人主观的优点：它的茎直立，花梗却比较弱，正常情况下就是这样的："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_23be0e579631.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我觉得这是月季最理想的形态，既不像HT那样僵硬，又不会垂头得需要用手扶起花朵才能观赏有人说这款垂头，其实正常的一年以上苗是不垂的，除非缺光或者缺肥导致茎太细弱。最大的优点，当然是它的重瓣大花了，层层叠叠的波浪瓣营造出十足华丽感，花径可达12cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8d6c8cb91986.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3b51b7366b1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6d3a5796b508.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5863f05291ab.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵从初开到盛开都充满着几何美感"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f97c5d3fea70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bf70a5fddc35.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "大马士革混合柑橘、杏、梨果香的强烈香气更是锦上添花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f1444ccca226.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "从小苗开始就很勤花，花量巨大"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c240a2945e1e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_14dd3b643c05.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ffefc42c0210.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "真真是花团锦簇"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1272ce9a3498.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4e6b8dd25696.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ddc0def88e8e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "盛开了最好看"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cc8ee2d9eeec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2f39194bbfdf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "植株刺很少'>非常抗病据说还比较抗红蜘蛛"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b33c6a49653f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_389d12795425.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "耐热，夏天正常生长，夏花质量很高花朵耐久，在南方的夏天能在枝条上开六天"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_69d332964e2c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2dd8f97489b3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3bd7afc0523f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4de917127203.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "上面说夏花可以维持6天，春秋的时候花朵可以开12天"
      },
      {
        "t": "还有个重要的优点就是花期比一般品种早"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3fdaaa6706b4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "很有某些老品种HP的神韵"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_27fa7eb5621e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eecf71c33f3c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f682ddaf5319.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_117d58083b3c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_50857094942c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这张神似Jacques Cartier"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_df8cbbd430c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这么一款矮小、丰花、勤花、大花、浓香、抗病、耐热、花期持久、少刺的品种，真是阳台党的福音了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f6b0f8aa5cf1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "真的不高"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_19189739933d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这张开出来牡丹的范了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7a21135e64af.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c3a955df3e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "PS 这款其实是致敬设计师Armond Ventilo 阿尔芒·文蒂洛，不过Ventilo确实是\"扇子\"的意思，译成这样也算简单好记了"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 芝士小起司贴吧的一个小姐姐种的'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ebf1d5d66df4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a2569b94bb32.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_83c94bfe9927.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 陈陈扇子确实很漂亮，花大还香，夏天还开的漂亮"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9676725f6ac9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "dddaccord搬运下@闪士☀ 的测评：【●】综合评比(二)：耐热性【●】耐热性内容包括高温环境下，植株的长势、开花的稳定性(花型 花色 花香 花量)2个大项。排名如下：品种名 得分扇子 96魅力波浪 90不眠芳香 87糖果雪山 82金辉 82梦露 77艾莎 72京 71冰山 70"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 邱..."
      },
      {
        "t": "ID：杨阳的花园一年苗的秋花，株形没有调整好，花枝比较分散，香味浓，长得慢，（根接苗优先考虑）夏花可以看两三天吧，秋花四五天，期待明年的春花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_afb396a40620.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3f6c0150890e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 蓝色月猫"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ef954060ee8d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "今天看了楼主的介绍，马上去下单，店家给我发的照片"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 沈家园月季扇子我爱它已经列入我育种清单。大花，浓香开花性也不错就是慢。"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: vivi19840904夏天的扇子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_28bd18516c0d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a82545867fe8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "太重了花都垂头了，花大漂亮。"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 贴吧用户_08MQXPJ上次在哪个帖子看到红色版扇子，很喜欢"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f28df4eacd47.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 花痴贝贝HY家的扇子和蜜蜜家的扇子，怎么感觉完全是两个不同的品种"
      },
      {
        "t": "HY说没错版"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73640e3045de.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_313e9c0ba82e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0c0f2adf3626.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 爱漂亮的徐徐我的扇子 不长个子总开花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8f5a5352cd3f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 烟里弄碧我的扇子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_47e7316f20ba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd8adbc5751b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_756be955a448.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: 微微欢颜33后悔入手晚了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_50ab13595513.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "dddaccord"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0e26004903ac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "ID: Brightlade如果说扇子的花瓣似炎夏里的层层热浪，她的香气则如清冽的山泉，沁人心脾'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "看来得入一颗了，长的慢也是优点"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款就是花花花花花"
      },
      {
        "t": "妥妥的阳台宝藏，埋没实在可惜，好在我有"
      },
      {
        "t": "耐阴怎么样"
      },
      {
        "t": "窗台盆栽党狂喜'>种草名单+1，要是黑斑抗性好点就好了，窗台不避雨，家里给老妈养的几棵月季全部黑斑严重"
      },
      {
        "t": "阳台党福音，毕竟是个微月"
      },
      {
        "t": "根系怎么样，会不会像海神王一样根系弱？"
      },
      {
        "t": "神似玫瑰，该不会有玫瑰血统吧"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0071": {
    "title": "蕾娜·萨穆郁 Reine Sammut",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_22b26de76138.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个花里胡哨的配色一看就知道是马马的手笔'>可以说是马马家的医生们的姐妹品种'>不过目前由吉洛家归在Generosa系列里发行致敬法国米其林一星名厨 Reine Sammut 蕾娜·萨穆郁："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ba2d7aa652d6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b3460714919b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_39f16e66ad9a.jpg"
