      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_45715d634bc8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "RB上评价不错 尤其提到花很持久，非常非常美，花色的美丽渐变照片上无法呈现出来'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b6cf9e7af3b7.jpg"
