      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "官方高度 1m10cm大花香气 2/3 中到强香香气柠檬混合黑加仑 很诱人'>非常勤花且适合瓶插主色调是正面樱桃红 背面金色 实际上每朵花开出来都有明显的不同 很有意思官方图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ea849cbb2e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_84d06a3ac55f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_50761cddedcf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b863f92884c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8f6042367f3a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_492448cfbd64.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "马马的厨师花'>日更博主ddd'>'>辛苦啦"
      },
      {
        "t": "下面是实际返图株型很饱满圆润 花量很大'> 看起来也不高"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5475dd5acf78.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2973c0d85751.jpg"
