      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c3532c811aad.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_555c595734a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d1ade94ea56.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2b0422d79853.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_952d49f0e74b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "初期是古典蔷薇花型 开散后有点芍药花的味道 依旧很美'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6dcd43647424.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dcfbe872952d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3a204b25bfb6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d2d53dc21a8c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9859740b92a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_12df493c1325.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b1468bc01a00.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其他资料不多 不过耐阴和抗黑斑还是不要指望太多 毕竟人马马自己说了，他首要追求的就是花朵美丽，其他是次要的，现在的竞赛选出来的品种不美，没啥意思"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e552e2f5ca66.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6d52eb3a9ffe.jpg"
      },
