  "rose_0200": {
    "title": "戴家2019 Thierry Marx 实拍图",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "惊不惊喜，意不意外>>"
      },
      {
        "t": "马德里目前还是夏末，气温大概22-29，最近几天都是大晴天，非常晒。这批花算第一波秋花，肯定质量是不及春花的。我看到的：花径全部打开在7-8cm。花型打开后非常标准的古典法国蔷薇式，颜色就是图上的样子。春花的花心应该会更丰满，但是现在这批露出金色的花心也很漂亮'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4019d96edb64.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "有人担心这款容易焦，我觉得就是一般HT的抗晒水平，连续几天暴晒开到后期才会焦边，参见这朵。同处别的HT基本都是这个水平。而且就算开到后期，花型和颜色保持的也还可以。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_20d1bc8d3282.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "植株非常健康，没发现一点黑斑和白粉缺点：我看到这棵有1.8m…… 株型还是HT老样子 有些凌乱"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0ae6a9dd3174.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1c045d56f0d5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "顺利找到Domaine de Chantilly 香缇别苑（玫瑰香橙）'> 不过就几朵在开花径目前这一批也是6-7cm，多头开，全开是这样的，花瓣非常多："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_242e723a1c18.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_32e03eb55cf1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_51d9736105b2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "气不如同一处的花宫娜浓"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_24f3ea7aa00d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_79c55009dfb8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "接着打开到浅杯状我看到的这棵高大概1.2m 应该有5年以上了 株型很茂密"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8a5ca3030b76.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "叶片完全没病 但是有点发黄 不知道是品种原因还是缺素症"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_94215404c810.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "再发些今天开的比较好的品种这个是2018年马德里月季竞赛HT类第一名 花非常好看 雍容华贵的感觉 这个季节还有十几厘米 丰花 淡香 株型丰满"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_573b29c55e05.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa41d8b332aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6c58dcb23690.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e80d9a117849.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ba7a3164e3a0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d7e0eefe814c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴尔巴德的老版Tourmaline 碧玺很美的荷花花型"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_22c0a3f97e70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f56339a3bbc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "NIRP的Pop Star 流行明星非常浓墨重彩的丰满大花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c387f86c3b66.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c0c1e9ffceb8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf445a827e5b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "几个还在测试的品种 第一张那款我好像在罗马也见过现在的HT叶子都超级油亮的"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ea9fdb4579c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de94ace976bf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_213b10ad80c4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dabb019cbcec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "开始恢复状态的格蕾丝王妃"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_105faa0ca0b8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d11117e733de.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "确实，HT大了也可以长成灌丛……"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aedd1d532f31.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯的诉说这朵有15cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c8e1ca7606d7.jpg"
      },
      {
