      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8f71692d7e3c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂还出过一款比摩纳哥王妃花瓣更多、花径更大、更香的Honoré de Balzac 巴尔扎克，可惜珠玉在前，没掀起太大水花："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_840287c5b0d1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8c8744b4e79b.jpg"
