      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_54528e53fe69.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d44bb56f83c4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa415c377fe6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_79d0e40e843b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "然后法国另一个育种家Gaujard出过一款和巴尔扎克傻傻分不清楚的La Rose Optimiste 乐天派之花，不过这款的柑橘香气强度比巴尔扎克更强"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f35bb316e6d4.jpg"
