      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_afc066c5db5e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "如果你要再妖艳一点的呢，还有戴尔巴德的强香ADR品种Pink Paradise 粉红天堂："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_521b061ee460.jpg"
