  "rose_0220": {
    "title": "Liv Tyler 丽芙·泰勒",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_df9dc75457f4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "玫昂2006年推出（其实比戴的花宫娜早）强烈桃子混合热带水果香气，因此被纪梵希选中，用于香水Very Irrésistible的原料，并以该款香水代言人丽芙·泰勒命名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_deeea85e5112.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_22c527351755.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款亲本大量使用了戴尔巴德奠基品种 卢尔德百年庆 Centenaire de Lourdes，最后含量高达37.5%，也难怪会和后来的花宫娜撞脸有意思的是还含有相当高的4%的刺梨血统"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e495e166e658.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "11-12cm大花，单朵开放或者2-5朵簇生开放，80枚花瓣，古典花心非常饱满"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_043db548bba2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b5e1f1c4cfcd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5de50767f02d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "植株官方高度60-70cm 宽度50cm直立而分枝性好适合容器栽植因为亲本里没有奥，所以炎热地区乱长可能性不大（本身玫昂那就很热）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7f84ad8dc262.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "非常适合家用切花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_85b942d6e385.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a049d202dbea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "抗病很好，复花性也完全没问题在美国和法国都上市，但是都水花不大，也没得什么奖，可能都被纪梵希拿去生产香水了；不过hmf上有限的评论总体还不错，提到这款适合微碱和保水的土壤问了问小玫昂，他说是因为照片没拍好所以流行不起来'>'>我觉得还是很值得一试的"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ee9a7c2da6c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ed024d278deb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5b47d6b608cc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_91e453ab7123.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "值得一试'>所以裸根有预售了嘛"
      },
      {
        "t": "花宫娜说：这个脸撞的有点大"
      },
      {
        "t": "丽芙泰勒和花宫娜二选一选哪个呢？"
      },
      {
        "t": "从这款旁系戴尔巴德也可以看出 卢尔德百年庆 对后代香气有着强烈的影响 基本就是桃杏香气的源头而Michel Adam的长久之爱则给戴的品种贡献了树莓香气两者后代莫利纳就是典型的桃杏+树莓，也就是戴家最有代表性的香气类型"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅毒小姐？"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个我喜欢"
      },
      {
        "t": "和花宫娜相比优势在哪里呢？"
      },
      {
        "t": "香味也撞脸吗？浓度比得上花宫娜吗？"
      },
      {
        "t": "对这花色毫无抵抗力"
      },
      {
        "t": "打开后是不是有点饼？"
      },
      {
        "t": "哪有卖呢？"
      },
      {
        "t": "看起来也可以替换玫昂小姐了，那货有点大'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "小株型有兴趣"
      },
      {
        "t": "话说抗病性是花宫娜还是这个更好"
      },
      {
        "t": "已经有了梅昂小姐和甜蜜尤瑞卡，感觉区别没有很大"
      },
      {
        "t": "阿春老师说好像以前因为小玫昂给的裸根尾货不太好退了，早期合作的时候"
      },
      {
        "t": "嗷，精灵公主"
      },
      {
        "t": "我这里花宫娜香味不浓，如果差不多，可以考虑买一颗。"
      },
      {
        "t": "花宫娜：我做错了什么？烦我了呗？'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "没地方的花友表示看着很不错👍"
      },
      {
        "t": "那，耐阴？"
      },
      {
        "t": "hmf上说这玩意1m5-1m8 = =但是照片看着都不高的样子好像对雨水抗性不大好= - ="
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0221": {
    "title": "Summer Sangria 夏日鸡尾酒",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9583c21c0475.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这是一个我最近非常种草的品种官方的说法是它的抗性可以和玫昂最好的景观类品种媲美，就不用多说了打动我的点，第一是它的颜色非常美丽可以看下和暗香的对比：田里的实拍，照片校正过颜色，实物基本就这个颜色（开到末期会偏玫红）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b78759312baf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "第二 它的香气非常好闻官方给的淡香，也就是2/5，亲测凑上去闻可以闻到很明显的甜甜水果香+一点点茶香'>反正绝对不会让你觉得是塑料花。顺便提一句杏色马卡龙也非常好闻'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d7eb011dac3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "第三 花能开到9-10cm 而且亲测它的花15-20度环境下瓶插观赏期7天以上'> 以及杏色马卡龙瓶插更久，可以维持10天观赏期我觉得一个绿化带品种能做到这样大花、有香味、瓶插持久非常难能可贵其实玫昂肯定知道绝代佳人系列花不好看，所以这种类似升级版绝代佳人的品种也会是未来的一个方向吧"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b7676eb570f2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "第四 非常直立饱满匀称的株型，群植效果好"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2fe8b68d48e1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "今年怎么没引进"
      },
      {
        "t": "2018年巴塞罗那月季竞赛最佳丰花月季+公众投票选择奖（耐湿热☑️）2021年美国（抗黑斑☑️）& 欧洲发行官方认证的耐雨淋、耐热、适合盆栽（大盆）品种'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f645e48b3eeb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "颜色我喜欢。"
      },
      {
        "t": "看视频的时候被这一款深深吸引！但是，到底什么时候才能拥有啊！"
      },
      {
        "t": "没得卖，空喜欢"
      },
      {
        "t": "这也是绝代佳人的亲戚？"
      },
      {
        "t": "叶子也是红的！"
      },
      {
        "t": "这颜色i了"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个我好爱'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "纪念芭芭拉也像这个，超级抗病"
      },
      {
        "t": "耐阴如何？年日照1700左右的地区能不能入呢？'>我好心水这种颜色啊"
      },
      {
        "t": "好棒'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "不够精致警告⚠️"
      },
      {
        "t": "和北京红有点像，不过大花是不能比的"
      },
      {
        "t": "美丽樱桃可以被夏日鸡尾酒替代吗？'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "年纪大了 我就喜欢这种颜色"
      },
      {
        "t": "种在家门口或绿化带绝对很吸睛"
      },
      {
        "t": "好喜欢这个株型啊，等看到有卖我也买一个"
      },
      {
        "t": "他最好和绝代一样耐阴"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0222": {
    "title": "Velásquez 委拉斯凯兹",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "相信很多人对粉和平 Pink Peace这个品种并不陌生 江浙一带大量用于绿化带 花又大又艳丽 而且具有好闻的红茶香气 植株作为上世纪50年代推出的品种来说 健壮抗病得吓人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c04496cfd1aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ab09cec26b26.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_449b90eba641.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我家门口之前就有一棵粉和平，在春夏6-7小时直射光的条件下 梅雨季几乎不会生黑斑 也没有白粉 令我非常吃惊 我也非常喜欢喜欢它的华丽花朵和香气 但最后还是忍痛拔了；为什么呢？实在是忍受不了它的两个致命缺陷：高温（印象里大于27度）下花焦边，极端高温（大于34度）下植株直接装死休眠"
      },
      {
        "t": "于是在粉和平推出很久很久以后，玫昂又推出了这款委拉斯凯兹，名字不用说，自然是为了纪念西班牙最伟大的画家之一Diego Rodriguez da Silva y Velasquez"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_29439e8e0aa0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款委拉斯凯兹的花官方标准照和粉和平非常非常像，除了色号深了一号和花瓣带蓝光："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2d2ef304f55e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ca7a88835d7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f61d389766be.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但其实 它的花初开时 花心和外瓣有色温上的渐变 有种花心发光的感觉 官方照没拍出来我的实拍："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e6ca36e4db8f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但我之前一直没有很注意过这个品种，然而，最近看到了它的夏花，大为惊喜：可以看到 花朵还是有8cm左右 花型维持的非常好 而且完全不焦 开到后期也很美 尤其是波浪瓣的轻盈感非常动人最最重要的是，委拉斯凯兹居然在高温下还有浓郁的红茶香！这个我觉得会是我入手这一款的最大理由，因为浓茶香的现代品种真的很稀少"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6fb07e377e4a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a2d8252ec9a2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d00610195864.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e3fdb7f9d727.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "委拉斯凯兹推出以来获得了9个国际奖项：2010东京月季竞赛银奖荷兰海牙月季竞赛一等荣誉证书比利时Le Roeulx月季竞赛荣誉证书都柏林月季竞赛最佳HT捷克月季竞赛最佳HT2011里昂月季竞赛特别奖 & 世纪月季捷克月季竞赛一等奖Alterarosa观众选择奖"
      },
      {
        "t": "官方花径给的13cm 抗病性非常出色 复花在HT属于相当快的一档在RB上总体反馈极佳：花非常大 经常轻松上15cm；花耐雨淋，耐晒，非常持久；非常香；不生病以下几楼的图都是花友的图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5340b349b662.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_027923ea60e8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_312e80cacde6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "一般情况下单头开放，但是强枝可以开一堆："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_12b87ebe9149.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2c43715f519b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "所以 委拉斯凯兹可以说是耐热升级版粉和平，华丽的花朵很相似，就连红茶味花香也完美复刻，甚至可能去更加浓郁'>'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_31a3c2108269.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d0912c97c942.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "总的来说 委拉斯凯兹的花朵 香气 复花 抗病 耐热 耐雨淋 长势这几个方面都很出色 但它最大问题就是株型官方给的株高是90-150cm 已经是他家最高的HT了'>（园艺王子 夏琳 莉娜都在130cm左右）而且枝叶不密 单株看上去就还是上世纪老HT典型的高脚鸡的感觉（同类品种：冷香和园艺王子）所以这款的应用 还是更适合花境后排、群植和家用切花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b2edabb62adc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "株型咋样？"
      },
      {
        "t": "刚发ddd也发了"
      },
      {
        "t": "另外我觉得可能有很多人接受不了这个死亡花色'>但是据小玫昂说现在这个颜色在英国是年轻人里很流行时髦的颜色"
      },
      {
        "t": "被埋没的名作"
      },
      {
        "t": "国内有售。去年冬天想入，但商家发生土豆风波，遂搁置。"
      },
      {
        "t": "我有 这个我是强烈推荐 冬天用它来替代法式优雅 我们西北干燥的气候 法式优雅5月份花瓣就焦点掉了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_23cc939c3f4f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ba961e45deee.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "我准备把粉和平送走，太不耐晒了"
      },
      {
        "t": "粉和平插瓶，不从顶上看，倒也还可以，乱入一个暮光之城"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f47905adc6fb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "创新难，复刻更难。难得的是品种变得更加优秀了"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个品种各方面跟美人丽芙相比怎么样？有点好奇这个香味，但是不想种太多同个色系的"
      },
      {
        "t": "可惜刺太多，给我扔了。"
      },
      {
        "t": "看了d神本帖，夏天我入了一棵一加仑苗子"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0223": {
    "title": "Mademoiselle Meilland 梅昂小姐",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "官图好喜欢这种花心发光的感觉>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f0093160abaf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_206ed1d183f6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "在美国上市叫Sweet Mademoiselle 甜姐儿"
      },
      {
        "t": "houzz上一片好评，但有人嫌颜色假，像这个："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1d21c3d0061a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "houzz上的图，株型很不错。花非常大。据说花打开相当慢，香味是苹果加桃子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e8efab03d5e4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2542ec4efadd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa9dd872ca51.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e75a2f66f1ba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_28c27b054069.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "另一些实际种植图可见花型与花色非常多变"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9c2859ae04be.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cc22153f068a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2523d1155893.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_04adaac61898.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf3b05c11f2e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "修剪得当的话花量也很丰盛"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7bbda9944e5d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_14c82d609049.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_955ea4358fc0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "看样子这款也是越晒越红的那种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ff5948e8fd9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5483d3867807.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_89ca2963c07f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_24f27b17518c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de77776b9f8b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aceda872749c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e6b7b673b805.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_847a2c3b4073.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂2016年推出，切花庭院两用品种株型110cm*50cm，68枚花瓣，平均13cm大花。中到强烈的桃、杏、柠檬混合果香非常抗病，勤花，丰花。这款和夏琳、莉娜一样，都是梅昂用格拉汗托马斯杂交HT两次后得到的品种，综合品质非常优秀，已经开始扫奖了。缺点也和莉娜 夏琳一样，温暖的地方会长得比较大木村给了高度评价：香气 3/5开花性 4/5株高 150cm长势 4/5抗bf 4/5抗黑斑 4/5耐阴 3/5耐寒 3/5耐暑热 4/5"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7dcdd74a760c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6babf98479f6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂小姐父本是和平的第一代后代，美国华裔育种家林彬的2001年的作品Love & Peace 爱与和平（温和没药味）："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_865ff04b3925.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "母本来源之一是梅昂自己1992年育成的克里斯托弗哥伦布（淡香）："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2cab2222c774.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd1b8a8cbcf0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "另一个母本来源是格拉汗·托马斯："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e3134c2969a7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01af67e1b9f5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e647e8033b8f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "母本：克里斯托弗·哥伦布 * 格拉汗·托马斯父本：爱与和平梅昂的HT，是不会专门往庭院品种培养的！也就是，在设定育种计划时，他们已经要求培育出的品种有作为切花商业生产的可能——所以耐开和枝条直立而且开花枝长这两点理论上是一定要保证的（用格拉汗托马斯和HT杂交两次也是尽量保证能做到这两点）但毕竟最后结果和理论会有差距，所以，在评估一个HT新品时：耐开，瓶插时间长得突出，花美，但是作为个人种植用有缺陷（抗病性，长势或者株型方面）==》作为切花推出作为切花不那么合适但适合个人种植 ==》作为庭院品种推出两者都符合就作为两用品种推出（典型园艺王子，夏琳，梅昂小姐）因此，国内外很多人吐槽梅昂的HT株型太丑，比如这样：这点短期内是改不了的，除非他们想专门弄一个庭院系列。"
      },
      {
        "t": "2016年摩纳哥月季竞赛金奖2017年意大利La Tacita月季竞赛HT类金奖+芳香奖第一名+最高奖2019年日本长冈国际芳香月季竞赛金奖+最佳月季奖进入国内后也得到了很多很好的评价'> 主要体现在花朵大、芳香、持久耐开，植株健壮抗病；主要槽点是株型有高脚鸡倾向，可能和种植环境有关，也可能和裸根第一年有关，随着植株成熟株型会丰满起来两广地区推荐种植（需充足日照和空间）>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_883e4e0358cd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e70b4a6b282.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96053c51aaf6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96e26a6a9640.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_69c18c89d953.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "莉娜、夏琳、梅昂小姐这三姐妹的成功和她们与传统的HT以及奥斯丁系的区别化是分不开的：比起传统的HT，她们的花型更契合时下流行，色彩细腻有层次，而且个个香味出众，长势强劲又非常抗病比起奥斯丁系，她们花朵明显更大（成熟春季第一波花的主花蕾打开轻松超15cm），更耐开，株型紧凑适合狭小空间和集中种植切花生产"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c806688cedde.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1628ce7d7f57.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_02b117bdd3fb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c1219d2decc1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eb5546e4c236.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "可以很清楚看到梅昂小姐花真的大"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b3b957510029.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f24ca11fcc27.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "三姐妹最多花瓣的那个"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a056ee424a06.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "橙色✔粉色✘"
      },
      {
        "t": "视频介绍'> 网页链接"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个不错，各方面都勉强达标"
      },
      {
        "t": "半日照条件已成青菜的梅昂小姐和一只不知天高地厚的蓟马"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵颜色初开时最好，后期橙色褪去就成一朵大粉花了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d9bdb6e941ef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5327658874c4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_27df463384e0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "浅粉色＋橙，我的爱"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个哪家有卖"
      },
      {
        "t": "花是又大又香，株型太丑了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_321cb37d828d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ad13ee6f4d9f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cc9678365000.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_398d0aa3ff05.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我这里有一些黑斑"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f7e9e43b7b8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花径12-14cm'>一些日本的新图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c62a984aa64d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3503b79f2156.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_40dba2cf084f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_11366ba55b2d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b0e8b259d3a5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c2bf1ede3d0d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e54340d429bb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_54b5efd21c9c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "最近发现家东莞的植物园也入了HY的苗，其中一株就是梅昂小姐'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "请问梅昂小姐不要全日照吧 六小时可以吗"
      },
      {
        "t": "请问我这个刚到的梅昂小姐杆子怎么回事啊 这样的部位还能发低位芽吗"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cc471ae540f1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "谢谢推荐，玫昂小姐无论颜色还是花型都是我最喜欢没有之一，即使抗病性不是最完美仍然爱她'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_052cdc26c125.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ce4525beb40.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ec25d1637b84.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5ed52be29b96.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "请问梅昂小姐和斯科博贝尔哪个好？它们各自的优缺点是什么呀？"
      },
      {
        "t": "好美啊！听说是没药+青苹果香气。我还没有闻过青苹果香气，"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0224": {
    "title": "Belles Rives 丽滨",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "法国蔚蓝海岸上的高级酒店Belles Rives “丽滨酒店”几年前向梅昂“定制”了一款适合当地干热夏天的月季品种，主要用于切花，这就是梅昂交出的答卷。因为其出色的综合品质，梅昂也把这款作为庭院品种于2017年在欧洲推出，并在今年在美国市场作为庭院品种以“Stiletto”的名字推出。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_57241c2a0409.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_94773e6d6ad7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款的品质，本身由几个事实就可以侧面说明：- 为干热气候定制- 梅昂的切花庭院两用品种（他家最优秀的品种几乎都是这一类）- 欧洲美国都上市除此以外，从亲本上也可窥见端倪：母本: Stephens' Big Purple (Stephens1985年育成的名作\"大紫袍\") × Princesse de Monaco (梅昂1981育成的摩纳哥王妃)父本: Lasting Love (Michel Adam1993育成的\"长久之爱\")大紫袍，非常耐热+浓香+强抗病，紫色系最重要的亲本之一"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b5851eda6677.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1c7fc32d5b46.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eb7b995ef564.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "摩纳哥王妃，温和水果香+细腻优美的花色+优良的长势，最出名的HT之一"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f79f317e97e6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_604ab2e9bf5c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Michel Adam的长久之爱，强烈的水果香气，本身就是一个切花名作"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_030af89c7847.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丽滨的各种品质，几乎就是这三个亲本的综合"
      },
      {
        "t": "美国的宣传资料"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_faf540ad16e0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "作为一个HT*HT*HT的产物，丽滨很自然地继承了HT标准的高雅花型，花色上基本随大紫袍，色调稍微偏红了一点"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9383891d2fca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花瓣厚实，有明显的丝绒感和暗纹"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf53b218ee68.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "HMF上写的香气是\"温和的老式蔷薇+柑橘果香\"但是上面美国的宣传物料写的\"非常强烈的香气\"不管怎么说，有明显的香气就是了标准花花径12cm，35枚花瓣>这款的叶子非常漂亮，继承了父本\"长久之爱\"和摩纳哥王妃的油亮叶片，但是叶脉平整了许多，更加赏心悦目了 整体枝叶也很紧凑茂密"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_196bb4a3490d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de26cf40f5c5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款的一大优点就是不但花朵耐热耐晒，而且复花速度非常快（小梅昂在某个宣传视频里说的）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_581701138911.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "植株也不大，大约90cm*50cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5b7ed12c9a6a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "作为切花已经在欧洲全面推出，来看看荷兰的月季切花公司给它的标准照："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4315411e89b7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "不要问我为什么是这个颜色，我也不知道可能插瓶就会变紫吧"
      },
      {
        "t": "丽滨月季在丽滨酒店内部应用的标准照：这个品种的气质真适合这种现代感的浪漫奢华"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d1b41fc372fd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3c205be5c9a3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6e106fc6d423.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4919f3270a03.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "与伊夫伯爵的合影："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0acbedbe0648.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "德国花商作为庭院品种的标准照>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bfdbaea1667c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_39870010ad6f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fbd0764a3216.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "自己养的花色应该是接近这种胭脂红里透点紫的颜色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_364bcfbe008a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂的两张官图这款需要全日照，也很耐寒。抗病能力优秀，长势迅速补充：实际反馈在半阴环境表现也很好"
      },
      {
        "t": "目前找到的一些实际种植图：可以看到开标准并不难，而且花色会随时间变化"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2dea8a525dae.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ffddb434c720.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d276aaf3dcc9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_435dccefaa4f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ceebc89bad22.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a715f44d168e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4db0a19b571c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-03-08 14:02 #60: 广东37ddd，舍农索开花了，你看会不会错版，花很大，没有闻到香味，可能是我没有凑前去闻"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_296e0c81989b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6a6824b03c8d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-04-17 10:23 #68: 格拉斯大南瓜到货"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f9049e3890e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-04-22 19:21 #70: 今夜月白丽滨带2花苞来的，今天开了，感觉打开挺慢，颜色很华丽，我这边昨天到今天下雨，一点也闻不到香味"
      },
      {
        "t": "，叶片非常厚且带革质感，整体看着很健康"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e02a96656365.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aa8fdba5af11.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_94a6bda40778.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-04-26 09:28 #71: 耳东1986的海角返个图吧，非阳光下和阳光下，要宣传图那种紫色，就放弃吧。标准的ht，香味很合适，两朵放书房，坐在1.5米远的地方，能闻到非常淡的香味。照片只加了logo，其他没动，直出。相机富士TX3"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bdad5c725a6e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c0a46bc3c3d6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-04-26 23:43 #72: 玄都小桃子'>'>剪了两朵瓶插，早上起来的时候一眼就看见了٩(•̤̀ᵕ•̤́๑)ᵒᵏᵎᵎᵎᵎ超级感动，花好美好大，香香的好喜欢"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dbf876ac6af1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cb4b899718d5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b442aaabeba3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-05-25 17:02 #75: 惹噜啾咪厚唉天热了开不出其他花友晒的第一波花的效果了'>不过很耐晒，全日照晒四五天就变成了图2右边那样的紫红色，比法式香'>狄安娜现在想拍朵完整的花就不容易了容易焦'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f294a54dfa17.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-06-14 11:16 #76: 惹噜啾咪厚丽滨真的好耐晒'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1b38b67b9477.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-07-11 10:46 #78: 缘于心广东36度天台的开品，还不错"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_48979b02fcdd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-07-29 15:57 #79: 惹噜啾咪厚'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-08-12 17:51 #81: 往事随风会浙江地区8月高温，花型还能标准，可以可以"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_429c66903399.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a96bc55d2178.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-08-25 18:55 #82: 烛姬"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8138a7c21528.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-10-08 19:05 #83: 缘于心"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_94f5544a841c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "虹越买的盆栽10L，丽芙美人是丽滨没错吧！！三天了还没打开'>'>美不美？？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_307780058853.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "存的吧友的丽滨返图 目前最美了吧"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7417a0d0513d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f1b85e648c5a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_003a3b7e25bb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "越看越像上次买的切花"
      },
      {
        "t": "不过上次买的没香气'>没这个美"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个颜色爱了爱了"
      },
      {
        "t": "看了你的推荐后买的，由于是高温天，拔掉了叶子后发货的，9月到货，收到时是光杆。不过长势非常好，很快就绿油油了。这是10月底的第一波花，现在还有好几朵没完全凋谢。这秋花非常持久，后来逛苗圃时看见过介绍，有个牌子上写了这是适合切下来插瓶的品种。坐标10a～"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ac31580e816.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5571ef608836.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6f2cc707114b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c5b047353a74.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eff1c5d29fe3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花苞期和含苞待放时也很美！"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b0e9f1803518.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_341d08f4a31e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "被毒害种草的我带花花图顶贴。耐热是必须的，叶片墨绿厚实，我爸过来吃饭见到差点就搬走了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6b961a106c90.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1fa865e17ec7.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0225": {
    "title": "一款接近完美的月季——莉娜·雷诺 (Line Renaud)",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "“接近完美”可不是我说的，是出品了无数经典的梅昂公司官方认证'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_696205d5a136.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3dfb89b2987b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_80c49b113cbb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Line Renaud 莉娜·雷诺 / Forget-Me-Not 勿忘我官网简介这是一款接近完美的品种！散发着梦幻香气的大型花朵不间断地开放在抗病性极强的枝叶上，莉娜·雷诺的育成象征着我们向“理想月季”又近了一步。由圆形饱满的花蕾绽放出大约13cm的美丽花朵，35枚花瓣外围整齐排列，中心重叠，花色由绯红到鲑鱼橙随温度和湿度变化，带淡紫色光彩。单头或2-5朵成小花序开放，从春末夏初一直开放到秋末。花朵有强烈而精致的玫瑰香气，混合柑橘、覆盆子、杏的香调，后调略带马鞭草和柏的味道。适合作切花。叶片深绿，半哑光，极为抗病。植株非常强健，一般高1m，条件合适可以长到1.5m。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c8de47c397a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8943e7562d1d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2f8b8dbe58c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "荣誉2005年巴黎Bagatelle月季竞赛荣誉证书、芳香奖布宜诺斯艾利斯月季竞赛金奖Saverne月季竞赛荣誉证书2006年里昂月季竞赛一等奖、“法国最美月季”2007年南特月季竞赛国际芳香品种大奖通过德国ADR测试（在11个不同气候区的种植园不打任何农药测试三年检测抗病、抗虫、耐寒、耐热、丰花性）2008年澳大利亚国家月季竞赛银奖、“最芳香月季奖”奥尔良月季竞赛 芳香奖2009年法国国家园艺协会月季类大奖2014年玫瑰山国际月季竞赛最芳香品种奖2017年Biltmore国际月季竞赛最芳香月季奖"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0397ac055be5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "helpmefind上的测评打分：花色 优秀花型 优秀花量 优秀-复花 良好+香味 优秀叶片 优秀活力 优秀抗病 优秀耐寒 优秀耐热 优秀耐阴 优秀耐雨 良好+综合 优秀总体来说就是综合抗性极为出色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_760b38ceb63e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "最有意思的是评论区和一些品种的对比'>The Rose Society of South Australia had a competition at their spring rose show, for the public to vote on their favourite scent of a dozen or so anonymous roses. Forget Me Not won (the competition included Pope John Paul II and Ispahan). 群众投票选最好闻的月季，这款当选第一，赢了教皇保罗II世和大马士革玫瑰。Dee-lish has the best fragrance among the 110+ rose varieties that I grew. The scent is strong, and lasts long until the petals fall apart. I have Munstead Wood next to it, and Dee-lish scent is twice stronger and better. Very vigorous and healthy as own-root, three times bigger than Lady of Shalott (own-root), and twice taller than Munstead Wood (own-root).这款在我的110多种月季里香气是最好的，强烈而且持久，一直到花瓣掉落。它的香气比种在一起的黑伍德强两倍，而且更好闻'> 植株非常强健健康。Dee-list needs less water than Stephen Big Purple .. but both can handle heat above 90.这款比大紫袍需水少。两个品种都能耐35度以上高温。The scent of Line Renaud/Dee-Lish, I consider more in balance, fresher, spicier, less heavy or obtrusive.（相比奥斯丁的葛楚德·杰基尔）这款的香气更平衡，清新，没那么冲。This rose has stayed completely healthy during a damp, wet summer.这款在潮湿多雨的夏天保持完全健康。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5d1d8d67cd12.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fdc85ac69f56.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_65eb9f509a46.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "网友评论Take Munstead Wood, crank up the scent 10 times, and you'll get Dee-lish. One bloom can perfume the entire room, smells like heaven regardless of the weather.香气比黑伍德浓郁十倍，一朵花可以令整屋飘香。无论天气如何，闻起来都像身处天堂。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_db60e81e0330.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5bb4326128fd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0f0a1a511b45.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "换她的德国发行名“易北河弗洛伦萨”后又搜出一波图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e10580885ebd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fe9dec5f14e8.jpg"
