      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2e4e868242bf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf5aa028080d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵也适合作为家用切花（说明花期不短）需要全日照"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bb553852c99b.jpg"
