  "rose_0295": {
    "title": "Sunny Sky 晴空",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "做一款抗病的黄月季难，做一款能拿到ADR的黄色HT更是难上加难2019年版的ADR大概有180个品种，把里面所有的深黄浅黄变色黄品种都算上才24个，其中黄色的HT只有三个：一个Sunny Sky 晴空，一个Limona 柠檬娜，一个2021未命名新品，全是科尔德斯出品晴空官方数据：香气 3/5花瓣数 4/5耐寒 3/5抗黑斑 4/5抗白粉 4/5抗病等级和茴香酒夫人是一样的，可参照"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_519a7feabf18.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ef9d1685760c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce03b2866d24.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_606e30a824f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2ed283fbd556.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯因为它完美的经典HT花型而把它归成了HT："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6eb69b6f1656.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d4cc8b8c6280.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_65bba11068c7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但其实，晴空的生长习性更接近于Shrub，完全不是传统HT的株型和开花效果："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a449933ecd4a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ac3e0c1f37a7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0305c584e125.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa2067c75050.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_254a42cb91c9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3fc797b1ad66.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "而且可以看到，晴空的花朵开到后期也是非常具有观赏价值的花球，一举摒除传统HT株型差、花量少、整体效果差、开翻了丑的弊病成熟植株大小120cm*60cm花径8-10cm成熟植株是开花机器，非常勤花"
      },
      {
        "t": "晴空的花朵初绽时有清冽的青柠檬香气，随着花朵打开，青苹果、梨子和桃子的香气渐渐明显，花朵打开后变为一种令人想起杏子干的成熟的水果甜香。当这些水果香散去后，留下来的是奶油调的蔷薇香气。花朵耐风吹雨打，也适合切花。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_48ac3cc271a0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7a313dadf56f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d5a6a493c4cb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e029c6aa5247.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_67e0a17f2558.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "英法德三国最高奖肯定：2014年法国园艺协会月季大赏大花灌木大奖2015年ADR2016年英国皇家园艺协会年度月季除以之外还获得：2010年蒙扎月季竞赛金奖2012年La Tacita国际月季新品竞赛HT金奖，爱尔兰Belfast月季竞赛金奖+最佳HT2014年海牙月季竞赛金证书，格拉斯哥月季竞赛荣誉证书"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e26bdfef2e98.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_06f8b3cf477a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a2f2110b2971.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_42dbce5a72c3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8cd71a6a9d47.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3233a49aad7c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6d0b08d647a0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "需要注意的两点：香气在傍晚最强花色由琥珀黄转为乳黄色，粉红晕不稳定。取决于环境待观察：高温下的花型保持和褪色情况这款晴空可以说是市面上所有类似品种的长势抗病花量株型全面强化的究极版了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3f8636f38c68.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01dd20456fec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_08e0d4f32595.jpg"
