      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bef1d82c127a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "遇到这种冲天枝，有地方就横拉，没地方就剪短"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b4fdc7e46a94.jpg"
