      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d3cf335facaa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_422fe685c270.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_14768e95f324.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "和上一楼同一株，看看花量"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73e2d24fc252.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6cd819b71b12.jpg"
