        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_606283a02352.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c6fa63a93964.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ec2d5181f028.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4147afe09cea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c4a97657ae4e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_35c42f025f8b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_16bf2d07c775.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5f936c23fc91.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本次更新：- 增加了今年新引入品种- 更新了获奖情况- 更新了部分图片- 根据国内反馈调整了部分数值可以说是目前最具参考性的中文资料了"
      },
      {
        "t": "这两年种下来的感觉就是，经理家抗病就算3/5都是基本不黑斑，复花5/5就是一直在开花，香味4/5已经很明显. 经理家太努力了'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "啊啊，两个剪影，一个卡拉乔，必入！卡拉乔别再鸽了！"
      },
      {
        "t": "希望音乐之声不要再鸽了。。"
      },
      {
        "t": "科家真是adr大户'>顶级抗病的代表"
      },
      {
        "t": "就买个卡拉乔"
      },
      {
        "t": "好失望没有蔷薇浪漫。打算入手音乐之声，大公夫人和柠檬娜。"
      },
      {
        "t": "没有庞贝吗"
      },
      {
        "t": "好多想买…地盘不够啊'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "想要这款https://tieba.baidu.com/p/7882273538"
      },
      {
        "t": "卡拉乔终于来啦'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "去年买的音乐之声无货，看看今年吧……如果能有大公夫人的品质，就无敌了"
      },
      {
        "t": "我看这个资料花大小都是8-10cm，想了解下音乐之声的花具体能开到多大cm？"
      },
      {
        "t": "比弗利及大公抗黑在我这，不打药无黑斑，发现科家标准越来越高了"
      },
      {
        "t": "白色那款没有么？"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0349": {
    "title": "童话魔法 Märchenzauber",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯官网的宣传语是“世界上最美丽的月季”——也许他家对美的定义就是健康、强壮、工整，无论你同不同意这个定义，这款童话魔法的美丽是毋庸置疑的。随着橙粉色的日渐流行，好品种也不断涌现出来，竞争也像粉红色系一样进入了白热化；而这款是有实力竞争同色系综合最佳的品种。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01693960b78a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ced29c7192bb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a1e817ec3810.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2003年育成2015年在德国以\"Märchenzauber\"之名推出2018年在澳大利亚以\"Fairytale Magic\"之名推出两个名字直译就是\"童话魔法\"2019年在美国以\"Bliss Parfuma 极乐芬芳\"之名推出，列入了美国发行的Parfuma芬芳系列——但其实这款香气不算很浓，官方给了3/5，因此在欧洲没有列进Parfuma芬芳系列（这个系列香气至少4/5）就像上次的奶油花环，凡是这种科尔德斯敢在欧洲、澳大利亚、美国同时上市的品种，绝对是他家最拿得出手的"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a796c597a4eb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "再看看奖项：2017年ADR认证2016年意大利La Tacita国际月季新品竞赛HT类金奖2016年巴登巴登月季竞赛金奖2017年爱尔兰Belfast月季竞赛丰花月季类金奖2018年格拉斯哥月季竞赛芳香奖+银奖2018年澳大利亚全国月季竞赛荣誉奖2019年美国Biltmore国际月季竞赛最佳丰花月季"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ecbff0534acf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9eacca5a8f8c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3564fb7072ec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "品质还需要多说吗？"
      },
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯官网给的参数：香气 3/5花瓣数 4/5 （HMF标注花瓣数可达120枚）耐寒性 4/5抗白粉 4/5抗黑斑 4/5成熟植株标准大小100cm*60cm，株型直挺花径8-10cm水果香官方图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c2bb68d36ba1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "虽然拍的不咋样，但好歹后两张把丰盛的花量和直挺紧凑的株型这两个特点拍了出来。株型确实不大，适合盆栽：在他人的镜头下也比官图更美丽"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6b52426a9c15.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9a96b93815aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7123e668ec1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款比较新所以实际种植反馈不多，但基本上都是好评，提到的唯一缺点是高温下花很快褪成白色。30度左右环境下花可以开5天，属于平均水准，更凉爽的时候就可以开得更久"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_44301db4571c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e8a80f943b7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e3fc1b7f1c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4cac274aa968.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d621261acbd5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c1be68f3fdd6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a17beb7423d5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1e713b6992e3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_699f1c71fdac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ab82b816e51a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2de1b18b5aea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_021ae00b67fb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_707a81a912a4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f21890cfc76f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ae828f63b65a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0390f6a0bfac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_75ebcae7195f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c36bd807a722.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_825ea1ac96e7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f25d3d48fd3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ecee02379b0d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55945f35987d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "反正我是真心觉得，要是我国的市场更成熟一点，现在很多流行品种很快就会被淘汰，品质差距明摆着"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de1c0a101f19.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b877842642f3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4c02a5453ef5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f6e982fcc143.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5408c8c64347.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也顺便再介绍下同色系另一个优秀品种，法国Michel Adam育成的Trésor du Jardin 花园宝藏以前提过Michel Adam醉心于改良HT，这款花园宝藏就是又一个典型：经典优雅的HT花型"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5fd05412ce96.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0066409f7e9a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但花量显著提升，不再是一枝一花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2c2ec583383c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "青翠健康的叶片配上温柔高雅的花朵真是赏心悦目后期露出的朱红色花心也很漂亮！"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03aa3866b4e4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "保留了HT的直挺紧凑株型，但枝叶更加茂密，高度控制到了80cm左右，免去了高脚鸡的感觉"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3bf23ec2e1f8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这组官图是用Iphone6拍的，你能信吗？发行穷酸到这种地步这款也是扫奖机器，可见其品种优秀：2015年巴登巴登月季竞赛HT类金奖+所有类别金奖+芳香奖里昂月季竞赛一等奖+最美法国月季奖比利时Le Roeulx月季竞赛荣誉证书2016年罗马月季竞赛HT类银奖+特别奖2017年捷克月季竞赛最美大花月季2018年捷克月季竞赛金奖其他一些图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_08a52172fda7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我在罗马月季园的实拍："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dcf426a3323e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b041b9137288.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b0c24cf2a6c9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4d548202fdc0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_576271b0db83.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a83c2004ece2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "可以看到这款气质很像茴香酒夫人，如出一辙的高大健壮风格，花量十分出色；这也是欧洲目前最流行的风格官方给的资料：强香（3/3），香型老式蔷薇+强水果调（李子+梨）非常抗病（3/3）植株高70-80cm，宽50-60cm花径13cm！28-30枚花瓣长势强健花期5月到结冰其他一些图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a9fc379df51e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a8ec9911bc4f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款真的好美……"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6bcde473bcc8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "好美'> @贴吧用户_QAMDQPA @惹噜啾咪厚🌳 @nc_zhang @☞烛姬☜"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f748a263776c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d8f09ce1be4d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_078737a98632.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_566704420120.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3d5e044bb02e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c36ecb758b80.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5a71b17097a2.jpg"
