        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_31039847773e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "看来颜色上已经做不出什么新文章了"
      },
      {
        "t": "传统艺能 绿化带品种不能丢满分抗性ADR 2020"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_467911d75647.jpg"
