  "rose_0357": {
    "title": "经理家育种负责人Thomas Proll演讲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "来自业内人士的观点，很多信息'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd8b9b65a99a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_37d8c9890db2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9e40023c4a68.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "直到上世纪80年代 传统HT占据全世界对月季审美的绝对主导地位 也是一般人眼里月季的形象"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6bdea511f665.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3521b774e1d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_99d3b30a42f5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c6ebf6b0bb3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e1e08befde64.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_31b0264f9b1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "数十年后的今天 经典HT不再是唯一的流行上世纪80年代中期奥奥的出现把古典花型带回大众视野并造成古典月季的复兴>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1e926bd5372a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_765341fc2121.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_25d60f1747d9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其他育种家需要时间明白这种“非常规花型”的流行不是一时的，从而调整育种方向，之后“非常规”的古典花型也遍地开花成为了常规>>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_254eb77ab214.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "古典花型的流行拓宽了月季审美，但是大众对于月季的关注仍然集中于经典HT上单瓣花对于大众来说一点都不受欢迎，但是随着欧洲昆虫数量锐减，对于月季的审美也转向更昆虫友好的单瓣或者半重瓣露心的花朵"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4bca06e1c9c1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_11c686c9881b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "关于杂交波斯蔷薇"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bba6fcf79543.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e0a796e745d1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4b9b4ff98ba3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4a578529db19.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_018e95470580.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "蓝色月季？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_28a2d704d425.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bb19adfc8fc5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "不走寻常路就意味着更大的风险"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3dd5157787ef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d94759f5fd6c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b6cedc08bad3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55e79f39555f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8d752f64293a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_baa96537124a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_534ee024f240.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dc59b43bd12f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_435c61039f2c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8a39f833a117.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "什么时候培育出类似菊花的管状花瓣，走菊花的路让菊花无路可走😅"
      },
      {
        "t": "昆虫锐减什么意思？欧洲不是不怎么打药吗？"
      },
      {
        "t": "现在从月季的花边、斑块、斑点、各种花型来进行创新了。"
      },
      {
        "t": "减少农药的使用或者使用环保药很重要'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "昆虫友好露心是趋势"
      },
      {
        "t": "看看人家的在看看所MZ育种家🐺！？根本没有可比性！🐺就是小丑'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "不接受反驳！"
      },
      {
        "t": "楼主有无原版PPT，图片看着有点糊'>'>'>"
      }
    ]
  },
