  "rose_0359": {
    "title": "艳瞎眼系列 · 火神岛 Vulcano",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b30d31dc4bdc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "买不到系列吗"
      },
      {
        "t": "科科家2019年推出 名字来自意大利西西里的一个火火山岛 - 火神岛Vulcano，而这个岛也就是用火神Vulcano命名的（传说人们觉得这里是火神的火炉）'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3eed97f6e6e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b3ae61f50dda.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "至于为啥取这个名字 这两张标准照上看的很贴切了：正是火山口喷薄而出的岩浆的颜色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_649892910482.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5174882adcb8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "科官方把这款描述为“直立但是株型丰满的HT，表现得一款F”，这不是说这是一款G，说明白一点就是这款HT的株型比较小，花量和复花速度接近F；特别注明株型紧凑，适合阳台盆栽香气 2花瓣数 4耐寒 3抗白 4抗黑 4抗锈 4植株70m*40cm花径7-8cm官方推荐应用：耐热、适合盆栽、适合切花另外科尔德斯的法国代理把这款标了耐半阴"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_062792be8393.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2019年推出以来已经获得：2020ADR华沙月季竞赛HT银奖捷克月季竞赛公众票选最美丽月季2019巴塞罗那月季竞赛最佳HT/G & 老年人特别奖 & 市民投票奖第一名比利时Courtrai月季竞赛金奖从奖项看这款火神岛有着非常好的气候适应性，无论是偏干冷的华沙、捷克还是全年温和多雨的Courtrai还是湿热的巴塞罗那都有出色表现在巴塞罗那得了73.28的超高分，湿热地区可以放心种了'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_32525a3eaf92.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_093b483b8423.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "RB上的评价，提到：- 勤花- 不怕热- 比吉洛的艾米利恩·吉洛花朵颜色更亮更饱和"
      },
      {
        "t": "- 花可以开到10cm- 一个花序可以有10朵花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3e9a410b51f2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "科的标准照"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_98d27bbe399b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f5c08ffed730.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "实际上 花型还会有一些变化："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5be5bc41b2ef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_692748ec0bc3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8efbad47027d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ef8c915de4df.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d914011912c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_469d9a9af9ea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这种直立紧凑的株型 群植效果非常好'>'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1732cdf95b07.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d57ddbb69c6f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "科官网用户的返图 盆栽效果很棒"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0e5a9cd4d92e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "FB一个网友的返图 颜色有变化"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9298ed925f46.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_13188bca59c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "总之呢 如果你不在意香气 科家这种得过很多奖的正经HT/F 看资料适合随便入就行了 总体水准非常高的'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0b6ccc0ac6a8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c4e7b6d29d61.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e27d8330e8f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d4bd4617b2a2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9bdcca761a2d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_373181b5e335.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个颜色能做到非常抗黑斑，已经是技艺高超了'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "适合盆栽好棒'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "伏尔甘？赫淮斯托斯？'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "这明艳的花取这名字第一时间让我想起了英格丽褒曼主演的电影火山边缘之恋，一搜好像真是取景地Stromboli Volcano，也满符合这部电影的气质"
      },
      {
        "t": "饱和度太高了，看的眼花。"
      },
      {
        "t": "塑料老头乐'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "买不到系列"
      },
      {
        "t": "神行者系列有阳光古董、焦糖古董、蜂蜜古董（其中有两个是芽变）、蓝色飓风神行者"
      },
      {
        "t": "色彩饱满，还有变化，加上紧凑的株型，加上耐阴属性，作为阳台党很有兴趣，不知道能不能买到，今天虹越的裸根都鸽了"
      },
      {
        "t": "科科家的这个色系已经严重饱和了，不过这株型我喜欢！"
      },
      {
        "t": "颜色亮瞎"
      },
      {
        "t": "可有店铺卖的？"
      },
      {
        "t": "单看照片已经是闪瞎眼了，想看实物"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0360": {
    "title": "花园公主玛丽-何塞 Gartenprinzessin Marie-José",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d25e070d4448.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_61f0035d6919.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ad184eafbbde.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这是科尔德斯“芳香”系列的一个品种，2016年德国上市，2018年通过ADR测评获得认证'>资料给的株型不大，高80cm*宽50cm，非常直立紧凑。最大特点应该就是它的5-6cm的中型包子花了，樱桃红中泛着银光，非常美丽，还有浓郁的水果香味。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1189bb0c76c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_04dd0563bc49.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce395d33f06d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a06664794932.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "官方资料香气 5/5花瓣数 3/5耐寒 4/5抗黑斑 4/5抗白粉 4/5主调非常甜美的树莓和红莓混合香气，带一点大黄的调，后调是广藿香和蔷薇；清晨和傍晚香气最强烈用作切花效果也很棒"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a4e3bbac706e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b927de80e67a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "下面是俄罗斯网友实际种植图 和宣传图没啥区别。花瓣背面的银色光泽真的特别吸引人，相信实物的花瓣质感更好看'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_47db476175f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fe0e9275f7a2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_17199a3f9a94.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c22d0925b30e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d26fded648c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "前排第一沙发"
      },
      {
        "t": "等花友的开花生活照"
      },
      {
        "t": "@下殿妖妖 @沈家园月季🌹 @惹噜啾咪厚🌳"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_92a08d01a706.jpg"
