        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_131a29cefd99.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Asagumo 朝云日本在上世纪也很喜欢用和平作为亲本，比如这款朝云：和平的影子非常明显"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e8e4569df265.jpg"
