      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eaea7ffc135f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "经历4次杂交的复杂过程得到的经典母本 [ George Dickson × Souvenir de Claudius Pernet] × [ Joanna Hill × Charles P. Kilham]父本 Margaret McGredy"
      },
      {
        "t": "马德里月季园这个测试中的新品种，十有八九和平也是直接亲本之一：宛如工笔画般的色彩"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9d126899f66e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花径12cm左右"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6cdea64bdb69.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "碧玺 Tourmaline乔治戴尔巴德1965年育成，1/4亲本是和平"
