      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ad3941075567.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Reine Marguerite d'Italie 意大利的玛格丽特王后1904年育成，继承了欧洲蔷薇的强烈百叶蔷薇香气，60-100cm灌木母本： HP Baron Nathaniel de Rothschild父本： Tea Madame la Princesse de Bessaraba de Brancovan"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d4d74864c32.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_07842809bb52.jpg"
