  "rose_0448": {
    "title": "替代哈迪-康斯坦茨的白色变种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_10c1aaef930a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cc507a17db6b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a191bb41736f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_380279e793cb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "哪怕拿出哈迪最美的照片对打，康也不算输"
      },
      {
        "t": "我康在印度也能开出非常美丽的花，请不要再诋毁我康不耐热了，它只是不耐开 谢谢"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cfcc6d1fcd23.jpg"
