        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a3ded7127dd2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "从左到右：伊夫伯爵本爵Yves Piaget，摩纳哥公主卡洛琳，小梅昂妻子Arsini，小梅昂"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd75ab9e9b9f.jpg"
      }
