        "t": "奥斯丁月季还是挺耐阴的 也有可能跟英国气候有关"
      },
      {
        "t": "哪里有卖根接夏夫人？"
      },
      {
        "t": "哎，说到耐荫品种一言难尽，开花是一直开，枝条太细弱了，尤其是秋日胭脂😂，我栽的就红苹果没问题，直立性复花性都不错。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0473": {
    "title": "Belle du Seigneur 老爷的美人及橙粉系HT",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁和吉洛有很多这个色系的shrub品种，这个贴就讲讲一些这个色系的HT大特写最合适HT"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_605ab144e35c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d755fa4446b4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e5282edb35f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴尔巴德的Belle du Seigneur 老爷的美人这个品种花型很舒展，开到后期也不卷边，橙色和粉色的渐变非常美丽"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d56616991465.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_988f14230262.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "平均花径11cm，春花轻松上15cm。同时她的花瓣非常厚实，抗晒耐雨淋。"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款还有个巨大的优点是株型，作为一款HT来说十分矮壮紧凑，叶片也茂密，所以整体效果比一般的HT好太多。成熟植株高60-80cm，宽50-60cm。这是我实拍，整株不超过50cm，开着15cm的大花："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_600f973311bc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8bc7b2dcde50.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "资料图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_28cebf71e951.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_83df932adbf2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "网上实际种植图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a216f8543be5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8359bb51d369.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_137bb642e79c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款长势强劲，抗病，花朵无论在植株上还是插瓶都能保持很久，复花性也好。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_760adf52eda7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6e4a325102dc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e8053a4be642.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "唯一可惜的是无香。"
      },
      {
        "t": "Märchenzauber 童话魔法科尔德斯2015年推出，2017年通过ADR认证，不用多说了吧。官方给的香气3/5，抗黑斑4/5，抗白粉4/5。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c6af5163602b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "美丽的法国蔷薇式古典橙粉色花朵，花径8-10cm成花序开放。水果强香。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3876f9c97661.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_736f6ba28c83.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_36db38ad58c5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "株型直立紧凑，100cm*60cm。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_995b57091d77.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_71048e811147.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花量非常大"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3a9323d6b1f3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f8de7e5737b3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5a521e05e5d2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_364cab10464c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Just Joey 乔杰伊入选世界月季荣誉殿堂的HT经典名作，母本是另一个经典——香云。极具艺术感的平均13cm浓香波浪褶边大花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b5e68c69f767.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_51b35566c8fd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7b7fc2e9f118.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1143a16a5130.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_93284e1b6cd3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "而且株型远强过一般的HT。这才是HT灌丛应有的样子："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9a727b98ce5e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "成熟植株75-120cm*120cm，虽然单头但也丰花花朵分布匀称"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_db1e057b2564.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "小苗也丰花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1d9ec1d5b15b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花可以非常大'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8839d167e581.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本款喜肥。各种抗性都不错。花朵持久。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2aa66b1a551d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_02c347509c90.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4c9fd6603634.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3127661687aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵开炸了也不难看，变成木槿花的样子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d76d9fbcb2dc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本款适合温暖地区，7b-10b种植。"
      },
      {
        "t": "再三张乔杰伊"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b3b216a89974.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_97145201d17f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b6a0af5690b1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Abbaye de Cluny 克吕尼修道院梅昂又继续用\"乔杰伊\"为母本得到了这款Romantica系列的杏色品种。平均花径11cm，生长季连续不断开花。温和香味或者无香。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ef2939a69c4d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这也是梅昂的一款切花，所以花朵持久度不会太差。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a574ff54abd6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_35b7d3fdd4c1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_212e4a61eacf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "株高75-100cm。强健，非常抗病。适合气候区7b及以南地区。花朵遇雨容易打不开。偏好温暖干燥环境。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c4486ac625bb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花可以开得非常大'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "Feeling 感情这款能不能引进啊 株型再丑也认了温和茶香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_33bbebc37bcc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6342c61a877f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bee33f15b98e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f90b6b3918d2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Apricot Candy 杏子糖果本款的1/4亲本是乔杰伊本款的花色特别有荧光感。温和到强烈的香料香。花径8-9cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ac7a830e0c55.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96c700bd772a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ed011bb8ded.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "虽然花径比起前几款略小，但本款多头开花，而且可以开出明显的羽毛边"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_45febbe43f2a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_858cd8b4934d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本款成熟植株株高1m5。耐热。非常抗白粉和黑斑。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b9f3cc687763.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "评论说这款的花可以维持1周以上，即使全开也不丑。耐极端高温。花可以开到13cm以上株型也很紧凑，比一般的HT好得多。耐寒。5a地区可以顺利越冬。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4e00bb246f69.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "在花园中运用效果非常好"
      },
      {
        "t": "About Face 回眸2003年美国Tom Carruth育成的名作。如同火焰一般的颜色。花瓣背面橙红，正面橙黄。平均花径10cm。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_454f3047f908.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7d02a46b57b4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf13a1b4aef7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "有温和到强烈的苹果香气"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_daf13ecd2001.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2b54c32ba736.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3479982dd9a9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "回眸 群开效果"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d8a7ce6375a2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_47816f011a45.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "单花也很精致>>>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7d007706fb8d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_255fca968a9e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Cremosa科尔德斯2018年推出，同年获得ADR认证"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d0c18c29b0d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5c44f77e0fcc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e72193ee5682.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花很美丽 可惜无香"
      },
      {
        "t": "有哪些引进了？"
      },
      {
        "t": "又进来给自己洗脑了，这次觉得杰乔伊可以"
      },
      {
        "t": "大溪地日落🌅怎么样"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0474": {
    "title": "Belle du Seigneur 老爷的美人及橙粉系HT",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "大特写最合适HT"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_610c9e075411.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2fa3f17b6d70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴尔巴德的Belle du Seigneur 老爷的美人这个品种花型很舒展，开到后期也不卷边，橙色和粉色的渐变非常美丽"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_35cffef0ad3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "平均花径11cm，春花轻松上15cm。同时她的花瓣非常厚实，抗晒耐雨淋。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4e76e5d43502.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_24e98ad2fbbd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ba803f46560d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款还有个巨大的优点是株型，作为一款HT来说十分矮壮紧凑，叶片也茂密，所以整体效果比一般的HT好太多。成熟植株高60-80cm，宽50-60cm。这是我实拍，整株不超过50cm，开着15cm的大花："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a06df7b608a0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3c854fa54880.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "资料图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6c230f40a964.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4b4526e008a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "网上实际种植图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1d23c8a0999d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_80d116ea8714.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款长势强劲，抗病，花朵无论在植株上还是插瓶都能保持很久，复花性也好。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f731b32cea0b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2d3a6211d9a4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "唯一可惜的是无香。"
      },
      {
        "t": "Märchenzauber 童话魔法科尔德斯2015年推出，2017年通过ADR认证，不用多说了吧。官方给的香气3/5，抗黑斑4/5，抗白粉4/5。"
      },
