      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9efc39d7e08e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a6bca9f04251.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶的Goethe Rose 歌德玫瑰/ Pure Poetry 纯粹诗意平均花径14cm，强烈的蜂蜜甜香。综合评价十分优秀的一款。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_26df5449edfd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55b5476caad8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b5c7741db35e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ec026476be7c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aa902fbe447d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_105aa01b2127.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂的粉和平 Pink Peace平均花径14cm，浓香。这个品种十分强健，香气好闻，非常抗黑斑和白粉。缺点株型太瘦高，高温下停止生长，花容易被强光晒焦。"
      },
      {
