  "rose_0483": {
    "title": "德系四美 （白-奶油色）",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "茴香酒夫人 Madame Anisette伊丽娜·邦达连科 Irina Bondarenko和平之光 Friedenslicht月神 Artemis"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_80668f0f971c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "茴香酒夫人 Madame Anisette宣传图 不知道国内为什么喜欢用一张特别丑的照片做宣传"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_94287f173ed2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_77253a355ea1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_27fa74857fa1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e380c54dbd0e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cb972b18b8be.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "关于这个品种，有两句丑话要说在前头：一是如果你不想要一个疯长到2m以上的绿怪物，请一定要给她一个全日照环境再强调一遍：6小时以上直射光的全日照环境（根据这些年来我的种植经验和其他花友的反馈，单纯的日照也没办法把它的株型压下去，尽可能少使用肥料会好一点）二是这款的香气比较怪异（也强调下，不是说难闻）正如她的名字，香气有很重的Anise调子。这个Anise虽然翻译成茴香，但和国内的八角茴香不是一回事，是欧洲常用的一种香料茴芹籽。味道是有些像八角，但是没那么冲，其实还挺好闻的。除了Anise，这款的香调里还有没药，老式蔷薇香，蜂蜜和肥皂的调子，所以第一次闻会有种非常怪异的感觉，要形容的话是比较醇厚的香气。除开这两点，她真的是极好的一款品种。特别花朵是现代品种里继承老式茶月季风韵最好的之一：（以下为科尔德斯宣传视频截图）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a0b9389c18cb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a1ffd954b2cd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_09562dc2f687.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1e0dcb345063.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "继续视频截图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d770749f0fcb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_78920b1320ea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_794c0fab18fe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "她还有个巨大的优点是整体株型。在充足光照下就是完美的G系花树，瘦高挺立，错落有致地点缀着花束：（以下为实拍）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_25721e95a1fa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_79ef0450ea49.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3a75cf525149.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6cad1a24a0eb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "款通过ADR测试，除此以外还获得15项国际大奖，包括今年的海牙月季竞赛金奖科尔德斯给了香气5/5 抗黑斑4/5 抗白粉4/5 实际反馈都是说基本不会生病另外有吧友说这款抗红蜘蛛，不管是不是真的，她的叶片本身很肥厚，蜡质层也非常厚，估计抗切叶蜂是最起码的"
      },
      {
        "t": "平均花径7-8cm成簇开放，春花如果疏蕾可以开到12-13cm。标准株型120cm*50cm。本款喜热，非常耐热，30度是适宜生长的气温，35度正常生长开花也没什么压力。澳洲花友说40度下暴晒叶片和花才出现灼伤。花朵一般不会因为淋雨打不开。实际种植图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_10cc20024a0a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_20f609ef747e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d1b8fb1a5f94.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花量非常大，整体效果出众"
      },
      {
        "t": "Irina Bondarenko 伊丽娜·邦达连科丹陶致敬同名乌克兰名模推出的HT切花品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4c6f5df4db8b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f991f0e44a3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1fafae431800.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_24318375470e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也先说缺点这款的缺点就是在德系里面显得比较娇气，丹陶给了耐寒1/3 抗黑斑2/4 抗白粉2/4 而且特别说明花园种植需要额外的照料才能有最佳效果，也就是要打预防性药和比较勤快的水肥管理"
      },
      {
        "t": "作为一款HT 单朵花美当然是最重要的她的平均花径有12-14cm，花瓣多，花型非常紧致，合适的条件下还有优雅的波浪边。花朵带强烈的蜂蜜水果甜香，丹陶香气给了5/5花朵比较耐雨，因为是切花品种，持久性也不错"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_39273e90bd31.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a0502a1e7ea0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_527f44c70ded.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5884fad1e646.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "株型什么的就是一般HT的样子，80-120cm*50cm。本种容易出脚芽。下面是实际种植图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e6ee51cfd2af.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "和平之光 Friedenslicht这款和上面的伊丽娜大头照非常像，但其实是花径6-8cm的丰花月季，实物差别还是很大的。虽然名字里带和平，但和梅昂的和平没有太多关系"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bb0c790fd458.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1970362adacc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_47245d744429.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_79286a52bd81.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "与Irina恰好相反，这是一款低维护的品种。丹陶给了：耐寒3/3抗黑斑 4/4抗白粉 4/4"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款2015年推出的品种因为其优秀品质已经获得了：2017年维也纳月季竞赛第二名2018年法国奥尔良月季竞赛银奖2018年意大利La Tacita国际月季新品竞赛灌木类金奖2018年捷克月季竞赛银奖"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5301ac55e7ff.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e4ac3bcdd763.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵有温和芳香，丹陶给了3/5花瓣质地非常强韧耐雨淋"
      },
      {
        "t": "株高120-150cm*50cm 略有横张趋势"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4bcc5b3cee87.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3bba95ce4bb8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "作为切花效果也很好"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8b414e6e4245.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c577fd6ae03c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_71e62dbe6b17.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7d388c4587b6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_53c0c41c2ba6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Artemis 月神特点刚开始外瓣泛绿"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2d9e065b9bc4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "还是从缺点开始：不适合福建两广，开花少，会变成绿巨人"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款有个特点就是非常爱出脚芽，很快就能长成一大丛花量非常可观"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5b61703d01e1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵抗晒且非常耐雨淋"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa44a80c55af.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5cb18a154219.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "美丽圆整的花型"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e430839a40c1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3011b710fe16.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b5b07e735bf7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶给了香气 2/5 温和的洋茴香香气抗黑斑 4/4抗白粉 4/4耐寒 3/3"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f2be12035e1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3e2059e7be49.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5b1ae5dc848f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5758a7295a10.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aa1cb61f9525.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "成熟植株非常勤花，基本花开不断花径4-6cm成簇开放株型120*50cm，长势很强2013年意大利La Tacita国际月季新品种竞赛灌木类金奖"
      },
      {
        "t": "茴香酒夫人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9b7c119ab2b8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5c5de398ba2a.jpg"
