        "t": "2019-12-06 13:46 #84: 守夜人20我的花园梦看来花瓣最少啊"
      },
      {
        "t": "，而且这品种似乎不是特别耐开，自洁性很好。颜色香味都不错"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-01-07 20:14 #90: 心野vv我的美少女，尖尖的花瓣很特色，耐热，长沙夏天花径变小点，能开好几天。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c7479f29bada.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-02-16 12:48 #94: 爱别離丶我也来贡献两张美少女，小苗头一年就这个花量了，可见优秀程度"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2ae22ccc92ae.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_583a462fc4c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2020-04-17 11:38 #98: 东观兰台我在室内又种了棵。近五个月没有打抗菌药。感觉这品种真的很健康，对光照要求也不咋高。室内种植也丝毫不减香气。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_19bbe4f47c4f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_27de8b6b4caf.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0485": {
    "title": "德系四美（暗红-紫红）",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一楼防吸"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_40cffc5c9074.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_670bf7a340b9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个色系品种不少，但是比较全面的好品种不多。老的暗红色HT比如林肯和梅昂爸爸长势和抗病有问题；奥斯丁那一系列，王子、莎士比亚2000、曼斯特伍德、福斯塔夫其他都不错，但是花太容易焦。戴尔巴德的四风之花很好，但香味不够浓，包括梅昂的一些深红色HT也是香味欠缺这次贴的这四个德系品种算是大花浓香抗病都兼顾了。因为这个颜色本身太吸热，35度高温和强光环境下花还是会焦边，这个就不能强求了。"
      },
      {
        "t": "Gräfin Diana 狄安娜伯爵夫人国内多译作“戴安娜伯爵夫人”，其实按德语发音是狄安娜。四款里最流行的一款，网上高清美图一大堆。花确实漂亮，特点是内外层花瓣明显的明度差异和外瓣发蓝的深紫调。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6ff9dd211b17.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f9c6bf2a99ed.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_177f65f3dc1c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_706794bb7c1d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_91f3d95027bb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce8c4d71caef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_10efdc07cf3e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_06dd05ffdbca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "收起回复"
      },
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯给她的评价是香气5/5抗黑斑 5/5抗白粉 5/5外加ADR认证，可以说是目前抗病最好的品种之一。香气不同于一般的暗红HT，科尔德斯给的描述是老式蔷薇香气里带接骨木、桃、李香调，花刚开时带柠檬、老鹳草、荔枝香气，接近凋谢时转为带蜂蜜调。我实际闻过这款，直观感觉是香气很特别，比单纯的大马士革调复杂很多，说不上来具体是什么味道，就像香水的感觉。浓，但不冲，比较收敛和偏清新的调子。株型方面就是一般的HT。后面四张是我的实拍，花型确实精致动人，花心视觉效果上特别明亮。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5a1276c39e2d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d86171bb0547.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4325af0778fa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f221683c4ade.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_539cb9b7a957.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8c55622a8b56.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_67cff708d174.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "至于高温强光下的表现，在同一条件下黑伍德的花糊成一团的情况下，本种的花焦边，但花型可以保持。下面是视频截图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_93afb57a02a9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_282d07c8e041.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f98a434b78b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8e5bb90b6e66.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ff6764f77025.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bbb74a5bb299.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6cf2443b0b9b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7b59dbafea12.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Soul 灵魂非常古典美的一款，古典花型，传统的老式蔷薇强香。丰花，株型也比较偏灌丛，不像一般的HT。ADR认证。2018年德国年度月季。丹陶给了她 香气 4/5 抗黑斑 4/4 抗白粉 4/4 的高度评价，并加了一句“能100%抵御真菌病害”，所以应该是他家抗病的扛把子品种了。花径8-10cm，多头群开，花量很大。株高100-150cm，宽40-60cm。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e72e4f7538e6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_af36c33339db.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_af1b5aaba9c9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ae974d77a6d9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c62044ba6419.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "下面是实际种植图 这款真的很美 完全可以和奥斯丁类似品种竞争然而缺点也是一样，高温强光下花会糊"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c1929a95b4e0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f2ff08b51665.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d763d8c3dc9e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dfc12c56b65c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "J. W. von Goethe Rose 歌德这款的花非常华丽丰满，花径达12-14cm，花瓣层层叠叠，排列整齐。蜂蜜、洋茴香调的强烈甜香。丹陶给的是香气 5/5抗黑斑 3/4（基本不会黑斑）抗白粉2/4（偶尔会白粉）株高100-120cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7846b50ebd5d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_986e072fef23.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf7a7cd7e230.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b1186af7205f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a00bb5300c37.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Admiral 海军上将12-14cm的华丽古典花型大花，暗红天鹅绒质感的花瓣。强烈的成熟梨子的甜香。株高80-120cm。比较新，2017年推出的品种。丹陶给的评价：香气 5/5抗黑斑 4/4抗白粉 3/4 （基本不会白粉）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5c881fb88a7e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b57759cad152.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_84a99b720ee9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个色系里我刚入了Tantau的福音gospel，主要是看到hmf上的honzaPM大神对它的评价很高：照片上的颜色有色差（红色花的通病），实物是非常暗的覆盆子色，有强烈的老玫瑰和莓果香气；耐日晒雨淋，有一定的耐阴性，花期长，能做切花。Tantau官网上给出的抗性没有灵魂soul高：香味 ★★★★☆黑斑 ★★★☆发霉 ★★☆☆福音也获了不少奖：Gold scent rose in Nagaoka/Japan 2013 ; Best scent rose in Rom / Italy 2013; Best TH Barcelona / Spain 2013;Golden Rose Geneva/Switzerland 2012"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c97c61903d1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7446578c571e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_be8dd16a0740.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4ccfd83e934f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "狄安娜伯爵夫人 FB用户图美翻天了'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ada9368c6c0e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_95318e6b9d2f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4ae75b4355f6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4cae495dcf7b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "一批灵魂的新图好心水 耐阴好的话今年收入绿化带'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd9071930ad9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7948624e8364.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4a7c3bc336bc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b75281dc351e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a536024631f1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_902df8df8938.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这四个我全有，外带黑伍德"
      },
      {
        "t": "是不是hy的暗夜芬芳，想买"
      },
      {
        "t": "狄安娜瓶插不持久……抗病无敌"
      },
      {
        "t": "等一手海军上将的测评，纠结狄安娜和海军上将，位置不够入苗越来越谨慎了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0b04327c8b8e.jpg"
