      },
      {
        "t": "Soul 灵魂非常古典美的一款，古典花型，传统的老式蔷薇强香。丰花，株型也比较偏灌丛，不像一般的HT。ADR认证。2018年德国年度月季。丹陶给了她 香气 4/5 抗黑斑 4/4 抗白粉 4/4 的高度评价，并加了一句“能100%抵御真菌病害”，所以应该是他家抗病的扛把子品种了。花径8-10cm，多头群开，花量很大。株高100-150cm，宽40-60cm。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_37dbf495a52d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_136a4d3db10a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_376f47444ff2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f33b8b8e2544.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ffe35bba8880.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "下面是实际种植图 这款真的很美 完全可以和奥斯丁类似品种竞争然而缺点也是一样，高温强光下花会糊"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c8d575636cd9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e122bc38370f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e07dcebe9837.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_34d83092cc53.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_027ccc56123a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6255fa228ff4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "J. W. von Goethe Rose 歌德这款的花非常华丽丰满，花径达12-14cm，花瓣层层叠叠，排列整齐。蜂蜜、洋茴香调的强烈甜香。丹陶给的是香气 5/5抗黑斑 3/4（基本不会黑斑）抗白粉2/4（偶尔会白粉）株高100-120cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0aff20f0440a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b1b37f132f1d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_694d6224ff79.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0a02b10b9708.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_893d884ce688.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Admiral 海军上将12-14cm的华丽古典花型大花，暗红天鹅绒质感的花瓣。强烈的成熟梨子的甜香。株高80-120cm。比较新，2017年推出的品种。丹陶给的评价：香气 5/5抗黑斑 4/4抗白粉 3/4 （基本不会白粉）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_17a259e28edf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c41ee2e04fcc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1c3c95c42e8a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "漂亮漂亮"
      },
      {
        "t": "哪种最抗灰霉呢？我的地方8区低温，湿度大，灰霉是最常见的问题。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0487": {
    "title": "拒绝黑斑——明黄三美",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "烛光晴空黄金城堡想要一个不生病的明黄系并不难"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a9f65a8e214a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cbb240f18eb0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "原帖是明黄四美，但是其中的国际大赦，因为德不配位已经被除名，各种原因上的德不配位。"
      },
      {
        "t": "其实选黄色系品种比起挑花眼的粉色系简单太多了，因为大多数品种都因为异味蔷薇基因的关系是弱鸡，没几个能打的'>烛光 Candlelight我经常说这款除了不怎么耐寒外没有缺点，如果你喜欢HT，这款就是完美的品种平均14cm的大花，十分耐热耐开，在八月份的浙江可以在枝头挂两周，光这点就吊打一片了吧"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dc0bf359d3d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03fe52eb250b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b81afdbf6f14.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2898c3c4ddbd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这么大的古典花型真的很少"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ecab567a3f5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶给的评价是香气 4/5抗黑斑3/4抗白粉3/4根据多方的反馈，这款正常情况下基本不会生病，黑斑白粉都没有。花瓣厚实抗晒，下雨也不会打不开。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ced2ce5002c4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_56fc80a331c0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dfadf1bd2e18.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "就是耐寒方面丹陶只给了 1/3 冬季最低温低于零下10度的地区要慎重，更南的地方就无压力了下面是网友实际种植图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_69692893dff7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "可以看到叶片十分健康 株型也还可以"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_529fb88ed1e7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_122146d792b7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_70c496b55871.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0bb66f1c4469.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e3466ae2069b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Sunny Sky 晴空科尔德斯出品+ADR认证+法国园艺协会大奖，品质不用多说了吧科尔德斯给了 香气 3/5 抗黑斑4/5 抗白粉4/5"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fdef080ec657.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "典型的HT花型展开后有优雅的波浪裙一般的花边，花径8-10cm中度的杏、梨、桃、柠檬、苹果混合果香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e4ebd47a5f4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ed50761aec8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c95ba876b852.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dfefd38348fe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b33f996c2675.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e518c53f0a94.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "120cm*60cm瘦高紧凑的HT株型以下为实际种植图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d52f7b9c548e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵耐雨而且不易褪色，开翻也不会露心"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_27f01eb9b0de.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ae0c73c61994.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8416f1412609.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6fb8f1890fb0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d492c6743990.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Château de Cheverny 黄金城堡如果你想要一款丰花月季，供庭院造景或者地被运用，我觉得这款就是终极选择。2016年推出的品种，已经获得ADR认证+法国园艺协会最高奖+N个月季协会大奖，包括芳香奖这款浓香，花径6cm左右成花序开放，非常丰花，可以开到不见叶子那种。单花花型精致，花朵耐雨。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_860ab2e5f448.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c843e02529f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "花朵花期过后自然掉落 不需要人为去残花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01bb0b8e680e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "叶片不怕霜冻，估计在江南地区可以保持四季常绿 适合地被总之，这是款不用管的月季"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e379cf8e2efa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "关于它的株型，我看到的资料不太统一，但可以确定基本上成熟植株是1m*1m往上，分枝多而且有横张趋势但官方说这款也很适合盆栽，估计拿个大盆加上修剪可以修成圆蓬蓬的一丛吧下面是实际种植图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_93103017ae35.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ddef1922d40.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c228f3d6f2cb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73227415a46a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "继续实际种植图目前看到这款唯一的负面评论是高温下花不持久，两三天就谢"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_76e28140b980.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6eaa9b7794d6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a0cec7bccb39.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a6a86f18d276.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "番外如果你追求浓香的话，推荐这个Souvenir de Marcel Proust 追忆普鲁斯特这款是戴尔巴德官方认为的他家最香品种，也就是比什么娜荷马、花宫娜、莫利纳、蓬巴杜之类都要香'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f359cfad73ad.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6c43ffc105b7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "据某位广东花友说这款在他家各方面表现都不错，浓香从开一直保持到谢，香型雅致。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4c0d7e5138ce.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_045e7cdc75f2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "最后我觉得柠檬娜这个品种完全可以入选明黄四美，柠檬娜 Limona https://tieba.baidu.com/p/9007384655全世界三款通过ADR测试的黄色系HT之一"
      },
      {
        "t": "不错不错"
      }
    ]
  },
