  "rose_0493": {
    "title": "月季的牡丹芍药模仿秀",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一大波粉红色警告"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e066d75d85c2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8171d8aef11b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "找图累死了，评论之后慢慢补，先把图发完先来个猜猜看热身：哪张是月季The Ingenious Mr. Fairchild，哪张是芍药Sarah Bernhardt ？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e640ddcf12cc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的 The Ingenious Mr. Fairchild 机灵的菲尔柴尔德先生"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e3aa32798b25.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d0754bd0aee.jpg"
      },
      {
