      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_10f3a19c0bd5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f0d76bd5b94e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f0b0b0a7776f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b0d05358123c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款非常抗病，12-14cm大花，小花序开花，浓香，开花很勤。但是枝干太细，支撑不了那么大和重的花序，需要额外支撑，不然就伏地。当然，奥斯丁系的通病还是有的。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f5f910194750.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4f483e40a461.jpg"
