      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_76fc98e01c8b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "月季女伯爵玛丽·昂丽叶特ADR认证。花型丰满圆润不张扬，香气非常出色。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_459a9654ac04.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e63e18a2f227.jpg"
