      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bda5c062a751.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_53ca5345271a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9877dacf231c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e39347fb502f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "狄安娜伯爵夫人ADR认证"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0daee911bb54.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_858608f2a4c7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_78cd8b44bce4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73db28f9bbbd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_30771a3889cd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ac341c17910.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_883274d54314.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa98ed064d97.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Kiss Me Kate 吻我，凯特这个系列里的小藤。古典花型。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9139600f8354.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e2ded3f9e3ce.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c2b7c427ceac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8d1c76aa2e9b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_47457414807b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_190b2bb7a6b2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "然后我找到了一个戴尔巴德2018年新品Henri Delbard 亨利·戴尔巴德的业余花友种植视频。从视频里看这个品种很丰花，一丛开了十几朵。官方资料写的这个品种芒果、柑橘、蔷薇、青草混合强香并且花十分持久，瓶插寿命可以十几天。植株强健，十分抗病。视频里可能植株光照不够，与宣传照的类似日落的明亮橙色不同，是类似于“和平”的配色：初开典型的HT高心花型"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce4f032aac03.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "打开后古典式展平，花心螺旋扭曲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d13259ef7a4a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "最后开成类似万寿菊的样子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c67067f09a5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "然后是前阵子刚颁奖的2019年法国里昂月季竞赛结果Andre Eve的Azay Le Rideau获得最高奖"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_75ba18dd4f21.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个品种也参加了今年的罗马月季竞赛并且获得了丰花月季类第一名。我看到了实物，花型像Madame Hardy，白的非常纯净，加上墨绿色叶片，更显得花朵在发光"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f319cde5685.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fe483698c512.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f05a9776ac5b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4883f6255ea1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2019年里昂月季竞赛芳香奖戴尔巴德未命名新品值得关注，怀疑这个新品是和索菲·罗莎同一批亲本，同样的锯齿边和牡丹花型，就是换了黄色带粉色条纹"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96b8b9306e33.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "里昂的记者投票选择奖科尔德斯的Peach Melba这个品种在今年罗马获得藤本类第一名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8e30c5f4689e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "里昂的观众选择奖Reuter 的未命名新品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_22367d325b3f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "香缇别苑宣传图高清版&发布会实拍图株型和花型可以看得更清楚一些了'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d4d087ab31ca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_87be2d4fb3c7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b7aca801eac8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6e9910d4dc7d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "某越来吧"
      },
      {
        "t": "主楼图一有老品种的风采"
      },
      {
        "t": "'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "来了来了"
      },
      {
        "t": "茴香酒确实漂亮"
      },
      {
        "t": "这四个我都好喜欢"
