        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ab309b339cb7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9c4295d77699.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我只拥有5了，其实我还想过要4的。但太大个子了，我家个子大的太多"
