  "rose_0616": {
    "title": "2019年新获德国ADR认证品种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "来奥斯丁也送品种去测试的，但迄今为止全军覆没，一个都没拿到ADR去年一共12个品种顺利通过了为期3年的ADR测试，其中11个已经上市或者准备投放市场。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_07e82a07697c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_796066819ea3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8e0b2a229815.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Domaine de Chantilly 香缇别苑（玫瑰香橙）戴尔巴德官网没有骗人，这款真通过了。马德里芳香奖+ADR+戴尔巴德官方给的\"杰出\"抗病评价，这款的综合品质无疑是同色系里的翘楚和很多同色系品种一样，气温高时偏橙黄，花瓣减少"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_acd8bc7a8e2d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_af2ee6d10f98.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "气温低时偏粉红，花瓣变得非常多"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9933fbd3903d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c5d94134b06.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_543a1436449e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_81a0a12c48a4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "感受下花的大小"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_baa78beaa4a5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4157c0d12819.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ebe929a78f93.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "你以为这是好几枝拼成的一束花？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f43c63533738.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5bf813bba3be.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9bee6f667a74.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其实只是一枝花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9f79fbcbc18d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f04efe161153.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本楼的图大多来自泰国山区某个花商的FB，所以这款肯定不用春化；至于耐高温程度倒不一定，据我所知泰国山区也有很凉爽的地方。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9a59b9172d5a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Maxim 美心丹陶的Nostalgic Rose系列，不知为何没引进国内中等香气，银背+法国蔷薇花型株型比较横张，80-100cm*90-110cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_569880dc78a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_93fc5093f48e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cbf74758046a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a14eabe9f5a0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_615dfc810c70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4c1eb9da2bbb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_76b17858aa43.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0c6746d1d119.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Lilac Wine 丁香色美酒来自英国的Dickson。ADR的图没拍好，颜色应该更接近下面官方图的丁香色。中等香气F系大型灌木，150-170cm*110-130cm花朵颇有回忆马美逊的风韵"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ac4e67230364.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_375c292b9451.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3d923defc76f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_48e90fad4fb1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_70c1f4559f4b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Freifrau Caroline 男爵夫人卡洛琳来自科尔德斯https://tieba.baidu.com/p/7051127806之前在这贴里已经详细介绍"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a44df109df24.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Divina 圣女丹陶准备2021年上市的新品2.5m*1.2m小型藤本这款应该非常香，ADR给的香气等级比香缇别苑还高"
      },
      {
        "t": "Peach Melba 蜜桃梅尔巴科尔德斯的250-270cm*70-90cm小藤，也是去年的罗马月季竞赛藤本大奖得主香气ADR给的淡香，但我在罗马实际闻还是有挺明显的桃子味"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0427d78702af.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Moscalbo来自Davide della Libera，看名字是意大利人。210-230cm*120-140cm小型藤本。淡香。"
      },
      {
        "t": "剩下四个就是科尔德斯的常规无聊的无香F系"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ae982e85225f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b3f758266d3c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_77332cc5cd01.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0c91683d0bb0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Almost 50 rose novelties from the breeders Austin, Dalla Libera, Delbard, Dickson, Freyer, König, Kordes, Meilland, Nirp, Noack, Poulsen, Tantau have been tested for three years at ten locations for resistance and garden value. The coveted ADR quality label was awarded to twelve varieties in 2019 (one will be named later) due to its excellent variety characteristics. The impact of the last two dry years on plant development was discussed in detail. Compared to other plants, the drought had no negative effects on the strength of the growth and flowering. The upcoming ADR test years are also very diverse and thriving and interest in the ADR is still very high at home and abroad.这次ADR测试的三年里后两年气候干旱，而50个参加测试新品种里选出的这12个品种长势和开花都没有受干旱气候的明显影响。"
      },
      {
        "t": "那个网站上还有前两年刚通过ADR品种的高清图 发一些上来科尔德斯的花园公主玛丽-何塞"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2770d2520978.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2018年通过ADR测试科尔德斯的Summer of Love 恋夏2018届"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96353d7a78ce.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯的Carmen Würth 卡门·沃尔斯2018届"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b56ceb302c00.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶的Desirée2018届丹陶对这款评价超高 但我觉得相比植株花太小了 所以一直懒得介绍"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a745ac8e2c5e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Michel Adam的Anastacia 安娜斯塔西娅2017届"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5b372d714e21.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0617": {
    "title": "2019年第77届罗马国际月季新品竞赛及市立月季园品种合集",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bf31e464d827.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55e40a275426.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "'>'>有花看"
      },
      {
        "t": "HT类第一名 梅昂未定名新品梅昂居然育成了这么个完全古典花型+完全现代枝叶的奇葩品种……倒不是不美，就是怪怪的。怀疑这个品种亲本是莉娜雷诺，株型和香气都特别接近。花10cm，打开后是一个非常平的饼，最经典的法国蔷薇花型该品种相对梅昂过去所谓的古典花型品种（皇家胭脂、夏琳等）有个突破，就是花瓣很柔软，光看花的话是真正的古典气质，没有丝毫现代HT的感觉，非常棒。强香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2471c25cab57.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bce31b659178.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "HT类第二名 丹麦Poulsen的Odelia因为只有一棵而且花快没了 只拍了一张，没看出特别之处来。花淡香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4a95031c0dcd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "HT类第三名 法国Richardier未命名新品种花型看着怪怪的。淡香。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a35e4a314aed.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "F类第二名 荷兰Interplant未定名新品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a78dc92fbecd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "F类第三名 科尔德斯 Medeor淡香HY远期有这个"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d9bfb653244f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "现在HT的潮流也是要多头开放 F系也越来越追求花型精致 两个系之间的区别越来越小了 更何况还有G系这个本来就不够清楚的系"
      },
      {
        "t": "景观类第一名 科尔德斯未命名新品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9405d3554d8c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "藤本类第一名 科尔德斯的Peach Melba 蜜桃梅尔巴/蜜桃冰淇淋非常好闻的中度桃子香气"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9b12d936f611.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "A Chacun son Everest 非常华丽的洒锦大藤"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a80f2018f6dd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a55294e43dea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b0220dfe3611.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_592c735d3103.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_df319d3f6ec5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "特别喜欢的一个未命名新品 在我看来花型花色香气植株叶片健康都很出色 就是株型有些乱"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6aa27ceca2a5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_440828636286.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_18c22b613c9a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的Charity 居然是强烈的荷花香味 很好闻"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_18487eeb4ff5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4d45f126a4a3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "法国2017年育成的新品The Pride 荣耀2017年罗马月季竞赛芳香奖得主这个品种是我见过的最接近蓝色的品种 在阳光下真的会闪现一种淡蓝色的光彩 照片拍不出来我尽量用后期还原了 到凋谢还是包的状态 不会开散 浓香但是香型我不是很喜欢"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a80deb73414e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b589affc4cbe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4ba83f30cdac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a5aa0c8fb1a6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5ddc932f297e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c6d54d944e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "科尔德斯2013年育成的Madame Anisette 茴香酒夫人目前欧洲的育种趋势标准应该就是这样了高大 健康 群花 花型精致 还有香味 说真的光看叶子我都会爱上本种通过ADR测试 抗性毋庸置疑"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01d26d42fd72.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a29da6ac5fb4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0a3b5ba116c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d971b13ce3e7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂2012年育成的Meirocades 浓香 花径12cm左右"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e8af41cc236b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3392bb2fd037.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0c02de86822a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_231c7642a2fb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹麦Poulsen2009年育成的Stockholm这个也是得奖大户因为参赛品种重剪过 像这些F系长得都很矮 所以我没有弯腰下来闻香气怎么样"
      },
      {
        "t": "某F系未命名新品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_83e791ceae2e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5e4df758e28f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "一款藤本古老月季"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bbb7ef74fc9c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_689147cb0862.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "古老月季Cécile Brünner 塞西尔·布吕耐"
      },
      {
        "t": "詹姆斯高威"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa7795edf67f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "爱尔兰育种家Kenny 2008年育成的Carmel Naughton这个花型和花色让我想起某种重瓣水仙"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_22734458edb6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5c37a2c8b9ec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_95d4c7ed8f15.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_622f94107c46.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "另一款很棒的G系 Trésor du Jardin 花园宝藏 很像茴香酒夫人 但是香味更浓一些也更好闻法国Adam 2016年育成的新品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b1328557aec7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8db340cfac9a.jpg"
      },
