      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_07334f92d67d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_06e31d0d5923.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹麦Paulsen 2008年的作品 LeaF系就是Poulsen搞出来的 现在还在孜孜不倦的开发F系品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_85678768a516.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "未命名新品花瓣背面的银光和圆润的花型都很美"
