        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4370ab997e90.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce8ab0caeea8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "玫昂爸爸金禧非常好 玫昂官方的照片没拍出来它的美 香气我觉得就是经典大马士革 虽然官方不这么认为小雨对花基本没影响 除了花瓣积水会把花梗压弯"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e2dbfadbfa1b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a8437fc5c721.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b2acf4ff5962.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "株型作为ht来说也不错 也不是很高 1m左右"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_160f05990832.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5886ea7fca75.jpg"
      },
