      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_392ff61228db.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "比弗利非常推荐 株型好 健康 花非常大 而且不会翻香气不算最浓 但是好闻 这次闻出来了官方写的草木和牡丹的味道'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3b306ed64687.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c8055e3fcec7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_17bff4ce19bc.jpg"
