      },
      {
        "t": "新西兰2'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fc94e9f17144.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "园丁安德雷3"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ecd891ff6533.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "园艺王子4非常轻微的病征"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4c9f36f2b80e.jpg"
