        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b128289977fb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥古斯塔·露易丝2'> 大量黑斑落叶好像她只有在丹陶本部才抗病"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_94592ae69534.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "库柏重瓣白5 完全不生病"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b4aa581a8588.jpg"
