  "rose_0687": {
    "title": "奥系品种庭院应用的又一重大缺陷·巴塞罗那月季园11_16日观察",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "那就是招叶蜂加上黑斑问题 没有人愿意在11月提前看一堆光杆"
      },
      {
        "t": "一个极端例子 保罗·奈龙 几乎全光黑斑掉叶子是整片叶子都掉，而这里你可以看到还有很多叶梗残留，那是被叶蜂吃的"
      },
      {
        "t": "另一个极端 因为黑斑光杆的费加罗夫人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f3830124d86a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "含奥的夏琳 被叶蜂严重攻击"
      },
      {
        "t": "同样是玫昂 看看同一地方不含奥的冷香（图1）、玫昂爸爸金禧（图2-4）、委拉斯凯兹（图5）、园丁安德雷（图6）、艾丽（图7），没一个惨成夏琳这样的"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1c3669d52cf2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_65750fa19750.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_40b1e9b35348.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e4ed1509841d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "叶峰真的看品种，其他品种都一半一半，布拉瑟和艾弗的玫瑰就少很多，蓝莓蛋糕惨不忍睹。"
      },
      {
        "t": "不含奥的园艺王子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_384b427935ac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "再来看科含奥的尘世天使和夏日韵事 看样子还行 老叶还在 只是新叶被叶蜂吃了一些 但是和下一楼对比你会发现长势明显受到影响"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_14817c2de63e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "看看不含奥的科：丑货（图1-2）、比弗利（图3）长得高大威猛"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f631217e35ca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7617c06bb15b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3d44d2058dea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "当然 凡事都有例外 在国内不可一世的茴香婆也招架不住这里的叶蜂（图1）珍妮·莫罗（图2）也不行两个都不含奥"
      },
      {
        "t": "那是要把夏琳退了吗"
      },
      {
        "t": "但总的来说，还是那句话：别靠近奥奥，会带来不幸"
      },
      {
        "t": "不含奥的巴登巴登回忆（图1）、巴尔扎克（图2）、麦卡尼之花（图3）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_32ee99beace8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_edb5c0100339.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "不过好像还没有哪家育种公司标注品种是否招虫，他们可能不太在意这些吧"
      },
      {
        "t": "其它一些现代品种长久之爱 在这里的HT里真的算不错的了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ee14880c01ec.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "另外几棵麦卡尼之花（注意和两边的对比）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_79ed1067ee0f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4d776d059c79.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a1b77ae96133.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03ab21e68f65.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "冰山宝宝和还珠格格"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b72df0a5c462.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "忆路易·阿玛德是这里少数长得很好的戴尔巴德品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd993d148598.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "心之雕刻"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0ac7a9d2d323.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "很淋的冰峰"
      },
      {
        "t": "黑斑缠身的尚多思美人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b109f19478ae.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "蒙特贝洛公爵夫人和Constance Spry 一脉相承的黑斑"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ee6817a90d95.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "香槟美酒"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d6bf36a861e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "男爵夫人卡洛琳"
      },
      {
        "t": "一个老品种F 象牙时尚 意外的不错"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e4673a95903b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "冰山 开花性确实没得说"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a06cca1eb74d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "那么 真正的低维护庭院月季现在是什么样呢？看看这些茶和含茶量高的china和波旁就知道了马美逊的回忆"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2586e6394abb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "马美逊的回忆芽变品种 Souvenir de St. Anne’s"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4e71f8d1d387.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_095ecde2c428.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ca8f0c34b20a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_95c7c5d81195.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "凯拉伯爵夫人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_484dd18f2640.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7d689057cd77.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6270ae4c22f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "剩下的茶不打名字了 有兴趣的自己看标牌"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_751a5e1fab57.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dcd4cc1a63d4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0cdb213ec87a.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0688": {
    "title": "弗洛伦萨市立月季园部分品种集",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "现在有些早，只拍了开花的部分品种以及我比较熟的品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5945457d9e18.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_72a348b9e697.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "几点感想：经典HT的株型实在是丑死了，在老式花园月季和奥斯丁庭院月季衬托下简直没法看易感白粉病的基因可以确定来源于中国月季，所有出现白粉的品种全部带中国月季血统，最严重的就是月月红/月月粉/蝴蝶/绿萼这几个原种。所有不带中国月季血统的全部无白粉。就连比较老的茶香月季（理论上是巨花蔷薇*中国月季）也没有白粉。"
      },
      {
        "t": "Souvenir de la Malmaison 马美逊的回忆闻了这个品种的香味后，我泣血推荐。太好闻了！！！！！非常诱惑性的甜香，不是资料上的茶香，也不是大马士革香。花苞圆滚滚的，非常可爱，株型也和谐。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cb6827e2eed7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e3bdba6775f9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_81fc046631ff.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aa9ef4ebb64b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7d96847332aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_213b7fb21494.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c6687f642d70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "月月粉 这个季节已经繁花一片了 不愧是开花机器"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_71756a320ec9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b182e690272d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "疑似某中国月季变种 一开始以为是蝴蝶月季 但花朵不变色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a38fff120271.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_571fd1ff1cbb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_65c1d0ee4e26.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_abf93d8a53dd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "某老茶香月季 疑似希灵顿夫人就连老式的茶香月季株型也比HT好看一万倍，哎。叶片也漂亮。本种有温和茶香，带苹果香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_962e8b62a581.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_36af5d6f64c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f95c1e094fb1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a4f5f01144be.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ef7cdb1848bc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "蝴蝶月季，近看全是白粉"
      },
      {
        "t": "丑丑的绿萼，也白粉中"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_91f94a12e926.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Paul’s Himalaya 保罗的喜马拉雅蔷薇杂交麝香蔷薇。实际效果太雅致了！！和现代藤本完全不同的气质。花香味很特别。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9a54fbdd84fe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_322bec6461ef.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1320d7cd3ea4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Belle lyonnaise 里昂美人前阵子好像在HP那贴里介绍过这款，资料是灌木，但这里变成了藤本。花很美。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3dbce7adedcb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "疑似藤法兰西，香气花型非常接近，但枝叶和我印象里的灌木版有些不一样。"
      },
      {
        "t": "一片HT"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bd65aa920d40.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "某欧洲蔷薇 看样子像Alba"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_476669f6cfc8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "再看看HT这种高脚鸡株型 真是无力吐槽"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的遗产 株型非常棒"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_92a6d9a81456.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_85b3c1572393.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Sally Holmes 萨莉福尔摩斯吐血推荐，株型优美，叶片超级健康，花淡香，花苞超级多。没开花就爱上了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_46f9c08d0b11.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9093092c192f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd9944e8180c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的康斯坦丝·斯普莱，花苞超级多，非常健康，长势超强"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_90c375717742.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e7d8ebe98fe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "因为园子里也有大马士革，对比了下Rugosa的香气确实有点冲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_931d65817f5d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "New Dawn 粉云长势很强，但我发现了黑斑。也许这款抗病也并不是传说那么强。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bf64205e40d1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "开得正好的黄木香 可惜香气没了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a396533b9cf5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f85524db32dc.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "貌似前阵子介绍这个，雪山蔷薇？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3cf879dc9c13.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_05ef5e5bf6a2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Katherine Harrop 凯瑟琳哈洛普波旁。BBC纪录片里这款是藤本，但这里是灌木，而且好像发育不良。记得纪录片里花比这个更大。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7715b188c175.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "补几张马美逊回忆"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dee73b61f5d4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bd9900319cfb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a15e5f71e0ab.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Conrad F. Meyer 留意看了下刺确实多"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_49c54fad4c96.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96bb3d70b83a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这棵红色单瓣中国月季整体还是不错的"
      },
      {
        "t": "保罗的喜马拉雅"
      },
      {
        "t": "另一个园子里这棵茶香系的藤 看着和丽江之路很像但又有些区别（基本确定为Souvenir de Madame Leonie Viennot, 葡萄牙美人的母本"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_12d1e66f2cc7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cc0509678d98.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e25614e84194.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96baf87746f0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Jaune Desprez 黄铜芙蓉"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a5d353ac5e70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_68a2fdc89daf.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "疑似Madame Alfred Carrière 阿尔弗雷德·卡利叶夫人"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f2c4a0683a05.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_010a2fed43e2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "大马士革"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0689": {
    "title": "德国月季协会2022年度月季出炉",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "丹陶又赢了"
      },
      {
        "t": "往届复习：德国月季协会年度月季评选 如镇楼 今年获得德国年度月季的是四季多米诺这款继获得巴登巴登最高奖（金月季）后又获得年度月季 可见德国业界对其厚爱"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8f03d450f53c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9b8096e00c0a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e43a3303ca2e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d8984fbca024.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1cefb543695a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "本届陪跑的提名者有：奥奥 博斯克贝尔"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cba19bd2cf95.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dec8dadb09ba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴戴 香缇别苑"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_794c0f57dc1f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fba49211bdf8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_18853a6d5c86.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "尼尼 流行歌星"
      },
      {
