      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b9d05fb668d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Princesse de Monaco 摩纳哥王妃2/5"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1c54fbea9005.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_befef91fc539.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Jubilee du Prince de Monaco 摩纳哥亲王金禧2/5"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8ee30694886f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Queen of Sweden 瑞典王后这品种没啥病，但每次去看它都半死不活稀稀拉拉的3/5Queen Anne 安妮女王2/5 这款种在比较荫蔽的地方 可能受影响了"
