        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7c921303dca9.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6a0d980c2578.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Harlow Carr3/5Baie des Anges 天使湾真的要再吹一把Barni的这个品种，不光耐热，浓香，多头，大花，花型漂亮，抗病性在这时候也见真章了5/5"
