        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_959a29d24946.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3883c5c3868a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5ba0afa58191.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f58f28a74226.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "玫昂家真优秀！"
      },
      {
        "t": "下面是本次全场最佳 甜蜜喜悦抗病在这里可以打满分了 只有极少数叶片有点黑斑香气非常好闻长势极强'> 大花序开花'>'> 这时候花开到了快10cm'>'>'>第一张图前面是老ht里已经很拿得出手的英格丽·褒曼 可以看看这鲜明的对比"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_044080467989.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_97cd96df0165.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2826b7be9d38.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1100a637e7af.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6b961749b282.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8461db4bb8c3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3561c52176df.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丑货抗病Slay（和旁边对比）还开了朵不错的花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5d06f67c7daa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "密密麻麻一片的晴空 就是没有花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fad179c5014e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "玫昂小姐能在重剪摧残下长这么大也不容易"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5c011957d97f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2b818673fc41.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "漏了个奥奥云雀高飞一朵花都没有 章鱼枝倒是很多"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_53588cb3ee2c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴的小王子和花宫娜花宫娜在这里黑斑有点多"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6f205ca4a88f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_32a7ded83fad.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥奥最大的贡献看来就是托马斯格拉汉姆托马斯，还有复古的理念，整体比不过那些百年老店"
      },
      {
        "t": "竞赛区的蓝莓蛋糕抗病满分 但是可以看到戴的品种缺水缺肥花的质量就很受影响"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3efd97125cea.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e52d6a08cbfe.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7aeaba8ab211.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f39f3c82def3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_dd76ff76952a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8484f18c7234.jpg"
