        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4125a94934e2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5fd2c5c32404.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_18b06f724d73.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2013年大花灌木类大奖 Anastasia 安娜斯塔西娅法国Michel Adam培育。经典HT花型，白色带奶油色晕和水红色边，强柠檬调果香，非常抗病。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce341b54e28e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2eaa2d5c0ce2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf5967f6277c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2013年丰花灌木类大奖 Larissa 拉丽莎来自德国科尔德斯。老式花型，花朵中等大小，残花自洁性好，抗病，抗锈病，非常抗黑斑。可惜无香。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bba3965a7c0d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3d520b99b14e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a0928f81bfb8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b684fdf8d715.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2014年这年特别红红火火，各国育种家齐齐上榜"
      },
      {
        "t": "所有类别最高奖 Icecap 冰冠梅昂/William Radler（美国）联合推出，堪称花型更精致的冰山。高70-80cm，株型紧凑，丰花，从春到深秋结冰花开不停。强抗病。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4007d2e255d1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_00432fb1b4c2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8a6c39d870eb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2014年大花灌木类大奖 Sunny Sky 晴空来自德国科尔德斯。清淡果香，丰花，复花快，强抗病，非常抗黑斑。株高70cm。初开经典HT花型，后期花瓣波浪边明显，形成球形花。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b9df42edd38c.jpg"
