      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fe5a112925ac.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b33f996c2675.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2014年丰花灌木类大奖 Novalis 诺瓦利斯再次来自德国科尔德斯。这款国内种的人蛮多的，不多说了。也通过了ADR认证，综合品质没得说。温和果香，不适合温暖气候，半荫庇环境下色彩最佳。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f400a89cdc7e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_af4a5a43d704.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fc4360988b14.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ecccbfb25863.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2014年庭院景观类大奖 Kew Gardens 邱园来自大卫·奥斯丁。杂交麝香蔷薇，无刺，株高150cm以内，从夏初一直开到秋末。抗病性极好，植株活力非常强。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ce1cab163a77.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_35b05d3036eb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e860d835b42d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2014年藤本类大奖 Invictus/Camelot 战无不胜/卡梅罗来自德国丹陶公司。名字很霸气。250-300cm中型藤本，平均花径7-8cm，丰花，花型类似茶花，花瓣粉红撒锦，强柠檬果香。长势强劲，极其抗病，极抗黑斑，极抗锈病。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_281b3b5d4955.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a19a080e8b31.jpg"
