        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1e81ce579886.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9202b4a735ca.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_55362fa9da5a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_13a101f06209.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b488775b8a17.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2015年所有类别最高奖 Sweet Delight 甜蜜喜悦法国Michel Adam育成，感觉像改版红双喜。长势强劲，非常抗病，丰花。强香，大马士革主调带风信子和热带水果调（听起来比红双喜的强香料香要好闻。。。）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7ed56e8eca3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2681fbfa494c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_267c86af23aa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6061fdae3758.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7daa61240df8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2015年丰花灌木类大奖 Cherry Bonica 樱桃红博尼卡梅昂的又一款塑料花。无香，花持久，超级抗病，几乎不用管理，丰花，从春到秋连续开花。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_19091ca57ce5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9cfa0683def2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a899493a38f7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_364dc7cfc0fa.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "2015年庭院景观类大奖 Lady of Shalott 夏洛特夫人来自大卫·奥斯丁。大普货，不多说了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0011e5715907.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8cb868c42f7e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6353896829e1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其实育种可以有很多方向 这方面梅昂真的是典范 尽管很多时候我觉得他家品种太标准了切花用的就是标准HT，现在重点加强抗病和香气绿化带用的就是标准丰花塑料花，强抗病灌就是灌 藤就是藤就算要抄袭奥斯丁风格 也搞出了超级强健的红龙沙和皇家胭脂"
      },
      {
        "t": "2016年所有类别最高奖 You’re beautiful 你真美丽英国Gareth Fryer育成，同名歌曲冠名。各方面都优秀的丰花灌木。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4861490b9d81.jpg"
