  "rose_0707": {
    "title": "罗斯柴尔德花园月季节欣赏",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "最大感想：法国的HT新品已经登峰造极，宣传图完全没拍出实物的美其次：没药味是臭的"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bc07ebab2cd2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4d9e030631f3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0528780eb38c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5f96b5c850c1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b1e6e9221f1b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e4ce1265d32f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3b9a5715c93c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我去主要是想看看有没有戴尔巴德的新品，但实际很少。几个花商主推的基本是10-15年推出的品种。卖的最好的是戴尔巴德的Fragonard 花宫娜，刚去的时候有十几棵，几小时后走的时候只剩1棵了。实物非常美，铜绿色油亮的叶片配肉粉色15cm+大花，实在引人注目；香气像木兰花，悠长绵软。枝条修长直挺，又不僵硬。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2f558fbd6ff2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d308146d50d0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6359b5da2567.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b4b806f9bb75.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "但我还是要推一下梅昂的Line Renaud，以前开帖介绍时很多人不屑，什么颜色俗啦花型一般啦，这两天连续见到实物以后，我已经深深中毒。首先它的花瓣颜色有种复古的暗调和边缘好像发光的白色渐变，相机直出片根本拍不出来真正的美，必须要调色还原才行。而且它的香气，冠绝全场，比戴尔巴德、奥斯丁、吉洛所有标强香的品种（比如葛楚德杰基尔和黄金庆典）都要香得多，但又不冲，而且香型是我从未见识过的。没见到打开的花，看花苞大小，打开后花径起码12cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1cc53d0f4ae5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cb53814d700b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6c2e97a4006e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ebb3cab8fad6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_314661bea564.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "老牌经典伊夫伯爵也不遑多让，15+大马士革强香巨花"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1bafd7134531.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_81ca14ee0b19.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_154a35005857.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e6f81914bb18.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aba0d40d8263.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我很喜欢的波特兰系品种 Yolande d’Aragon 也有卖 7-8cm中等花 非常正的大马士革香气"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_841ea1ef8d2a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4f01d176753f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_50ec7a86a60b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b5f64fad7b25.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "第一次看见Charles de Mills 完全被它华丽的外表迷住了；而且第一次闻到法国蔷薇的香味，是和大马士革不一样"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4868e1247ce0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d2f06fbcaca2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7616c06ba2ba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "也有卖可以复花的杂交玫瑰"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3ae8e9e0597f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "应该是某个复古新品，花瓣正反面撞色"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0f06ac99cac8.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_73e1c42ee47c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "法国园艺协会某年的月季类特别奖得主Ténéré,才介绍不久居然就见到实物了'>本种枝条很软，适合做树月，花叶随风披拂；莲花花型，橙黄色渐变非常美，有种透明感。花径差不多12cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6830416bb1fb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3de5de7e2880.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_30cdfb55ae69.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶的Nostalgic rose系列的Augusta Luise似乎是今年主打款，几个花商摊子上都有。确实又美又香。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_01d60d4e2868.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7e351ba54e06.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶Nostalgic rose系列里的康沃尔伯爵夫人，国内hy叫音乐厅。非常像切花朱丽叶，但有香气"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8a338f06fb03.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9c9ba679e50b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d39206399781.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的黄金庆典"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_82a1e2eb5e17.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_401ab0592963.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1c1d5bbd1e9d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_78abdf4c44b6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的德伯家的苔丝这款国内几乎没人种，但这边参加的所有花商都在卖"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_74e91a14157a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_735d88a78074.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "奥斯丁的Gertrude Jekyll这款香味不错"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0c634e0d0ced.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c050ac985747.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f3ed7b468b77.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f934e631e802.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7bf9f0ad5d20.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "波特兰系 香堡伯爵 Comte de Chambord我感觉这款的香气大马士革调里带甜味再感叹下，古老月季的株型和枝叶真好看"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_562266e40bc7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_66bd0757ba49.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "波特兰系 Jacques Cartier都是我最近介绍过的品种'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_70c709a6b83b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fef5a5ac9757.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴尔巴德画家系列的Marice Utrillo，花比我预想的大得多，12cm+"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_06663c65077c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_eb738c6cdfb0.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "丹陶的新品Boréale 花朵神似粉龙沙但花梗直立 株型是小灌木资料写的连续开花、强香有没有人心动呢？"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d385e4127149.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "不了解出处的Léo Ferre 也是今年花商主推的一款花径10cm左右"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0d01d53a2a89.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1abaded08e3d.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f269a31d114c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款Michel Onfray是法国一位我不认识的育种家（其实就认识那三个）今年最新作品，色彩、花型、整体气质都深得我心。香气很独特，不好描述，但不是奇怪的香味。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5163d9cbdd54.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b485a8b097ad.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ef66282a8f72.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "戴尔巴德的老品种 Belle du Seigneur 老爷的美人这品种我没有拍好，实际上花会随时间变色，一株上有好几种颜色的花。花很大，15cm+ 植株大概40cm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ba157dfe3987.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "该品种没看见名牌，感觉是戴尔巴德的Rose de Lourdes"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1bbd3fc55ec4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03ddb57da876.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "梅昂的老品种 Jardins de Bagatelle强香"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7b5feea44b7a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9eba77592ebb.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_99fdf02d4fd7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个品种叫Sweet Revelation 也是不知道资料的新品"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2c08eccddc79.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_5ebf61d251ee.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个品种叫Sweet Love 估计和上面那个是一系列的 长得也很像 这个品种香味很甜美 是今年的主推品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f10a3598db70.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_589b5167757f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "有个蓝紫色系的叫Love Song 情歌我不怎么喜欢蓝紫色系所以没多拍 花还是挺好看的 12cm+"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_05d7aefdecd7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Cocktail 鸡尾酒"
      },
      {
        "t": "Bernadette Lafont花全场最大 打开了以后22cm+"
      },
      {
        "t": "Super trouper"
      }
    ]
  },
