      },
      {
        "t": "虽然大多数情况单头开花，但因为植株分枝能力优秀，枝条又统一直立向上生长，也会有整齐优美的群开效果'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fd3876a58040.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_c5bed65db420.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cf1f99d03c17.jpg"
