  "rose_0807": {
    "title": "朝圣路之花",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "高清：【Rosa del Camino de Santiago 朝圣路之花 - 无惧病虫害的真正低维护品种-哔哩哔哩】网页链接"
      },
      {
        "t": "视频和图片拍摄于马德里月季园在几乎无管理，缺水、缺肥、蚜虫泛滥导致叶片发生煤烟病的情况下仍旧茁壮成长并开出大量10cm以上大花，根系强大，花朵不焦，株型饱满，景观效果十分出色，足以媲美专门的景观类品种，表现甚至优于同处一些ADR品种（我就不点名了），更不用提一般的HT，强烈推荐"
      },
      {
        "t": "资料贴：朝圣路之花 Rosa del Camino de Santiago..."
      },
      {
        "t": "最后，香气官方给了3/3满分，我这次实际闻着是中等水果香，但很可能是缺水缺肥影响了香气实地拍的一些图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_e0f612c073f3.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7eabdd94ef77.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_96888f065a59.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_7128cebc243e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "目前Nirp在售品种里我见过甜蜜喜悦、香槟美酒、花园宝藏、朝圣路之花，每一个都非常非常好接下来会介绍的摇滚之花和黄金时代也非常棒，真的强烈推荐，早种早出效果早享受"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_03d965e7c7a1.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_abe025c94e4f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "nitp在哪"
      },
      {
        "t": "没能成团啊，差了三十多"
      },
      {
        "t": "哈哈我买了"
      },
      {
        "t": "优秀的太多，实在是缺块地"
      },
      {
        "t": "看着app上图片颜色很难看，没买"
      },
      {
        "t": "漂亮~~"
      },
      {
        "t": "求赶紧引进吧"
      },
      {
        "t": "朝圣路之花跟甜蜜喜悦哪个抗性更好啊？"
      },
      {
        "t": "漂亮，看了又想买了，得赶紧淘汰一些了，快两百棵了"
      },
      {
        "t": "最终决定先入甜蜜喜悦"
      },
      {
        "t": "群开好震撼'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "hy上植株大小80x50，差点买了预售，准备盆栽。这个是大个子吗？"
      },
      {
        "t": "再看一遍，好美！"
      },
      {
        "t": "希望能引进"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0808": {
    "title": "Taxandria 塔珊德里亚",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "沙发，这个完全是我的菜'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "高清：【现代杂交麝香Taxandria 比利时Martin Vissers作出-哔哩哔哩】网页链接"
      },
      {
        "t": "【旁系奥奥】Jean Robie 让·罗比 这个贴说了Martin Vissers的育种思路，让·罗比属于改版奥斯丁，那么今天就来看看他师承Louis Lens杂交麝香思路下的一个代表作Taxandria"
      },
      {
        "t": "Taxandria的亲本构成如下："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_073633bf97f6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "母本Echo & 父本Alden Biesen、1/4亲本Pleine de Grâce & Pretty Pink 全部是Louis Lens的作品值得注意的是Taxandria的一个1/8亲本即是腺梗蔷薇 Rosa filipes, 加之它本身半重瓣的特性，理论上是非常好的引入腺梗蔷薇血缘的亲本"
      },
      {
        "t": "具体来看下育种过程先认识下1937年英国Bentall育成的杂交麝香 Ballerina 芭蕾舞女"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd901d9f3d14.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_3842f9cbf483.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_25b700e9cf4b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "原产我国的腺梗蔷薇"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ff4830df58ce.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_0ddd6177eba7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "原产日本的一个野蔷薇变种Rosa multiflora var. adenochaeta Ohwi"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_cd79e24693b4.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Louis Lens用芭蕾舞女为母本，腺梗蔷薇为父本，得到了这个Pleine de Grâce（遗传了相当浓烈的腺梗蔷薇特征，尤其果子）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_460b1fdf5ac2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fb2152c2db29.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "他用Rosa multiflora var. adenochaeta Ohwi为母本，芭蕾舞女为父本，得到了这个Pretty Pink"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f06ceb844451.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "哇，好美！真的好美！"
      },
      {
        "t": "然后用Pleine de Grâce为母本，Pretty Pink为父本，得到Alden Biesen（麝香蔷薇特征再次主导）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_deed03ced590.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "最后，Martin Vissers用Louis Lens的另一个灌木品种Echo为母本"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_be0bdc6d219c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Alden Biesen作为父本，得到Taxandria"
      },
      {
        "t": "Taxandria基本信息可以参考RB的资料卡：点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "关于耐阴和株型，全日照下会长成这样1m左右的丰满规整小型灌木（图片实拍于蒙扎，三棵种一起的效果）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_adfce4ef1b61.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "下图半阴处可见枝条拉长倾泻下来，就是另一种风情了（毕竟1/8亲本里有两个大藤本）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4dbeb7a8f8f5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Taxandria获得：2014捷克月季竞赛一等奖2013里昂月季竞赛一等奖马德里月季竞赛银奖2009巴登巴登月季竞赛金奖 & 特别奖"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_63ab32f3a2d6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "某个颁奖仪式上，Martin Vissers手握两张证书（Taxandria和Jean Robie同时获奖）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_fa7db4f25ca2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_adb0bb9cfe63.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "蒙扎的两张实拍"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_34cb8b70f369.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4d3365694a4c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "其他一些网图"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_89342473162f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b83109d5eb54.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_8c61d24f0c71.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_42076ade2f35.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aa774ec7062c.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "继续贴下Vissers另一个作品：比利时王妃克莱尔"
      },
      {
        "t": "花量好大。"
      },
      {
        "t": "有个花园该多好'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个可以啊"
      },
      {
        "t": "看视频让我想到玛丽帕维奇~"
      },
      {
        "t": "太美了！我直呼好家伙！"
      },
      {
        "t": "好美啊！最近超想要一个白色丰花品种，这个简直是梦中情花了'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "确实柔美。不喜欢白色的我也觉得清新迷人。"
      },
      {
        "t": "跟奥斯汀的湖蔓夫人有种神似的感觉，估计湖蔓夫人也是杂交麝香吧"
      },
      {
        "t": "how may '>"
      },
      {
        "t": "这个系我真的好爱"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0809": {
    "title": "Rock ’n’ Rose 摇滚之花",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "高清：【可可爱爱的摇滚之花 Rock 'n' rose - Michel Adam育成-哔哩哔哩】网页链接"
      },
      {
        "t": "姐妹品种1：【苹果花开】Utopia 乌托邦"
      },
      {
        "t": "姐妹品种2:野趣天成·Lavender Meidiland 薰衣草梅..."
      },
      {
        "t": "法国Michel Adam育成，NIRP推出官方资料：景观应用类现代灌木花径 6cm花瓣数 15香气 1/3 （清淡水果甜香）高度 100/110cm宽度 70/80cm抗病 3/3非常丰花且连续不断开花，长势强健，适合做花篱和花境2007巴登巴登月季竞赛银奖比利时Le Roeulx月季竞赛金奖2008蒙扎月季竞赛银奖马德里月季竞赛荣誉证书里昂月季竞赛世纪伟大月季奖"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f93d419dac26.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "景观效果非常棒的一款，视频和照片都是在马德里和蒙扎月季园的实拍，的确长势强且非常抗病，而且似乎也不招虫这款唯一需要注意的是不要重剪！！！"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9fa555f62fff.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1530c135c823.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_a2c9c169bd8b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2436edc29b27.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f0a7b20aeb95.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_80011cf003c7.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_789510cdc145.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_1378048167bd.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_2e72fe7fd5e5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_63454d8aef72.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_f394bac655e6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "救命，这是长在了我的审美上"
      },
      {
        "t": "这款我喜欢的，清新。名字感觉不大合适吧。花不够狂野"
