      {
        "t": "双厨狂喜 记得之前美国还有个乐器叫rock'n roll 欣赏不大，来这个就好看多了'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "看上了今年获奖那个像杜鹃花的。老头乐的颜色真喜庆哈哈哈"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0810": {
    "title": "木村的模式是不是给自己挖坑",
    "segments": [
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_b59e3c68c3ba.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "他的新品种很明显是晚熟的（分类shrub，株型很大）就这样还敢卖小苗，被吐槽照骗也是自己作的'>毕竟大部分人买到手的期待就是初花就能拍个照炫耀从这个反面例子就看得出来 为什么业界标准就是出售1.5年裸根 这样最大程度上消费者能第一时间有比较理想的体验就连冰冠这种品种 也有人买了扦插小苗养了几个月就吐槽“枝条细软不直立”现在的人确实是没什么耐心的"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村的野鸡品种迟早孽力回馈'>河本虽然烂，至少通过喷药能开出精致单花和整体宣传效果"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村的信念怎么样？"
      },
      {
        "t": "大个子中轮花还中香…反正没有吸引我的点"
      },
      {
        "t": "我这些图是差不多刚满一年的木村品种除了最后一个温暖才几个月，虽然木村有些品种确实有点照骗，不过在我这开花性确实还不错，小苗就可以出很多花苞了，抗性也还说的过去，包邮区今年非常多阴天雨水没黑斑。我也希望国内能卖木村的裸根大苗，毕竟看日本花友分享那边的木村大苗开品确实好很多，但是国内目前只有小苗但是价格的确杀下来了20多一棵还带彩标这点还是很亲民的。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_d9268292b590.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_bad02132b86f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_6328a5fddd04.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "被河本小苗害了风评，抢了风头"
      },
      {
        "t": "包括很多品种牙签就是先横长再往高里长 这个也是吐槽重灾区'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "成熟度应该怎么判断呀，植株冠幅大小还是根系生长情况"
      },
      {
        "t": "我一直在吐槽木村大个子中轮花难看这个是成熟后的样子其实相当早熟，这样一来大个子中花就不算缺点了夏利玛我准备当微月养了枝叶稀疏的样子不错就是开花一头白纸惨兮兮另外春天它的霜霉在我这里是最严重的现在夏天气温高，好一些了其他的娜乌斯卡，枝叶、开花性都和夏利玛很像，盲猜同一组亲本"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村还有一个问题是照骗比如瑟西，同一个花序上主蕾和副蕾，因为前后几天气温不同，一个白纸，一个蓝紫，气死我了。不过都说是照骗的梦幻曲，我看还行。反正，木村的品种，真的要慎重观望一年再下场不迟"
      },
      {
        "t": "种过7种木村品种。两颗扦插都超过3年，5颗根接，其中刚接到虹越来的玛丽伦。木村式的晚熟是在开品不稳定，开花性没有问题。跟科奥不开花式晚熟完全不同。而且相较于需要脱土3个月左右的1.5年裸根，普通国内不需要脱土的6-12个月根接苗在长势上并不输。我认为没有耐心的人对所有晚熟品种都没耐心，跟1.5年裸根还是半年根接没关系。"
      },
      {
        "t": "人家主攻抗病不捞快钱，不需要迎合市场，市场审美全是新手菜逼视角，随便拉一车堆满月季5月看一波就喊大神大神。。。。本身抗病这条路艰难又耗时回报不高，同时还要仙好看？跟某狼卖名称专业户大捞特捞比比简直是圣人天上地下云泥之别。。。。"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村品种其实吧就是晚熟（不是不开花是需要年限才标准），抗性在我这里比较稳定他的品种，老品种除外"
      },
      {
        "t": "姜斯汀虚假宣传抗性，村斯汀虚假宣传开品，好像没啥本质区别'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "他筛选品种时候看中开花性和抗性，但太忽略其他了，比如园丁老班学习玫昂的直立株型，但是枝条又不够粗导致倒伏，很多人往往向往直立多头，但是没想过枝条粗细支撑得住没，直立株型倒伏很可怕的。比细软倒伏还辣眼睛"
      },
      {
        "t": "大个子开出硬币花，和飞飞子有异曲同工之妙'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村家的品种在华北还可以，而且容易出笋。就是开不出宣传照"
      },
      {
        "t": "我今年尝试的梦幻曲和海伦小苗感觉都还行，开花性没问题不过偏小是真的，比晚熟完全不开花的强些。不过丽拉好像是个例外，究极勤花早熟胜微月'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_9976c3f77e5a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_103ccfca1f0f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ec0ef1c1432a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "回到主题—木村品种晚熟，他发布品种又十分的多每年，这就导致了生产压力，加上日本本身地理位置和人工土地成本在哪里（河本就是例子，国内难控版权，裸根又堪比奥斯汀，导致合作商压力积压库存，短期是河本爽了但是伤害虹越。），所以他把目光投向中国。但是中国国内花卉生场合作商是要看到短期收益的，这就导致了小苗出货，这就直接导致晚熟品种无法做到1.5年生裸根出场。其实木村最好还是做点早熟品种（转变育种思路），不然这种高周转模式会因为晚熟品种的口碑崩盘。（其实木村问题就是在育种方向和商业模式不匹配问题）"
      },
      {
        "t": "不想开可以不开'>干脆全部掐了养苗了"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_aeae9e366050.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_ae3138021c79.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "我意志还算坚定，三年了，没买过一棵奥斯丁和日本品种"
      },
      {
        "t": "去年秋天的夏莉玛开的很漂亮，抗性也不错，导致我对木村印象很好，可今天春天的夏莉玛开的不忍直视，现在就只是继续观察丽拉， 目前看抗性很好，就是花不耐雨，所以我把从地里换到了盆里，避雨再观测。"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村前年的新品成功让我远离。信念八爪鱼，夏利玛像扫把。不过抗病提升是真的。"
      },
      {
        "t": "木村太照骗了"
      },
      {
        "t": "好在我的丹墨玫枝还行，去年秋天的小苗，现在已经长满5加了，又被我妈要走了。"
      },
      {
        "t": "天方也还不错。别的品种我还是觉得缺了点特色。（潘妮罗佩亚我觉得还不错，等等反馈再看。）"
      },
      {
        "t": "可能木村不很关注在中国大陆市场的收益？或者说，他作为育种家非常有分享精神？这两年的新品都授权了多家苗商，而且零售价格如此之低（相对日元和欧美市场），我觉得他可能赚不到。我反正定期会买木村来自己种种试试，他还是有有特色的品种，而新品的抗病也真的是不错。"
      },
      {
        "t": "'>木村我入了蝶之舞和精灵女王扦插小苗，养了两个月一朵花都无。"
      },
      {
        "t": "我家天堂也是木村的，吐了，抗性辣鸡，还傻大个不开花"
      },
      {
        "t": "做育种还是要像木村一样有点坚持～不能全跟市场。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0811": {
    "title": "哈克内斯新品 Queen Elizabeth II Rose",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "为庆祝英女王伊丽莎白二世 铂金庆典 特别推出极其芳香 10/10 满分抗病 5/5 满分花径 6-8cm植株 60*70cm'>适合盆栽适合花床适合花境边缘"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_af94efc709ff.jpg"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_839d9ef2fc42.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "替换奥利维亚'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "天噜，正经的女王出道了改了香味等级评价机制？我记得是10分制？"
      },
      {
        "t": "真假女王'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_46bb3f9422c5.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "看见了，10分香这个目前他家只有哈里埃德兰，同情，幸福，钱多思美人是这个等级，看样子能吊打奥利维亚。。。"
      },
      {
        "t": "既然是献给伊丽莎白二世的 怎么都不会差吧'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "花瓣感觉很少啊"
      },
      {
        "t": "香气满分啊，堪比同情～啧啧。"
      },
      {
        "t": "耐阴么'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "感觉没有奥利维亚的花瓣剔透些，不过很像啊！"
      },
      {
        "t": "替换奥利维亚暂且不谈，织工马楠是彻底可以🈚️了，马楠这货早期就硬币大小的白花，还极难标准。"
      },
      {
        "t": "总结下：比奥利维亚小，比奥利维亚香得多，抗病应该差不多，不过估计没有奥利维亚耐寒"
      },
      {
        "t": "期待'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "我喜欢这个。"
      },
      {
        "t": "只可惜花小了点，而且是粉色………"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0812": {
    "title": "天鹅古董2.0闹剧来咯",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "'>智商税开征"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_de8d4e894b15.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "美丽品种逃不开的宿命：冠名伊芙；冠名奥斯汀；芽变芽变芽变"
      },
      {
        "t": "我家全日照的保罗二世不高啊，养一年了，还是50cm的高度，这认真是芽变吗？"
      },
      {
        "t": "保罗不高啊，而且温度合适我这也有带羽毛边的"
      },
      {
        "t": "全日照扦插保罗满头花也就60cm左右静高，这款太好控了，不愧是毕业级家用切花，抗病略拉胯在我这里不用打药，高压力地区稍微打点"
      },
      {
        "t": "顺便，我也在碟子姐那里买过天鹅，亏瘸了（发生在创立本吧前）"
      },
      {
        "t": "保罗可以在1.5加仑地老天荒。"
      },
      {
        "t": "是怎么做到一本正经打出保罗三世这个名字的"
      },
      {
        "t": "我家有保罗13世"
      },
      {
        "t": "这取名，哈哈哈哈"
      },
      {
        "t": "保罗二世本来就有因为花瓣多淋雨打不开的问题了 那些人居然还要炒作花瓣更多更包 是不变成淋雨就烂baozi不罢休是吗'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "保罗三世这名字是认真的吗？哈哈哈哈"
      },
      {
        "t": "还有一花多名同店售卖也很多见………"
      },
      {
        "t": "。。。白色系那几个普货这都开始卷替身分身了是吗"
      },
      {
        "t": "期待珍妮莫罗的芽变品种 假妮莫罗'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "'>？？？"
      },
      {
        "t": "算了，目前国内对于芽变一点严谨性都没有。随便一个不成熟的植株开一朵不标准的花马上冠以芽变。'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "看小红书时间长了会降智"
      },
      {
        "t": "新手，不懂就问，这是不是保罗三世'>'>'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "真真，爱爱，怜怜"
      },
      {
        "t": "差点被骗"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_69af9a74b87f.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      }
    ]
  },
  "rose_0813": {
    "title": "还珠格格实锤",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "Anastasia这个名字确实是来自英格丽·褒曼主演的【真假公主】'>"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_4d4f9d40dff2.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "点击展开，查看完整图片"
      },
      {
        "t": "1928年的巴黎，一名流浪女子被布南将军及其同伙抓住。几人共同组成一个团伙，要她冒名俄罗斯沙皇尼古拉二世的小女儿——阿纳斯塔西娅·尼古拉耶芙娜·罗曼诺娃，以获得被推翻的俄罗斯帝国皇室遗留在英国银行的财产。经过训练的安娜·克来夫取得了一些流亡法国的沙俄贵族的认可，另一些则持否定态度。于是，布南决定接近阿纳斯塔西娅的祖母——皇太后玛丽，以她的认可来肯定安娜的身份。另一方面，布南与安娜之间也渐生情愫。一番折腾之后，安娜取得了皇太后的认可。但在公开确认安娜身份的前夕，安娜却选择了与布南私奔。'>多么熟悉的剧情"
      },
      {
        "t": "还真的是还珠格格"
      },
      {
        "t": "这是个传说中的故事？"
      },
      {
        "t": "所以有没有容嬷嬷'>"
      },
      {
        "t": "所以虹越翻译成“假面公主”这名字很贴切咯"
      },
      {
        "t": "带图顶一下"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/rose_700664264897.jpg"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0814": {
    "title": "'Baron Bold'（狂野男爵）",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "[第60页] 'Baron Bold'（狂野男爵），Dick Wright培育出的带疣品种，独生，生长速度比其他带疣品种更缓慢，需要每3-4年砍头重新发根种植，可以通过砍头和随之而来的分头繁殖。它的疣的边缘是锯齿状的，十分好辨认。2 G- q. k8 h$ a u- T/ B\n'Baron Bold'（狂野男爵）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ab86629618c7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "（英文原著于 《Echeveria Cultivars》，作者 Lorraine Schulz / Attila Kapitany）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0815": {
    "title": "'Mexican Giant'（墨西哥巨人）",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "*本文由原译者Qiuhan授权由小岛向北代为发布。\n[第136页] Echeveria colorata 'Mexican Giant'（墨西哥巨人）\n由于其特别的白色巨型叶子而从栖息地收集来并培育的品种。通常独生，成株约30厘米，几乎无茎，随着年龄的增长偶尔会分头。厚叶子肉肉的，老叶子有时会偏粉。它的白霜很容易被抹掉，叶子表面会因此留下污迹，所以为了美观应避免触摸或着水。可以通过分头、叶插和种子繁殖，种子应来自与其他品种隔离并自授粉的植株。\n'Mexican Giant'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dbaf146e1569.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "（英文原著于 《Echeveria Cultivars》，作者 Lorraine Schulz / Attila Kapitany）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0816": {
    "title": "A. saundersii 珠碧桑氏莲花掌",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文来自ICN\n翻译：杂交赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。SAUNDERSII Bolle, 1859\nSynonyms :\nSempervivum saundersii (Bolle) Christ (1888)\nAldasorea saundersii (Bolle) hort. ex Haage & Schmidt (1930)异名：\nSempervivum saundersii (Bolle) Christ (1888)\nAldasorea saundersii (Bolle) hort. ex Haage & Schmidt (1930)\nSection Chrysocome\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gomera); ± 150 – 800 m.\nChrysocome系列\n分布：加纳利群岛（戈梅拉岛）；海拔150米到800米。Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n形态描述（根据2003版IHSP）Perennial, densely branched shrublets to 30 cm, with distinct pleasant scent.\n多年生植物,可长成株型30cm的多分枝小灌木,具有独特的芳香。Branches 1 - 4 mm in diameter, glabrate, slightly viscid, ± smooth.\n枝干1 - 4毫米直径，无毛，稍黏，光滑或毛糙。Rosette 2.5 - 6 cm in diameter, flattish, inner leaves ± erect, imbricate and forming a globose bud during the dry season.\n莲座直径2.5 - 6厘米，扁平，生长点周边叶可能直立，叶片覆瓦状排列。在干燥的季节会包裹成一个球状。Leaves 1.2 - 3.5 x 0.7 - 1.3 cm, 1.5 - 2.5 mm thick, elliptic to obovate, apically acute or rounded, retuse, cuneate or attenuate, pubescent, green to yellow-green, lower face reddish variegated.\n叶1.2－3.5厘米长，0.7－1.3厘米宽，1.5 - 2.5 mm厚，椭圆形到倒卵形，顶部锐尖或圆润，微凹，楔形或渐狭。具短柔毛，绿色到黄绿色，叶背面有红斑。Inflorescences lax, 3 - 8 x 2 - 15 cm, 5- to 70-flowered, peduncle 3 - 8 cm, pedicels 3 - 12 mm, puberulent.\n花序排列疏松，3～8×2 - 15厘米，有5到70朵花，花序梗3—8厘米高，花梗3 - 12毫米，被细小的绒毛。Flowers 12- to 16-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 6 - 9 x 1.5 - 2.5 mm, oblanceolate, acuminate, yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花12～16瓣，萼片被微柔毛，花瓣6～9×1.5 - 2.5毫米，披针形，渐尖，黄色，花丝无毛。Cytology : 2n=36\n细胞学检查：2n（2倍体）＝36Aeonium saundersii La Gomera :\n戈梅拉岛上的桑氏莲花掌"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_460d95b50cae.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7a89e69a610f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_049f3503d8a5.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "园艺状态的植株："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6d933252160c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c219edfe2ecd.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3647600c1416.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a938ac1a4209.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Noelene Tomlinson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_35bef423c942.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé.网络图："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_01843dde1518.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3018dc1ce3c6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fd59c04f0672.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_050a74dd9ba0.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0817": {
    "title": "Aeonium arboreum",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "ARBOREUM (Linnaeus) Webb & Berthelot, 1840"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9416f2b5212e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Aeonium manriqueorum（即arboreum]原始种为避免搜索到其余变种使用独立异名,但图片品种仍不可确定是否原始种arboreum.）\n©FarOutFlora\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum arboreum Linnaeus (1753) / Sedum arboreum (Linnaeus) Hegi (1921)\nSempervivum mutabile W. Schlecht ex Breiter (1817)\nAeonium manriqueorum Bolle (1859) / Sempervivum manriqueorum (Bolle) Christ (1888)Distribution : Canary Islands, as neophyte in the Mediterranean.\n分布:加那利群岛,现在在地中海区域也有分布.\n3 varieties :\n3个变种:\nAeonium arboreum var. arboreum\nAeonium arboreum var. holochrysum H.-Y. Liu (1989)\nAeonium arboreum var. rubrolineatum (Sventenius) H.-Y. Liu (1989)P.S.该种为原始种,习性与变种相近,本帖主要介绍其变种.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nARBOREUM var. ARBOREUM 绿法师\n即绿法师,所能够加上\"法师\"名字的,仅是包括黑法师( A. arboreum 'Atropurpureum')墨法师(A. arboreum 'Zwartkop')在内的这一脉的变种."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_77e6bfa0cbed.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "© Faaxaal\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gran Canaria), 200 - 1200 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(大加那利岛),200 - 1200m区域.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSO,2003):\nPerennial few-branched subshrubs to 2 m, branches ± erect or ascending, often in groups, 1 - 3 cm diameter, smooth, without reticulations, rosettes 10 - 25 cm diameter (much smaller during the dry season), centre flattened with young leaves tightly appressed to each other.\n多年生树状亚灌木,2m左右高,枝干直立,易群生.茎干直径1 -3 cm,顺滑无纹.莲座状叶直径10 - 25cm(干旱时将缩小),生长点叶片扁平互相紧贴.\nLeaves 5 - 15 x 1 - 4,5 cm, 1,5 - 3 mm thick, obovate to oblanceolate, apically acuminate, basally cuneate, glossy, glabrate, green, usually purplish variegated, margin with curved cilia.\n莲座状叶长5 - 15cm,宽1 - 4.5cm,厚1.5 - 3mm,叶倒卵形或倒披针形,叶形细尖,基部楔形,叶面有光泽, 平滑 ,绿色或紫色,通常是杂色,叶缘具弯曲纤毛。\nInflorescences ovoid, 10 - 25 x 10 - 15 cm, peduncle 5 - 20 cm, pedicels 2 - 12 mm, puberulent.\n卵形花序,长10 - 25,宽10 - 15cm,总花梗5 - 20cm,花梗2 - 12mm,被细柔毛.\nFlowers 9- to 11-merous, sepals pubescent, petals 5 - 7 x 1,5 - 2 mm, narrowly oblong to lanceolate, acuminate, yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花基数9 - 10,萼片被短柔毛,花瓣5 - 7片,1.5 - 2mm长,狭长圆形至披针形,渐尖,黄色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18, 30, 36\n染色体:n=18,30,36\nVarious cultivars are quite common in cultivation :\n它的栽培变种十分常见:\nA. arboreum 'Zwartkop',(墨法师)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3914a4cbfc16.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Autumn's Stuff\nA. arboreum 'Albovariegatum',(艳日伞)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ce9b276a56de.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©douneika\nA. arboreum 'Atropurpureum', (黑法师)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3bccd7207125.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©shadowshador\nA. arboreum 'Luteovariegatum', (与 A. arboreum 'Albovariegatum'略有区别,可能是黄附轮......)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a5e458684c02.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Eduardo Carbonell"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_87fe7544c6ea.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8146019b6f90.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Javier Conde"
      },
      {
        "t": "醒目:'Zwartkop'&'Atropurpureum'的区分...............http://funjing.com/8391/-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nARBOREUM var. HOLOCHRYSUM H.-Y. Liu, 1989 君美丽\n即国内的君美丽."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_434fa8d1c81e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©shadowshador\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum urbicum Lindley (1835)\nAeonium vestitum Sventenius (1960)\nAeonium holochrysum Webb & Berthelot (1840)Distribution : Canary Islands (Tenerife, Gomera, La Palma, Hierro), to 1500 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(特内里费岛,戈梅拉岛,拉帕尔马岛,耶罗岛),1500m地区\nDiffers from var. arboreum :\n与Aeonium arboreum var. arboreum的不同之处:\nInflorescences ovoid or conical, 7 - 30 cm long, pedicels glabrate.\n花序卵圆形或圆锥形,7 - 30cm长,花梗平滑.\nFlowers : Sepals glabrous, petals yellow.\n花:萼片无毛,花瓣黄色."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_32a32aa71704.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©jaro-es\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_50c909802f52.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "holochrysum较有特点的\"Pad叶\"\n©Zusung-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nARBOREUM var. RUBROLINEATUM (Sventenius) H.-Y. Liu, 1989 欢伯\n\"Rubrolineatum\"是拉丁文中\"棕色\"的意思,结合其生长季粽底赭纹,夏季绿叶红缘的外形特点,神似酒染,春秋红酿,夏季葡酒,拟名欢伯.(即酒,引焦赣(汉)《易林·坎之兑》:\"酒为欢伯,除忧来乐.\")"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7ee6d7ef7637.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©bramwellii\nSynonym : Aeonium rubrolineatum Sventenius (1950)Distribution : Canary Islands (Gomera), to 1200 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(戈梅拉岛),1200m地区\nDiffers from var. arboreum :\n与Aeonium arboreum var. arboreum的不同之处:\nInflorescences semiglobose to ovoid, 8 - 15 cm long, pedicels glabrate.\n花序半球形至卵形,长8～15cm,花梗无毛.\nFlowers : Sepals glabrous, petals rather pale yellow, commonly striped with reddish.\n花:萼片无毛,花瓣浅黄,通常有红色条纹.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_af9898639811.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "仔细看看,是不是很像我们市面上流通的黑法师原始种?其实不是哦~\n©Arid SD"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b1b1605be50c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "这是只有野生环境下才有的,Aeonium的真实之美.羸弱纤细的不是真正的Aeonium.\n©Universität GöttingenAeonium arboreum一脉应该是我们较为熟悉的,其后代的黑色色彩也是Aeonium内较有代表性的.不过,越是熟悉的品种,似乎越难溯源,这似乎是定理......\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0818": {
    "title": "Aeonium balsamiferum 香馥",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "BALSAMIFERUM Webb & Berthelot, 1840 香馥\n名字来源于拉丁文\"balsamum\"意为香脂,取词义拟名\"香馥(fù)\"."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_24a6c1bae1a1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Daniel Grobbel-Rank\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum balsamiferum (Webb & Berthelot) Webb ex Christ (1888)\nSection Aeonium\n莲花掌组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Nothern and Central Lanzarote, naturalized in Fuerteventura).\n分布:加那利群岛(兰萨罗特岛北部及中部,原生于富埃特文图岛.)\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003)\nPerennial rather few-branched subshrubs to 1.5 m, with resinous scent.\n多年生树状亚灌木,高1.5m左右,有树脂香味.\nBranches ± erect or ascending, often in groups, 8 - 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, smooth, without reticulations.\n枝干直立,易群生,茎干直径8 - 20mm,顺滑无纹.\nRosette 7 - 18 cm in diameter, center flattened with young leaves tightly appressed to each other.\n莲座状叶直径7 - 18cm,生长点叶片扁平互相紧贴.\nLeaves 3 - 7 x 1.5 - 3.5 cm, 1.5 - 3 mm thick, narrowly obtrullate to obtrullate-spatulate, apically mucronate, basally cuneate, glabrous, margin with curved cilia (0.5 - 1 mm), greyish green, occasionally with some brownish stripes along the margin.\n叶3 - 7片,长1.5 - 3.5长,1.5 - 3mm厚,狭倒镘形或匙形倒镘形,先端短尖,基部楔形,无毛,边缘有弯曲的纤毛(0.5 - 1mm),通常为灰绿色,有时叶缘附近有棕色条纹.\nInflorescences 15 – 25 x 14 - 20 cm, peduncle 8 - 15 cm, pedicels 2 - 12 mm, glabrous.\n花序15 - 25枝,14 - 20cm,花序梗8 - 15cm,花梗2 - 12mm,无毛.\nFlowers 7- to 8-merous, sepals glabrous, petals 6 – 8 x 1.2 - 1.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花基数7 - 8,萼片无毛,花瓣6 - 8片,长1.2 - 1.5mm,披针形,渐尖,花丝无毛."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a3a21f6b1838.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野境下面容朴素,却散发着暗香的香馥\n©Ray Stephenson (from ICN)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_32063ad87d5e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Imzaa"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8e267a801b70.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Luis Borja"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_90f86a8c65fa.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "黄橘绿的完美渐变\n另注:本图疑为Aeonium 'Ballerina' 富士之雪\n©Manuel M. Ramos"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bc89169656fa.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "特写:磨砂质感的叶面\n©MBG photo intern coordinator"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_80e688feba16.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "带着枯叶的样貌更是可人\n©chuck b."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e24f0416a840.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "生如夏花之绚烂,死如秋叶之静美.\n©chuck b."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_82f119d6775d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "花气袭人知骤暖,鹊声穿竹识新晴.\n©sftrajanAeonium balsamiferum香馥,身带清馥,曳音似燕喃.天生优雅,亭亭青衫优伶.女神级别的香馥,不论是其优雅婀娜的株型,冷清轻郁的香气,还是磨砂般的叶片,都美得不可方物.\n君喜花开香袭人,熟知穷冬叶落尽,偏偏是这样一个女神,却在如此环境中兀自美丽.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0819": {
    "title": "Aeonium canariense",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "CANARIENSE (L.) Webb & Berthelot, 1841\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum canariense L. (1753)\nSection Patinaria\n帕蒂娜(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands\n分布:加那利群岛\n4 varieties :\n4个变种:\nAeonium canariense var. canariense\nAeonium canariense var. palmense (Webb ex Christ) H.-Y. Liu, 1989\nAeonium canariense var. subplanum (Praeger) H.-Y. Liu, 1989\nAeonium canariense var. virgineum (Webb ex Christ) H.-Y. Liu, 1989P.S.该种为原始种,习性与变种相近,本帖主要介绍其变种.-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCANARIENSE var. CANARIENSE 香炉盘\n即香炉盘.\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum latifolium Salisbury (1796)\nAeonium giganteum Webb ex Christ (1888)\nSempervivum canariense ssp. typicum Burchard (1929)\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Northern Tenerife); 600 - l300 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(特内里费岛北部);海拔600 - 1300m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennials.\n多年生.\nStems stout, smooth.\n枝干粗壮而光滑.\nRosette solitary or caespitose, 10 - 60 cm in diameter, cup-shaped, inner leaves ± erect.\n莲座状叶,植株单生或群生,直径10 - 60cm,叶呈杯状,生长点附近叶片直立.\nLeaves 6 - 35 x 3 - 12 cm, 3 - 10 mm thick, obovate to oblanceolate, apically rounded, mucronate, basally cuneate, velvety with glandular hairs 0.7 - 1 (-1.4) mm (5 - 15 hairs per mm2), margin occasionally slightly undulate, green, occasionally reddish or yellowish.\n叶6 - 35片,长3 - 12cm,厚3 - 10mm,卵形或倒披针形,先端圆形,有短尖(注:新叶尖,生长之后叶尖会逐渐变为卵圆,不过短尖仍会保留.),基部楔形,叶似天鹅绒般,有0.7 - 1(1.4)mm长的腺毛(每mm2大约5 - 15根),叶缘偶尔会呈波浪状,叶通常绿色,颜色偶尔会偏红或偏黄.\nInflorescences 30 - 45 x 20 - 30 cm, peduncle 12 - 30 cm, leafy, pedicels 0.5 - 5 mm, pubescent.\n花序30 - 45枝,长20 - 30cm,总花梗 12 - 30cm,十分繁茂,花梗0.5 - 5mm,被绒毛.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, sepals glandular-pubescen, petals 7 - 9 x 1.5 - 2 mm, narrowly elliptic, whitish-green, filaments glabrous.\n花基数8 - 10,绒毛萼片,花瓣 7 - 9片,长1.5 - 2mm,狭椭圆形,白色,或绿色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c423a4795694.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Jens Kumke"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_099d7952886d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_08c8db8c4bae.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "生长季的Var. canariense\nPhotos Eric Barbier"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ebb4cf272a3f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_55f7c70eeaf6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Dionysos en Olerdola"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2c1b91442003.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9c3bf22cef81.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Luis Borja-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCANARIENSE var. PALMENSE (Webb ex Christ) H.-Y. Liu, 1989 隐霜莲\n该品种成株后,由于叶面被绒毛,时常有覆霜之感.故拟名隐霜莲.\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nAeonium palmense Webb ex Christ (1888) / Sempervivum palmense (Webb ex Christ) Christ (1888)\nSempervivum xchristii Praeger (1925) / Sempervivum canariense ssp. christii (Praeger) Burchard (1929)\nSempervivum canariense ssp. longithyrsum Burchard (1929) / Aeonium longithyrsum (Burchard) Sventenius (1969)\nSempervivum propinquum Praeger (1932)\nDistribution : Canary Islands (La Palma, N Hierro); to 1200 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(拉帕尔马,耶罗岛N地区);海拔1200m内地区.\nDiffers from var. canariense :\n与Var. canariense(香炉盘)的不同:\nRosette cupshaped.\n莲座杯状.\nLeaves velvety with glandular hairs 0.3 - 0.5 (- 1) mm (30 - 60 hairs per mm2), viscid, margin often strongly undulate.\n叶似天鹅绒般,有0.3 - 0.5(-1)mm长的短密绒毛(每mm2大约30 - 60根),叶有粘性,叶缘常呈强烈波浪状.\nInflorescences 40 - 60 x 15 - 30 cm.\n花序40 - 60枝,长15 - 30cm.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, petals 7 - 10 x 2 - 3 mm, lanceolate, yellowish-green.\n花基数8 - 10,花瓣7 - 10片,长2 - 3mm,披针形,黄绿色.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_824058f902d9.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_73c4053064ea.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9028d724a394.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "所谓隐霜\nPhotos Jacquie Koutsoudis, SA"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c98878cf6401.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c0742efcf55d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "4年植株的迷人大波浪\nPhotos Eric Barbier-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCANARIENSE var. SUBPLANUM (Praeger) H.-Y.Liu, 1989 软绒盘\n根据其特点,拟名软绒盘.\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nAeonium subplanum Praeger (1928)\nSempervivum canariense ssp. latifolium Burchard (1929)\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gomera); 200 - 1000 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(戈梅拉岛);海拔200 - 1000m地区.\nDiffers from var. canariense :\n与Var. canariense(香炉盘)的不同:\nRosette often flattish.\n莲座常持平.\nLeaves velvety with glandular hairs 0.3 - 1mm (5 – 15 hairs per mm2).\n叶似天鹅绒般,有0.3 - 1mm长的短密腺毛(每mm2大约5 - 15根).\nInflorescences 18 - 30 x 15 - 28 cm.\n花序18 - 30枝,长15 - 28cm\nFlowers 10- to 12-merous, petals 7 - 10 x 2 - 2.5 mm, lanceolate.\n花基数10 - 12,花瓣7 - 10片,长2 - 2.5mm,披针形\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18注:Aeonium canariense var. subplanum有香味."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f5c3dab54176.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_38d247d12d2a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8a8fec10c6cf.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Jens Kumke"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_87c74b77503a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Liz21UK"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_36d73187f68d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f148e5109ae8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c052bead41da.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d82f88439e93.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nCANARIENSE var. VIRGINEUM (Webb ex Christ) H.-Y.Liu, 1989 加那利少女\n\"virgineum\"来自于拉丁语\"Virgo\",意为少女,结合其原生地,拟名加那利少女.\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nAeonium virgineum Webb ex Christ (1888)\nSempervivum virgineum (Webb ex Christ) Christ (1888)\nSempervivum canariense ssp. virgineum (Webb ex Christ) Burchard (1929)\nDistribution : Canary Islands (N Gran Canaria); to 1000 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(大加那利岛N地区);海拔1000m内地区.\nDiffers from var. canariense :\n与Var. canariense(香炉盘)的不同:\nRosettes cup-shaped.\n莲座杯状(注:植栽观察家里的植株,认为较大的不同是生长点状况,以及叶形.)\nLeaves velvety with glandular hairs 0.6 - 0.9 mm (10 - 20 hairs per mm2), margin occasionally undulate.\n叶似天鹅绒般,有0.6 - 0.9mm长的短密腺毛(每mm2大约10 - 20根).叶缘偶尔呈波浪状(注:极少).\nInflorescences 15 - 45 x 12 - 30 cm.\n花序15 - 45枝,长12 - 30cm\nFlowers 6- to 9-merous, petals 7 - 8.5 x 1.5 - 2 mm, lanceolate, yellowish-green.\n花基数6 - 9,花瓣7 - 8.5片,长1.5 - 2mm,披针形,黄绿色.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18注:Aeonium canariense var. virgineum有香味."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7cbb4e816a96.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a14f8537051a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_67472a34889c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_376fb2e6396a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Enez35"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ad881fcb03df.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Joyce-Tex-Buckner"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_49dc3bddeb6f.png"
