        "t": "From CACTUS E DINTORNI"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cf5d1742874d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray StephensonAeonium canariense一脉是Aeonium中较较为有收集价值的,因其叶被绒毛,成为Aeonium中较为出色的亲本之一,很多著名杂交种譬如Aeonium 'Blushing-beauty'(韶羞)与Aeonium 'Velour'(天鹅绒)(亲本均为Aeonium canariense ,A. arboreum 'Zwartkop'但是父母本详情并不明了.)\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0820": {
    "title": "Aeonium davidbramwellii 寒月夜",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "DAVIDBRAMWELLII H.-Y.Liu, 1989 寒月夜\n\"davidbramwellii\"来源于该物种的发现者——英国荣誉植物学家大卫·布拉姆韦尔(David Bramwell 1942),他在加那利群岛的大加那利岛Tafira Alta发现了这个物种.考虑到其变种花叶寒月夜的存在,拟名为]寒月夜."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_276015381c44.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Liz21UK\nSynonym :\n异名:\nAeonium ciliatum ssp. praegeri Bañares (1990)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (La Palma); to 1000 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(拉帕尔马岛);海拔1000m内地区\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial few-branched subshrubs to 1 m.\n多年生少分枝亚灌木,高度可达1m左右.\nBranches ascending, 7 - 25 mm , glabrous, reticulate.\n分支向上生长,直径7 - 25mm,无毛,茎干呈网格状.\nRosette 6 - 22 cm in diameter, rather flattish.\n莲座直径6 - 22cm,叶尖持平.\nLeaves 3 - 12 x 2 - 4 cm, 2 – 6 mm thick, obovate to oblanceolate-spatulate, apically acuminate, basally attenuate or cuneate, puberulent, margin with conical cilia ( ≤ 0.5 mm), dark green to yellowish-green, often reddish or brownish variegated along margin.\n叶长3 - 12cm,宽2 - 4cm.厚2 - 5mm,倒卵形至倒披针匙形,先端渐尖,基部衰减或楔形,被微柔毛,边缘具圆锥形的纤毛(≤0.5mm),叶呈深绿色至黄绿色,常带红色或褐色的沿缘杂色.\nInflorescences ± ovoid, 10 - 35 x 8 - 25 cm, peduncle 5 - 20 cm long, pedicels 1 - 3 mm, puberulent.\n花絮大致呈卵形,高10 - 35cm,宽8 - 25cm,总花梗长5 - 20cm,花梗长1 - 3mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 6- to 8-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 6.5 - 9 x 1.5 - 2.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, generally greenish variegated, filaments puberulent.\n花基数6 - 8,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长6.5 - 9mm,宽1.5 - 2.5mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,常有绿色掺杂.花丝被微柔毛.\nCytology : 2n=36\n染色体:2n=38(即n=18)\nEasily confused with A. ]ciliatum(Bañares Baudet & Catalina León 1997).\n容易与Aeonium ciliatum混淆."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_11178cd9f808.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5b4654a5ba41.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Zusung的植株.家庭种植的理想状态.\n©Zusung"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_34147d33f621.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Marijn van den Brinkdacidbramwelii在原生地(生长季):"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_34b519a23028.png"
