        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1a3811a2015b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Dr. Michael Schwerdtfeger\n(P.S.Dr. Michael Schwerdtfeger似乎就是Flickr的Universität Göttingen,一位大学教授.)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c595c2ba9541.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Aeonium davidbramwellii的花.\n©limonium64'Sunburst'(灿烂/花叶寒月夜)\nMost probably a variegated cultivar of A. davidbramwellii.\n较可能是Aeonium davidbramwellii的锦叶变种.\nIncorrectly distributed by ISI as Aeonium decorum 'Sunburst'. Rudolf Schulz writes : \"… the reversion of this plant is very much like A. davidbramwellii, with rosettes growing up to 400 mm in diameter, well beyond anything that A. decorum could manage\" .\n错误地被ISI作为Aeonium decorum 'Sunburst'.鲁道夫·舒尔茨写道:\"......这种植物的退化植株非常像Aeonium davidbramwellii,莲座能够成长到400mm的直径,远远超出任何一株Aeonium decorum能够到达的大小.\n染色体:2n =36"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3ad854fbde34.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Beadmobile"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_02dbc5421f54.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6e2539bb595b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Colleen Sharmat花叶寒月夜的缀化植株:"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_efc65c7a2a34.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©FarOutFlora\nPhoto Noelene TomlinsonAeonium davidbramwellii寒月夜,是硬叶系Aeonium中较有代表性的,种子发芽率较为高,抗性亦较好,并且随着季节轮转的变化非常大,有时很难看出它们是一个品种.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0821": {
    "title": "Aeonium decorum 花钿",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "DECORUM Webb ex Bolle, 1859 花钿\n(Wikipedia:epithet Latin meaning \"decorative\")\n\"decorum\"一词来自拉丁语,意为\"装饰性\",故结合其外形拟名为花钿(diàn)(P.S.在古代,女性用簪钗来绾住头发,而后将花钿直接插入绾好的发髻中,装饰发髻.)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dfe7ea11eefc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Liz21UK\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum decorum (Webb ex Bolle) Christ (1888)\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gomera, Tenerife); 100 - 900 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(戈梅拉岛,特内里费岛);海拔100 - 900m地区\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial densely branched shrublets to 60 cm.\n多年生小型灌木,枝杈较为密集,高度可达60cm左右.\nBranches ascending or pendent, tortuous, 5 - 8 mm diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n枝干上升或下垂,茎干曲折,直径5 - 8mm,无毛,网状.\nRosettes 5 - 10 cm in diameter, rather flattish.\n莲座状叶直径5 - 10cm,叶尖持平.\nLeaves 2.5 - 5 x 1 - 1.5 cm, 2.5 - 4.5 mm thick, obovate to oblanceolate, apically acuminate, basally cuneate, glaucous, puberulent, margin with few scattered cilia (≤ 0.5 mm), dark green to yellowish-green, often reddish variegated along margin.\n叶片长2.5 - 5cm,宽1 - 1.5cm,厚2.5 - 4.5mm,倒卵形至倒披针形,先端渐尖,基部楔形.叶被白霜,被微柔毛,边缘有一些零星的纤毛(≤0.5mm),叶呈深绿色至黄绿色,常带红色,叶缘则常呈杂色.\nInflorescences lax, cylindrical, 8 - 30 x 8 - 20 cm, peduncle 10 - 30 cm, pedicels 2 - 10 mm, puberulent.\n花序疏松,圆柱形,高8 - 30cm,宽8 - 20cm,总花梗长10 - 30cm,花梗长2 - 10mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 6- to 8-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 7 - 8 x 2 - 2.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, often pinkish or reddish variegated, filaments sparsely puberulent.\n花基数6 - 8,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长7 - 8mm,宽2 - 2.5mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,常有粉色,红色混杂其中.花丝疏生柔毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18\nRecently also reported from Tenerife ( Hernández 1998).\n(埃尔南德斯 1998):较近在特内里费岛亦有发现."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_368ee8b23337.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d49e00698f13.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d660191c7f53.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_81f3438b5504.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "P.S.这个貌似是一个变种,但是种植者亦无法确定.\n©Virata33"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ac877f44d47c.png"
