      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9b63e44492d1.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4202d2d31b00.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "The same plant after summer dormancy, Aug. 2012 :\n同一株植物,在夏季休眠后的样子(2012.8):"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_833bdae1b5af.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Eric Barbier"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_84219bf3ee92.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ff7e7cbf1a05.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5b3560564f5d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:lapshinAeonium decorum花钿,拥有小巧精致的莲座和优雅的株型,其艳丽的色彩更是为她的魅力加分,薄而尖的叶有着不输于大型种的气势,正如花钿,看上去精致可人,质地却坚硬无比.也是很棒的杂交亲本.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0822": {
    "title": "Aeonium glandulosum 盃莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "GLANDULOSUM (Aiton) Webb & Berthelot, 1840 盃莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_48592a8a8898.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©cactiphobia Synonyms : 异名: Sempervivum glandulosum Aiton (1789) Aeonium meyerheimii Bolle (1859) / Sempervivum meyerheimii (Bolle) Murray (1899) Sempervivum patina Lowe (1864) Distribution : N Madeira (Deserta Grande), to 1500 m. 分布:北部马德拉群岛(大德塞塔岛),海拔1500m以下地区. Description (according to IHSP, 2003) : 描述(根据IHSP,2003): Biennial to perennial, single or occasionally offsetting rosette plants. 两年生植物,通常独生,有时生侧芽. Stems stout, smooth. 茎粗壮,光滑. Rosette 12 – 40 cm in diameter, cup-shaped. 莲座直径12 - 40cm,杯状.(P.S.事实上通常为盘状的平面,但新生叶是标准的杯状,故命名为盃莲.) Leaves 6 – 11 x 3 – 8 cm, 3 – 5 mm thick, obovate or oblanceolate, puberulent, tip acute, mucronulate, basally cuneate, margin with bead-shaped cilia (ca. 0.6 mm). 叶长6 - 11cm,宽3 - 8cm,厚3 - 5mm,倒卵形或倒披针形,被微柔毛,先端锐尖,叶形短尖,基部楔形,叶缘缘具珠状纤毛(约0.6mm). Inflorescence much wider than tall, 8 – 25 x 12 – 40 cm, peduncle 2 – 10 cm, leafy, pedicels 3 – 18 mm, glandular-pubescent. 十分宽大的花序,高8 - 25cm,12 - 40cm,总花梗长2 - 10cm,密被叶,花梗长3 - 19m,被腺状短柔毛. Flowers 8- to 13-merous, sepals glandular-pubescent, petals 7 – 11 x 3 – 4 mm, lanceolate, acute, pale yellow. 花基数8 - 13,萼片被腺柔毛,花瓣长7 - 11mm,宽3 - 4mm,披针形,锐尖,呈淡黄色. Cytology : n=18 染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
