  "succ_0823": {
    "title": "Aeonium glutinosum 相思染",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "GLUTINOSUM (Aiton) Webb & Berthelot, 1840 相思染\n\"glutinoum\"应来源于拉丁语,意为有粘性的.(英语中存在\"glutinous\"adj.粘性的;胶状的.这个词)古往今来,较是相思稠,相思染叶,岂能不粘:),恰好植栽非常喜欢龚琳娜的《相思染》,因此拟名为相思染."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3c477b9445e1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum glutinosum Aiton (1789)\nSection Patinaria\n帕缇娜雅(音译)组\nDistribution : Nothern Madeira (Deserta Grande); to 300 (rarely 1700).\n分布:北部马德拉群岛(大德塞塔岛);海拔300m以下区域(事实上1700m内均有分布).\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial caespitose or slightly shrubby rosette plants.\n多年生丛生或灌木状生莲座状植物.\nBranches 7 - 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, sticky, smooth.\n茎干直径7 - 20mm,无毛,粘,光滑.\nRosettes 12 - 22 cm in diameter, cup-shaped.\n莲座直径12 - 22cm,杯形.\nLeaves 7 - 12 x 3 – 5.5 cm, 2 - 4.5 mm thick, obovate-spatulate, apically acute, basally cuneate, glabrate,margin with very few to numerous straight to curved cilia (≤ 0.5 mm), pale to dull green, usually with brownish stripes along the midrib and near the apex.\n叶长7 - 12cm,宽3 - 5.5cm,厚2 - 4.5mm,倒卵状匙形,先端锐尖,基部楔形,无毛.边缘有或多或少,或直或弯曲的纤毛(≤0.5mm),叶 呈白到暗绿色,通常沿中脉和叶尖附近分布有褐色条纹.\nInflorescences very lax, sticky, 15 - 40 x 15 - 30 cm, peduncle 10 - 25 cm long, pedicels 2 - 10 mm, puberulent.\n松散状花序,粘,高15 - 40cm,宽15 - 30cm,总花梗长10 - 25cm,花梗长2 - 10mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 5 - 7 x 2 - 3 mm, ovate to lanceolate, yellow, lower face with reddish lines, filaments glabrous.\n花基数8 - 10,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长5 - 7mm,宽2 - 3mm,卵形至披针形,呈黄色,下表面有淡红色的线条,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18大家有没有发现,同为 帕缇娜雅(音译)组的银粟峰和相思染在某些情况下,出侧芽的方式几乎一样呢?\n(注:下图是Aeonium glutinosum在缺光或徒长状态下的植株.)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3e69c1d35bf6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a1c9e5c9a2ac.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Grenville Godfrey"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_15f2cbeb5916.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f4c8fb39ab47.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野境中的glutinosum\n©naturgucker.de"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_873708a6d8b2.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6b785d1a567a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "园艺种植下的glutinosum\n©FarOutFlora"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_679b3a2277cf.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f83acbc008f9.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1a4909153131.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Kelly Macdonald"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0759084e1fc6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "标准植株\n©Universität Göttingen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bd504322253c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "glutinosum对环境的变化也是很敏感的,差距会很大.\n©COLECCION DE CACTUS DE DON FRANCIS"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_564aaba1f08d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_62aa16a6129c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Aeonium glutinosum的花\n©Virata33"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_85657d282e0c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "逆光拍摄的图片.可能经过模糊处理.\n©Made in MaderiaAeonium glutinosum 相思染 是非常有趣的Aeonium,除根部外,全植株都有粘性,而且它富有特点的叶色叶纹,也为Aeonium增色不少.是一款经得起看的Aeonium.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0824": {
    "title": "Aeonium gomerense 戈梅拉之彤",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "GOMERENSE (Praeger) Praeger, 1928 戈梅拉之彤\n\"gomerense\"意为:来自戈梅拉岛,加那利群岛.结合其低温时叶缘泛红的特点,拟名为戈梅拉之彤(tóng)."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ba289695af03.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum gomerense Praeger (1925)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gomera); 500 - 1100 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(戈梅拉岛);海拔500 - 1100m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial loosely branched subshrubs to 2 m.\n多年生亚灌木,分支松散,成株可达2m.\nBranches ascending or pendent, 3 - 15 mm in diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n枝干上升或下垂,直径3 - 15mm,无毛,呈网状.\nRosette 10 - 28 cm in diameter, rather flattish.\n莲座直径10 - 28cm,叶大致持平.\nLeaves 5 - 14 x 2.5 - 4 cm, 3 - 7 mm thick, obovate to oblanceolate, apically acuminate, basally cuneate, glabrate, slightly glaucous, margin with ± straight cilia (0.5 - 1 mm), green, often reddish variegated along the margin.\n叶长5 - 14cm,宽2.5 - 4cm,厚3 - 6mm,倒卵形至倒披针形,先端渐尖,基部楔形,叶平滑,稍被白粉,叶缘时有纤毛(0.5 - 1mm),叶呈绿色,叶缘常带有斑斓的红色.\nInflorescences ± ovoid, 15 - 40 x 10 - 30 cm, peduncle 10 - 20 cm, pedicels 2 - 6 mm, glabrous.\n花序大致呈卵形,高15 - 40cm,宽10 - 31cm,总花梗长10 - 20cm,花梗长2 - 6mm,无毛.\nFlowers 7- to 9-merous, sepals glabrous, petals 8 - 10 x 1.5 - 2 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, lower face greenish variegated, filaments glabrous.\n花基数7 - 9,萼片无毛,花瓣长8 - 10mm,宽1.5 - 2mm,披针形,渐尖,发白,下表面呈淡绿色为主的杂色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6ca25971b37f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d2ef679bc94d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©PattyHankins"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6658604d25ed.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "已具规模的gomerense\n©Naturaleza Bella. Clara Caro."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f23e5b2d31f8.png"
