      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ee2640b4f4bb.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "苗期goochiae ©neoecoAeonium goochiae 古琦 是Aeonium中较美的品种之一,亦是女神级Aeonium.其优雅婀娜的身姿,叶片的轻薄精致淡淡和草绿色,以及周身散发出的清香,无不为她增色. 资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0826": {
    "title": "Aeonium gorgoneum 晓之埃",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "GORGONEUM J.A.Schmidt, 1852 晓之埃\n\"gorgoneum\"应该源自拉丁语词干\"gorgonias\"指\"Gorgades(现今的佛得角群岛)\".根据其叶面被粉,冬季鲜红的特点拟名为晓之埃,意为清晨暖阳所洒下的尘埃."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1fc28e369477.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:Wikimedia Commons\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum gorgoneum (J.A.Schmidt) J.A.Schmidt ex Coutinho (1914)\nSection Aeonium\n莲花掌组\nDistribution : Cape Verde Islands (San Antonio, San Nicolau, San Vicente); ± 300 - 1300 m.\n分布:佛得角群岛(圣安东尼奥岛,圣尼谷岛,圣维森特岛,);海拔300 - 1300m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial branched subshrubs to 2 m.\n多年生丛生亚灌木,成株高度可达2m.\nBranches ascending, usually in groups, 5 - 15 mm in diameter, glabrous, smooth; Ros 9 - 20 cm in diameter, centre rather flattened with young leaves tightly appressed to each other.\n分枝上升,通常群生,茎直径5 - 16mm,无毛,光滑;莲座直径9 - 20cm,中心扁平,生长点附近叶片相互紧贴.\nLeaves 5 - 10 x 1.5 - 3 cm, 3 - 6 mm thick, oblanceolate-spatulate, apically acute or acuminate, mucronate, basally cuneate, strongly glaucous, glabrous, margin with straight or forward-curved cilia (≤ 0.5 mm), green, often reddish variegated along margin and midrib.\n叶长5 - 10cm,宽1.5 - 3cm,厚3 - 6mm,叶呈倒披针形,匙形,先端急尖或渐尖.叶短尖,基部楔形,被厚白霜,无毛,缘具直或向前弯曲的纤毛(≤ 0.5mm),叶通常呈绿色,常有以红色为主的杂色沿中脉和叶缘分布.\nInflorescences pyramidal, 5 - 8 x 7 - 10 cm, peduncle 5 - 8 cm, pedicels 1 - 8 mm, glabrous.\n锥形花序,高5 - 8cm,宽7 - 10cm,总花梗5 - 8cm,花梗长1 - 8mm,无毛.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, sepals glabrous, petals 5 - 6 x 1 - 1.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, yellow, reddish variegated, filaments glabrous.\n花基数8 - 10,萼片无毛,花瓣长5 - 6mm,宽1 - 1.5mm,披针形,渐尖,呈黄色,有红色等杂色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : 2n=36\n染色体:2n=36 即n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_557c107de006.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo éric Barbier"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_30abf790835b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b2ac43441572.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3acbade4b913.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7d441a06b8d0.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_beb9459882d9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "冬季的gorgoneum."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5a673ade12a8.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "gorgoneum的花.\nFrom:canariasconservacionICN旧站图:"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b79b30c04173.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1b33d9756688.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cf076171c2ce.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1418e5bf17f6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_76314662d03e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "园艺栽培下的gorgoneum."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e2e09ed3b5d9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "苗期gorgoneum.\nFrom:sureealsucculents"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bf6bb6774a52.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f02a7b3f8f9e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:ICN(Old)Aeonium gorgoneum 晓之埃 是Aeonium中难得的厚粉品种,并且其标准而密密层叠的玫瑰状叶也是Aeonium硬叶系种较有代表性的.其冬日下的暖红,和春秋季时粉嫩的颜色完全不同,趣意盎然,值得收集.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0827": {
    "title": "Aeonium hierrense 戴冠曲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "HIERRENSE (R.P.Murray) Pitard & Proust, 1909 戴冠曲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b4587f909223.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©anniesannuals\nSynonym :\n异名\nSempervivum hierrense R.P.Murray (1899)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (La Palma, Hierro); to 1200 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(拉帕尔马岛,耶罗岛);海拔1200m以内区域\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial, unbranched or rarely few-branched, monocarpic subshrubs to 1.5m.\n多年生亚灌木,少分枝或无分枝,果后死亡,成株可达1.5m.\nBranches ascending, 20 - 45 mm in diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n分枝上升,直径20 - 45mm,无毛,呈网状.\nRosettes 15 - 60 cm in diameter, flattish.\n莲座直径15 - 60cm,叶尖持平.\nLeaves 8 - 30 x 5 - 8 cm, 3 - 7 mm thick, obovate or oblanceolate, apically acute, caudate and often recurved, basally cuneate, strongly glaucous, glabrate, margin with slightly curved cilia (1 - 2 mm), green, with reddish or pinkish variegated margin.\n叶长8-30cm,宽5-8cm,厚3-7mm,倒卵状披针形,顶部尖,尾状核,通常下弯,基部楔形,被厚白霜,光滑,边缘具稍弯曲的纤毛(1-2mm),呈绿色,通常有红色或粉红色的杂色.\nInflorescences dome-shaped, 15 - 50 x 12 – 50 cm, peduncle 5 - 25 cm, pedicels 2 - 6 mm, puberulent.\n花序圆顶形,高15-50cm.宽12-50cm,花序梗5-25cm,花梗长2-6mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 6- to 9-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 7 - 9 x 1.5 - 2 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, median part often pinkish variegated, filaments puberulent.\n花基数6 - 9,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长7.9mm,宽1.5 - 2mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,正中通常杂有色粉红色.花丝被微柔毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a711d1c80bfe.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©mapa-73"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b9f49ca290b2.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ebbd666b3b76.png"
