      {
        "t": "©kantc2"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3ff19eb2b42b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Dionysos en Olerdola"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6c985adbc10e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©bramwellii"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ef8b840af56a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_128883e868ca.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fbc1d2f2e3e2.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Jens Kumke"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cd60edaf5f6f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_68e16449232c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_070b08257c44.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b53b2b82b006.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7e2aacf23a0c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d5d867a8192c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:nelocactus"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_48cf5ea3202b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray StephensonAeonium hierrense 戴冠曲 是大型莲花掌中较为我们熟知的品种,其身姿飒爽优雅,习性强健,在外国园艺多肉植物中有很高的地位.嗜独生的特点,更是令她拥有了高贵冷艳的气质.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0828": {
    "title": "Aeonium korneliuslemsii 瑾悬山",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "KORNELIUSLEMSII H.-Y. Liu, 1989 瑾悬山\n\"瑾\"为美玉名,代指其色;\"悬山\"是中式建筑的一种屋顶,其特征是檩木出梢,恰似叶尖形.故拟名瑾悬山."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_db6f619e0fb6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray Stephenson\nSection Aeonium\n莲花掌组\nDistribution : South Western Morocco\n分布:西南摩洛哥\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial rather few-branched subshrubs to 1.5m.\n多年生少分枝亚灌木,成株可达1.5m.\nBranches ± erect to ascending, often in groups, 10 - 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, smooth.\n分枝直立上升,常成群,茎直径10 - 20mm,无毛,光滑.\nRosettes 5 - 17 cm in diameter, centre flattened with young inner leaves thightly appressed to each other.\n莲座直径5 - 18cm,生长点附近平坦,新叶相互紧贴.\nLeaves 4 - 9 x 2 - 3 cm, 1.5 - 3 mm thick, obovate or obovate-spatulate, apically truncate or rounded, basally cuneate, puberulent, margin with straight or curved cilia (0.4 - 1 mm), pale green to yellowish-green.\n叶长4 - 9cm,宽2 - 3cm,厚1.5 - 3mm,叶倒卵形或倒卵状匙形,先端截形或圆形,基部楔形,被微柔毛,边缘具直的或弯曲的纤毛(0.4 - 1mm),叶片呈淡绿色至黄绿色.\nInflorescences 5 - 20 x 5 - 18 cm, peduncle 10 - 13 cm long, pedicels 3 - 8 mm, puberulent.\n花序高5 - 20cm,宽5 - 19cm,总花梗长10 - 14cm,花梗长3 - 8mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 7- to 9-merous, sepals sparsely puberulent to puberulent, petals 4.5 - 6 x 1.5 - 2.5 mm, elliptic, acute, occasionally emarginate, yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花基数7 - 9,萼片疏生柔毛到微柔毛,花瓣长4.5 - 6mm,宽1.5 - 2.5mm,椭圆形,尖锐,有时微凹,呈黄色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : 2n=36\n染色体:2n=36 即 n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_30046bce6a7d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Coffee Obsessive"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5b7eabe380ab.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bdeb6ca1fe9e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e61e4cf3b255.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:Wikipedia"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ac2bc8448df3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野外状态下Aeonium korneliuslemsii\nFrom:cutcaster"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f26c6d730fe5.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "休眠时期状态\nFrom:RP"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_017d6d275702.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5202b6f8d7ed.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_74632866b443.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野境下的Aeonium korneliuslemsii\nPhotos Jean-André AudissousAeonium korneliuslemsii 瑾悬山 是一款相当低调的Aeonium,其不具有辨识度的外形成为了硬伤,但事实上,其叶片的质感远胜于与其极其相似的Aeonium arboreum 一脉,并且在Aeonium组中是为数不多的叶被毛品种,这些都决定了他会是一个相当出色的亲本!\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0829": {
    "title": "Aeonium lancerottense 刃之舞",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "LANCEROTTENSE (Praeger) Praeger, 1928 兰萨/刃之舞\n\"lancerottense\"意为\"Of or from Lanzarote, Canary Islands(源自兰萨罗特岛,加那利群岛.)\"以其叶为倒披针形(oblanceolate)拟名刃之舞,另音译一名兰萨."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2b7fe0bc3446.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:wikimedia\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum lancerottense Praeger (1925)\nSection Aeonium\n莲花掌组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Lanzarote); 200 - 600 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(兰萨罗特岛);海拔200 - 600m.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial densely branched subshrubs to 60 cm.\n多年生亚灌木,易群生,成株可达60cm.\nBranches ascending, 7 - 15 mm in diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n分枝上升,直径7 - 15mm,无毛,呈网状.\nRosettes 10 - 18 cm in diameter, rather flattish.\n莲座直径10 - 18cm,叶尖持平.\nLeaves 5 - 9 x 1.5 - 4 cm, 3 - 6 mm thick, obovate- or oblanceolate-spatulate, apically acute, caudate, basally cuneate, glaucous, glabrate, margin with some wrinkled cilia in the upper part, green to yellowish-green, often reddish variegated along margin and at the apex.\n叶长5 - 9cm,宽1.5 - 4cm,厚3 - 6mm,叶呈倒卵形或倒披针形,匙形,先端急尖,尾状,基部楔形,叶被白霜,光滑,边缘有一些起皱的纤毛,叶呈绿色至黄绿色,沿微和尖顶常有杂色.\nInflorescences dome-shaped, 8 - 30 x 8 - 25 cm, peduncle 6 - 20 cm, pedicels 1 - 3.5 mm, glabrous.\n圆顶形花序,高8 - 30cm,宽8 - 26cm,总花梗长6 - 20cm,花梗长1 - 3.5mm,无毛.\nFlowers 7- to 8-merous, sepals puberulent to glabrate, petals 6 - 9 x 1 - 1.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, median part pinkish variegated, filaments glabrous.\n花基数7 - 8,萼片被微柔毛到光滑,花瓣长6 - 9mm,宽1 - 1.5mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,花瓣中心有以粉红色为主的杂色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3a60a90773e0.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_08c92202fbf6.png"
