  "succ_0830": {
    "title": "Aeonium leucoblepharum 冬炎",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "LEUCOBLEPHARUM Webb ex A. Richard, 1848 冬炎\n\"leucoblepharum\"意为\"From the Greek leukos (white) and blepharis (eyelash); for the thin white leaf margins(来自希腊语.leukos(白色)和blepharis(睫毛);薄白叶缘.)\"叶缘薄白,恰似冬季萌霜,而其叶火红,因此拟名为冬炎."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5f983aac48e4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Liz21UK\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum leucoblepharum (Webb ex A. Richard) Hutchison & E. A. Bruce (1941)\nSempervivum chrysanthum Hochstetter ex Britten (1871) / Aeonium chrysanthum (Hochstetter ex Britten) A. Berger (1930)\nSempervivum chrysanthum var. glabrum Chiovenda (1919)\nSempervivum chrysanthum var. glandulosum Chiovenda (1919) / Aeonium leucoblepharum var. glandulosum (Chiovenda) Cufodontis (1969)\nDistribution : Yemen, E. Africa, (Ethiopia, Somalia, Kenya, Uganda); ca. 2000 – 3500 m.\n分布:也门,东非,(埃塞俄比亚,索马里,肯尼亚,乌干达);约海拔2000 - 3500m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial branched subshrubs to 2 m.\n多年生群生亚灌木,成株可达2m.\nBranches ascending to decumbent, usually in groups, 7 – 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, smooth.\n分枝上升或匍匐,通常群生,直径7 - 20mm,无毛,光滑.\nRosettes 10 – 20 cm in diameter, centre flattened.\n莲座直径10 - 20cm,中心生长点附近扁平.\nLeaves 5 – 12 x 1.5 – 3-5 cm, 2 – 5 mm thick, oblanceolate- to obovate-spatulate, apically acuminate, basally cuneate, margin with straight or curved cilia (0.4 – 1 mm), glabrate, yellowish-green to dark green, usually reddish variegated along margin.\n叶长5 - 12cm,宽1.5 - 3-5cm,厚2 - 5mm,倒披针形至倒卵状匙形,先端渐尖，基部楔形,边缘具直或弯曲的纤毛( 0.4 - 1mm), 光滑,叶呈黄绿色至深绿色,通常叶缘微红有杂色.\nInflorescence 3 – 15 cm, pedicels 1 – 6 mm, puberulent.\n花序高3 - 15cm,花梗长1 - 6mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 7- to 10-merous, sepals sparsely puberulent, petals 6 – 8 x 1.8 – 2.5 mm, elliptic or lanceolate, retuse, yellow, occasionally reddish variegated, filaments glabrous to sparsely puberulent.\n花基数7 - 10,萼片疏生柔毛,花瓣长6 - 8 mm,1.8 - 2.5mm,椭圆形或披针形,微凹,呈黄色,有时带红色的杂色,花丝无毛到疏被微柔毛.\nCytology : 2n=36\n染色体:2n=36 即 n=18Note :\n附记:\nA. leucoblepharum is one of two east African species, the other being A. stuessyi. It \"is extremely variable, which is not surprising considering its 1800 km range across a wide variety of isolated mountainous habitats. The species is locally common on rocks and cliffs at 200 – 3500m. Many of its known habitats are in isolated moist and forested mountain ranges which rise up out of the surrounding semi-arid and desert habitats.\nA. leucoblepharum can be erect to 2 m or almost stemless and densely clumping.\" (Rudolf Schulz :\"Aeonium in habitat and cultivation\", 2007, p. 136 – 137)\nAeonium leucoblepharum一至两东非品种，另一个是Aeonium stuessyi .它\"是一个变数极大的品种,这并不奇怪,尤其是考虑到在各种不同的孤立的山地栖息地及其1800公里范围.该品种是在海拔200 - 3500米的岩石和峭壁常见的.它的许多已知的栖息地是孤立的半干旱地区,沙漠栖息地,潮湿的森林和山脉.\nAeonium leucoblepharum可直立到2米或几乎无茎抑或浓密丛生\" (鲁道夫·舒尔茨: \" 2007 Aeonium的栖息地和栽培学\",第136 - 137页)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f8ae0d29f776.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c9244fe07891.png"
