  "succ_0831": {
    "title": "Aeonium lindleyi",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "LINDLEYI Webb & Berthelot, 1840 Synonyms : 异名: Sempervivum lindleyi (Webb & Berthelot) Webb ex Christ (1888) / Sempervivum tortuosum var. lindleyi (Webb & Berthelot) Kuntze (1891) Distribution : Canary Islands 分布:加那利群岛 2 varieties : 名下有2个变种: Aeonium lindleyi var. lindleyi 登天乐 Aeonium lindleyi var. viscatum (Bolle) Liu (1989) 璇铃子P.S.该种为原始种,习性与变种相近,本帖主要介绍其变种.----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- LINDLEYI var. LINDLEYI 登天乐"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9e14588a13b6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Liz21UK Distribution : Canary Islands (NE Tenerife); to 1000 m but most common between 200 and 500 m. 分布:加那利群岛(东北部特内里费岛);海拔1000米内区域,但大多数分布于海拔200 - 500m之间的地区. Description (according to IHSP, 2003) : 描述(根据IHSP,2003): Perennial densely branched shrublets to 50 cm. 多年生群生灌木,成株高度可达50cm. Branches : 3 - 15 mm diameter puberulent, viscid, smooth, without reticulations. 分枝:直径3 - 15mm,被微柔毛,有粘性,光滑,无网纹. Rosettes : 4 - 9 cm diameter, rather flattish, inner leaves ± erect. 莲座:直径4 - 9cm,叶尖持平,内叶大致直立. Leaves : 2 - 4,5 x 0,6 - 1,6 cm, 5 - 7 mm thick, obovate or obovate-spatulate, apically obtuse, acute, or attenuate, basally cuneate or attenuate, puberulent to distinctly pubescent, viscid, yellowish-green to dark green. 叶:长2 - 4.5cm,宽0.6 - 1.6cm,厚5 - 7mm,倒卵形或倒卵状匙形,先端钝,锐尖或渐狭,基部楔形或渐狭,叶被微柔毛到明显短柔毛,有粘性,呈黄色绿色到深绿色. Inflorescences cymose panicles, floriferous part 2 - 7 x 3 - 9 cm, peduncle 1 - 9 cm, pedicels 1 - 10 mm, puberulent. 聚伞状圆锥花序,多花,高2 - 7cm,宽3 - 9cm,总花梗长1 - 9cm,花梗长1 - 10mm,被微柔毛. Flowers 8 - to 9 – merous, sepals pubescent, petals 5 - 7 x 1,5 - 2 mm, narrowly elliptic or lanceolate, acuminate, yellow, filaments glabrous. 花基数8 - 9,萼片被短柔毛,花瓣长5 - 7mm,宽1.5 - 2mm,狭椭圆形或披针形,渐尖,呈黄色,花丝无毛. Cytology : n=18 染色体:n=18 P.S.登天乐有香味."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8a99f7ebb654.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dfaad3fe4b5e.png"
      },
      {
