      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_72dc093a5ac9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Frank.Ebinger----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- LINDLEYI var. VISCATUM (Bolle) H.-Y. Liu, 1989 璇铃子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5c2ee24a4de9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©carlesjbox Synonyms : 异名: Aeonium viscatum Bolle (1859) / Sempervivum viscatum (Bolle) Christ (1888) / Sempervivum tortuosum var. viscatum (Bolle) Kuntze (1891) Distribution : Canary Islands (E Gomera); ± 100 - 900 m. 分布:加那利群岛(东部戈梅拉岛);海拔大约100 - 900m. Differs from var. lindleyi : 与变种登天乐的不同: Leaves 3 - 4 mm thick, with a dense covering of extremely short multicellular hairs (< 0,04 mm). 也厚3 - 4mm,有密集覆盖的极短的多细胞毛(<0.04mm). Flowers 7- to 9-merous, petals 5 - 7 x 1 - 1,5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate. 花基数7 - 9,花瓣长5 - 7mm,宽1 - 1.5mm,披针形,渐尖. Cytology : n=18 染色体:n=18 P.S.事实上二者的差别还是非常大的,登天乐的叶形更加圆润,而璇铃子则是纺锤状的叶子."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b945df69910e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a4a8c4e923cf.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_81646360f29c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:Wikimedia"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_538e7d9faebe.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_382bd5e2e452.png"
      },
      {
