        "t": "家庭种植的植株. ©carlesjbox"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_abaa5f4a3ef3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8e3ccc8c0de1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:botany.cz"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_04b434de4599.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©cactus-aventures"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_603ae3cefaa1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Daniel Grobbel-RankAeonium lindleyi 一脉以其圆润可爱,绒毛质感的肥厚叶片和其散发出的怡人香气而闻名.再加上小型种天生所具有的魅力,登天乐和璇铃子都是Aeonium中的小王子,深受Aeonium迷的喜爱. 另外,他们也是非常出色的亲本,无与伦比的特性让他们的后代都注定是佼佼者. 资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0832": {
    "title": "Aeonium nobile 镜狮子",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "NOBILE (Praeger) Praeger, 1928 镜狮子"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8822245ceab8.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Daniel Grobbel-Rank\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum nobile Praeger (1925)\nSection Megalonium\n米格洛纽门(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands, La Palma, 0 – 750 m, dry slopes, banks and cliffs.\n分布:加那利群岛,拉帕尔马岛,0 - 750m地区,干燥的山坡,河岸和悬崖.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial robust monocarpic solitary rosette.\n多年生植物(结一次果,即花后死亡),健壮的莲座状植物.\nStems rather stout, 1 – 3 cm in diameter, glabrous, ± smooth.\n茎粗壮,直径1 - 3cm,无毛,大致光滑.\nRosette 25 – 80 cm in diameter, broadly cup-shaped to rather flattish, with inner leaves ± erect.\n莲座状叶直径25 - 80cm,大致呈杯状,叶尖大致持平,内叶大致直立.\nLeaves 7 – 50 x 4 – 30 cm, 6 – 18 mm thick, obovate, apically acute or acuminate, basally attenuate or occasionally cuneate, often longitudinally folded, glabrate, often viscid when young, lower part of margin occasionally with some few scattered cilia about 0.5 mm long, yellowish-green occasionally reddish or brownish variegated esp. along the margin.\n叶片长7 - 50cm,宽2 - 30cm,厚6 - 18mm,倒卵形,先端急尖或渐尖,基部缩小或偶尔楔形,通常纵向折叠,无毛,新叶常具有粘性.叶缘下部和上部常有长0.5mm左右的零星纤毛,叶呈黄绿色,偶尔淡红,叶缘常有褐色等杂色掺杂.\nInflorescence flat-topped to broadly dome-shaped, 20 – 40 x 30 – 60 cm, peduncle 2 – 5 cm, pedicels 1 – 2 mm, puberulent.\n平顶状花序,大致呈圆顶形,高20 - 40cm,宽30 - 60cm,总花梗长2 - 5cm,花梗长1 - 2mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 7- to 9-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 3 – 5 x 1 – 1.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, intensely reddish variegated, filaments glabrous.\n花基数7 - 9,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长3 - 5mm,宽1 - 1.5mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,掺杂有浓烈的红色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_40361fc1761b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "来自Zusung的证件照.不过看起来光照不够呢.\n©ZusungAeonium nobile在原生地:"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3de779326f53.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d679fec0e47f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2860cdb47335.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7e8e1ae6df43.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_88c4c89feba6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1b8f7261ca9e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e6728ce12813.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©naturgucker.de"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_53938fa12216.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "事实上,nobile不像大多数大型Aeonium一样少生甚至不生侧芽.\n©FarOutFlora下面是植栽个人非常喜欢的,转自刀姐(微博@刀之莲台)的一组nobile 镜狮子的写真.\n(原地址http://blog.sina.com.cn/s/blog_7d320b9101012xgy.html)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_58b84e3b1e5e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "这张图是植栽较较喜欢的."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_561f970d970e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ca11cdad0f82.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c29ad65229ec.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d1c8a71c768d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_133e7b185106.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Aeonium nobile镜狮子是Aeonium中较受玩家欢迎的一种,即使是很多岩牡丹爱好者,也有收藏之心.Aeonium的狂野,奔放,野性之美,在nobile身上体现得淋漓尽致,而其多变的色彩和端正的株型更是迷人!如果说Aeonium balsamiferum香馥是Aeonium中的女神,那么nobile绝对就是Aeonium中的男神.\n镜狮子,你绝对值得拥有.另外.nobile的发芽率很高,生长速度也还不错,可以尝试.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0833": {
    "title": "Aeonium percarneum 蓬莱阁",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "PERCARNEUM (R.P.Murray) Pitard & Proust, 1909 蓬莱阁\n\"percarneum\"意为\"Very flesh colored(非常地肉色)\".结合其外形,拟名为蓬莱阁."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0f83d7560120.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©bramwellii\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum percarneum R.P.Murray (1899) / Aldasorea percamea (Murray) hort. ex Haage & Schmidt (1930)\nAeonium percameum var. guiaense G.Kunkel (1977)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gran Canaria); ± 100 - 1300 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(大加那利岛);海拔约100 - 1300m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP.2003):\nPerennial few-branched subshrubs to 1 m.\n多年生亚灌木,少分枝,成株高度可达1m.\nBranches ascending, 7 - 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n分枝上升,直径7 - 20mm,无毛,呈网状.\nRosettes 8 - 20 cm in diameter, flattish.\n莲座直径8 - 20cm,叶尖持平.\nLeaves 4.5 - 10 x 2 - 4 cm, 3 - 6 mm thick, obovate- to oblanceolate-spatulate, apically acute, caudate, basally cuneate, glaucous, glabrate, margin often weakly denticulate, often with curved cilia (≤ 1 mm), dark green, often reddish variegated along the margin.\n叶长4.5 - 10cm,宽2 - 4cm,厚3 - 6mm,倒卵形至倒披针形,匙形,先端急尖,尾状,基部楔形,被白霜, 叶面光滑,边缘常带弱细齿或弯曲的纤毛( ≤ 1mm) ,呈深绿色,边缘常有红色等杂色.\nInflorescences dome-shaped, 10 - 30 x 10 - 25 cm, peduncle 8 - 20 cm, pedicel 1 - 3 mm, puberulent.\n圆顶形花序,高10 - 30 cm,宽10 - 26cm,总花梗长8 - 20cm,花梗长1 - 3mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 7 – 8 x 1.2 - 1.8 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, median part pinkish variegated, filaments sparsely puberulent.\n花基数8 - 10,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长7 - 8mm,宽1.2 - 1.8mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,中间有部分粉红色的杂色,花丝疏生柔毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_38b735b05e8a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d8993012858b.png"
      },
      {
