        "t": "©Marianne Perdomo"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_debbc4b76a94.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_220519cdda2c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7f32c45bd41a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "蓬莱阁Aeonium percarneum的花序.\n©Virata33"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_752f06c87e3a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ed061bd59018.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Van in LAAeonium percarneum 蓬莱阁 是一款经典的大型Aeonium,在国外常被用于园林种植.其大气磅礴的外形和庞大的株型,成为Aeonium大型种的代表之一.蓬莱阁拥有无与伦比的叶形和密集的莲座,家庭种植时亦有不同的秀气表现,值得收藏.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0834": {
    "title": "Aeonium sedifolium 小人祭",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "SEDIFOLIUM (Webb ex Bolle) Pitard & Proust, 1909 小人祭\n\"sedifolium\"意为\"With fleshy foliage(有着肉质叶子的)\"."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_284c8a792c51.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Liz21UK\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nAichryson sedifolium Webb ex Bolle (1859) / Greenovia sedifolium (Webb ex Bolle) Webb ex Christ (1888) / Sempervivum sedifolium (Webb ex Bolle) Christ (1888)\nSempervivum masferreri Hillebrand (1881)\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Tenerife [Teno], northern La Palma) ; to 1000 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(特内里费岛[特诺地区],北部拉帕尔马岛)；海拔1000m内地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial densely branched shrublets to 40 cm, branches 1 - 5 mm diameter, sparsely puberulent, viscid, smooth, without reticulations, rosettes 1,4 - 3 cm diameter, rather flattish, inner leaves ± erect, imbricate and forming a globose bud during the dry season.\n多年生灌木,分枝密集,成株高度可达40cm,茎干直径1 - 5mm,疏生柔毛,有粘性,光滑,无网纹,莲座直径1.4 - 3cm,大致持平,内叶大致直立状分布,叶覆瓦状排列,并在​​旱季形成球形芽.\nLeaves 0,7 - 1,5 x 0,4 - 1 cm, 3 - 5 mm thick, ovate or obovate, glossy, puberulent, viscid, green to yellowish-green, lower face with reddish stripes, variegated with many brownish lines near the apex.\n叶长0.7 - 1.5cm,宽0.4 - 1cm,厚3 - 5mm,卵形或倒卵形,有光泽,被微柔毛,有粘性,呈绿色至黄绿色,下表面有淡红色条纹,叶缘与叶尖附近有许多杂色条纹.\nInflorescences lax, floriferous part 2 - 7 x 2 - 5 cm, commonly 6- to 15-flowered, peduncle 2 - 8 cm, pedicels 5 - 16 mm, puberulent.\n疏松花絮,多花,高2 - 7cm,宽2 - 5cm,通常6 - 15朵花,总花梗长2 - 8cm,花梗长5 - 17mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 9- to 11-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 5 - 7 x 2 - 2,5 mm, obovate or oblanceolate, acute or obtuse, yellow, filaments sparsely puberulent.\n花基数9 - 11,花萼被微柔毛,花瓣长5 - 7 mm,宽2 - 2.5mm,倒卵形或倒披针形,锐尖或钝尖,呈黄色,花丝疏生柔毛.\nCytology : n = 18\n染色体:n = 18\nP.S.事实上Aeonium sedifolium 小人祭 在拉帕尔马岛(La Palma)和特内里费岛(Tenerife)的产地种差别是很明显的,主要区分为卵形叶与扁叶.\n我们见到的小人祭,一般是来自于拉帕尔马岛的扁叶小人祭,其背面有许多透明腺体.而来自于特内里费岛的卵叶小人祭叶形如同名字一样\"卵形\",十分圆润可爱,叶背面仅有一条居中的腺体.\n其实两种小人祭都非常美,只是传统的小人祭对于养功的要求比较高,所以我们很少看见它美好的样子.Aeonium sedifolium 产地:拉帕尔马岛(La Palma)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_363488183042.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©succulentlover77"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2878d3ce4262.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_febb83d1dbc3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Manuel M. Ranmos"
