      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_713402677fc1.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f97e0f889756.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Noelene TomlinsonAeonium smithii 静谧莲 是Aeonium中较珍稀的物种之一,全植株高度肉质化,叶背的红色腺体更是其较为突出的特征.不论从收藏还是栽培的角度,都是一个很棒的品种.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0836": {
    "title": "Aeonium spathulatum 仙童唱",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "SPATHULATUM (Hornemann) Praeger, 1928 仙童唱\n\"spathulatum\"意为\"With a small spathe(暗示其勺形叶.)\",已有中文名仙童唱."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_10985668a4ee.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Alanca1\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum spathulatum Hornemann (1819)\nSempervivum lineolare Haworth (1819)\nSempervivum barbatum C.Smith ex Otto (1820)\nSempervivum villosum Lindley (1832)\nAeonium cruentum Webb & Berthelot (1840) / Sempervivum cruentum (Webb & Berthelot) Webb ex Christ (1888) / Sempervivum spathulatum var. cruentum (Webb & Berthelot) Praeger (1929) / Sempervivum strepsicladum var. cruentum (Webb & Berthelot) Burchard (1929)\nAeonium strepsicladum Webb & Berthelot (1840) / Sempervivum strepsicladum (Webb & Berthelot) Webb ex Christ (1888) / Aldasorea strepsiclada (Webb & Berthelot) hort. ex Haage & Schmidt (1930)\nAichryson pulchellum C.A.Meyer (1842) / Sempervivum pulchellum (C.A.Meyer) Walpers (1843)\nAeonium bentejui Webb ex Christ (1888) / Sempervivum bentejui (Webb ex Christ) Christ (1888)\nSection Chrysocome\n克丽丝蔻(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gran Canaria, Tenerife, Gomera, La Palma, Hierro); 250 - 2500 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(大加那利岛,特内里费岛,戈梅拉岛,拉帕尔马岛,耶罗岛);250 - 2500m.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial densely branched shrublets to 60 cm.\n多年生密生灌木,成株可达60cm.\nBranches 1 - 3 cm in diameter, puberulent, smooth, without reticulations.\n枝干直径1 - 3cm,被微柔毛,光滑,无网纹.\nRosettes 1 - 5 cm in diameter, flattish to distinctly cup-shaped, inner leaves ± erect.\n莲座直径1 - 5cm,明显呈杯形,内叶大致直立.\nLeaves 0.5 - 2.5 x 0.3 – 0.9 cm, 1 - 1.5 mm thick, obovate-spatulate, apically obtuse, basally cuneate or attenuate, puberulent, lower face with conspicuous longitudinal brownish tannic stripes, margin with bead-shaped cilia (0.7 - 1 mm).\n叶长0.5 - 2.5cm,宽0.3 - 0.9cm,厚1 - 1.5mm,倒卵状匙形,先端钝,基部楔形或渐狭,被微柔毛,叶背面具明显的褐色鞣酸纵条纹,叶缘有珠状纤毛(0.7 - 1mm) .\nInflorescences : Floriferous part lax, 3 - 10 x 3 - 15 cm, peduncle 5 - 20 cm, pedicel 1 - 10 mm, puberulent.\n花序：松散花絮,高3 - 10cm,宽3 - 15cm,总花梗长5 - 20cm,花梗长1 - 10mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 4.5 - 6 x 1.5 - 2 mm, elliptic, obtuse, yellow, often with reddish lines, filaments glabrous.\n花基数8 - 10,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长4.5 - 6mm,宽1.5 - 2mm,椭圆形,钝,黄色,常带红色线条,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_af7ff7454826.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0e5a89b662c7.png"
