        "t": "©FarOutFlora"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f3228c57fcd4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Aeonium spathulatum的花序.\n©ORTOSA"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ae93fe475f08.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0837aded3877.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "经典的Aeonium spathulatum 仙童唱图片.\n©thehumofbeesAeonium spathulatum 仙童唱 是Aeonium小型种中十分有魅力的一款,其玫瑰形的莲座极易在温差大的秋冬春季泛红,充满柔艳美得叶与虬劲的枝干形成鲜明对比,值得收藏!\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0837": {
    "title": "Aeonium undulatum 艳姿",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "UNDULATUM Webb & Berthelot, 1841 艳姿\n\"undulatum\"意为\"Wavy(波浪状的).\"暗示了其叶的特点,已有中文名艳姿."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cd6aa78a8e4b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©FarOutFlora\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum undulatum (Webb & Berthelot) Webb ex Christ (1888)\nAeonium yongianum Webb & Berthelot (1841) / Sempervivum yongianum (Webb & Berthelot) Webb ex Christ (1888)\nSection Aeonium\n莲花掌组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gran Canaria); 300 - 1500 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(大加那利岛);海拔300 - 1500m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial unbranched or basally few-branched, often monocarpic subshrubs to 2.5 m.\n多年生亚灌木,基部少分枝或不分枝,一果植物,成株可达2.5m.\nBranches ± erect, 1 - 3 cm in diameter, glabrous, smooth.\n分枝大致直立,直径1 - 3cm,无毛,光滑.\nRosettes 10 – 30 cm in diameter, centre flattened.\n莲座直径10 - 30cm,生长点附近平坦.\nLeaves 6 - 18 x 3 - 5 cm, 1.5 – 3 mm thick, oblanceolate-spatulate or oblong-spatulate, apically acute, mucronate, basally cuneate, glabrate, margin with curved cilia (0.5 - 2 mm), dark green, often reddish variegated along margin and near apex.\n叶长6 - 18cm,宽3 - 5cm,厚1.5 - 3mm,倒披针形,匙形或长圆状匙形,先端锐尖,短尖,基部楔形, 叶面光滑,边缘具弯曲纤毛( 0.5 - 2mm),叶呈深绿色,叶缘或叶尖附近常带红色等杂色.\nInflorescences 12 - 50 x 12 - 40 cm, peduncle 5 - 20 cm.\n花序高12 - 50cm,宽12 - 40cm,总花梗长5 - 20cm.\nFlowers 9- to 12-merous, pedicels 1 - 8 mm, glabrous, sepals glabrous, petals 6 - 8 x 1.2 - 1.5 mm, lanceolate, retuse, yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花基数9 - 12,花梗长1 - 8mm,无毛,萼片无毛,花瓣长6 - 8mm,宽1.2 - 1.5mm,披针形,微凹,黄色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=36\n染色体:n=36"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4068adb376c3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5cee4f6b67e3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_60afff22e1d3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野境中的undulatum.\n©Universität Göttingen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fe1cabd7eb7a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Keenan Pepper"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_153322b2f15e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "园艺种植中的undulatum.\n©Kelly Macdonald"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3b4b0f9aafdf.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©thehumofbees"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_06482e5dc0a9.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_33a06bacb8ef.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "开花的undulatum.\n©mikh43Aeonium undulatum 艳姿 是一款非常出色的大型Aeonium,在国外被大量应用于花园种植,其具有特色的波浪状叶,其奔放大气的外形,都深得宠爱.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0838": {
    "title": "Aeonium urbicum 翡翠城",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "URBICUM (C.Smith ex Hornemann) Webb & Berthelot, 1841 翡翠城\n\"urbicum\"意为\"Urban (belonging to cities or towns)(属于城市的)\",结合其特点拟名为翡翠城."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_87b3b92ae0fd.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©FarOutFlora\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum urbicum C.Smith ex Homemann (1819)\nAeonium pseudurbicum Bañares (1992)\nAeonium urbicum var. meridionale Bañares (1999)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Tenerife); to 1900 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(特内里费岛);海拔1900m内地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial monocarpic unbranched or rarely few-branched subshrubs to 2 m.\n多年生亚灌木,少分枝或不分枝,一果植物,成株可达2m.\nBranches ascending, to 6 cm in diameter, glabrous but rough when young, reticulate.\n分支上升,直径可达6cm,光滑,但新生时粗糙,有网纹.\nRosettes 15 - 32 cm in diameter, rather flattish.\n莲座直径15 - 32cm,大致持平.\nLeaves 8 - 22 x 3 – 5.5 cm, 4 - 7 mm thick, obovate-spatulate or oblanceolate, apically acuminate, basally cuneate, glaucous or green, glabrate or puberulent, margin with ± straight cilia (0.5 – 1 mm), yellowish-green to dark green, variously reddish variegated.\n叶长8 - 22cm,宽3 - 8.9cm,厚4 - 6mm,倒卵状匙形或倒披针形,先端渐尖,基部楔形,被白霜或绿色, 光滑无毛或者被微柔毛,边缘偶具直毛( 0.5 - 1mm) ,呈黄绿色到深绿色,有各种微红杂色.\nInflorescences domeshaped, 15 - 75 x 10 - 45 cm, peduncle 3 - 15 cm.\n穹顶形花序,高15 - 75cm,宽10 - 45cm,总花梗长3 - 15cm.\nFlowers 8- to 10-merous, pedicels 2 - 6 mm, glabrous, sepals glabrous, petals 7 - 10 x 1.2 - 2 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, occasionally reddish variegated, filaments glabrous.\n花基数8 - 10,花梗长2 - 6mm,无毛,萼片无毛,花瓣长7 - 10mm,宽1.2 - 2毫mm,披针形,渐尖,白色,偶尔有红杂色,花丝无毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18\nPlants from Gomera formerly identified as A. urbicum have recently been described as A. appendiculatum.\n戈梅拉岛的植株,曾经被认为是Aeonium urbicum 翡翠城,较近被认定为Aeonium appendiculatum附魔莲."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_da90c3cb8ed4.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_862d82b9cd2d.png"
      },
      {
