  "succ_0839": {
    "title": "Aeonium valverdense 舞龙华",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "VALVERDENSE (Praeger) Praeger, 1928 舞龙华"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_17d1d576596e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©subhumanfreaks\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum valverdense Praeger (1925)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Hierro); to 800 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(耶罗岛);海拔800m内地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial few-branched subshrubs to 1 m.\n多年生少分枝亚灌木.成株高度可达1m.\nBranches ascending, usually in groups, 10 - 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n分枝向上生长,通常群生,直径10 - 20mm,无毛,呈网状.\nRosettes 12 - 25 cm in diameter, rather flat, inner leaves ascending.\n莲座直径12 - 25cm,十分平坦,内叶向上直立.\nLeaves 6 - 12 x 4 - 6 cm, 5 - 8 mm thick, obovate, apically acute, occasionally mucronate, basally cuneate, puberulent, margin with ± straight or slightly curved cilia (0.8 - 1.2mm), green to yellowish-green, often pinkish variegated.\n叶长6 - 12cm,宽4 - 6cm,厚5 - 8mm,倒卵形,先端急尖,偶尔有短尖,基部楔形,被微柔毛,边缘具直或稍弯曲的纤毛( 0.8 - 1.2mm),呈绿色至黄绿色,常有粉红色等杂色.\nInflorescences domeshaped, 10 - 30 x 10 - 25 cm, peduncle 5 - 30 cm, pedicels 2 - 4 mm, puberulent.\n穹顶状花序,高10 - 30cm,宽10 - 26cm,总花梗长5 - 31cm,花梗长2 - 4mm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 7- to 9-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 10 - 12 x 2 - 2.5 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, often pinkish or reddish variegated, filaments puberulent.\n花基数7 - 9,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长10 - 12mm,宽2 - 2.5mm,披针形,渐尖,呈白色,粉红色或经常有红色等杂色,花丝被微柔毛.\nCytology : 2n=36\n染色体:2n=36 即n=18"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_67d52a0a058d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0e95e019fe11.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1a4bd23e4f61.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:jardinexotiqueroscoff.com"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6e4e0e18b078.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_325d20e2e91f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:Wikimedia Commons"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f9a3116106a6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f6510b55a39f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "From:mrugala.net"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_38aaa7bf2d0e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "园艺种植下的valverdense.\nFrom:daepc.org"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dada475ddaa6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_85fb1af7cd7a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野境下的Aeonium valverdense.\nFrom:floradecanarias.comAeonium valverdense 舞龙华 拥有硬质的叶片以及端正的株型,在温差大的环境下,他所表现出的暖色与叶片形成了强烈的反差,令其拥有了一种别样的艺术美.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0840": {
    "title": "Aoenium ciliatum 绯缘莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "CILIATUM Webb & Berthelot, 1841 绯缘莲\n\"ciliatum\"暗指\"cilios\",意为纤毛,根据其十分有区分度的外形,拟名为."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_792ac6f553d7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo John Richards\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSempervivum ciliatum Willdenow (1809)\nSection Leuconium\n琉康尼昂(音译)组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Nothern Tenerife); 200 - 1000 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(特内里费岛北部);海拔200 - 1000m.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial few-branched subshrubs to 1 m.\n多年生少分枝亚灌木,高度可达1m左右.\nBranches ascending, 5 - 20 mm in diameter, glabrous, reticulate.\n分枝上升,直径5 - 20mm,无毛,呈网状.\nRosette 8 - 20 cm in diameter, rather flattish.\n莲座状叶,直径8 - 20cm,叶尖持平.\nLeaves 4 - 12 x 2 - 5 cm, 4 – 8 mm thick, obovate-spatulate, apically acute, basally attenuate or cuneate, glaucous, glabrate, dark green to yellowish-green, occasionally slightly folded longitudinally near the apex, margin with straight or slightly curved cilia 0.4 - 0.8 mm.\n叶片长4 - 12cm,宽2 - 5cm,厚4- 8mm,倒卵状匙形,先端尖锐,基部变细或呈楔形,叶被白霜,光滑,深绿色至黄绿色,偶尔会在叶尖附近出现纵向的0.4 - 0.8mm的纤毛.\nInflorescences domeshaped, 15 - 40 x 10 - 35 cm, peduncle 5 - 20 cm, pedicels 2 - 4 mm, puberulent.\n穹顶状花序,高15 - 40cm,宽10 - 35cm,总花梗5 - 20cm,花梗长2 - 4cm,被微柔毛.\nFlowers 7- to 9-merous, sepals puberulent, petals 7 - 10 x 1.2 - 2 mm, lanceolate, acuminate, whitish, lower face often greenish variegated, filaments sparsely puberulent.\n花基数7 - 9,萼片被微柔毛,花瓣长7 - 10mm,宽1.2 - 2mm,披针形,渐尖,发白,花瓣背面通常呈绿色杂色,花丝有稀疏的微柔毛.\nCytology : n=18\n染色体:n=18\nEasily confused with A. davidbramwellii.\n与A.davidbramwellii容易混淆."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2713e58cd3b2.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "原生地的Aeonium ciliatum.\n©Avhinojosa"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7651d7b3c624.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Aeonium ciliatum的花序\nFrom Wikipedia"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_be470ee9cd93.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野外植株.\n©Daniel Grobbel-Rank"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_12813eeff2ec.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "苗期Aeonium ciliatum\n©Dionysos en Olerdola"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a2452f90929d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_61838cd382af.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "进入夏季的Aeonium ciliatum.\n©carlesjbox理想状态,或者说特征显现时的Aeonium ciliatum:"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_622a54814bea.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Ray StephensonAeonium ciliatum绯缘莲是一个非常有特点的,能与Echeveria的红缘媲美的Aeonium,不过有时候,经常与Aeonium haworthii(夕映)及其优选种Aeonium 'Kiwi'混淆.它一定会是一个很棒的亲本.\n资料来源:ICN 有谬误之处敬请指正."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0841": {
    "title": "Crassula orbicularis 蔓巴",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权力属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者。原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕\n\n蔓巴 ORBICULARIS L. 1753Synonyms :\n异名：\nPurgosea orbicularis (L.) P.V.Heath (1993)\nCrassula sedoides Miller (1768)\nCrassula rosularis Haworth (1821)Distribution : SA (Western Cape, Eastern Cape, KwaZulu-Natal), thickets in shade.\n分布：南非（西开普，东开普，夸祖鲁纳塔尔），阴影下的灌木丛中。Description (according to Tölken, 1985, and IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据Tölken1985年的描述，和2003年的 IHSP）：\nPerennials up to 25 cm high when flowering.\n多年生植物，开花时可达25厘米高。Roots fibrous, main branches short\n纤维状的根，主枝短Rosettes few to many, often reproducing my means of runners, forming dense groups to 30 - 50 cm in diameter.\n莲座少数到多数，经常出现走茎，形成直径30 - 50厘米的密集群生。Leaves spirally arranged, oblanceolate to narrowly elliptic, or rarely obovate, 15 - 80 (-100) x 5 - 20 (-26) mm, acute, glabrous except for a dense row of spreading cilia, dorsiventrally flattened, slightly tinged pink to red along margins and towards apex, old leaves remaining attached to stems.\n叶螺旋状排列，倒披针形到狭椭圆形，或很少倒卵形，15 - 80 (-100) x 5 - 20 (-26)毫米，急性，无毛，密排蔓延的纤毛，背面扁平， 沿边缘和在先端微染粉色到红色，老叶在茎部残留。Inflorescence a terminal elongate thyrse, rarely spike-like and with numerous dichasia, pedicels short, with distinct peduncle 5 - 20 cm long.\n花序为一聚伞圆锥花序，终端细长，很少穗状和多数的二歧聚伞花序，花梗短，具有鲜明的花序梗5 - 20厘米长。\nNear Oudtshoorn.\nOudtshoorn附近\nPhotos Ryan Helen"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_efb51b0ef153.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8b4a7aefa258.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "At Bathurst, Albany district, South Africa; thicket growth.\nPhotos Jacquie Koutsoudis, South Africa"
      },
      {
