  "succ_0842": {
    "title": "Crassula schmidtii 筑波根",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权力属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者。原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕\n\n筑波根SCHMIDTII Regel, 1886 (eng./ fr.)Synonyms :\n异名：\nCrassula gracilis Hort.\nCrassula hookeri Hort.\nCrassula impressa N.E.Brown (1870)\nCrassula rubicunda Hort.Distribution : South Africa, without known locality.\n地理分布：南非，无已知地方（？）Description :\n描述：Succulent perennial herb, forming mats.\n多年生肉质草本植物，形成垫状。Stems erect or ascending, 5 - 9 cm high, green as the leaves or ± purple, covered with recurved hairs.\n茎直立或上升，5-9厘米高，叶片绿色或±紫色，被下弯毛。Radical leaves almost rosulate, oblong or linear-lanceolate or almost linear;\n胚根叶近莲座状，长圆形或线形披针形或近线形；stem leaves linear, opposite, not united; all leaves fleshy, acuminate or almost blunt, dorsiventrally glabrous, upper surface flat, green, pitted, back surface convex, margins horny and ciliate.\n茎叶线形，均在一列，不统一；全部叶肉质，渐尖或近钝，背面无毛，上表面绿色，扁平，凹陷，背面凸，边缘角和具缘毛。Inflorescences manyflowered, lax, branched, part inflorescences and flowers pedicellate, peduncle and pedicels glabrous.多花的花序，疏松，分枝，部分花序和花的花梗，花葶和花梗无毛。Flowers : Sepals not united, linear-lanceolate, acuminate, glabrous but with minutely ciliate margins,petals not united, elliptic-oblong, with a subapical mucro, almost keeled, 1/3 longer than the calyx, first erect, later spreading at the tips, red, base white.\n花：萼片不统一，线状披针形，渐尖，无毛但是稍具边缘缘毛，花瓣不统一，椭圆状长圆形，与根尖短尖头，几乎晕倒，1 / 3，长于花萼，第一直立，后来蔓延在提示，红色，基部白色。Flowering time : Winter to spring\n花期：冬季至春季Note:\n注：According to Tölken (Flora of Southern Africa, 1985, p. 229) \"a species insufficiently known .... C. schmidtiiis very similar to and probably based on a horticultural form of C. exilis subsp. cooperi as it does not agree with any of the forms recorded from the natural habitat.\"\n根据Tölken（南部非洲的植物，1985，p. 229）；一种了解不够的…C. schmidtiiis非常相似，很可能是源自C. exilis subsp. cooperi 的一个园艺形态。因为它不符合任何形式的自然栖息地的记录。\"\n\nCrassula schmidtii Protologue image, from Regel, Crassula schmidtii Rgl. Gartenflora 33: 345-346, t.1225. 1886."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_21d0088b54e4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Corrado Coccorese"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e95d06e2a3c1.png"
      },
