  "succ_0843": {
    "title": "Crassula susannae 苏珊乃漂流岛",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文来自ICN，青锁龙属 Crassula susannae 词条\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nSUSANNAE Rau & H.-C. Friedrich, 1962\n苏珊乃，由Rau 和 H.-C. Friedrich发表于1962年Section Argyrophylla\n银叶组\n（译者注：青锁龙属翻译增加后必然会牵涉到属下分组的概念 这里先暂译一下 待以后修正。 \"Argyrophylla\"词义为\"银叶，银杉\"）Distribution : RSA (Northern Cape: Little Namaqualand); growing on slopes with quartzite gravel.\n分布：南非共和国（北角：小纳马夸兰）；生长在石英砾石组成的坡地上。Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n形态描述：（根据2003版本IHSP）:Dwarf, rosulate, with erect 4-ranked leaves but sunken as a whole so that only the upper leaf margins are exposed in nature.\n矮生莲座型由以四为基数的竖直叶片组成，但因为整体凹陷（在地面？）所以只有上部的（新）叶片能暴露在外。Leaves 6 – 10 x 4 – 8 mm, oblong, flat, undulating, upper face flat, lower face slightly convex, epidermis smooth, upper exposed surface papillate, grey-green to brownish, tips truncate, old leaves persistent.\n叶长度6到10毫米，宽4到8毫米，长圆形，扁平波浪形，叶片上表面平坦，下面略凸。表皮光滑，叶尖部有小乳突，（叶片）灰绿色到棕色，叶片呈截型（译者注：类似于玉扇，寿的叶片形态），老叶片寿命很长。Inflorescences cymose capitula with few sessile flowers, peduncle to 3 cm with recurved appressed fine hairs.\n聚伞头状花序，着生数量较少的花朵，花梗约3厘米，有内弯的（？）贴伏细毛。Flowers : Sepals to 2 mm, triangular, with somewhat recurved hairs, margin ciliate, corolla tubular, to 3.5 mm, white, petals fused shortly at the base, oblong-oblanceolate, tips with indistinct dorsal appendage, anthers black.\n花萼2mm，三角形，有些许内弯的细毛，边缘有纤毛。花冠管状可有3.5mm长。花白色，花瓣在花冠基部短暂融合，长圆形或倒披针形，尖端背侧有模糊的赘生物。花药黑色。Flowering time : April - May\n花期：四到五月\nCrassula susannae, Riethuis :"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4c859b618a1b.png"
