  "succ_0849": {
    "title": "E. calderoniae 狂刃",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=113&x270_id=1134&x270_listsearch=1\n图文：ICN & Flickr\n（一切权利归原作者 \\ 转载请注明出处）（译注：原拉丁名calderoniae为\"刺猬\"之意。此莲株形独特，与其他E属或端庄、或奇崛、或古朴的外形有很大区别，而呈现一种矫健灵动、桀骜不驯的美；结合其株形、叶形和拉丁种名发音，拟名\"狂刃\"。另：此种在欧洲引种较早，栽培者也不少，但未有其任何变种或交配种的记录可查，这对E属算是比较有趣的现象）CALDERONIAE Pérez-Calix, 1997\n由植物学家Pérez-Calix在1997年命名Series Secundae \\ 七福神系Distribution : Mexico (Guanajuato)\n分布：墨西哥（瓜纳华托州）Description \\ 描述 (according \\ 根据 to IHSP 2003) :\nStem nearly lacking, branching. Rosette ± 12 cm in diameter. Leaves 20 – 30, lanceolate to narrow - oblongate, acute, with a reddish mucro, 2 – 6 x 0.5 – 0.9 cm wide in the middle, 2 – 4 mm thick, green, reddish in age. Inflorescence a cincinnus 6 – 12 cm long, pedicels 3 – 9 mm. Flowers : Sepals ascending, 3.5 – 10 mm, corolla 8 – 12 mm, 3 – 6 mm in diameter at base, reddish or orange below, yellow above.\n近乎无茎，多分生。莲座直径 ±12厘米。叶量 20 - 30片，披针形至狭长圆形，远端急尖，叶尖微红；叶长2 - 6厘米 x 宽0.5 - 0.9厘米，中部稍宽，厚2 - 4毫米；叶色绿，随成株略变红。倒蝎尾花序，6 - 13厘米；花梗长3 - 9毫米。花：萼片立生，3.5 - 10mm，花冠8 - 12毫米，基部径宽3 - 6毫米；红红色，或基部橙色+上部黄色。"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Andrea Flühs"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6a245582fbf8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_35636db9c69c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Rudolf Zacher"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2fadd14da912.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_01ab28eea4b1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos by Flickr"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0850": {
    "title": "E. cante 广寒宫",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "Echeveria cante 广寒宫原文：http://crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1189\n翻译：Qiuhan\n转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。CANTE Glass & Mendoza-Garcia, 1997\n广寒宫，由Glass和Mendoza-Garcia发表于1997年\nSeries Gibbiflorae\nGibbiflorae系\nDistribution : Mexico (Zacatecas)\n分布于墨西哥的萨卡特卡斯州\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年的IHSP）：\nStems to 10 cm tall, 2 – 3 cm in diameter, not branching.\n茎部：能长到10cm高，2-3厘米直径，不分枝。\nRosette to 40 cm in diameter\n莲座：约40cm直径。\nLeaves oblong-obovate, acute, to 18,5 x 7,2 cm, 6 mm thick, upper face flat to concave, thickly white-pruinose, sometimes tinged lavender, margin reddish.\n叶子：椭圆形或倒卵形，窄，能长到18.5x7.2cm的长宽，6mm厚，上表面是平的或凹面的，覆有一层厚厚的白霜，有时显现淡淡的薰衣草色，叶缘发红。\nInflorescences 1 or 2, all parts pruinose, cymose-paniculate, 45 – 60 cm, ±1 cm in diameter near the base, branches ± 5, each with 4 – 12 flowers, pedicels 2 – 7 (-17) mm, to 4 mm in diameter.\n花序：1-2根，部分覆有白霜，聚伞状圆锥花序，45-60cm高，基部1cm左右直径，约有5个左右分枝，每枝上4-12朵花，花梗月2-7（或17）mm长，4mm直径。\nFlowers : Sepals ascending, 10 – 15 mm ; corolla 20 mm, 10 – 15 mm in diameter near the base, exterior pruinose, orange-pink, nectar scales yellowish tinged pink.\n花：萼片竖直，10-15mm；花冠22mm，基部10-15mm直径，外覆白霜，粉橙色，蜜腺鳞片为淡黄色略带粉色。\nCytology : n = 27\n染色体：n=27\nPlants in habitat in Mexico :\n墨西哥原产地上的植株："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c75bb85e3926.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_57721a15f2c1.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a9ec54e29ce3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a9e740391e7f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Gerhard K?hres\nSierra Chapultepec, Zacatecas, Mexico :"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b61f58780660.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Dieter Felix"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6f0fee66e7b7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5e72ea74ec25.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7d6c61e6e56c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7eda52a908df.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Rudolf Zacher\nICN旧站上的相关条目（http://crassulaceae.net/echeveri ... veria-listings-c-uk，by James Low）CANTE (Glass & Mendoza, 1997), of central Mex., a long known but improperly named species, related to Ech. subrigida; name 'cante' is American Indian for \"life-water\"; published in CSSA Journ. Sept. 1997; now in new Series 5 (Gibbiflorae) in 2003 Lexicon; cytology: n=27(?), main stem to 10 cm tall, not branching, rosettes quite wide to 40 cm. dia, leaves heavily white frosted (pruinose) tinged lavender with reddish margin, inflorescences cymose, from 45 to 60 cm tall and pruinose, flowers orange-pink. This species was long confused with Ech. subrigida which has several minor details of difference.\n=*Ech. cante [Glass & Mendoza, 1997], current. = \"false Ech. subrigida of Zacatecas\" (name used by some growers since 1930s).广寒宫，由Glass和Mendoza发表于1997年，分布于墨西哥中部，是一个久负盛名的品种，但一直被冠以不当的名字，比如E. subrigida（刚叶莲）；'cante'在美国印第安人之中意为\"生命之水\"；发表于1997年九月号的CSSA Journ.；根据2003年的Lexicon中，目前属于系列5（Gibbiflorae系）；n=27（持疑）；主干10cm高，不分枝；莲座直径能长大40cm之大，叶子上覆有厚厚的白霜，发淡紫色，叶缘发红；聚伞状花序，45-60cm高，花朵覆霜，粉橙色。这个品种常常和E. subrigida（刚叶莲）混淆，但二者之间有一些细微的不同。=*Ech. cante [Glass & Mendoza, 1997], current\n=*Echeveria cante，由Glass和Mendoza发表于1997年，现用名= \"false Ech. subrigida of Zacatecas\" (name used by some growers since 1930s).\n= Echeveria subrigida of Zacatecas，错误的名字，一些种植者自二十世纪三十年代起用这个名字。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0851": {
    "title": "E. decora 德克拉饰莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "德克拉 \\ 饰莲(台译)\nDecora '데코라'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0b89bc17ad9b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "以下原文来自 International Crassulaceae Network\n作者 International Crassulaceae Network（引言）& J. C. 范柯培尔（描述）\n翻译 horse2000引言A somatic mutant of E. 'Metallica' – NOT E. gibbiflora 'Metallica' !\n它是拟石莲花属 \\ 铁石莲花的变种，而不是拟石莲花属 \\ 粉叶莲的变种！Origin unknown, introduced by Mrs. V. Debergue and Sons, Cambrai, Northern France.\n由法国北部康布雷镇的\"冯•德柏尔克女士母子公司\"(园艺公司)引进。原产地不详。First published with a short description by Emile Rodigas in : L'illustration Horticole 30 : 185, p. 505, 1883.\n此品种首次见诸书端，是在1883年埃米尔•罗迪格斯所绘并出版的《园艺插图》，第505页。Distributed in UK under the wrong name \"E. 'Meynenii' by J. C. van Keppel.\n在英国以\"拟石莲属 \\ 美奈霓\"的误名广泛引种描述Habit caulescent.\n形态 地上茎。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7545bf8d9593.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Stem 20 – 60 cm long in older plants, 20 – 30 mm thick, erect, with a dense rosette on top.\n茎干 成年株拥有20 - 60厘米长的直立茎干，径宽20 - 30毫米，密集的莲座于顶端着生。Rosette 10 – 20 cm in diameter.\n莲座 直径10 – 20厘米Leaves fleshy, 10 – 15mm thick, erect, later spreading, obovate, 4 – 10 cm long, 2 – 5 cm broad, margins irregular, most whitish or pinkish, apiculate, underside convex, upper side often deeply channeled, colour marbled green, whitish and pinkish, sometimes striped.\n叶片 肉质，10 – 15毫米厚，先直立，而后外展，倒卵形，4 - 10厘米长，2 - 5 cm宽；叶外缘不规则，颜色大多数泛白或粉红，叶端具细尖；叶面底部凸，上部常深内凹，叶片大理石绿色为主，夹杂白色和粉红色，常具拉丝锦纹。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ff0d2f2fc958.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Inflorescences 20 – 40 cm long, 1 – 1.5 cm thick, often marbled, at first spreading, later erect, bracts many in a loose rosette, smaller than in the main rosette but of the same colour; flowers in a raceme of short cincinni with 1 – 5 flowers each, pedicels short.\n花序 花茎20 - 40厘米长，1 - 1.5厘米厚，大理石纹路，先外展，而后直立，若干苞片着生在一个小型松散莲座中，此花茎莲座较主叶面莲座小，但颜色一致；短蝎尾花序，为1 - 5朵构成，花梗短。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e49852e854cb.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Flowers : Sepals unequal, widespreading at anthesis, 3 – 10 mm long, shining reddish before flowering, later variegated, corolla pinkish outside, yellowish inside, 10 mm long and wide, tips not strong, curving outwards, stigmas reddish, anthers sterile.\n花 萼片不平，花期向后打开，3 - 10毫米长，开花前带有醒目的红色，而后变为杂色；花冠外呈粉红，内为黄色，长10毫米，宽，瓣尖较薄，向外微翻，柱头微红色，花药不育。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_de345837e0b6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "又：花车为E. hoveyi，不是德克拉。正宗花车 E. hoveyi 图片如下："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_15ae9a34e912.png"
      }
    ]
  },
