  "succ_0853": {
    "title": "E. lilacina丽娜莲系杂交品种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "收集 翻译 校对：种花小医杂家赵\n资料来源：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/\n转载请注名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9386f1c9d88c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6795acbfc72f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Lola'\n露娜莲\n亲本：E. lilacina 丽娜莲 x E. derenbergii 静夜（它是由著名的石莲花属育种大师Dick Wright培育的品种）\n较常见的丽娜系杂交之一"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_974c9c7c22a8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_311d865aa4aa.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "E. 'Derenceana' （目前无正式中文名 拟为'姬露娜'）\n亲本：E. derenbergii 静夜 x E. lilacina 丽娜莲（和露娜莲父母本相反）\n关于两者的区别ICN是这样描述的：\nThe parents are the same as for Echeveria 'Lola' but the mother plant for 'Lola' is Echeveria lilacina.\nE. 'Derenceana' and E. 'Lola' are fairly similar. Differences in young plants often are not distinct, and the flowers of both hybrids are the same. Older plants can be distinguished because of their size - the rosette of E. 'Lola' is larger and more open than that of E. 'Derenceana'.\n可见两者是极为相似的，在幼株时甚至无法分辨。而两者的花也很相似。只有在成株后才能发现区别，露娜莲的直径要明显大过E. 'Derenceana'\n（译者的想法：\n1.感觉国内的大部分露娜莲其实是E. 'Derenceana'？ 因为从文中可知露娜莲的体量基本和丽娜是一致的 而我观察到各个版本的的露娜尺寸相对迷你\n2.通过这一对父母本交换的杂交品种对比，我们发现母本是静夜时，子代遗传到了更加小巧的株型，这是否是母本细胞质遗传会影响后代性状的例子呢？而在观察雪莲杂交的时候也有类似感觉，雪莲作为母本时子代往往会拥有雪莲的丸状叶片 叶尖不明显 而雪莲作为父本时子代的叶尖往往典型存在-----随母本石莲花的性状）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_28100a1731e4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Lidia'\n起源不明\n亲本 : Echeveria lilacina 丽娜莲 x E. spec. （不明石莲花属品种）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4f13962071b7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Lucinda'\nHybrid by Jocelyn Ainsworth.\n亲本 : Echeveria lilacina 丽娜莲 x E. spec. （不明石莲花属品种）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e9a5530caec2.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Clarina'\n亲本 : E. colorata 卡罗拉 x E. lilacina 丽娜莲\nCreated by Paul Neut, Belgium."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a0e6c24d333d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c4434b89d4a4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Tynie Burger'\n可能的亲本 : Echeveria elegans 月影 和 E. lilacina 丽娜莲 或者 E. 'Lola'露娜莲的杂交（父母本顺序不明）\n这是一个在Tynie Burger的苗圃发现的自发杂交品种\n叶子的厚度和颜色根据阳光多寡，是否露养等环境差异会发生较大变化\n阴养状态："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_809933e43bd6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_55f0fd35cfd4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Secret Garden'\n起源不明\n亲本 : Echeveria pulidonis 花月夜 x E. lilacina 丽娜莲 （这个组合似乎和猎户座一样哦？）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4dd970cb7ed8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0b1dcba14af0.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Beverley'\n亲本 : E. lilacina 丽娜莲 x E. 'Mexican Giant' 墨西哥巨人\n培育人：Jocelyn Ainsworth"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e610e33537fb.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "'Sibil'\n亲本: E. shaviana 沙维娜x E. lilacina 丽娜莲 ?\nNamed by / Nommée par Catalina Marti & Maria Osma"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0854": {
    "title": "E. purpusorum 大和锦系杂交品种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "收集 翻译 校对：种花小医杂家赵\n资料来源：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/\n转载请注名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_811004826dae.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e95cf3bd0abe.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c0376451580d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle AubéGreen Leaf '그린 리프'\n起源不明亲本 : 大和锦 x 不知名拟石莲属植物\"Echeveria Cultivars\" indicates : \"Should be E. purpusorum 'Green Leaf' (a form of the species)\" – this is not correct. The plant is a hybrid of E. purpusorum.\n《园艺石莲花》标明：'绿叶'是大和锦的一个变型的说法是不对的。这种植物是大和锦的杂交品种。——————————————————————————"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_72fac4bf75c3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dce919fd13e2.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f8e688f4e40f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_98096a6bb6f4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle AubéParva '파르바'Listed in the catalogue of Haage & Schmidt with the parentage : E. purpusorum x E. spec.\n在哈格尔和施密特编写的目录中记录亲本为：大和锦*不知名拟石莲属植物Distributed as ISI 804, 1973\n由 ISI 804, 1973所描述\"An old hybrid between E. purpusorum and possibly E. pumila [now E. secunda 'Pumila'], this should be more widely grown. Neat and compact as in E. purpusorum, it also shows similar spotted leaf markings. It is nearly stemless, eventually offsetting, and is easily grown. Grown from plants originally from Grown from plants originally from Eric Walther in 1959.\" in 1959.\"\n一款古老的杂交品种，亲本为大和锦，另一亲本极有可能是 E. pumila （即七福神），这种植物应该被更广泛的种植。它有简洁和紧凑的株型，一如它的亲本大和锦，也有类似于大和锦的叶面斑点。近乎无茎，易丛生，容易种植。此植物较初是在1959年从Eric Walther 处传播开的。——————————————————————"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_52ddd0d50354.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cb3c58f07d7a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ff77746456e1.png"
      },
      {
