        "t": "Photo Jacquie KoutsoudisAmethorum '아메토룸'\n红葡萄\nCreated by Charles Uhl.\n由Charles Uhl培育.Parentage / Parenté : Echeveria purpusorum (Uhl #2007) x Graptopetalum amethystinum (Uhl *1390B).\n亲本：大和锦*桃之卵Distributed as ISI 1662: This strangely attractive hybrid has a compact rosette reminiscent of some haworthias, with greyish leaves tipped with a green margin.\n由 ISI 1662描述：这种不同寻常的、极具吸引力的杂交品种拥有紧凑的莲座，甚至让人联想起某些十二卷属植物。它有灰色的叶片和绿色的叶尖和叶缘。——————————————————————————"
