  "succ_0855": {
    "title": "E.globuliflora 珠花莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "翻译：种花小医杂家赵\n原文来自ICN-echeveria条目-原始种globuliflora词条\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。种名\"globuliflora\"来源于拉丁语,意为\"小球形的花朵\"。拟中文名为\"珠花莲\"，本文感谢刀之莲台提供植株图片。\nGLOBULIFLORA Walther, 1959\n珠花莲，由 Walther发表于1959年Series Nudae\n蜡牡丹系Distribution: Mexico (Oaxaca Tehuantepec, Cerro Jilotepec) ± 2100 m.\n分布：墨西哥(Oaxaca Tehuantepec, Cerro Jilotepec)， 海拔± 2100 m.Description (according to IHSP, 2003):\n描述（根据IHSP，2003版本）：Stem to 10 cm long or more, sparsely branching.\n茎长10厘米或以上，分枝较松散。Leaves subrosulate, oblong-oblanceolate to obovate-cuneate, mucronate, acute or shortly acuminate, ± 5- 1,5 cm, green, lower face, edges and keel reddish.\n叶近乎排列为莲座型，倒披针形长圆形或倒卵形楔形叶片，具短尖，锐尖或短渐尖，±5厘米长 1.5厘米宽，叶片绿色，叶片下表面、叶边缘和叶中脊线红色。Inflorescences irregularly cymose-paniculate, to 25 cm long, lower branches few, short, each with 2 – 6 flowers, pedicels to 1 cm or more.\n花序：圆锥状不规则，长25厘米，下部分枝少，短，每个花序2–6花，花梗1厘米或更长一些。Flowers: Sepals strongly ascending to appressed, longest 4 – 5 mm, corolla globose-urceolate, pentagonal, to 10 x 8 mm in diameter, petals apiculate, orange -red.\n花：萼片紧密贴合在花上，较长约4-5毫米，花冠球瓮形，（正面观）五边形，10×8毫米直径，花瓣尖细，橘红色。Cytology : n= 42\n细胞学检查：染色体数=42Note :\n注释- Whether Fig. 144 and 145 in Pilbeam's book \" Echeveria\" show the correct plant is rather doubtful.\nPilbeam的著作《拟石莲属》中的图144和145是否是正确的图示非常可疑。- And the 2 photos by Julia Etter & Martin Kristen of a plant in cultivation show X Cremneria ′Expatriata′:\n由朱丽亚埃特和马丁克里斯汀栽培的植物的两张照片展示的其实是X cremneria′expatriata′\n珠花莲的图片："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_79d002d5c0a1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "作者不明 来自微博搜索"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_01e59716bfae.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fefb0e7c3078.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_af98a22185a3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "pics from 刀之莲台"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b7e521b349dc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "出处见水印"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0856": {
    "title": "E.leucotricha 白兔耳及其杂交种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "写在较前面的话：\n因为名字的关系，这个品种长期和月兔耳 千兔耳 黑兔耳 福兔耳 火星兔子等品种混杂，但其实白兔耳是拟石莲属的植物 ，月兔耳 黑兔耳等品种是伽蓝菜属植物，火星兔子是青锁龙属的。原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=113&x270_id=1431&x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。LEUCOTRICHA Purpus, 1914Series Echeveria\n拟石莲系Distribution: Mexico (Puebla: Cerro del Castillo, Caltepec)\n分布地：墨西哥 (Puebla: Cerro del Castillo, Caltepec)Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n形态描述（根据IHSP 2003版）：Stem to 15 cm tall or more, 12 – 15 cm in diameter.\n茎干：高15厘米以上，（单个莲座）约有12 - 15厘米直径。Leaves laxly subrosulate, oblong-oblanceolate, obtuse, mucronate, 5 – 8 x 2 – 2,8 cm, 10 – 13 mm thick, green but densely covered with white hairs, with brown hairs at the tip.\n叶片：排列疏松，近莲座形。叶长圆状倒披针形，钝，有短尖，长5 - 8厘米，宽2 - 2,8厘米，厚度10 - 14毫米。叶色绿，密被白色茸毛，尖端的绒毛呈棕色。Inflorescences subspicate to subpaniculate, to 40 cm, pedicels short, mostly single-flowered.\n花序：近似于穗状花序或圆锥花序，高可达40厘米，花梗短，多为单花。Flowers: Sepals appressed, to 10 mm, corolla to 18 x 8 mm in diameter near the base, 7 mm in diameter at the mouth, red.\n花：萼片贴伏，10毫米，花冠基部附近直径18×8毫米，花冠直径7毫米，花红色。Cytology : n = 38\n细胞学检测：染色体数=38"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e25d9a41a2cc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé"
