      },
      {
        "t": "An attractive white-haired form, 'Frosty', was found by A. Lau at San Miguel Maninaltepec (Oaxaca) :\n一个引人入胜的白毛形态：雪晃星(Echeveria pulvinata 'Frosty')，由A. Lau在Oaxaca州的San Miguel Maninaltepec发现:"
