      {
        "t": "Echeveria pulvinata 'Ruby' (选育的锦晃星'Ruby'，同样条件下其红边总是比锦晃星原始种更明显，怀疑园艺市场上流行的应该都是'Ruby'）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d2a3872034a5.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_40fd9d8bf8de.png"
