  "succ_0858": {
    "title": "E.setosa var.ciliata 王妃锦司晃",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1910\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria setosa var. ciliata (Moran) Moran, 1993\n锦司晃变种：王妃锦司晃，由Moran发表于1993年Synonym : Echeveria ciliata Moran (1961)\n异名：Echeveria ciliata Moran (1961)Series Ciliatae\nCiliatae系Distribution : Mexico (Oaxaca : SE of Huajuapan)\n分布于墨西哥Oaxaca州Huajuapan的东南部。Description (according to IHSP. 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Differs from var. setosa :\n与锦司晃的不同之处：\nRosette 5 – 13 cm in diameter, branching.\n莲座：5-13cm直径，易分枝。Leaves obovate-cuneate, obtuse, mucronate, 2.5 – 6 x 1.5 – 3.7 cm wide above, 5 – 9 mm thick, green, margins and keel ciliate, surface glabrous or slightly hirsute.\n叶：倒卵形-楔形，圆头，有短尖，2.5-6cm长，1.5-3.7cm宽，5-9mm厚，绿色，叶缘和脊背上有纤毛，表面无毛或有些许粗毛。Inflorescence with 3- to 14- (to 24-) flowered cincinni, pedicels 6 – 35 mm.\n花序：上有3-14甚至24根有花的蝎尾状花序，花梗6-35mm。Flowers : Corolla 10 – 16 x 6.5 – 10 mm in diameter.\n花：花冠10-16mm高，6.5-10mm直径。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4c2df2422912.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9de026ff560f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ed Dunin-Wasowicz"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_42773a1c4a74.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_59c19af24ec0.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dd58a72b190d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Werner Krell"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0859": {
    "title": "E.setosa var.deminuta 小蓝衣",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1911\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。Echeveria setosa var. deminuta J. Meyrán, 1989\n锦司晃变种：小蓝衣，由J. Meyrán发表于1989年Synonym : Echeveria rondelii Hort. Sterk (1989)\n异名：Echeveria rondelii Hort. Sterk (1989)（译者注：Echeveria tundelii应当也是小蓝衣。tundelii=rundelli，我不知道这一步是误传还是确实是异名，但很多地方都说tundelii also known as rundelli或者rundelli also known as tundelii。而rundelli=rondelii，这一步基本可以肯定是误传，因为rundelli并不是rondelii的异名，但rundelli确实是rondelii，因为几乎所有rundelli的资料都指向rondelii。较后Echeveria rondelii 是E. setosa var. deminuta 的异名。详见http://funjing.com/forum.php?mod ... &page=1#pid3811中的讨论。如有错误还请指出。另外，Echeveria 'Jim Rundell'也是小蓝衣，这个名字很不常见了，出现于这个物种刚被发现并引入商业的时候。）\nSeries Ciliatae\nCiliatae系Distribution : Mexico (Oaxaca : Sierra Mixteca)\n分布于墨西哥Oaxaca州的Mixteca山脉Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem 6 – 8 mm in diameter, copiously branching.\n茎部：6-8mm直径，易分枝。Rosette 2 – 6 (-7) cm in diameter.\n莲座：2-6（或7）cm直径。Leaves oblanceolate, acute, 1 – 3 x 0.4 – 0.9 cm wide above, 1.5 – 5 mm thick, glabrous or commonly with a few white hairs near tip or sometimes on margins or keel, green or at first glaucous.\n叶：倒披针形，有尖，1-3cm长，上端0.4-0.9cm宽，1.5-5mm厚；无毛，或顶端有些许白毛，有时白毛也出现在叶缘和脊线上；绿色，新叶可能为灰绿色。Inflorescences glabrous or somewhat hirsute except inside flowers, 3 – 16 cm long, 1.5 – 3 mm in diameter, cincinni 2- to 7- flowered, pedicels 9 (-27) mm.\n花序：无毛或除了花心之外有粗毛；3-16cm长，1.5-3mm直径，蝎尾状花序上2-7朵花；花梗9（-27）mm。Flowers : Corolla 8 – 12 x 4 – 7 mm in diameter.\n花：花冠8-12mm高，4-7mm直径。Cytology : n = 25\n染色体：n=25"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_114539b3fde6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Jens Kumke"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f837d00ba65a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_82e26df85641.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Werner Krell"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bd28efff785e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_91e67594f746.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Jacquie Koutsoudis, South Africa"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0860": {
    "title": "E.subcorymbosa 蓝宝石和lau 026",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文来自ICN —— 拟石莲属属下E. subcorymbosa 词条\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nSeries Racemosae.\n总状花序系Distribution : Mexico (Oaxaca :North of Santiago Juxtlahuaca)\n分布：墨西哥（瓦哈卡州：Santiago Juxtlahuaca以北）Description (according to IHSP 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年的IHSP）：Stem usually < 4 cm long, 5 – 8 mm in diameter.\n茎通常短于4厘米，直径5 - 8毫米。Rosette 4 – 6 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径约4到6厘米Leaves obovate-spatulate, cuspidate, 1,5 – 3 x 0,8 – 2,5 cm wide at the widest part, glaucous bluish-grey, often red-flecked beneath, margins reddish.\n叶：倒卵状匙形，尖，1.5 - 3厘米长，0.8 - 2.5厘米宽(在较宽的部分)，叶为带有白霜的蓝灰色，叶背面常有红色斑点，叶缘红色。Inflorescences:4,5 – 11 cm, racemose but appearing corymbose because of the long lower pedicels, pedicels sub-erect, 1 – 3 cm, the lowest the longest, each with 1 – 3 minute bracts.\n花序：4,5 - 11厘米，总状花序，因为下方的花梗较长，故形似伞房花序。花梗直立，1 - 3厘米长。低位的花梗较长，每个花梗有1 - 3个小苞片。Flowers 3 – 12, sepals slightly ascending, 5 – 11 x 2 – 3 mm, corolla ovoid, pentagonal, 8 – 14 x 6 – 8 mm in diameter, 3 – 4 mm in diameter at the mouth, petals oblong, subobtuse, lower portion reddish-orange, upper part yellow.\n花：3 - 12（朵）。萼片稍微上翘，5 - 11毫米长，2 - 3毫米宽。花冠卵圆形，五角形。8 - 14毫米长，花管6 - 8毫米直径，花朵开口3 -4毫米宽。花瓣长圆形，稍钝，近花梗处红橙色，上部黄色。Cytology : n = 29\n细胞学检查：染色体数29The population from Tlacotepec has much wider leaves and may be deserving of varietal status.\n在Tlacotepec分布的subcorymbosa种群有更宽大的叶片，可能足以获得独立物种地位。\nE. subcorymbosa Lau 030 in habitat near Laguna Encantada, Oaxaca, Mexico.\nE. subcorymbosa Lau 030在 靠近Laguna Encantada，墨西哥的瓦哈卡州的栖息地状态"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0b2319e79fe3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_469f8f7dbbbc.png"
      },
      {
