  "succ_0861": {
    "title": "Echeveria 'Alba Aloha'阿罗哈",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "Echeveria 'Alba Aloha'原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=2442\n翻译：Qiuhan\nParentage : Echeveria tolimanensis x E. subcorymbosa Lau 030\n亲本：拟石莲属杜里万莲 x 拟石莲属蓝宝石Lau 030Created by Brian McDonough\n由Brian McDonough培育Brian explains the name as follows :\nBrian对这个名字的解释如下：\"The Alba in this instance is not a reference to a white colour, but to the Gaelic name for Scotland. The Aloha came as a result of the flowers. The wavy, horizontal disposition of the flowering stem reminded me of the arm movements of Hawaiian dancers. Hence 'Alba Aloha' - A Scottish Hello !\" \"这里的Alba（意为'白'）并不是指颜色，而是盖尔语中苏格兰的意思。Aloha（夏威夷语的词汇，代表希望、爱、和平、幸福等）则是指花的形态，那种水平伸展的波浪状花梗让我不禁想起夏威夷舞者舞动的手臂。因此，'Alba Aloha'可以理解为——来自苏格兰的祝福。\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fd6b80a7350b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2e50e6b753a1.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5a32044493a9.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_552be5a8297a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c219c431fbf8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b33a2b2d7606.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos by Brian McDonough\n另：\n亲本之一的E. subcorymbosa 蓝宝石，图片同样来自ICN，Photos by Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_42d4b9e2aeed.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_09e45d08f4dc.png"
