  "succ_0862": {
    "title": "Echeveria 'Blue Bird'（蓝鸟）",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "感谢@Qiuhan 的贡献。\n*本文由原译者Qiuhan授权由小岛向北代为发布。\n[第67页] 'Blue Bird'（蓝鸟），由Frank Reinelt培育，成株约25厘米大，规律地移除分出来的小头能够使植株长得更大。健康植株的叶子呈现浓郁的蓝白色，叶缘在秋冬季发红。需尽量避免碰触叶子，上面的白霜极易被抹掉。可以通过分头和叶插繁殖。\n'Blue Bird'（蓝鸟）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_61346bfcaeac.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "（英文原著于 《Echeveria Cultivars》，作者 Lorraine Schulz / Attila Kapitany）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0863": {
    "title": "Echeveria Crinkles",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "[第83页] 'Crinkles'，由Harry Butterfield培育，独生，成株约20厘米，之后发展成老桩，需要每3-4年砍头重植。植株为发银色的蓝灰，季节性变色较少，褶皱的叶缘非常特别。可以通过砍头以及随之而来的分头繁殖，花梗繁殖也可行。\n'Crinkles'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3577932ced6b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "（英文原著于 《Echeveria Cultivars》，作者 Lorraine Schulz / Attila Kapitany）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0864": {
    "title": "Echeveria alata 红翼",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index ... p;x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵\n一切权利属于原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者，欢迎勘误。\nALATA Alexander, 1941\n红翼 由亚历山大发表于1941年Series Nudae\n蜡牡丹系Distribution : Mexico, Oaxaca.\n分布：墨西哥，瓦哈卡。Description (according to IHSP 2003) :\n形态描述（根据IHSP2003版）Stem to 8 cm tall or more, ± 7 mm in diameter.\n茎干8厘米高或更高，直径7毫米上下。Leaves diffuse along the stem or subrosulate, oblanceolate, cuspidate, 3 – 6 x 1 – 2,4 cm, 6 - 8 mm thick, green, margin red.\n叶沿茎松散生长或成半莲座型，叶倒披针形，骤尖，3 - 6厘米长1 - 2,4厘米宽，6 - 8毫米厚，绿色，叶缘红。Inflorescences : racemes 10 – 20 cm, pedicel 15 – 18 mm.\n花序：总状花序，10 - 20厘米长，花梗长15 - 18毫米。Flowers : Sepals strongly ascending, to 11- 18 mm, corolla urceolate, 17 – 22 mm long, sharply 5- angled or 5-winged, scarlet below, yellow at apex.\n花：萼片上翘，11 - 19毫米长，花冠壶状，17 - 22毫米长，锋利的五角星形或五边形，基部深红色，口部黄色。Cytology : n = 17\n细胞学检查：染色体数=17Distributed as ISI 1643 in 1986 with the description : \"Forming a small shrublet with dark green leaves, this species puts on a colourful display with its bright orange flowers. .... a plant collected ... by A. Lau at 2200m below Quiotepec, near Yolox, in the Chinanteca Alta, Oaxaca, Mexico; plants grew in humus in crevices of almost perpendicular rock.\"作为 ISI1643号植物（1986年）被如此描述：\"生长为有深绿色叶的小型灌木，这个品种色彩丰富，体现在其明亮的橙色花朵........由A.lau于Quiotepec这个地点的海拔2200米以下收集而来，（这个地点）靠近Yolox，在墨西哥瓦哈卡州的Chinanteca，alta。植株在几乎垂直的岩缝腐殖质中生长。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ed35954e2bd6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_50702aac7233.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a407afca146f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e807fee2b38d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_776fc10bd074.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Werner Krell"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_906c5962267e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "pics from flicker"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0865": {
    "title": "Echeveria amoena 花乃井",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1086\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。AMOENA De Smet, 1875\n由De Smet发表于1875年Synonyms :\n异名：\nEcheveria pusilla A.Berger (1904)\nEcheveria purpusii Britton (1905)\nEcheveria microcalyx Britton & Rose (1911)Series Paniculatae\n圆锥花序系（译注：此系名下仅有子持白莲和花乃井两个物种）Distribution Mexico (Puebla, Veracruz)\n栖息地：墨西哥（普埃布拉，韦拉克鲁斯）Description (according to IHSP 2003) :\n形态描述（根据IHSP2003版）：Stem to 5 cm or more, 3 – 5 mm in diameter, branching.\n茎干5厘米或更长，3 - 5毫米直径，多分枝。Rosette 2,5 – 5,5 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径2.5到5.5厘米Leaves obovate-spatulate, cuspidate, 1 – 2 x 0,7 – 1,5 cm, ± 4 mm thick near tip, glaucous-green, often red-tipped.\n叶倒卵状匙形，骤尖，1 - 2厘米长×0,7 - 1,5厘米宽，叶尖附近±4毫米厚，覆盖白霜的绿色，常有红尖。Inflorescences laxly cymose-paniculate with cincinni, ± 10 – 20 cm long, bracts minute, 4 – 10 (-20) mm, easily detached, pedicel slender, 1 – 3 cm.\n花序为稀疏的聚伞-圆锥状蝎尾花序，±10 - 20厘米长，苞片极小，4 - 10（-20）毫米长，容易脱落，花梗纤细，1 - 3厘米。Flowers : Sepals slightly spreading, < 3 mm, corolla cylindrical, 7 – 9 x ± 4 mm in diameter near the base, salmon-orange.\n花：萼片稍开展，<3毫米。花冠圆筒形，7 - 9mm长，接近基部约4毫米直径，鲑鱼橙色。Cytology : n = 33,66.\n细胞学检查：N =33,66。Echeveria microcalyx differs mainly in having slightly larger leaves and in growing taller.\n与微萼石莲花的区别主要是稍大的叶型和较高的株高Plant in habitat, Laguna de Aljojuca, Puebla, Mexico :\n原产地植株，Laguna de Aljojuca, Puebla, 墨西哥："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_89d207aee775.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f0d5037ddf32.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4879011693a6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Alexis HernándezPlants in cultivation :\n园艺种植："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b2d1220bfcd4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Paul NeutE. amoena, Perote (Veracruz), with much longer inflorescence :\n来自派罗特（维拉科鲁兹）的花乃井，有更长的花序;"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c18a7046829f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6c1bce4728e9.png"
