  "succ_0866": {
    "title": "Echeveria bifida 贝飞达",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1098\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。Echeveria bifida Schlechtendal., 1839\n贝飞达，由Schlechtendal.发表于1839年Synonyms :\n异名：\nCotyledon bifida (Schlechtendal) Hemsley (1880)\nEcheveria bifurcata Rose (1909)\nEcheveria erubescens E. Walther (1972)\nEcheveria tenuifolia E. Walther (1972)Series Angulatae\n剑司系\nDistribution : Mexico (Hidalgo, Queretaro?)\n分布于墨西哥Hidalgo州和Queretaro州（持疑）\nDescription (according to IHSP 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem to 6 cm tall or more, ±1 – 1,5 cm in diameter, usually unbranched\n茎部：6cm或更高，±1-1.5cm直径，茎部通常不分枝。Rosette 6 – 10 ( - 20 cm) in diameter.\n莲座：6-10（-20）cm直径。Leaves lanceolate to rhomboid-oblanceolate, acuminate, mucronate, 4 -10 x 1 – 2,5 cm, upper face, concave to flat, green to purplish.\n叶：披针形到菱形-倒披针形，渐尖，有短尖，4-10cm长，1-2.5cm宽，上表面下凹或平坦，绿色到淡紫色。Inflorescences single, to 3-branched cincinni, with 6 – 20 flowers, pedicels 1 – 4 (- 8) mm.\n花序：独生，较多有3根蝎尾状分枝，6-20朵花，花梗1-4（-8）mm。Flowers : Sepals to 15 mm, subterete to terete, spreading to reflexed, corolla 12 – 17 x 9 – 11 mm in diameter at the base, 4 mm in diameter at the mouth, reddish or yellowish below, reddish above.\n花：萼片可达15mm，半圆柱型到圆柱形，张开或反折；花冠12-17mm高，基部9-11mm直径，顶部4mm直径；基部淡红色或淡黄色，顶部发红。Cytology : n = 12\n染色体：n=12\nAlthough Walther (1972) recognized 3 other species distinct from E. bifida, all have the same chromosome number and differ in such minor details as stem length, the concavity of the upper leaf face, number of inflorescences branches and length of the pedicels. They all seem better reduced under E. bifida.\n尽管Walther曾认为有三种与贝飞达不同的物种（译者注：即Echeveria bifurcata、Echeveria erubescens、Echeveria tenuifolia ，但它们的染色体数目全都相同，且四者之间的差异非常细微，比如茎部的长度、上表面的下凹程度、花序上的分枝数目和花梗的长度。因此，其他三种较好也都归于贝飞达名下。\nNote :\n请注意：The flower photo Fig. 39 in Pilbeam \"Echeveria\", p. 60, by B. Kemble, is misleading : The flower of E. bifurcata (synonym of E. bifida) is pale yellowish in the lower third to half – and not whitish – and pinkish to reddish above – not dark red.\nPilbeam的《Echeveria》一书中第60页上第39幅插图（by B. Kemble）很具有误导性：E. bifurcata（贝飞达的异名）的花下半部分应该是淡黄色的，不是白色，上部应该是淡粉色至淡红色的，不是深红色。\nE. bifida, Zimapan, HGO and E. bifida, Sta Maria Mexicano,QRO\nHidalgo州Zimapan地区的贝飞达和Queretaro州Sta Maria地区的贝飞达："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bab3feafa4bf.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ae82f0f8a816.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "E. bifida, Guanajuato :\nGuanajuato州的贝飞达："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_be7a7254c4d5.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_990dbe825b54.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Rudolf Zacher"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d020a6f5136c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Margrit Bischofberger左下为译者2013春播的贝飞达："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c7302256c980.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0867": {
    "title": "Echeveria calycosa 金明灭",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "翻译：种花小医杂家赵\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\n\"calycosa\"应来源于拉丁语,意为\"有翘起苞片的\"。草拟中文名时看到出状态的成株图，色调金绿，叶薄纤弱，颇有花姿。如唐朝仕女额上所贴花黄。花黄也称花子，是古代妇女脸部的一种女性额饰，又称额黄、鹅黄、鸭黄、约黄等。它是用彩色光纸、绸罗、云母片、蝉翼、蜻蜒翅乃至鱼骨等为原料，染成金黄、霁红或翠绿等色，剪作花、鸟、鱼等形，粘贴于额头、酒靥、嘴角、鬓边等处。故引唐代温庭筠词《菩萨蛮 小山重叠金明灭》中【金明灭】一词——\"额上若隐若现的花黄\"，拟为中文名。\nCALYCOSA Moran, 1967.\nCALYCOSA 由Moran于 1967发表.Series Valvatae\n镊合花系Distribution : Mexico (Michoacan)\n分布地：墨西哥Description (based on IHSP 2003) :\n形态描述，根据2003版IHSP：Stems < 4cm long.\n茎＜4cm长。Rosette single, 5 – 10 cm in diameter.\n莲座单生，直径5–10厘米。Leaves spatulate, obtuse, slightly mucronate, 2,5 – 5 (-9) x 1,5 - 2,5 (- 3,5) cm, light green.\n叶片匙形，钝圆，稍短尖，2,5–5（- 9）厘米长，1.5 - 2（－3）厘米宽，淡绿色。Inflorescence mostly a single cincinnus, at first nodding, later ascending, to 21 cm long, with conspicuous bracts, imbricate in young inflorescences, pedicels 2 – 5 mm.\n花序多为单一蝎尾状聚伞花序，起始处低垂，后平展生长，长可达21厘米，有引人注目的苞片叶，在幼嫩花序上排列为覆瓦状，花梗2到5毫米长。Flowers : Calyx pink at base, light green above, sepals ascending, very unequal, to 13 mm ; petals valvate ; corolla 7,5 – 10 mm long, yellow above, orange below.\n花：花萼基部粉色，上部浅绿色，萼片上翘，大小极为不均，较长约13毫米；花瓣镊合状；花冠7,5–长10毫米，上部黄色，下方为橙色。Cytology : n = 31\n细胞学检查：N = 31Growing in lichens on shaded vertical rocks.\n与地衣伴生在垂直岩壁的背阴处。Distributed as ISI 964, 1976.\n发布于ISI 964，1976。Note :\nThe closest relative is E. valvata. Both species have valvate (not imbricate) petals, a bicoloured calyx and comparatively long sepals.\n注：\n与E. valvata有较近的亲戚关系。两个品种都有有镊合状（不是覆瓦状）的花瓣，双色的花萼和相对较长的萼片。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_46493a8987f6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f1613aaf9818.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Mieke Geuens"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_db675003b389.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4e192956f5b4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos zusang"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5ec03b273a01.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "photo 尘一凡"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0868": {
    "title": "Echeveria carnicolor 银明色",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1100\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria carnicolor E.Morren, 1874\n银明色，由E. Morren发表于1874年Synonym : Cotyledon carnicolor, Baker (1870)\n异名：Cotyledon carnicolor, Baker (1870)Series Racemosae\n总状花序系\nDistribution : Mexico (Veracruz)\n分布于墨西哥的Veracruz州\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003IHSP）：Stem usually < 6 cm long, 1 – 1,5 cm in diameter, branching.\n茎：长度通常小于6cm，1-1.5cm直径，分枝。Rosette 7 – 10 cm in diameter.\n莲座：7-10cm直径Leaves oblong-oblanceolate, obtuse to subacute, 4 – 7 x 1 – 1,5 cm, 5 – 6 mm thick, densely papillose and glistening, greyish or purplish-green.\n叶：椭圆形-倒披针形，叶尖圆润或微尖，4-7cm长，1-1.5cm宽，5-6mm厚；上有密集的乳突，闪亮；灰绿色或紫绿色。Inflorescences to 15 cm, equilaterally racemose, often basally branching, bracts easily detached and rooting, pedicels to 8 mm.\n花序：可达15cm，等边圆锥花序，常从基部分枝；苞叶很容易脱落并发根；花梗8mm。Flowers : Sepals widely spreading, to 6 mm, corolla sharply pentagonal, to 10 x 6 mm in diameter, salmon-orange above, flesh-colored below.\n花：花萼6mm，显著张开；花冠为标准的五边形，可达10mm高、6mm直径，上部为三文鱼肉一样的橙色，下部鲜肉的颜色。Cytology : n = 18\n染色体：n=18\nDistinctive because of its slightly glistening papillose leaves and short inflorescence.\n因为其闪亮的带乳突的叶子而独一无二，短短的花序也很特别。Note:\n请注意：According to David Jimeno, plants in the wild are never greyish or bluish-grey like the plants in our collections.\n根据David Jimeno的说法，野生环境下的银明色并不像人工养殖的植株那样呈现灰色调或蓝灰色。"
      },
