  "succ_0869": {
    "title": "Echeveria chihuahuaensis 吉娃娃",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1205\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。Echeveria chihuahuaensis von Poellnitz, 1935\n吉娃娃，由von Poellnitz发表于1935年\nSeries Urbiniae\nUrbiniae系Distribution : Mexico (Sonora, Chihuahua, Durango)\n分布于墨西哥的Sonora州、Chihuahua州、Durango州。Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem < 5 cm long, ± 1 cm in diameter, rarely branching.\n茎：<5cm长，直径1cm左右，茎部很少分枝。Leaves obovate-oblong to obovate-spatulate or oblong, 4 – 6 x 3 – 4 cm, cuspidate-mucronate, glaucous white to greenish- white, margins and tips reddened.\n叶：倒卵形-椭圆形到倒卵形-铲形或椭圆形，4-6cm长，3-4cm宽，具硬尖-短尖；蓝绿色或绿色，被霜；叶缘和叶尖发红。Inflorescence a cincinnus, 1 – (to 5 -) branched, to 20 cm, pedicels to 14 mm.\n花序：单枝蝎尾状聚伞花序，1-5根分叉，可达20cm高；花梗约14mm。Flowers : Sepals very unequal, longest ± 8 mm, appressed or ascending ; corolla cylindrical, ± 2 x as long as thick, ± 14 mm long ; petals reddish,\n花：萼片大小差异很大，较长的约8mm，紧贴花瓣或竖直；花冠为圆柱形，长14cm左右，约为宽的2倍；花瓣淡红色。Cytology : n = 26, 50.\n染色体：n=26, 50。\nThe species typically has white-glaucous leaves but, in one population, there were a few plants with dark green leaves.\n这个物种通常有着蓝绿色覆白霜的叶子，但某个特定种群有着深绿色的叶子。\nNote : The correct name is \"chihuahuaensis\", not \"chihuahuensis\" as erroneously indicated in IHSP.\n请注意：正确的名字是chihuahuaensis，不是chihuahuensis，IHSP写错了。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5d06d0821d67.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2e04319f5db3.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4512b5710a94.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_195766b2242d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Bernie DeChantEcheveria chihuahuaensis 'Ruby Blush'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e17ab3768956.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_eb05fc33ced8.png"
      },
