  "succ_0870": {
    "title": "Echeveria colorata 卡罗拉",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1102\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria colorata fa. colorata E.Walther, 1972\n卡罗拉，由E. Walther发表于1972年Synonym : Echeveria lindsayana.\n异名：林德赛\n（译者注：lindsayana已经更名为卡罗拉，林德赛这个名字不应当再出现了。且林德赛不是卡罗拉的亚种/变种/变形，而就是卡罗拉本身。Echeveria colorata 和 Echeveria colorata fa. colorata是一回事，即卡罗拉\nSeries Urbiniae\nUrbiniae系Distribution Mexico (Jalisco)\n分布于墨西哥的Jalisco州Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem < 8 cm long, rarely branching.\n茎：小于8cm长，茎部很少分枝。Rosette 13- 20 cm in diameter, with up to 40 leaves.\n莲座：13-20cm直径，叶子可达40片。Leaves ovate to obovate, 5 – 9 x 3 – 5 cm, to 8 mm thick, bluish-glaucous, suffused with red along margins and tip.\n叶：卵形或倒卵形，5-9cm长，3-5cm宽，淡蓝色或蓝绿色被霜，叶缘和叶尖红色。Inflorescences to 30 cm tall, 2- to 3-branched, cincinni to 5 cm, 4- to 6-flowered, pedicels 5 – 13 mm.\n花序：可达30cm高，上有2-3分枝，蝎尾状结构约5cm，4-7朵花，花梗5-13mm。Flowers : Sepals 1 – 4 mm ; corolla urceolate, 10 – 14 x 6 – 8 mm in diameter ; petals acute to obtuse, reddish or orange near the base, yellow to light orange above.\n花：萼片1-4mm；花冠为瓮形，10-14cm高，6-8mm直径；花瓣尖或圆头，基部淡红色或橙色，顶部黄色或浅橙色。Cytology : n = 27\n染色体：n=27Distributed by ISI n° 496 (1966) and ISI n° 89-49 (1989) as Echeveria lindsayana.\n曾作为林德赛出现在1966年ISI上（编号496）和1989年ISI上（编号89-49）。E. colorata in habitat in Mexico :\n墨西哥原产地上的卡罗拉"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_75120c36f14d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Gerhard Köhres"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7c6200c34f46.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_447bf194e25c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8842067caf3b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2b0c2b78fe09.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Echeveria colorata ISI 496. Photos Bernie DeChant"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d426531549f3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé\n（译者注：卡罗拉和吉娃娃非常相似，但国内二者的价格却有如云泥。较明显的辨别特征是（1）吉娃娃叶子的顶端有个硬硬的短尖（具硬尖-短尖），而卡罗拉没有此特征/特征不明显；（2）吉娃娃叶尖红，叶缘只是淡淡地泛红，但卡罗拉的叶缘上半部分可以非常红。但是当然了，叶形、叶尖和叶缘的特征即便是相同的物种不同个体间差异也很大，而且不同产地间形态也略有差异，并不能据此100%判断出特定植株的归属。但个人建议，选购卡罗拉的时候还是挑选卡罗拉特征明显的植株吧，某宝上较好选一物一拍的。吉娃娃欢迎讨论。）（再注：卡罗拉的变种勃兰特Echeveria colorata f. brandtii)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0871": {
    "title": "Echeveria derenbergii 静夜",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1454\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria derenbergii J. A. Purpus, 1921\n静夜，由J. A. Purpus发表于1921年。Series Ciliatae\nCiliatae系Distribution: Mexico (Oaxaca: Sierra de Mixteca)\n分布于墨西哥Oaxaca州的Sierra de Mixteca。\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003):\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem short, multibranching.\n短茎，易形成多头。Rosettes 6 – 8 cm in diameter.\n莲座：直径约6-8cm。Leaves obovate-cuneate, mucronate, 3 – 4 x 2 – 2,5 cm, 3 – 5 mm thick, light green, ± glaucous, margins and tips often reddish.\n叶：倒卵形或楔形，具短尖，3-4cm长，2-2.5cm宽，3-5mm厚，淡绿色，多少具白霜，叶缘和叶尖通常泛红。Inflorescences to 4 or more, cincinni to 10 cm, single or sometimes 2, each with 5 or more flowers, pedicels erect, to12 mm.\n花序：4根或更多；上有蝎尾状聚伞花序，约10cm，1支，有时2支，每支上有5朵或更多的花；花梗向上，较长达12mm。Flowers: Sepals ascending to spreading, subequal; corolla erect, 12 – 15 mm long, yellow, keels and tips reddish.\n花：萼片向上竖直展开，大小基本相同；花冠向上直立，12-15mm长，黄色，脊线和尖端发红。Cytology: n = 27\n染色体：n=27\nNote :\n请注意：In cultivation E. derenbergii rosettes may reach a diameter of more than 10 cm and also grow higher than the description indicates.\n园艺中的静夜莲座可以长到10cm以上，茎部也比描述中的更长。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_976d6fec5122.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1a48d89ee342.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_472a1681fc60.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "绿体静夜："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5cc41186f780.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_10aa2087d40b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Stefan Neuwirth"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0872": {
    "title": "Echeveria elegans 月影",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index ... p;x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权力属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接与译者，欢迎勘误。Echeveria elegans Rose, 1905\n月影，由Rose发表于1905年\nSynonyms :\n异名：Ech. perelegans (Berger, 1930) 墨西哥雪球\nEch potosina (Walther, 1935) 星影\nEch.elegans var. kesselringiana (Poellnitz, 1936) 月影之宵\nEch. albicans (Walther, 1958) 厚叶月影\nEch. hyalina (Walther, 1958) 海琳娜\nEch.elegans var. hernandonis (Walther, 1972)\nEch.elegans var. tuxpanensis (Walther, 1972)（译注：也就是说，由于在植物学和分类学意义上差异不够显著，墨西哥雪球、星影、月影之宵、厚叶月影和海琳娜已经被合并到了月影E. elegans里面，这些名字不应该再被继续使用了。如果非要叫的话，她们的名字应写作E. elegans 'Perelegans' 墨西哥雪球，E. elegans 'Potosina' 星影， E. eleganse 'Kesselringiana' 月影之宵，E. elegans 'Albicans' 厚叶月影，E. elegans 'Hyalina' 海琳娜，但是这些名字都是非正式的。亦不排除未来重新分类的可能性。）Series Urbiniae\n瓮花系\nDistribution: Mexico (Hidalgo, San Luis Potosi, Guanajuato, Querétaro, Jalisco?)\n分布于墨西哥Hidalgo省，San Luis Potosi省，Guanajuato省，Querétaro省和Jalisco省（持疑）。Description (according to IHSP, 2003):\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stems nearly lacking.\n几乎无茎。Leaves densely rosulate, oblong-obovate or obovate-cuneate, acute to truncate, mucronate, upper face flat or concave, 7 – 7,5 x 1 – 3,5 cm, thick, nearly white or greenish glaucous, sometimes tinged purplish.\n叶：形成密集的莲座；椭圆型-倒卵形，顶部尖锐或截形，有短尖，上表面平坦或下凹，7-7.5cm长，1-3.5cm宽，厚；几乎为白色，或淡绿色被霜，有时边缘泛紫色。Inflorescences: a cincinnus, 10-15 cm tall, pedicels to 6 – 14 mm.\n花序：单只花序，10-15cm高；花梗6-14mm。Flowers : Sepals 5 – 10 mm, appressed to expanding ; corolla conoid-urceolate, 11 – 18 x 8 – 12 mm in diameter, rose to pink, slightly glaucous, often yellowish or greenish at apex.\n花：萼片5-10mm，紧贴花瓣或摊开；花冠圆锥形-瓮形，11-18mm长，8-12mm直径，玫红色至粉色，略被霜，顶部常为淡黄色或淡绿色。Cytology : n = 31, 32, 34, 60, 62-63, 96, 120-130.\n染色体：n=31，32，34，60，62，63，96，120-130.A species that is both popular and variable, leading to the publication of several weak taxa.\n这个物种流传甚广，却又极端多样化，导致曾被作为不同的分类单元发表。They mainly differ in such minor characters as leaf-shape and -size, sepal expansion and corolla colour and are placed here in synonymy.\n这些不同的名字之间差异非常细微，不同之处主要在叶子的形状和大小、花萼是否张开和花冠的颜色而已，现在都作为异名列出。Note:\n请注意：Unfortunately these now obsolete names are still cherished in private as well as in public collections, producing much confusion because usually applied to the wrong plants. An example : What is distributed as E. potosina is a freely offsetting plant – but the description of E. potosina clearly states that this is a plant with few or no offsets. This means that the photo in Pilbeam, Echeveria, p. 106, Fig. 117, showing a heavily clustering plant, is wrong.\n不幸的是，这些早已成为过去式的名字如今仍在爱好者之间广为流传，制造了许多货不对板的误解。比如说，作为星影售卖的东西是一个特别爱分头群生的家伙，但根据星影的描述它极少有分头的习性。这也意味着在Pilbeam的《Echeveria》一书中第106页图177上那个群生的植物并非星影。And plants labeled as E. kesselringiana usually are simply E. albicans – now also a synonym for E. elegans. Of all now synonymous species of E. elegans, the latter is the one best to be distinguished from what is commonly known as E. elegans and is mostly correctly named.\n而被冠以\"月影之宵\"名字的植物通常只是厚叶月影而已，现在也只是月影大家庭的一个普通成员。而厚叶月影倒确实是所有那些月影的异名植物里较容易和普通月影区分开的，也是比较不容易货不对板的一个。（这一段在我兔地盘上同样成立）\nE. elegans 'Albicans' in habitat (Queretaro, Mexico)\n墨西哥Queretaro州自然栖息地上的厚叶月影："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bb5fb4b12781.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_677fa3516795.png"
      },
      {
