  "succ_0873": {
    "title": "Echeveria eurychlamys 黑夜",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1133\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转帖请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria eurychlamys (Diels) A.Berger, 1930\n黑夜，由Berger发表于1930年Synonym: Cotyledon eurychlamys Diels (1906)\n异名：Cotyledon eurychlamys Diels (1906)Distribution: Peru (Cajamarca : Hualgayoc, Celendín, Chota).\n分布于秘鲁卡哈马卡省的Hualgayoc, Celendín和Chota地区。Description (according to IHSP, 2003):\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem usually < 10 cm tall, 5 – 10 mm in diameter.\n茎部：通常不高于10cm，5-10mm直径。Rosette 7 – 9 cm in diameter.\n莲座：7-9cm直径。Leaves obovate-oblong, 3,5 – 6 x 1,5 – 3 cm, mucronate, greyish-green, often red-tipped.\n叶：倒卵形-椭圆形，3.5-6cm长，1.5-3cm宽，有短尖，灰绿色，常有红尖。Inflorescences : Erect straight racemes to 25 cm; bracts semi-orbicular, fleshy, 10 – 15 x 6 – 12 mm, pedicels stout, 2 – 3 mm long.\n花序：直立的总状花序，可达25cm；苞叶半圆形，肉质，10-15mm长，6-12mm宽；花梗粗壮，2-3mm长。Flowers: Sepals ascending, fleshy; corolla to 14 – 16 x 6 – 8 mm in diameter, coral- red.\n花：萼片上向，肉质；花冠14-16mm长，6-9mm直径，珊瑚红。Cytology : n = ± 80\n染色体：n=±80\nDescription (according to G. Pino, Haseltonia 15, 2009) :\n描述（根据发表于2009年的Haseltonia 15中G. Pino的说法）：Roots fibrous.\n须根。Stem not growing above ground.\n地上没有明显的茎部。Rosette up to 15 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径可达15cm。Leaves 26 – 38, 6 – 8 cm long, 2 – 4 cm wide, 3 – 4 mm thick, widely obovate-oblong, light green to glaucous white, margins hyaline.\n叶子26-38片，6-8cm长，2-4cm宽，3-4mm厚，宽阔的倒卵形-椭圆形，浅绿色或灰绿色，叶缘透明。Inflorescence an equilateral raceme with 8 – 16 flowers, nodding at first, then erect, up to 30 cm long, bracts numerous,1.6 – 2.6 x 0.6 – 1.7 cm, obovate to orbicular, spurred at base, pedicels 2 – 6 mm long.\n总状花序，上有8-16朵花，顶部下折，底部竖直，可达30cm长；苞叶众多，1.6-2.6cm长，0.6-1.7cm宽，倒卵形到圆形，底部有小刺；花梗2-6mm长。Flowers : Sepals erect, ovate-deltoid, 5 – 7 mm long, light green-glaucous, corolla ovoid, 6 – 7 mm thick near base, petals 1.1 – 1.2 cm long, outside yellow to pink at base, salmon to pink towards apex, inside salmon-yellow, tips recurving.\n花萼竖直，卵形-三角形，5-7mm长，淡绿色-灰绿色；花冠卵形，基部6-7mm直径；花瓣1.1-1.2cm长，外部的基部黄色到粉色，顶部橙红色到粉色，内部橙红色-黄色，顶部反折。\nNote :\n请注意：Plants in nature show only slight variation.\n自然界中的植株没有太大个体差异。Plants in cultivation differ strongly from plants in nature.\n园艺中的植株与其自然栖息地上的状态大相径庭。This species is unique for its almost orbicular bracts.\n这个品种较大的特点是其近乎于圆形的苞叶。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_99e29c79b792.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3d99fc4536c4.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ed Dunin-Wasowicz"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_35dcdcad2d36.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4fd959ecb600.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cbf75be4cba8.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger暂无有明确信息的杂交后代"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0874": {
    "title": "Echeveria gigantea 大瑞蝶",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1221\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria gigantea Rose & Purpus, 1910\n大瑞蝶，由Rose和Purpus发表于1910年\nSeries Gibbiflorae\nGibbiflorae系Distribution : Mexico (Puebla, Oaxaca)\n分布于墨西哥的Puebla和Oaxaca州Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem usually unbranched, to 50 cm long, 2 – 3 cm in diameter.\n茎部：通常不分枝，可高达50cm，2-3cm直径。Rosette 15 – 20 cm in diameter.\n莲座：约15-20cm直径。Leaves widely obovate-spatulate, obtuse, apiculate, 15 – 20 x 8 – 10 cm, green, margins purplish red.\n叶：宽阔的倒卵形-铲形，圆头，顶端有细尖，15-20cm长，8-10cm宽，绿色，叶缘紫红色。Inflorescences cymose-paniculate, to 1 – 2m tall, with 7 or more cincinni, each with 7 – 16 flowers, pedicels 2 – 8 mm.\n花序：聚伞花序-圆锥花序，可高达1-2米，上有7根或更多蝎尾状花序，每根上有7-16朵花，花梗2-8mm长。Flowers: Sepals spreading to recurved, very unequal, to 15 mm; corolla pentagonal, 12- 17 x 9 – 11 mm in diameter, rose-red, faintly glaucous.\n花：萼片摊开或反折，大小非常不一，较长15mm；花冠五边形，12-17mm高，9-11mm直径，玫红色，微微被白霜。Cytology : n = 54\n染色体：n=54Distributed by ISI as n° 215 (1961) and 1327 (1982)\nISI编号215（1961）和1327（1982）\nNote :\n请注意：Charles Uhl writes (Haseltonia Nr. 9, 2002) :\nCharles Uhl写道（Haseltonia Nr. 9, 2002）：\"Walther (1972) distinguished this large species from E. gibbiflora chiefly by its red-margined leaves, but otherwise they intergrade enough with each other to question their validity as separate species.\"\n\"Walther (1972)将这个大型品种与E. gibbiflora（粉彩莲）分开，主要依据是其带红边的叶子，但在其他方面二者却是趋同的，因此他们是否应当作为独立的物种存在仍值得商榷。\"\nE. gigantea in habitat in Mexico :\n大瑞蝶在墨西哥原产地中的样子："
      },
