  "succ_0877": {
    "title": "Echeveria lauii 雪莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1429\n翻译：Qiuhan转载请注明原文链接和译者\nLAUI Moran & J. Meyrán, 1976\n雪莲，由Moran和J. Meyrán发表于1976年\nSeries Pruinosae\nPruinosae系\nDistribution: Mexico (Oaxaca: in one of the lateral ravines of the Rio Salado-Quiotepec), 500 m alt, growing in a hot and dry area.\n分布于墨西哥瓦哈卡州的一条山谷里，海拔500米，气候干燥炎热。\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：\nStem usually 5 – 10 x ± 1,5 cm in diameter, unbranched, covered below with persistent dry leaves.\n茎部：通常5-10cm高、直径1.5cm左右，不分枝，底部堆积干枯的叶片。\nRosette 12 – 15 cm in diameter.\n莲座：12-15厘米直径。\nLeaves obovate, broadly obtuse, minutely mucronate, 5 – 8,5 x 3 – 4,5 cm, 6 – 8 mm thick, upper face nearly flat to slightly concave, strongly white-glaucous or sometimes pinkish glaucous.\n叶子：倒卵形，线条圆润，有一个小小的叶尖，5-8.5厘米长，3-4.5厘米宽，6-8mm厚，上表面几乎是平的或者微微下凹，覆有一层厚厚的白霜，白霜有时候发淡粉色。\nInflorescence 6 – 10 cm long, with 5 – 7 conspicuous heavily glaucous bracts, cincinnus with 9 – 17 flowers, pedicels 2 – 4 mm.\n花序：6-10cm高，上有5-7片覆有白霜的苞叶，苞叶很明显，蝎尾状聚伞花序上有9-17朵花，花梗约2-4mm。\nFlowers : Sepals ascending, very unequal, 3 – 18 mm, corolla pentagonal-pyramidal, 13 – 16 mm long, red but heavily pruinose.\n花：花萼向上生长，非常不规则，3-18mm；花冠是五角的锥形，13-16mm长，红色，但覆着一层厚厚的白霜。\nCytology : n = 15\n染色体：n=15\nDistributed by ISI n° 1199 (1980).\nISI编号1199（1980）\nEcheveria laui in habitat :\n自然栖息地中的雪莲："
      },
      {
