  "succ_0878": {
    "title": "Echeveria lutea 鱿鱼系",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1197\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。Echeveria lutea Rose, 1911\n鱿鱼，由Rose发表于1911年\nSynonym : Echeveria lutea var. fuscata E. Walther (1972)\n异名：Echeveria lutea var. fuscata E. Walther (1972)Series Angulatae\nAngulatae系Distribution: Mexico (San Luis Potosí)\n分布于墨西哥的San Luis Potosí。Description (according to IHSP, 2003):\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：\nRoots thickened.\n根系浓密。Stem < 5 cm long, 1 – 2 cm in diameter, sparsely branching.\n茎：长度小于5cm，直径1-2cm，茎部很少分枝。Rosette 8 – 13 cm in diameter.\n莲座：直径8-13cm。Leaves densely rosulate, linear-elliptic to oblanceolate, long-acuminate, tip acute, upcurving, deeply channelled above, 4 – 5 x 0,8 – 1,8 cm, 3 – 7 mm thick, green to brownish-green.\n叶：形成密实的莲座状排列；线形-椭圆形到倒披针形，具长尖，顶端锐利，向上弯曲，叶缘上卷形成明显的沟槽结构，4-5cm长，0.8-1.8cm宽，3-7mm厚，绿色或棕绿色。Inflorescences with 1 or 2 cincinni, to 28 – 75 cm tall, apical portion strongly deflected before anthesis, bracts conspicuous, elliptic-linear, semiterete, 25 – 65 mm, pedicels to 2 mm long, 2 – 4 mm in diameter.\n花序：上有1-2根蝎尾状聚伞花序，28-75cm高，顶端会在要开花时显著下弯；苞叶很大，椭圆形-线形，半圆柱状，25-26mm；花梗约2mm长，2-4mm直径。Flowers: Sepals widely spreading to somewhat reflexed, corolla strongly pentagonal, 12 – 17 x 8 – 12 mm in diameter near the base, 2 – 5 mm in diameter at the mouth, yellow.\n花：萼片大张，有些下弯；花冠为明显的五角形，12-17mm长，底部8-12mm直径，顶部2-5mm直径，黄色。\nCytology : n = 12\n染色体：n=12."
      },
      {
