  "succ_0879": {
    "title": "Echeveria megacalyx 玉壶光",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "种名的意思是\"巨大的苞片\"，因此种株型圆润，叶薄透光，色调金黄。故取辛弃疾《青玉案 元夕》中\"凤箫声动，玉壶光转，一夜鱼龙舞\"中【玉壶光】一词拟为中文名——喻其如月光流转。原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1445\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。MEGACALYX Walther, 1959\nmegacalyx 由walther发表于1959年Series Racemosae\n总状花序系Distribution: Mexico (Oaxaca)\n栖息地：墨西哥（瓦哈卡）Description (according to IHSP, 2003):描述（根据IHSP，2003年）;Stem sparsely branching, < 5 cm long, 1,5 – 2 cm in diameter.茎干少见分支，<5厘米长，1.5 - 2厘米的直径。Rosette 6 – 9 cm in diameter. *\n莲座6 - 10厘米直径。 *Leaves oblong-spatulate, mucronate,margins translucent and dentate-lacerate, 3 – 10 x 2 – 3 cm, green to slightly bluish-glaucous.\n叶长圆状匙形，有尖，边缘半透明的，有齿状缺刻，3 - 10×2 - 3厘米，叶片绿色略微偏蓝，覆盖白霜。Inflorescences racemes to 45 cm, ± 8 mm near base, pedicels of lower flowers 3 – 8 mm, of upper flowers very short.\n花序：总状花序约45厘米长，近基部约8毫米粗，低位着生的花柄3–8毫米长，高位花的花柄很短。Flowers: Sepals somewhat spreading, large and leaves-like, obovate-elliptic, acute, 8 – 10 x ± 6 mm; corolla urceolate, ± 8 x 5 – 8 mm in diameter near tip, dull green-yellow.\n花：萼片稍平展，宽如叶片，倒卵状椭圆形，有尖，大小8–±10 x 6毫米；花冠瓶形，尖端直径±8 x 5–8毫米，花暗黄绿色。Cytolog: n = 20.\n细胞学检查：染色体数=20* This seems to be an error - Walther's description indicates the length of the leaves as up to 10 cm.\n这似乎是一个错误-瓦尔特的描述表明叶片长可达10厘米。\nNote :\nFig. 215, p. 169, in Pilbeam, Echeveria, is not correct, petals are not recurving and the flower colour does not correspond to the description cited on pages 169, 170.\n注：\n图215，169页，在Pilbeam，《石莲花属》，是不正确的，（megacalyx）花瓣不转向，花的颜色也不符合引用169页和170页上的描述。Plants in habitat :\n栖息地状态："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5a2e50b3e960.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b803aea68d7c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_346493ba4ab7.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_edba051578de.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_80b45b8488c0.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Mieke Geuens"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9088cd7ad5ed.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Gerhard Köhres园艺种植状态："
      },
      {
        "t": "E. megacalyx, Pacifica, Oaxaca.\nPhoto Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger网络搜索图："
