  "succ_0881": {
    "title": "Echeveria nodulosa 红司及其杂交",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index ... p;x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nNODULOSA (Baker) Otto, 1873\nSynonyms:\nCotyledon nodulosa Baker (1869)\nEcheveria discolor De Smet (1874)\nEcheveria misteca De Smet ex Morren (1874)\nEcheveria sturmiana von Poellnitz (1938)\nEcheveria nodulosa var. minor E. Walther (1972)异名：\nCotyledon nodulosa Baker (1869)\nEcheveria discolor De Smet (1874)\nEcheveria misteca De Smet ex Morren (1874)\nEcheveria sturmiana von Poellnitz (1938)\nEcheveria nodulosa var. minor E. Walther (1972)Series Nudae\nNudae系Distribution: Mexico (widely distributed and rather common in North Oaxaca and South Puebla).\n分布：墨西哥（分布广泛,而在北瓦哈卡州和南普埃布拉极为常见）Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):Stems to 20 cm long, much-branched, irregularly angular.\n茎长20厘米，多分枝，茎干上有不规则的角状突出。Leaves, bracts, sepals and outside of petals minutely papillose.\n叶，苞片，萼片和花瓣均为磨砂质感。Leaves subrosulate to scattered, obovate-cuneate, acute, to 5 x 1,5 cm, ± heavily marked with purplish-red on both faces and along margins, rarely entirely green.\n叶序为较为松散的玫瑰型（此句存疑），叶倒卵形楔形，尖，5×1.5厘米大小，叶正反面和叶缘可有浓烈的紫红色条纹，很少完全绿色。Inflorescences racemose, to 30 cm, pedicels to 5 mm.\n总状花序，30厘米长，花梗到5毫米。Flowers: Sepals widely spreading, rarely reflexed, upcurving at tips, corolla sharply pentagonal, ± 16 mm long, petals rose, yellowish along margins and at tips.\n花：萼片平展，很少反折，顶端上翘。花冠五边形，大约长16毫米，花瓣玫红色，沿着边缘和尖端呈黄色。Cytology : n = 16\n细胞学检查：染色体数=16条Distributed by ISI n° 420 (1963) and ISI n° 1137 (1979) as E. nodulosa 'Painted Beauty', a clone with especially beautiful markings.\nISI n° 420 (1963) 和ISI n° 1137 (1979) 描述了一种拥有特别优美条纹的红司栽培种（？）—— E. nodulosa 'Painted Beauty'（拟翻译为\"朱颜红司\"）Note :\nThis species is much more variable than the description implies. There are forms with sessile rosettes, green plants are not really rare, but on the other hand stem growing plants are often not much-branched.\n(MB)\n注：\n相较于品种标准描述而言，红司实际形态则很多变。有近乎无茎干的莲座型植株，纯绿色植株也并不罕见。但另一方面，那些符合长茎干描述的植株，通常分枝也不多。See also : Echeveria nodulosa 'Painted Beauty'\n可参见：朱颜红司 条目http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=2110自然栖息地生长的红司："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e4a8528f71ed.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2020ced72ef1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "附生生长！\nPhotos Kim Holbrook"
      },
      {
