  "succ_0882": {
    "title": "Echeveria pallida 霜之鹤及其杂交种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "翻译：种花小医杂家赵\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。PALLIDA Walther, 1938\n霜之鹤 由Walther发表于1938年Series Gibbiflorae\n粉彩莲系Distribution: Mexico\n栖息地：墨西哥Description (according to IHSP, 2003):\n形态描述（根据IHSP 2003版）：Stem branching, to 10 cm long or more, ± 15 mm in diameter.\n茎多分枝，高度可超过10厘米，直径15毫米左右。Rosette 15 – 20 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径15到20厘米。Leaves obovate-spatulate, > 15 x 9 cm, obtuse, mucronate, light green.\n叶片倒卵状匙形，＞15×9厘米，钝，有短尖，淡绿色。Inflorescences to 50 cm, cymose-paniculate, with 8 or more cincinni, these sometimes 2-branched, pedicels < 6 mm.\n花序长50厘米，聚伞状圆锥花序，可有8支或更多的蝎尾状分支，有时蝎尾状花序会2次再分枝，花梗小于6毫米。Flowers: Sepals very unequal, to 14 mm, corolla 16 x 12 mm in diameter near the base, scarlett to pink.\n花：萼片大小差异悬殊，约14毫米，花冠基部直径16 x 12毫米，花色从深红色渐过渡粉红色。Cytology : n = 54\n细胞学检查：染色体 = 54This plant is evidently not a hybrid, but a native locality has not yet been recorded.\n这个物种显然不是一个杂交品种，但它没有自然栖息地的记录。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_663b20a4e263.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d095462b5056.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_461f7136c282.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c0f6db2bae97.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c6dad5fbb26d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger———————————————— 分割线 ————————————————\n霜之鹤作为亲本得到的杂交品种，在国内流传的不多，大家比较熟悉的如白凤，花之鹤等。它的子代一般拥有宽大的、稍有褶边的柠檬绿色叶片，植株体量也较大，可作为岩石园花境的主体植物，嫩绿色的叶片充满蓬勃活力。1 agavoides x pallida"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_04e5becabab9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "2 Lawrence 花之鹤\n起源不明\n亲本：花月夜*霜之鹤\n在韩国这种杂交种被称为 Echeveria 'Pallida Prince'. 此名是不符合命名规范的，因为杂交品种的名字里不能带有原始种的名字。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8681c929519d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "3 Lemon Twist 柠檬卷\nCreated by J. Napton\n亲本不明，母本可能是霜之鹤"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_719560951861.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a775f04919c3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "4 Blondie ''\n由 Dick Wright培育\n由 E. Lillie命名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f74de9630bbb.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e2b7202c0c21.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "5 Margrit ''\nParentage / Parenté : E. gigantea x E. pallida ?\n亲本：大瑞蝶*霜之鹤（存疑）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_93aaf0fa7107.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8913ea2c8694.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "6Hakuhou ''白凤\n日本品种\n亲本: 雪莲*霜之鹤（存疑）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0883": {
    "title": "Echeveria paniculata龙田凤及其变种",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权力属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者。原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕\n\n原种：龙田凤\nPANICULATA var. PANICULATA Gray, 1852.Synonyms:\n异名：\nCotyledon greyi Baker (1869) / Echeveria greyi (Baker) Morren (1874)Series Thyrsiflorae\n聚伞圆锥花序系Distribution: Mexico (Chihuahua, Durango, Zacatecas)\n地理分布：墨西哥（奇瓦瓦州，Durango州, Zacatecas州）Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述：（根据2003年IHSP）Roots fusiform, fleshy.\n根纺锤形，肉质。Stem nearly lacking, rarely branching.\n几乎没有茎，少分枝。Rosette ± 10 – 12 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径± 10 -12厘米Leaves spreading horizontally, oblanceolate, acuminate, ± 10 x 3 cm, rather thin, green.\n叶片水平张开，倒披针形，渐尖，±10×3厘米，微薄，绿色。Inflorescences cymose-paniculate, branches 6 – 8, each with 1 – 6 flowers, pedicels short.\n花序为聚伞状圆锥花序，分枝6–8，每支花茎生有1–6花，花梗短。Flowers: Sepals more ascending than in var. maculata, to 10 mm, corolla ± 12 x 9 mm in diameter near the base, reddish-yellow near the base, yellow above.\n花：萼片比其变种var. maculata更长，约10毫米，花冠近基部，直径±12 x 9毫米，基部红黄色，上面黄色。Cytology : n = 28\n染色体：n=28\n\nPhotos Mieke Geuens"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bbceb1d9f3c4.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_53bae8ecfda2.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "E. paniculata, Durango, Mazatlan\nPhotos Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f428c68b2a4a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3eafa834ddb5.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c55f228747cc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Noelene Tomlinson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_07cdfbd409c1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "变种：\nPANICULATA var. MACULATA (Rose) Kimnach 1998.Synonyms:\n异名：\nEcheveria maculata Rose (1903)\nEcheveria longipes E. Walther (1935)Series Thyrsiflorae\n聚伞圆锥花序系Distribution: Mexico (Hidalgo, Querétero, Michoacán, San Luis Potosí, Zacatecas, Jalisco).\n地理分布：墨西哥（Hidalgo, Querétero, Michoacán, San Luis Potosí, Zacatecas, Jalisco）Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）Differs from var. paniculata :\n不同于原种 龙田凤：Leaves narrowly rhomboid-oblanceolate, 7 – 10 x 1,5 – 2,5 cm, rather thick and more succulent.\n叶片狭菱形倒披针形，7-10×1.5-2.5厘米，相当厚，肉质。Inflorescences thyrses, either subpaniculate below and spicate-racemose above or with numerous, mostly 2-flowered branchlets, pedicels 1 – 2 (-16) mm.\n花序为聚伞圆锥花序，既不及圆锥花序同时又超过穗状的总状花序，或者带有大量的大多生有2花的小枝，花梗1–2（16）毫米。Flowers : Sepals widely expanding, to 8 mm, corolla ± 16 x 9 mm in diameter near the base, yellow.\n花：萼片普遍平展，8毫米，花冠直径±16 x 9毫米，近基部，黄色。Cytology : n = 28\n染色体：n=28\n\nEcheveria paniculata var.maculata, Quiroga.\nPhoto Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0af0185d7966.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Seeds of E. paniculata var. maculata\nPhotos provided by Gerhard Köhres"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c78f7b711f52.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e1643db53a7d.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0884": {
    "title": "Echeveria pinetorum 松间莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1833\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria pinetorum Rose, 1905\n松间莲，由Rose发表于1905年Synonyms:\n异名：\nEcheveria sessiliflora var. pinetorum (Rose) von Poellnitz (1936)\nEcheveria huehueteca Standley & Steyermark (1944).Series Mucronatae\n尖叶系\nDistribution : Mexico (Chiapas, Oaxaca), Guatemala\n分布于：墨西哥的Chipas州，Oaxaca州，Guatemala州Description (according to E. Walther, Echeveria, 1972) :\n描述（根据E. Walther1972年的Echeveria一书）：Roots fleshy, fusiform.\n纺锤状的肉质根。Stem nearly lacking, branching.\n几乎无茎，可分枝。Rosettes dense, up to 20 leaves.\n莲座紧实，可达20片叶。Leaves often deciduous during the dry season, narrowly oblanceolate, acute to acuminate, 2 – 4 x 1 – 1,5 cm, rather thick, above flat or shallowly concave, rounded beneath, often denticulate when young, yellowish green.\n叶为窄倒披针形，叶子有尖或渐尖，2-4cm长，1-1.5cm宽，较厚，上表面平坦或微凹，下表面圆润；新叶常有细齿；干旱季节叶子常脱落。Inflorescences spicate, to 30 cm tall, bracts appressed, to 3 cm, pedicels usually quite short, only rarely as much as 8 mm long.\n穗状花序，可达30cm高；苞叶平贴，可达3cm；花梗通常较短，很少有8mm以上。Flowers : Sepals unequal, to 3 mm, corolla 8 – 10 x 6 mm in diameter near the base, 4 mm in diameter at the mouth, petals scarcely spreacing at tips, scarlet at the base, yellowish above.\n花：萼片大小不均，可达3mm；花冠8-10mm高，基部6mm直径，口部4mm直径；花瓣几乎不绽开，基部鲜红色，顶部黄色。Cytology : n = 14\n染色体：n=14\nNote :\n请注意：Whether Fig. 282, p. 208, in J. Pilbeam, Echeveria, of a 13 cm (!) wide seedling really shows E. pinetorum is rather doubtful.\nPilbeam那本《Echeveria》里208页图282上那棵13cm（！）大的小苗到底是不是松间莲很可疑。\nPlants in habitat in Mexico :\n墨西哥栖息地上的植株："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7836fbe2767f.png"
      },
      {
