  "succ_0885": {
    "title": "Echeveria prolifica 子持白莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文地址：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1869由Moran 和 J. Meyrán于1978命名。\n穿心莲样分支系列（Series Paniculatae）Distribution: Mexico (Puebla)\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\nStem < 3cm long, 4 – 7 mm in diameter, proliferous by stolons.\nRosette 4 – 8 cm in diameter.子持白莲：\n原生地位于Mexico 的Puebla。形态描述(根据IHSP,2003):子持白莲的茎干不超过3厘米长,直径约4 - 7毫米,通过地面匍匐茎形成群生。其单个莲座可生长至4 - 8厘米直径。Leaves obovate-cuncate, obtuse, cuspidate, 2 – 4 x 1 - 1,6 cm, 4 – 8 mm thick, convex on both faces, light glaucous-green.Inflorescences sprawling-decumbent, cymose, 15 – 25 cm long, bracts easily detached and rooting to form new plants, the cyme dense, 2 – 3 cm wide, with 2 – 5 cincinni, each with up to 4 flowers, pedicels ± 1 mm.Flowers : Calyx cup-shaped, sepals upcurved, corolla campanulate, 5 – 6 mm long, yellow.子持白莲的叶片呈倒卵形，钝园，叶尖处骤尖。长度2到4厘米，宽度1 到 1.6厘米，厚4到8毫米，叶片两面凸出，呈亮蓝绿色，覆盖着白霜。\n花序呈匍匐生长状态，聚伞状，15到25厘米长。花梗上的叶状苞片很容易脱落，可生根形成新的植株。花序在植株上密集分布，每2–3厘米宽可再生长出新的蝎尾状聚伞花序，每个蝎尾状聚伞花序上较多可开出4朵花。花梗约1毫米左右长。\n花萼杯状，萼片上弯，花朵瓮状，5–6毫米长，黄色。\nCytology : n = 33The stout campanulate flowers are unique in the genus. As with its ally, E. amoena, it will easily spread because of its deciduous bracts.Distributed by ISI n° 1388 (1983)细胞学：染色体=33。子持白莲拥有矮胖的瓮形花朵，这在拟石莲花属中较为独特，这与它的近亲E. amoena（花乃锦/雨村）很相像。子持白莲很容易蔓延繁殖形成群生，因为它花茎上脱落的叶状苞片极易出芽形成幼株。ISI编号为1388，1983年录入。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9d4bc4d46a70.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_62b2a137fff8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3851013e9067.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_38451ff86a9d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bernie DeChant"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_47d7cc921332.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9459dc78768b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle Aubé."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0886": {
    "title": "Echeveria pulidonis 花月夜 及其杂交",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index ... p;x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。Echeveria pulidonis Walther, 1972.\n花月夜，由Walther发表于1972年Series Urbiniae\n瓮花系\nDistribution: Mexico (Hidalgo: Beristain).\n分布于墨西哥Hidalgo州的Beristain\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Plants nearly stemless, glabrous.\n几乎无茎，光洁无毛。Stem branching.\n茎部可分枝。Rosette 7 – 9 cm in diameter.\n莲座：7-9cm直径。Leaves obovate-oblong, minutely mucronate, 3,5 – 5 x 1,2 – 1,5 cm, green, conspicuously red-margined.\n叶：倒卵状椭圆形，有细短尖，3.5-5cm长，1.2-1.5cm宽，绿色，有明显的红边。Inflorescence a cincinnus, apical portion strongly nodding in bud, to 18 cm long, pedicels 6 mm.\n花序：单根的蝎尾状聚伞花序，顶部聚集许多花蕾，可长达18cm；花梗6mm。Flowers: Corolla bluntly pentagonal, to 10 mm long, yellow, petals strongly recurving apically.\n花：花冠为圆润的五边形，长可达10mm，黄色，花瓣顶部明显反折。Cytology : n = 32, 62, 64.\n染色体：n=32,62,64"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_06a80be0d67b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_26b46786489b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle Aubé\nEcheveria pulidonis是日韩以整个园艺界非常钟爱的杂交亲本之一，其艳丽的红边、标致的株型和好生养的特性都是非常宝贵的基因，尤其适合亚洲地区作为阳台或花园里的盆栽植物。比较有特点的杂交品种包括（资料all from ICN)：\nEcheveria 'Esther'，月光女神\n亲本：Echeveria pulidonis花月夜 与 Echeveria derenbergii静夜\n（请注意：月光女神的学名并非广为流传的Echeveria 'Moon Goddess'）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f8d7f9527a34.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Bernie DeChant Echeveria 'Hanatsukiyo'，（日韩国卖的'花月夜'多是这个，一个杂交品种，品种加词就是'花月夜'的罗马拼音）\n亲本：Echeveria pulidonis花月夜 x Echeveria elegans月影，或是Echeveria elegans月影 x Echeveria pulidonis花月夜（杂交公式中前者为母本，后者为父本）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c13bf1b68c26.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Echeveria 'Christmas'，绿体花月夜\n亲本：Echeveria pulidonis花月夜 x E. spec某种拟石莲\n（绿体花月夜并非原始种，而是一个杂交品种）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1caab68b7f24.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller x Pachyveria 'King Midas'，迈达斯国王\n亲本：Pachyphytum oviferum星美人 x Echeveria pulidonis花月夜\n跨属杂交，花可以看出明显的厚叶草属基因（巨大的花萼），不是Echeveria"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5050b4723230.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ad4c59ad4226.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Bernie DeChant Echeveria 'Secret Garden'，秘密花园\n亲本：Echeveria pulidonis花月夜 x Echeveria lilacina丽娜莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_55f0fd35cfd4.png"
