  "succ_0887": {
    "title": "Echeveria purpusorum 大和锦",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=431\n翻译：Qiuhan转载请注明原文链接和译者。Echeveria purpusorum\n大和锦\nBerger，1930\n由Berger发表于1930年\nSeries Urbiniae\nUrbiniae系\nDistribution : Mexico (Puebla, near San Luis Atolotitlán)\n分布：墨西哥San Luis Atolotitlán附近的Puebla\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：\nStem usually 5 – 8 cm high, ± 2 cm in diameter, rarely branching.\n茎：5-8cm高，2cm左右直径，茎部很少分枝。\nRosettes 6 – 7 cm in diameter and high.\n莲座：直径和高均为6-7cm.\nLeaves ovate-acuminate, acute, ± 3 – 3.5 x 2 – 2.5 cm, to 1 cm thick, sharp-edged, obscurely keeled on the back, light olive-green, heavily mottled and spotted with irregular reddish-brown markings, margin translucent, unspotted.\n叶：卵形-渐尖形，尖端锐利；±3至3.5cm长，2-2.5cm宽，1cm厚；边缘锐利，背部隐约有一条脊线；淡橄榄绿色，颜色斑驳，有红棕色的不规则斑点；边缘半透明，无斑点。\nInflorescence a cincinnus, unbranched, to 20 cm tall, pedicels to 12 mm.\n花序：蝎尾状聚伞花序，不分叉，较高20cm；花梗约12mm。\nFlowers : Sepals appressed, corolla globose-urceolate, to 12 mm long, rose below, scarlet above, yellow at the tips.\n花：花萼平贴，花冠为球状-瓮状，12mm高，底部玫瑰红，上部猩红色，顶端黄色。\nCytology : n = 27\n染色体：n=27"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7ae0582b9679.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Noelene Tomlinson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3f7e31b08a2d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f28eaa29ca8a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9e8f5c3c164d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Bernie DeChant"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c94bef06adab.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Werner Krell"
      }
    ]
  },
