  "succ_0890": {
    "title": "Echeveria sessiliflora 施施莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "Echeveria sessiliflora Rose, 1905\n施施莲，由Rose发表于1905年Synonym : Echeveria corallina Alexander (1941)\n异名：Echeveria corallina Alexander (1941)Series Mucronatae\n尖叶系Distribution : Mexico (Chiapas)\n分布于墨西哥Chiapas州。Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Roots not tuberous.\n不是块茎。Stem 2 – 3 cm long, branching.\n茎：2-3cm长，易分枝。Leaves rosulate, oblanceolate, abruptly acute, mucronate, 6 – 8 x 1,5 – 1,6 cm, pale green with brownish-purple margins, very glaucous,\n叶：呈莲座状排列，倒披针形，急尖，有短尖；6-8cm长，1.5-1.6cm宽；淡绿色，有紫红色叶缘，白霜明显。Inflorescences spicate, ± 15 – 30 (-40) cm long, pedicels ≤ 1 mm.\n花序：穗状花序，约15-30（或40）cm长，花梗小于1mm。Flowers : Sepals appressed, corolla 8 – 14 mm long, coral-red.\n花：萼片紧贴；花冠8-14mm长，珊瑚红色。Cytology : n = 15\n染色体：n=15\nPlants in habitat in Mexico :\n墨西哥自然栖息地上的植株："
      },
      {
