  "succ_0891": {
    "title": "Echeveria setosa 锦司晃",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1914\n翻译：Qiuhan一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria setosa var. setosa Rose & Purpus, 1910\n锦司晃，由Rose与Purpus发表于1910年Series Ciliatae\nCiliatae系Distribution : Mexico (Puebla: San Luis Atolotitlán, Cerro de la Yerba)\n分布于墨西哥Puebla州的San Luis Atolotitlán, Cerro de la Yerba\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem to 10 cm long, 1 – 2 cm wide, branching.\n茎部：较高10cm，1-2cm宽，易分枝。Rosette 5 – 12 cm in diameter.\n莲座：5-12cm直径。Leaves oblanceolate-spatulate, acute becoming obtuse, apiculate, (2.5-) 4 – 7 x 0.8 – 2 cm wide above, 5 – 7 mm thick, green, hirsute, ciliate with hairs 2 – 3 mm long.\n叶：倒披针形-铲形，有细尖，尔后叶尖渐圆，2.5或4-7cm长，前端0.8-2cm宽，5-7mm厚，绿色，多毛。Inflorescence a cincinnus, hirsute except inside flowers, 10 – 30 cm long, pedicels 1 – 3 cm.\n花序：蝎尾状聚伞花序，除花朵内侧外的部位多毛，10-30cm长，花梗1-3cm。Flowers : Sepals spreading, corolla (8-) 10 – 15 x (6-) 8 – 10 mm in diameter, orange-red below, yellow near the tip.\n花：花萼摊开；花冠(8-)10-15mm高，（6-）8-10mm直径；底部橙红色，顶部黄色。Cytology : n = 25\n染色体：n=25\nPlants in habitat in Mexico :\n墨西哥原产地上的植株："
      },
