  "succ_0892": {
    "title": "Echeveria shaviana 沙维娜",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文链接：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1962\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者是植物学白痴，欢迎勘误。Echeveria shaviana Walther, 1972\n沙维娜，由Walther发表于1972年\nSeries Angulatae\nAngulatae系\nDistribution : Mexico (Tamaulipas, Nuevo León)\n分布于墨西哥的Tamaulipas州和Nuevo León州。\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：\nPlants glabrous.\n表面光洁。\nStem usually < 5 cm long, ± 1 cm in diameter, sparsely branching.\n茎部：通常不长于5cm，直径1cm左右，茎部很少分枝。\nRosette 8 – 10 cm in diameter.\n莲座：8-10cm直径。\nLeaves obovate-spatulate, mucronate, the whitish margins undulate-crispate, 3 – 5 x 1,5 – 2,5 cm, thin, glaucous-greenish to -pinkish.\n叶：倒卵形-匙形，有短尖；叶缘泛白，有波浪形褶皱；3-5cm长，1.5-2.5cm宽，瘦长；浅绿色或浅粉色，被白霜。\nInflorescences with 1 – 2 cincinni, to 30 cm tall, pedicels < 2 mm.\n花序：上有1-2根蝎尾状聚伞花序，可高达30cm，花梗不超过2mm。\nFlowers : Sepals ascending, corolla 10 – 13 mm long, pentagonal, rose.\n花：萼片直立，花冠10-13mm长，五片花瓣，枚红色。\nCytology: n = 13\n染色体：n=13。Distributed by ISI n°456 (1963)\nISI编号456（1963）。\nNative to shaded areas, where it grows in pine-needles on boulders.\n原生于岩石间阴影地带的松针落叶里。\nPlants in habitat in Mexico - all at one and the same place.\n墨西哥原产地上的植株——同一地区，同一时间。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d80610d86fbc.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7a6d6eff8ccc.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b57b65642b3e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4c7d526639b7.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_147721459f7b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a5b8b2d64a5e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8bbd2de50977.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Gerhard Köhres"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_71b5f7f7fff3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Werner Geissler"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8459cfb53f73.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_48f6b2355198.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_84f3437c6fd8.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle Aubé.E. shaviana 'Pink Frills'\n祗园之舞——沙维娜的园艺品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_85e3e14654c6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Margrit Bischofberger\n译者注：所以实际上沙维娜及其各个园艺品种应当半阴养殖较好，腐叶土/泥炭比例可以略大些。而祗园之舞区别于沙维娜之处是叶缘的粉色较重，沙维娜的叶缘则泛白。"
