  "succ_0893": {
    "title": "Echeveria simulans 镜莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1440\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria simulans Rose, 1905\n镜莲，由Rose发表于1905年（译注：simulans的拉丁词根意为\"相似的\"，经讨论命名为镜莲）\nSynonym : Echeveria elegans var. simulans (Rose) von Poellnitz (1936)\n异名：Echeveria elegans var. simulans (Rose) von Poellnitz (1936)\n（译注：即原先为月影变种，现已独立为原始种，不应再被冠以\"皱叶月影\"等名称）Distribution : Mexico (Nuevo León)\n分布于墨西哥的Nuevo León(译注：原文未注明系别，经查应为瓮花系。拟石莲属17系资料详见http://funjing.com/7821/)\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem nearly lacking, sparsely and slowly branching.\n几乎无茎，茎部偶尔会缓慢分枝。Rosette to > 10 cm in diameter.\n莲座：直径大于10cm\n（译注：实际上，根据Julia Etter & Martin Kristen的记载，其直径可达18cm）Leaves loosely rosulate, obovate, mucronate, to 7 x 4 cm, glaucous, greenish-white.\n叶：形成松散的莲座，倒卵形，7x4cm，被霜，淡绿色中透白。Inflorescence with 1 – 2 cincinni, 20 – 40 cm tall, pedicels to 10 mm and more.\n花序：上有1-2根蝎尾状结构，20-40cm高；花梗可达10mm以上。Flowers : Sepals ± appressed, corolla conoid-urceolate, to 15 x 10 mm in diameter near the base, rose-pink, yellowish at the tip.\n花：萼片微贴花瓣；花冠为圆锥状的瓮形，长可达15mm，基部直径10mm，玫瑰粉，顶部黄色。Cytology : n = 32\n染色体：n=32\n（译注：经查为二倍体）\nNote :\n请注意：Distinguished from the numerous forms of E. elegans by its larger, less compact rosettes and larger leaves and corolla.\n与月影的各种形态不同，镜莲的莲座、叶子和花冠都更大，莲座也不似月影那么紧凑。\nE. simulans (Ascencion)\nAscencion地区产的镜莲："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6698b72c6631.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "（译注：此处高亮！KK上卖的ECHEVERIA simulans, Ascension (5110) 即是这个。请注意三点：一是kk种子逗号后面的是产地，不是品种，\"ECHEVERIA simulans, Ascension\"的意思是阿森松地区产的镜莲的种子，而不是一个名叫阿森松的品种的种子！二是Ascension亦可拼作Ascención，是墨西哥Nuevo León附近的一个地名。三是，如果ICN可信的话，Ascención地区产的镜莲叶子并不是很皱，不知道http://www.xianzhenyuan.cn/thread-286623-1-1.html中lz为什么认为Ascención较皱？图一的原始来源是ICN旧站，上面并未标明产地。如果读者有自播的Ascención产地镜莲，恳请po图证明叶子形态。也欢迎自播的其他产地镜莲的图）\nE. simulans (Pinal de Amoles)\nPinal de Amoles地区产的镜莲："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6c4294431e62.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_db45c0e2cf51.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "E. simulans (Laguna Sanchez)\nLaguna Sanchez地区产的镜莲："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3000cc35f881.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_40d713d189c3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Werner Krell\nE. simulans, Galeana, Nuevo Leon.\nNuevo Leon的Galeana地区产的镜莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_65e8d4ad41a7.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bbbc51664c4a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cabda67eaf22.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle AubéICN旧站配图（无产地信息）："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8e05b4065fbe.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ac499b7c6d12.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_09b7b5b7a9a1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "译注：\n译注的数量绝对可以代表我对这个物种的喜爱程度\n如果读者熟悉七福神和玉蝶，应该会发现镜莲同样也出现了\"光谱\"情况，即不同产地的镜莲叶子形态和褶皱程度略有差异，各产地间形成渐变\n除上文提到的，镜莲产地还包括Pajonal，Rayones和Siberia，kk有稳定的种子供应\n暂无资料明确的杂交后代"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0894": {
    "title": "Echeveria strictiflora 剑司及杂交",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1968\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria strictiflora A. Gray, 1852\n剑司，由A. Gray发表于1852年Synonym : Cotyledon strictiflora\n异名：Cotyledon strictifloraSeries Angulatae\n剑司系\nDistribution : USA (Texas), Mexico (Coahuila, Chihuahua?, Nuevo León?)\n分布于：美国德克萨斯州，墨西哥Coahuila州、Chihuahua州（持疑）、Nuevo León（持疑）\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP):Stem < 3 cm tall, 0,5 – 1,5 cm in diameter, rarely branching.\n茎部：小于3cm高，0.5-1.5cm直径，很少分枝。Leaves rosulate, ascending-spreading, oblanceolate-rhombic, acute, 3 – 9 x 1,5 – 3 cm, grey-green or buff- green, with or without a red margin.\n叶：莲座状排列，向上伸展或摊开；倒披针形-菱形，顶端尖锐，3-9cm长，1.5-3cm宽，灰绿色或浅黄色-绿色，有些有红边，有些没有。Inflorescences secund-racemose, unbranched or rarely 2-branched, 20 – 25 cm tall, pedicels ± 1 mm .\n花序：secund-racemose（不知对应的中文是什么），不分枝，偶尔会分出2枝，20-25cm高；花梗1mm左右。Flowers : Sepals ascending, 9 – 13 mm, corolla conoid to urceolate-campanulate, strongly pentagonal, rose near the base, yellowish-red above, 13 x 15 x 8 mm in diameter ner the base, 5 mm in diameter at the mouth.\n花：萼片撑开，9-13mm；花冠圆锥形-瓮形-钟形，非常明显的五边形，基部玫红色，顶部淡黄色-红色，基部13x15x8mm，顶部5mm直径。Of interest as the only echeveria native to the USA. It is also one of the more difficult species to cultivate.\n令人感兴趣的是，这是唯一一种原产于美国的拟石莲花，也是较难人工培植的拟石莲花之一。Some populations in Texas and Mexico have red-margined leaves but seem to be uncorrelated geographically.\n德州和墨西哥的一些种群有红边，但红边这一特征似乎与地理分布无关。A plant collected by A. Lau in the Sierra Gomas, west of Bustamante, Nuevo León, has unusually broad leaves (to 4 cm wide) and after further study may be proposed as a new variety or species.\nA. Lau曾在Nuevo León州Bustamante西部的Gomas山脉收集到一棵植株，它有着不同寻常的宽叶子（宽达4cm），更进一步的研究可能会提出这是一个新的变种乃至物种。A form with red margins from Coahuila :\n产自Coahuila的红边形态："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_aeb5d26aff13.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cd9d90edee43.png"
      },
