  "succ_0895": {
    "title": "Echeveria subalpina 浮岳莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "\"subalpina\"这个词的意思是\"亚高山生长\"的，带入属名后意思是这个物种是在亚高山处生长的石莲花。故拟中文名\"浮岳莲\"。（玩过怪物猎人的盆友你懂的……）\n原文地址：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=113&x270_id=1113&x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵\n一切权利属于原作者，转载请注名原文链接及译者，欢迎勘误。SUBALPINA Rose & Purpus, 1910\n浮岳莲 由Rose 和 Purpus发表于 1910年\nSynonyms :\n异名：\nEcheveria akontiophylla Werdermann (1932)\nEcheveria meyraniana E. Walther (1959)Series Secundae\n七福神系Distribution : Mexico (Puebla, Tlaxcala, Veracruz)\n分布地：墨西哥（普埃布拉州，特拉斯卡拉，韦拉克鲁斯）Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n形态描述(gju 2003版本IHSP)：Stem < 4 cm tall, rarely branching.\n茎<4厘米高，很少分枝。Rosette 4 – 10 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径4到10厘米。Leaves oblanceolate to linear-oblanceolate, long-acuminate, cuspidate, 2.5 – 5 (-14) x 1 – 1.5 cm, glaucous-green, mucro reddish.\n叶倒披针形至线状披针形，长尖形。叶尖骤然变尖，2.5 - 5厘米长（-14厘米）×1 - 1.5厘米狂，叶有白霜，绿色，叶尖红色。Inflorescence a single or 2- branched cincinnus, to 30 cm long, pedicels 4 – 8 (-22) mm.\n花序单支或2 分支蝎尾状花序，30厘米长，花梗4 - 8（-22）毫米。Flowers : Sepals widely spreading, corolla 10 – 12 x 6 – 8 mm in diameter near the base, orange to red, petals margins yellow.\n花：萼片外展。花冠10 - 12毫米长，基部约6 - 8毫米直径，橙色至红色，花瓣边缘黄色。Cytology : n = 34\n细胞学检查：染色体数=34The collection from Tlaxcala (Mun. Temezontly, Cerro Cuatlapangas) has smaller leaves and more caespitose rosettes.\n从 Tlaxcala （Mun. Temezontly，Cerro Cuatlapangas）处收集的个体有较为短小的叶片，植物丛生。Note :\n注意：\nVery often the hybrid E. 'Olivine' is distributed under the name of this species.\n一个叫做E. 'Olivine'的杂交石莲花常常被冠以Echeveria subalpina 的名字。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9b182b5577a5.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5f78ca3320cc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "E. subalpina Perote, Puebla, Mexico.Photos Margrit Bischofberger以下来自google 搜索"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_eaf85f5cc328.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f200da266dde.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cdb59f54dd92.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0896": {
    "title": "Echeveria subrigida 刚叶莲、钢叶莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=430\n翻译：Qiuhan转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria subrigida 刚叶莲Synonyms :\n异名：Cotyledon subrigida Robinson & Seaton (1893)\nEcheveria palmeri Rose (1903)\nEcheveria rosei Nelson & Macbride (1913)\nEcheveria angusta von Poellnitz (1936)\nSeries Gibbiflorae\nGibbiflorae系\nDistribution : Mexico (México, Hidalgo, San Luis Potosí, Guanajuato, Querétaro)\n分布于墨西哥的México州、Hidalgo州、San Luis Potosí州、Guanajuato州、和Querétaro州Description (according to IHSP 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：\nStem usually < 5 cm tall, to 5 cm in diameter, rarely branching.\n茎部：通常不超过5cm高，较大直径5cm，很少分枝。\nRosette 15 – 20 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径约15-20cm。\nLeaves oblong-oblanceolate, acute or shortly acuminate, 15 – 25 x 5 – 10 cm, thick, rigid, margins somewhat upturned and often finely undulate-crenulate, white-pruinose, sometimes nearly or entirely green, margin and mucro reddened.\n叶：椭圆形或倒披针形，叶尖处陡然变窄；15-25cm长，2-10cm宽，厚实，坚硬；叶缘略微上翘，而且带有一丝微妙的褶边和细圆齿；被白霜，有时近乎于或完全是绿色的，叶缘和叶尖发红。\nInflorescences 1 - 2, narrowly cymose-paniculate, to 1 m tall, ± 15 mm in diameter near base, to 12-branched, each branch with 1 – 7 flowers, pedicels stout, 2 - 5 mm.\n花序：1-2支，稀疏的圆锥聚散花絮，较高1m，基部直径15mm左右，较多12根分枝，每支约1-7朵花；花梗短粗，2-5mm长。\nFlowers : Sepals ascending, to 25 mm, corolla urceolate, pentagonal, to 25 mm long, 14 mm in diameter or more near the base, ± 20 mm in diameter at the tip, glaucous, pink to scarlet, nectar scales scarlet.\n花：花萼上翘，约25mm；翁状花冠，五角形，约25mm长，14mm直径，基部直径可能更大，顶部直径20mm左右；被霜；粉色或猩红色；蜜腺鳞片（？）猩红色。\nCytology : n = 27, 54\n染色体：n=27,54。Note :\n请注意：\nUntil its description in 1997 Echeveria cante erroneously has been distributed as E. subrigida. This means that hybrids with E. subrigida as one parent created prior to 1997 in fact are hybrids with E. cante.\n直到1997年，拟石莲属广寒宫一直被误当做拟石莲属刚叶莲。这意味着1997年以前所有以刚叶莲为亲本之一的杂交品种实际上都是广寒宫的后代。\nPlants in habitat, Pinal de Amoles, Mexico :\n墨西哥的Pinal de Amoles，原产地上的植株："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d537b4c9d315.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1de22bbe031f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5fc9273e1a5f.png"
      },
