  },
  "succ_0897": {
    "title": "Echeveria tencho 天珠莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "很遗憾译者没有好用的拉丁词汇辞典，种加词tencho找不到其含义。谷歌翻译告诉我这个词的意思是\"天诛\"——应该是日语的罗马音形式，估计和这个植物没啥关系……真是宿命多舛，于是用音译的方法，拟中文名为\"天珠莲\"。原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1935\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nTENCHO Moran & Uhl, 2005\n天珠莲 由Moran和Uhl发表于2005年Series Spicatae\n穗状花序系Distribution : Mexico (Veracruz)\n分布：墨西哥（韦拉克鲁斯）Description (according to Haseltonia 11, 2005) :\n描述（按2005版 haseltonia 11期）：Plant shrubby, caudex branching, to 50 cm tall or more, 8 – 15 mm thick, pale green and glaucous above, darker below, leaf scars lenticular.\n植株灌木型，茎多分枝，可长至50厘米高或更高，茎干8到15毫米粗，淡绿色，有白霜，近根处色深暗，叶痕呈双凸形。Rosette terminal, rather diffuse, 7 – 12 cm wide.\n莲座顶生，较松散，7到12厘米宽。Leaves 12 – 25, oblanceolate, broadly acute and submucronate, 5 – 6.5 cm long, 15 – 22 mm wide above, 6 mm wide at base, 3 – 4 mm thick, at first ventrally channeled but later flattish, somewhat glaucous when young, later green or becoming reddish.\n叶数12–25片，倒披针形，宽大有尖，叶下有棘，5–6.5厘米长，宽约15–22毫米以上，在叶基部6毫米宽，3–4毫米厚。近叶尖处有浅沟，渐移行平坦，嫩叶稍有白霜，成熟后成为绿色或红色。Inflorescences 1 – 3, to 50 cm tall, with 15 – 50 bracts, ascending at base but outcurved, elliptic to oblanceolate, broadly acute, spurred, up to 2.5 – 4 cm x 11 – 17 mm and to 3 mm thick, green, glaucous; racemes 7 – 20 cm long, with 25 – 40 flowers, rarely with a 2-flowered branch; pedicels 2 – 3 mm long.\n花序：1–3枝，可达50厘米高，附着约15–50片小叶，在花序的基部向外上方弧形生长，椭圆形到倒披针形，宽尖型，有小刺，较大约2.5–4厘米长×11–17毫米宽，3毫米厚。绿色，有白霜；总状花序7–20厘米长，25–40朵花，稀见花序分支；花梗长3毫米。Flowers : Sepals widely spreading, unequal, triangular-lanceolate, acuminate, 6 – 12 mm x 2 – 4 mm, corolla 13 – 15 mm long, 6 – 7 mm thick at base, 9 – 11 mm thick above, light yellow somewhat tinged with rose on apical half, petals slightly divergent, not in contact in upper two-thirds, triangular-lanceolate.\n花：萼片平展，不等长，三角形披针形，渐尖，6–12毫米长×2–4毫米宽，花冠13–15毫米长，在基部厚6–7毫米，上部约9–11毫米厚，淡黄色，有些顶端呈玫红色。花开放不完全，打开约花瓣全长的三分之二，花瓣呈三角状披针形的。Cytology : n = 51\n细胞学：染色体数=51Plants in habitat :\n栖息地植株："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_459883d647f0.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b62ef0c02c9b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Gerhard Köhres"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f8e7ee07fb56.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6070bfd1a9eb.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ed Dunin-Wasowicz"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0bdf10e6de2b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5fb42b33495f.png"
