  "succ_0898": {
    "title": "Echeveria tobarensis 拓跋莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：ICN新站，Echeveria目录，Species子目录，TOBARENSIS条目\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria tobarensis A. Berger 1930\n拓跋莲，由Berger发表于1930年\n（中文名\"拓跋莲\"由@种花小医杂家赵 和Qiuhan根据音似而拟定）Synonym : Urbinia lurida Rose (1911)\n异名：Urbinia lurida Rose (1911)（译者注：根据ICN旧站信息，拓跋莲应属瓮花系。）Distribution : Mexico (Durango)\n分布于：墨西哥DurangoDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据IHSP，2003）：Stem short (?)\n短茎（？）Rosette 6 – 8 cm in diameter.\n莲座6-8cm直径Leaves densely rosulate, ovate, acuminate, glabrous, 3 – 4 x 1,5 – 2,5 cm, very thick, purple or reddish.\n叶子呈紧密的莲座状分布，卵形，锐尖，表面光洁，3-4cm长，1.5-2.5cm宽，很厚，紫色或淡红色。Inflorescence of 2 cincinni, 25 cm long.\n花序2根，25cm长。Flowers: Sepals small, ovate, acute, corolla 6 – 7 mm long, dark red.\n花：萼片小，卵形，有尖；花冠6-7mm长，暗红色。\nThis uncultivated species is known only from the type collection. Two attempts to re-collect it at the type locality were unsuccessful.\n这个物种尚未被人工培育，只在样本栖息地被发现过。两次有人试图再赴栖息地采集，均失败了。\n译注：但目前拓跋莲的种子kk已经有售，国内亦可买到，尚不知kk的种子来源，期待有人带大。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e7e619fca7e4.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_175390bbf92a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "图片收集自网络"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0899": {
    "title": "Echeveria tolimanensis 杜里万莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1890\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。译者不懂植物学，欢迎勘误。\nEcheveria tolimanensis Matuda, 1958\n杜里万莲，由Matuda发表于1958年Series Urbiniae\n瓮花系\nDistribution : Mexico (Hidalgo)\n分布于墨西哥的Hidalgo州\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem less than 5 cm long, 1 – 2.5 cm in diameter, rarely branching.\n茎部：长度小于5cm，1-2.5cm直径，很少分枝。Leaves rosulate, narrowly lanceolate to linear-oblong, semiterete, upper face somewhat flattened, aristate, 4 – 9 x 1.5 – 2 cm, 8 – 13 mm in diameter, lightly pruinose, greenish-white.\n叶：莲座状排列；窄的披针形到线形-椭圆形，半圆柱状，上表面较为扁平，顶端有芒，4-9cm长，1.5-2cm宽，8-13mm直径；略带白霜，淡绿色-白色。Inflorescence with 2 – 3 cincinni, 10 – 12 cm long, racemes 2 – 3, pendent, pedicels slender, 6 – 17 mm.\n花序：上有2-3根蝎尾状分枝，10-12cm长，总状花序2-3根，悬垂状，花梗纤细，6-17mm。Flowers : Sepals spreading to reflexed, corolla terete-urceolate, 10 – 14 mm long, coral-pink below, orange above.\n花：萼片张开或向后弯折；花冠圆柱形-瓮形，10-14mm长，底部珊瑚粉色，顶部橙色。Cytology : n = 30\n染色体：n=30\nPlants in habitat in Hidalgo, Mexico :\n墨西哥Hidalgo州原产地上的植株："
      },
