  "succ_0901": {
    "title": "Echeveria unguiculata 魔爪",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10122&x270_id=1178\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者，欢迎勘误。Echeveria unguiculata Kimnach, 2002\n魔爪，由Kimnach发表于2002年Series Angulatae\n剑司系\nDistribution : Mexico (SW Tamaulipas, E San Luis Potosí)\n分布于墨西哥Tamaulipas西北部，San Luis Potosí以东。\nDescription (according to IHSP 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Stem to 5 cm tall or more, 1 – 1.5 cm in diameter.\n茎部：高可达5cm以上，直径1-1.5cm。Rosette 8 – 10 cm in diameter.\n莲座：8-10cm直径。Leaves narrowly ovate-lanceolate, subulate, 4 – 4.5 cm long, 1.2 – 1.5 cm wide at the widest part 2 – 3 cm below the tip, 8 – 10 mm thick, purplish, mucro sharp, reddish.\n叶：窄的卵状披针形，钻形，长4-4.5cm，较宽处1.2-1.5cm（约在距叶尖2-3cm的部位），8-10mm厚，略带紫色，有锐尖，尖端发红。Inflorescence racemose, to 50 cm or more with ± 8 flowers , pedicels 6 - 17 mm.\n花序：总状花序，长可达50cm以上，上有8朵左右的花，花梗6-17mm。Flowers : Sepals at right angles to the corolla, slightly recurving, very unequal, 2 – 12 mm, corolla subcylindircal, obtusely angled, 15 - 17 mm long, 8 - 9 mm in diameter, light salmon-pink.\n花：萼片与花冠垂直，略微向后弯曲，大小悬殊，2-12mm长；花冠近圆柱形，棱角处很圆润，15-17mm长，8-9mm直径，淡淡的粉橙色。\nCytology : n = ± 220.\n染色体：n = ± 220By mistake distributed by ISI (nr. 1644, in 1986) as aff. angustifolia.\n1986年ISI误将其作为aff. angustifolia收录。First published in Cactus & Succulent Journal of America 76(2): 93-94, ills., 2004\n首次发表于 Cactus & Succulent Journal of America 76(2): 93-94, ills., 2004"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ec70f3fc7c8f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2af6955b44bb.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1a1c37500d1b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_99b3311efd32.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Rudolf Zacher\n译注：\n魔爪有时会和Echeveria craigiana很相似，区别在于魔爪有非常锐利且泛红的爪尖\n\"蒙恰卡\"和魔爪不是一个物种，\"蒙恰卡\"是（产自蒙恰卡的）墨西哥女孩"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0902": {
    "title": "Echeveria xichuensis 惜春",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "[翻译]Echeveria xichuensis原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=113&x270_id=1159&x270_listsearch=1\n翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。XICHUENSIS Lopez & Reyes, 1998\nxichuensis 洛佩兹&雷耶斯，1998Series Angulatae\n鱿鱼/剑司系Distribution : Mexico (Guanajuato)\n分布：墨西哥（瓜纳华托）Description :\n描述：Stem lacking or 5 cm tall.\n无茎干或者茎干5cm高。Rosette 10 - 12 cm in diameter.\n莲座直径约10 - 12厘米。Leaves 15 - 20, ovate to obovate or oblanceolate, acute or obtuse, 6 x 2.7 cm, to 3 mm thick, dark olive green tinged purple, with transverse and longitudinal markings.\n叶15～20，卵形到倒卵形或倒披针形，有锐尖或钝圆，6×2.7厘米，3毫米厚，深橄榄绿色微染紫色，有横向和纵向的暗纹。Inflorescence a cincinnus to more than 50 cm long with up to 25 flowers, bracts numerous, ca 2 x 0,4 cm, pedicels 3 – 3 mm.\n花序：蝎尾状聚伞花序，可长达50厘米。花序上较多可生长25朵花，附生较多小叶，大约2×0.4厘米，花梗3–3毫米。Flowers : Sepals spreading or ascending, unequal, up to 9,5 mm, corolla ca 11 mm long, ca 7 mm in diameter at base, 5 mm in diameter at mouth, pink at base, salmon higher up and light orange inside, petal tips slightly outcurved.\n花：萼片平展或上翘，各个苞片长度不等，长可达9.5毫米。花冠约11毫米长，基部约7毫米直径，花口部直径5毫米，花基部呈现粉色，至花冠部逐渐过渡为鲑鱼红色，花内部浅橙色，花瓣尖稍外翻。Cytology : n = 32 ? ?\n细胞学检查：染色体可能为32We consider E. xichuensis sufficiently different from E. humilis to be a good species and not synonymous with the latter as published in IHSP 2003.\nICN站观点：我们认为E. xichuensis 与 E. humilis有极大的区别，足以作为一个独立物种存在。且与发表在IHSP 2003上的后者也不是同物异名。附上E. humilis的图片，来自微博花友恋恋多肉季"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1c56b9baf4e1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "以下为Echeveria xichuensis 惜春的图片E. xichuensis,墨西哥原生地照片 :"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1e166ec2d7dc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Gerhard Köhres"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_76a7c3746fcf.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_267fa27b2d38.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_be9b6a0db3a1.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2cb3d6cdc482.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Rudolf Zacher"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_febb4f4704ba.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Zusung"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0903": {
    "title": "Echeveria‘violet Queen’紫罗兰女王",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "由Edward Orpet培育，在新西兰被误称为Echeveria subsessilis，亲本之一可能是Echeveria elegans（月影）。成株约11厘米，之后疯狂分头形成20头以上的大型群生，直径可达30厘米，是理想的温带花园植物。凉爽的温度和轻微的霜降可以使颜色更靓丽。可以通过分头繁殖。\nViolet Queen'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_23f51b58b51b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "（英文原著于 《Echeveria Cultivars》，作者 Lorraine Schulz / Attila Kapitany）"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0904": {
    "title": "G.'Douglas Huth' 初恋",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "原文：http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10138&x270_id=238\n翻译：Qiuhan\n一切权利属于原作者，欢迎勘误。（初恋的拉丁文名网上盛传为Echeveria cv. Huthspinke，这是错的，请以×Graptoveria 'Douglas Huth' 为准）×Graptoveria 'Douglas Huth' 初恋Possibly created by / peut-être créée par Douglas Huth, UK.\n也许是由英国人Gouglas Huth培育的。First published and named by J. C. van Keppel / Publiée et nommée par J.C. van Keppel : Succulenta 58 (10) : 253-254,1979.\n由J. C. van Keppel命名并发表于1979年的Succulenta 58 (10) : 253-254,1979。Parentage / Parenté : Graptopetalum paraguyense x E. sp. ? (E. gigantea ?).\n亲本为Graptopetalum paraguyense（风车草属胧月）和某种拟石莲属，也许是E. gigantea（拟石莲属大瑞蝶）Synonyms : Echeveria 'Dr. Huth's Pink' hort., Graptopetalum 'Dr. Huth's Pink' hort., Graptopetalum 'Dr. Huth's Blue' hort., Graptopetalum californica hort. angl. non hort. am., Graptopetalum uruguayense (France), Echeveria 'Perle d'Azur'.\n异名：Echeveria 'Dr. Huth's Pink' hort.，Graptopetalum 'Dr. Huth's Pink' hort.，Graptopetalum 'Dr. Huth's Blue' hort. ，Graptopetalum californica hort. angl. non hort. am.，Graptopetalum uruguayense （法国），Echeveria 'Perle d'Azur'.Note: Leaf colour changes a lot when either grown in full sun – pinkish - or in shade – bluish - which explains the two synonyms 'Dr. Huth's Pink' and 'Dr. Huth's Blue'.\n请注意：不同光照下叶子的颜色差异很大，全日照是是粉色的，室内养殖时则发蓝，这也是为什么会有'Dr. Huth's Pink' 和 'Dr. Huth's Blue'这两个异名流传的原因。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_42264d950d9e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8eb9e00c4d39.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0e7bed770ebf.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e6f1a0061be0.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_af297169cbd8.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0905": {
    "title": "Graptopetalum 'Snow-White'紫悦",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权力属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者。原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕\n\nSnow-White / Blanche-Neigeaka Graptopetalum 'Purple Delight' in Australia\n在澳大利亚被称为Graptopetalum 'Purple Delight'（注：中文名紫悦的出处）Description:\n描述：\nCaulescent plant, stems first prostrate, later decumbent but somewhat upright at top, appr. 15 cm high.\n有茎的植物，枝干起初匍匐，然后外倾并顶端直立，大概有15厘米高。Stem (for this plant) 25 cm long, 1,2 – 1,3 cm in diameter, aerial roots.\n枝干长25厘米，直径1.2~1.3厘米，生有气根。Rosette ca. 10 cm wide, about 20 leaves.\n莲座约10厘米宽，大约20片叶子Leaves pale green but very pruinose – thus the name! 5,3 cm long, 2.1 cm wide and 0,9 cm thick; above flat to slightly convex, below convex without keel.\n叶片淡绿色，但具有厚重的粉霜–因而得名！长5.3厘米，宽2.1厘米厚0.9厘米；叶子正面平微凸,背面没有龙骨状凸起。Inflorescence the same as in Graptopetalum paraguayense; petals white with some red dots different from flower to flower; anthers white, carpel greenish.\n花序和胧月（G.paraguayense）相同;花瓣白色，每朵花有不同的红点;花药白色,心皮绿色。Note:\n注意：This plant is very special in being extraordinary pruinose. It differs from G. 'Marquise de Sévigné' in the colour of the leaves and in having less red dots inside of the petals – but this may also depend on growing conditions.\n这种植物因具有浓厚的粉霜而非常特别。它与G. 'Marquise de Sévigné'的区辨在于叶子的颜色和花瓣内侧较少的红点——但是这也取决于生长条件。Published in Subtropica 26, April 2009 by Jean-Michel Moullec.\n由Jean-Michel Moullec在Subtropica于2009年4月26日发表。\n\nPlant grown in Australia :\n在澳大利亚种植的植株：\nPhotos Noelene Tomlinson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b485a3449d48.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a4e7ba4957f6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1cec3f4493e2.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dacc58bba751.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1955d88bddf2.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Graptopetalum 'Snow-White' together with xGraptosedum 'Salmon' :"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_363d0295c78e.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0906": {
    "title": "Graptopetalum filiferum 菊日和",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "作者：James Low\n翻译：Qiuhan原文链接：http://crassulaceae.net/graptopetalummenu/59-speciesgraptopetalum/150-genus-graptopetalum-uk一切权利属于原作者。欢迎勘误。Graptopetalum filiferum（菊日和）由Watson发表于1888年，Whitehead发表于1943年；分布于墨西哥中北部；n=31,32；花白色，上有红纹。拉丁文名的意思是\"有丝线的\"，指的是其顶端细长的叶子。这个品种可谓植物王国里的无冕之王，有许多杂交后代。如有名的x Graptpveria 'Silver Star'（银星），其另一个亲本为E. agavoides（东云），由Kimnach杂交。参考CSSA的1974年五月号第140页的ISI-869，CSSA的1976年号第65页，以及CSSA的1983年十一月号第261页。=Sedum filiferum，由Watson发表于1888年，已弃用。\n=*G. filiferum。由Whitehead发表于1943年，现用名。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ecc047315eed.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Graptopetalum filiferum（菊日和）【照片和植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4354470c972a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Graptopetalum filiferum（菊日和）【照片和植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_083c816319bf.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Graptopetalum filiferum（菊日和）【照片和植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0907": {
    "title": "Graptopetalum mendozae 丸叶姬秋丽",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "作者：James Low\n翻译：Qiuhan原文链接：crassulaceae.net/graptopetalummenu/59-speciesgraptopetalum/150-genus-graptopetalum-uk一切权利属于原作者。欢迎勘误。Graptopetalum mendozae （丸叶姬秋丽）由Glass和Chazaro发表于1997年的墨西哥仙肉杂志，17（4）的第79-82页；分布于墨西哥东北部的Veracruz州（原文为Veracuz，疑为笔误）。它看起来很像是一种更小而且多枝杈的G. paraguayense ssp. bernalense（胧月的一个亚种）。Glass是为了纪念Mario Mendoza-Gracia而为它命名的，他认为Mendoza有可能是第一个发现这个品种的人。但实际上，Uhl才是第一个发现它并指明了产地的人（参见CSSA Journ.1997年九月号第239页，和1998年一月号第17页）。这是一种精致的植物，颜色苍白，但其实长的很快，很好养活。不像其他风车草属植物，它的花瓣上没有斑纹，花朵呈绿色到白色，n=34。=G. mendozae（丸叶姬秋丽），由Glass和Chazaro发表于1997年，现用名。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_70762349d60f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "G. mendozae, 发现于墨西哥Veracruz州【照片植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_aef91a8d9c87.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "G. mendozae, 发现于墨西哥Veracruz州【照片植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_837e25f9d5fc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "G. mendozae, 发现于墨西哥Veracruz州【照片植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】\n更多图片来自ICN新站，新站上的文字比较专业，如果需要翻译请回复提出，地址是crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10131&x270_id=98"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a2dbbbd590a6.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d0087a4bdaef.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Al Waltemyer"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_da74828059d4.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_96014cec7a30.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_18e82a4e1a5d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d114532f2718.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Mateo Lichtenstein\n2014.3.10译注：之前将这个物种对应为姬秋丽，并不严谨，经楼下@duorou9 指正，已更新为丸叶姬秋丽。姬秋丽应为Graptopetalum 'Mirinae'"
      }
