  "succ_0908": {
    "title": "Graptopetalum superbum 华丽风车",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "作者：James Low\n翻译：Qiuhan原文链接：http://crassulaceae.net/graptope ... us-graptopetalum-uk一切权利属于原作者。欢迎勘误。\nGraptopetalum superbum （华丽风车）由Kimnach发表于1987年，Acevedo-Rosas发表于2003年，即原来的G. pentandrum ssp. superbum，在2003年Novon#13（4）第377-380页上正式作为独立品种发表。= G. pentandrum ssp. superbum，由Kimnach发表于1987年，已废弃。\n==*G. superbum, 由Acevedo-Rosas发表于2003年，现用名。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b9352d9d68b7.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bf0fdc0fd8ec.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b3c75445ccb3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Graptopetalum superbum华丽风车【照片和植株由Jean-Michel Moullec提供】译者注：基本没说什么，我超级爱这个品种，花开起来很霸气，已经秋播，多翻译几句新站内容http://www.crassulaceae.ch/index.php?TPL=10131&x270_id=97Synonym : G. pentandrum ssp. superbum Kimnach (1987)\n异名：G. pentandrum ssp. superbum ，由Kimnach发表于1987年（竟然是我出生那年哈哈）Distribution : Mexico (Jalisco); 1200m\n分布于墨西哥的Jalisco州，海拔1200米Description :\n描述：Plant schrubby, branching basally, to 20 cm tall or more, entirely glabrous.\n丛生，基部分头，可达20cm高以上，表面光洁。Stems branching mostly from base, suberect to semidecumbent, 10 – 12 cm thick near base, 5 – 10 mm thick near apex, prominently marked with elliptical, tan leaf-scars.\n茎：从较底下分叉，直立或半直立，基部10-12cm厚，顶端5-10mm厚，有明显的褐色椭圆形叶疤。Leaves 12 – 20 on apical 1 – 2 cm of stem, the more apical ones in a dense, nearly flat rosette, the lower ones separated 5 – 8 mm at base, soon deciduous, oblong-obovate, with a deltoid mucro, heavily glaucous with purplish bloom, amber-green beneath wax, 4 – 6 cm long, 2 – 2.5 cm wide at widest part 1.5 – 2 cm from apex, 5 – 7 mm thick at thickest part ca. 5 mm from apex, the upper surface nearly flat, the lower surface more or less strongly convex.\n叶：在靠近顶端的1-2cm处有12-20片，形成紧实、近乎于扁平的莲座，靠近基部的地方每隔5-8mm长一片叶子，很快就脱落了；椭圆形-倒卵形，末端有一个三角形的小尖；紫红色的厚霜，霜底下是黄绿色；4-6cm长，较宽处距叶尖1.5-2cm，2-2.5cm宽，较厚处距叶尖约5mm，5-7mm厚；上表面几乎扁平，下表面为显著的凸形，凸起程度不一。Inflorescences : Flowering stems up to 3 to a stem, erect or ascending-horizontal, 30 – 40 cm long and ca. 20 – 30 cm wide, peduncle 7 – 12 cm long, bracts lacking on basal 2 – 3 cm, ca 10 above, similar to leaves but smaller, branches 12 – 15, ca. 2 – 4 cm apart, 5 – 9-flowered, pedicels 10 – 14 mm long.\n花序：较多3支，直立或斜向上，30-40cm高，占据约20-30cm宽的空间；肉质茎7-12cm长；苞叶不生长在基部2-3cm处，约10多片，和叶子很像，但更小；分枝约12-15根，每根之间约有2-4cm的间隙，上有花5-9朵，花梗约10-14mm长。Flowers : Sepals appressed to petals, 3 – 4 mm long, glaucous, corolla ca 9 mm long when unopened, 15 – 16 mm wide when expanded, petals 5 (or 6), triangular, the upper surface greenish yellow, the apical millimeter reddish brown, the next 2 mm with 2 – 3 crossbands and scattered dots of same colour.\n花：花萼紧贴花瓣，3-4mm长，覆有白霜；未盛开时，花冠约9mm长，盛开后15-16mm款；花瓣5或6片，上表面黄绿色，顶端的几毫米处为红棕色，之后的2mm上有2-3条红棕色的条带或斑点。Cytology : n = 64\n染色体：n=64"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_806df7dda221.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ce378120ce90.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7d40d7ad6bc1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle Aubé"
      }
    ]
