  "succ_0909": {
    "title": "Greenovia aurea 黄金山地玫瑰深探",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "Aeonium aureum (C.Sm. ex Hornem.) T.H.M.Mes\nWCSP（World Checklist of Selected Plant Families）认可\n常用名：Greenovia aurea\nGreenovia aurea是Greenovia(山地玫瑰属)合并为Aeonium(莲花掌属)后确认的四个原始种之一,同时也是山地玫瑰中广为人知的品种.\n该种广泛分布于加那利群岛的大加那利岛（GranCanaria）,特内里费岛（Tenerife）,耶罗岛（El Hierro）,戈梅拉岛（La Gomera）和拉帕尔马岛（La Palma）海拔1000- 1900m北坡针叶林区的岩缝隙中.\nGreenovia植株直径约为20-25cm,叶子颜色常呈灰蓝,青色,在表面被有白粉.花期为5-7月,花色为奶黄色,花后有大量的种子,而且侧芽生长十分迅速,因此繁殖方式主要为侧芽和种子.\n黄金山地应该是山地玫瑰种较具有代表性的品种,其在夏季休眠时所呈现出的玫瑰状态更是山地玫瑰系受到欢迎的原因之一.\nAUREUM (C.Smith ex Hornemann) Mes, 1995 黄金山地\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nSempervivum aureum C.Smith ex Hornemann (1819) / Greenovia aurea (C.Smith ex Hornemann) Webb & Berthelot (1840)\nSempervivum calyciforme Haworth (1819)\nGreenovia ferrea Webb in Christ (1888) / Sempervivum ferreum (Webb) Christ (1888)\nGreenovia polypharmica Webb in Christ (1888) / Sempervivum polypharmicum (Webb) Christ (1888)\nGreenovia rupifraga Webb in Christ (1888) / Sempervivum rupifragum (Webb) Christ (1888)\nSection Greenovia\n山地玫瑰组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gran Canaria, Tenerife, Gomera, La Palma, Hierro); 400 - 2000 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(大加那利岛,特内里费岛,戈梅拉岛,拉帕玛岛,耶罗岛);400 - 2000m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nMonocarpic perennials.\n(花后死亡)多年生植物.\nRosette solitary or occasionally offsetting, 8 - 25 cm, cup-shaped with the inner leaves erect, tightly closed during the dry season.\n莲座状叶,植株单生,偶尔有侧芽,植株8 - 26cm,呈杯形,内叶直立,在旱季紧闭.\nLeaves 5 - 11 x 3 - 6 cm, obovate-spatulate, apically rounded, truncate or broadly cuneate, minutely apiculate or retuse, basally broadly cuneate, glabrous, glaucous, margin hyaline and occasionally with some minute glandular hairs, pale green.\n叶长5 - 11cm宽3 - 6cm,倒卵状匙形,先端圆形,截形或宽楔形,有微小的细尖或微凹,基部宽楔形.叶无毛,有白霜,边缘透明,某些情况下会有腺毛,淡绿色.\nInflorescences flat-topped, 10 - 25 x 20 - 45 cm, peduncle 15 - 35 cm, densely leafy, pedicels 2 - 5 mm, pubescent.\n平顶花序,长10 - 25cm,宽20 - 45cm,总花梗15 - 35cm,密被叶状,花梗2 - 5mm,被柔毛.\nFlowers 25- to 32-merous, sepals puberulent or pubescent, petals 7 – 8 x 1.5 - 2 mm, oblanceolate, acuminate, often apiculate, deep yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花基数25 - 32,花萼被微柔毛或短柔毛,花瓣长7 - 8mm,宽1.5 - 2mm,倒披针形,渐尖,先端尖,深黄,花丝无毛."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4175038d1797.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia aurea in summer\n©Zusung上图应该是较经典的aurea,相片以及植株均出自Zusung之手.从Zusung那里得知他所用的铺面材料是铁胆石一类的石头,并不是太昂贵的材料.遗憾的是,由于中国地区疯狂地盗用这系列图片,现在,Zusung所有的图片都开始打上大面积的不透明LOGO."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5f0e3911b6af.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia aurea from Tenerife\n©Susan"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia aurea from El Hierro"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_671230df3395.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "1 A0 G# d2 H XGreenovia aurea from GranCanaria\n©Zusung"
      },
      {
        "t": "野外状态下的Greenovia aurea (产地未知)\n©COBCAN"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_efcfa0ba66eb.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野外状态下的Greenovia aurea（产地未知）\n©Marianne Perdomo"
      },
      {
        "t": "耶罗岛的Greenovia aurea\n; ~, z7 t4 L( e. `) FPhotos Eduardo Carbonell\n1 f0 N1 z. `0 J4 [# R$ r7 [7 ?"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f584c5aa761f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "戈梅拉岛的Greenovia aurea\nPhotos Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c7f3bd1da58c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Thomas Delange"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1a2af015f09a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia aurea的生命较后之灿烂，亦是延续\n©Nature canariensis"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_734643b666c6.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Universität Göttingen\n与所有Aeonium(莲花掌属)植物一样,成年后,它们会走上生命较后的,也是较灿烂的旅程,花后,植株会枯萎死亡,然而在这之后,新的植株会生长起来.它们就是靠这样一种耐人寻味的方式生存,扩散着.\n资料引用自:Google & Flickr & The Plant List"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0910": {
    "title": "Greenovia diplocycla 冷霜",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "Aeonium diplocyclum (Webb ex Bolle) T.H.M.Mes\nWCSP（World Checklist of Selected Plant Families）认可\n常用名：Greenovia diplocycla\nGrenovia diplocycla是Greenovia(山地玫瑰属)合并为Aeonium(莲花掌属)后确认的四个原始种之一,同时也是山地玫瑰中休眠状态较可爱的品种.\n该品种主要分布于加那利群岛的特内里费岛（Tenerife）,戈梅拉岛（La Gomera）和拉帕尔马岛（La Palma）海拔50-1700m的岩石峭壁之上.\nGreenovia diplocycla是Grenovia原始种中较大的,直径能够达到15-20cm,圆润可爱的青绿叶片被有白霜,该种和Grenovia aurea很相似,但它并不像前者一样喜欢长出侧芽,因此它的主要繁殖方式就是种子繁殖.\nDIPLOCYCLUM (Webb ex Bolle) Mes, 1995 冷霜\nSynonyms :\n异名:\nGreenovia diplocyclaWebb ex Bolle (1859) / Sempervivum diplocyclum(Webb ex Bolle) Christ (1888)\nSection Greenovia\n山地玫瑰组\nDistribution : Canary Islands (Gomera, La Palma, Hierro);海拔 50 - 1700 m.\n分布:加那利群岛(戈梅拉岛.拉帕尔马岛,耶罗岛);50 - 1700m地区.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\nPerennial solitary monocarpic rosettes 6 - 18 cm in diameter, cup-shaped with inner leaves erect, tightly closed during the dry season.\n多年生植物,独生,莲座状叶直径6 - 18cm,植株杯形,内叶直立,在夏季叶片闭合.\nLeaves 5 - 8 x 4 - 6.5 cm, obovate-spatulate, apically rounded, truncate or broadly cuneate, apiculate or rarely retuse, basally broadly cuneate, glabrous, glaucous, margin hyaline, occasionally sparsely glandular-hairy, often minutely erose or sinuate, pale green.\n叶片长5 - 8cm,宽4 - 6.5cm,倒卵状匙形,先端圆形,截形或宽楔形,偶尔具细尖或微凹,基部宽楔形,无毛,有白霜,边缘透明,偶有稀疏腺毛,叶缘往往呈微小的啮蚀状或波状,淡绿色。\nInflorescences flat-topped, floriferous part 13 - 16 x 15 - 20 cm, peduncle 8 - 22 cm, densely leafy, pedicels 2 - 4 mm, glandular-hairy.\n平顶状花序,多花部分高13 - 15cm,宽15 - 20cm,总花梗8长 - 22cm,密被叶状,花梗长2 - 4mm,有腺毛.\nFlowers 19- to 24-merous, sepals glandular-hairy, petals 5 - 6 x 1 - 1.5mm, lanceolate, acuminate, often apiculate, deep yellow, filaments glabrous.\n花基数19 - 24,萼片被腺毛,花瓣长5 - 6mm,宽1 - 1.5mm,披针形,渐尖,常具细尖,深黄,花丝无毛.\nHardly different from A. aureum - this species group (including A. dodrantale) is not yet satisfactorily resolved.\n与Aeonium aureum几乎没有不同,(P.S.其实较大的不同就是大小还有是否出侧芽,Aeonium aureum是会出侧芽的品种.)"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3761f8b14035.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Grenovia diplocycla in summer\n©Zusung"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c1eadb4a185e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Grenovia diplocycla from La Gomera\n©Zusung\n上图是较经典的图片,出自Zusung之手,可以看到同一种之间由于地域隔离产生的独立特征还是很不一样的,值得收集.与其它地区的Grenovia diplocycla不同的是戈梅拉岛(La Gomera)的Grenovia diplocycla老叶在特定的情况下会泛红."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9808de654edd.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Plants at La Palma after a very dry summer.\n拉帕尔马岛的植株,在干旱的夏季之后.\nPhoto Carolina Carbonell Launois相对于Grenovia diplocycla来说,似乎它的园艺变种Greenovia diplocycla var. gigantea更加受欢迎,因为它更近乎于卵形的休眠期模样,实在是勾魂."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_05cead2d6ebd.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_804373646903.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_276c1ca66a34.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia diplocycla 'Gigantea'\n©Zusung"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_939a19db9635.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia diplocycla var. gigantea\n©Kelley Macdonald"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f6d371279f4e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_48945731a781.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©fraying接下来仍然是Greenovia diplocycla"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_04ea0bbe3b15.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©anniesannuals"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f5983b7614cd.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©thehumofbees"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7866ced71486.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "野外状态下的Greenovia diplocycla (产地未知)\n©Universität Göttinge"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e0342513c868.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9cfa67b2756b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Greenovia diplocycla 较后的绽放\n©allloe\n和别的Greenovia相同,Greenovia diplocycla 将耗尽生命绽放出灿烂的花朵,然而它并没有留下侧芽.也就是说,这使得它更要耐人寻味.每一株Greenovia diplocycla 都是独一无二,它盛开它死去,便完全消失在世界上.这点,使得我这个和它相同的人类有了一种难以言说的复杂感受.资料引用自:Google & Flickr & The Plant List & International Crassulaceae Network\n文本内容为植栽根据多方材料整理,带有部分个人观点,敬请谅解."
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0911": {
    "title": "Lenophyllum guttatum京鹿之子",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权利属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕【注】：Lenophyllum属目前被称为【深莲属】\n\nGUTTATUM (Rose) Rose, 1904 (engl./ fr.)Synonym : Sedum guttatum Rose (1903)\n异名：Distribution : Mexico (Coahuila, Nuevo León), 1200 – 2100 m.\n地理分布墨西哥（Coahuila, Nuevo León）海拔1200-2100米Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述：（根据2003年IHSP）Plants 5 – 20 cm tall.\n植株5-20厘米高。Leaves rhombic-ovate to –obovate or –lanceolate, low-rounded at the very tip, 2 – 4 x 2 cm, grey-green blotched with purplish-red.\n叶片菱形-卵形到倒卵形或披针形，较前端圆形，2–4×2厘米，有灰绿色和紫红色斑点。Inflorescences cymes with few cincinni of 8 – 15 flowers.\n花序聚伞花序和少数蝎尾聚伞花序，8-15朵花。Flowers : Sepals rounded at tips, corolla yellow, outside with red lines.\n花：萼片圆尖，花冠黄色，外面有红线。Cytology : n = 32, 33\n染色体：n=32,33\n\nPhoto Corrado Coccorese"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_43ca511d028b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Meinolf Stützer"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_892ca6cc5193.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_01888df2028c.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f5f26197f04d.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6aee52dd91a1.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0912": {
    "title": "Lenophyllum texanum德克萨斯景天",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权利属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕【注】：Lenophyllum属目前被称为【深莲属】\n\nTEXANUM (J.G.Smith) J.N.Rose, 1904 (engl./ fr.)Synonyms :\n异名Sedum texanum J.G.Smith (1895) / Villadia texana (J.G.Smith) Rose (1903)\nLenophyllum pusillum Rose (1905)Distribution : USA (S Texas), NE Mexico; below 100 m.\n地理分布：美国（德克萨斯州南部），墨西哥东北部；海拔100米以下Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述：（根据2003年IHSP）Plants 10 – 40 cm tall, green becoming reddish.\n植株10-40厘米高，颜色由绿变红。Leaves ovate-lanceolate to elliptic to oblanceolate, acuminate, 1 – 2.5 x 0.4 – 1 cm.\n叶卵状-披针形到椭圆形到倒披针形，渐尖，1-2.5 x 0.4-1厘米。Inflorescences racemes or spikes or narrow thyrses, 2 – 15 x 1.2 – 2 cm, with 5 – 25 commonly 1-flowered branches.\n花序为总状花序或穗状花序或狭窄的聚伞圆锥花序，2-15 x 1.2-2厘米，每支花枝通常开5-25朵。Flowers : Sepals acute to acuminate, corolla buffy or dull yellow, often marked with red.\n花：萼片锐尖到渐尖，花冠淡黄色或暗黄色，往往带有明显的红色。Cytology : n = 44\n染色体：n=44Note :\n注意：In the greenhouse this plant can become very invasive, and nurseries consider it a pest. Leaves and bracts detach and root easily and produce multitudes of new plantlets.\n这种植物在温室和苗圃入侵性会变得极强，认为它是一种有害植物。叶片和苞片脱落后，容易生根并产生大量新植株。\n\nPhotos Corrado Coccorese"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1d4578d6391e.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fa289edcf659.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0a4158e03553.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0ea492da78a1.png"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0913": {
    "title": "Orostachys japonica晚红瓦松",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权利属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕\n\nJAPONICA (Maximowicz) A.Berger, 1930Synonyms :\n异名：\nCotyledon japonica Maximowicz (1883) / Sedum malacophyllum var. japonicum (Maximowicz) Fröderström (1931) / Orostachys erubescens var. japonica (Maximowicz) Ohwi (1953) / Sedum erubescens var. japonicum (Maximowicz) Ohwi (1965)\nCotyledon polycephala Makino (1910) / Sedum polycephalum (Makino) Makino (1927) / Orostachys polycephala (Makino) H.Hara (1935) / Orostachys erubescens var. polycephala (Makino) Ohwi (1953) /Sedum erubescens var. polycephalum (Makino) Ohwi (1965) / Orostachys japonica fa. polycephala (Makino) H.Ohba (1981)\nSedum japonicola Makino (1927)\nOrostachys latielliptica Y.N.Lee (2000)\nOrostachys margaritifolia Y.N.Lee (2000)Section Orostachys\n属：瓦松属Distribution : Japan.\n地理分布：日本Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述：（根据2003年IHSP）Rosette 0.6 - 2 cm in diameter in winter, up to 8 cm in diameter in summer.\n莲座冬季直径0.6-2厘米，夏季直径超过8厘米。Leaves rosulate lanceolate to subulate-lanceolate, 2.5 - 8 x 0.5 - 1.5 cm in summer rosettes, tip spiny-acute to acuminate, grey-green to whitish-green, often reddish in winter, apical spines conspicuous in winter rosettes.\n叶子披针形的到钻形披针形, 夏型叶2.5～8×0.5 - 1.5厘米，尖端锐尖到渐尖，灰绿色带白色绿色，冬天常带淡红色，冬型莲座顶刺突出。Flowering stems 8 - 30 cm tall, cauline leaves and bracts oblong-lanceolate to lanceolate, 1 - 4 cm x 4 - 6 mm, tip spiny-apiculate to spiny-acute, triangular in cross-section.\n花茎8－30厘米，茎生叶，苞片长圆状披针形的到披针形，1—4厘米×4 - 6毫米，具细尖的尖端刺，急性，三角形的横截面。Flowers pedicellate, pedicels 2 - 7 mm, with 2 - 5 secondary lanceolate bracts, sepals oblong-ovate, 3 - 4.5 mm, tip spiny-acute or apiculate, petals white, oblong-elliptic or oblong-lanceolate, 6 - 8 mm, suberect,stamens longer than the petals, anthers dull-red.\n花梗，花梗2-7毫米，2 – 5枚披针形的苞片，萼片长圆状卵形，3 - 4.5 mm，尖端急性或具细尖的刺，花瓣白色，长圆状椭圆形或长圆状披针形，6 - 8毫米，近直立，雄蕊比花瓣长，花药暗红色。Flowering time : October to November.\n花期：10-11月Cytology : 2n = 24 (Uhl & Moran 1972)\n染色体：2n=24 (Uhl & Moran 1972)\n\nPhoto Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_182ab20d6862.png"
      },
