  "succ_0914": {
    "title": "Prometheum typhaeum 点滴莲",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "TYMPHAEUM (Quézel & Contandriopoulos) 't Hart, 1995 点滴莲\nSynonym :\n异名:\nSedum thymphaeum Quézel & Constandriopoulos (1967)\nDistribution : Nothern Greece; mountains, on rocks in crevices, limestone, 2000 – 2200 m, rare endemic and only known from 3 or 4 mountain tops.\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\nPerennials, densely covered with minute glandular hairs, sticky.\nRosette globose, forming offsets on short axillary stolons.\nLeaves oblong-obovate to spatulate, flattened, 10 – 12 x 3 – 4 mm .\nInflorescence axillary, ascending or erect, 5 – 8 (-10) cm, generally as few-flowered corymbose cymes with 2 – 3, sometimes forked, cincinni, pedicels to 8 mm,\nFlowers : Sepals basally slightly connate, oblong , 3 – 4 mm, petals 7 – 9 mm, basally conate, with broadly ovate-elliptic, acute, 3 – 4 mm wide , white or sometimes tinged with red, filaments white, anthers red, styles ± 1 mm, fruits stellate-patent, yellowish-brown, with distinct paler (whitish) lips along the sutures, seeds ovoid, brown.\nCytology : 2n = 14\nFormely included in Sedum, but closely related to the monocarpic P. pilosum and P. sempervivoides.\nThe 3 species can be easily hybridized, but their hybrids are completely sterile ('t Hart & al. 1999).\n分布:北希腊;山,岩石上的裂缝,石灰石,2000–2200米地区,十分稀有,且仅在3-4座山峰有分布.\n描述(根据IHSP,2003):\n多年生草本,密被小腺毛,有粘性.\n莲座结形成球状,匍匐茎短腋生侧芽.\n叶片长圆状倒卵形的到匙形,扁平,10–12 x 3–4毫米.\n花序腋生,上升或直立,5–8(－10)厘米,通常是少花的伞房状聚伞花序2–3支.有时分叉,蝎尾状聚伞花序,花梗到8毫米长.\n花:萼片长圆形.基部稍合生.3–4毫米.花瓣7–9毫米.基部合生,有时为宽卵形椭圆形,急尖,宽3–4毫米,白色或有时微染红色,花丝白色,花药红色,±1毫米,星状的种荚,黄棕色,有明显的苍白(白色)唇沿缝线,种子卵球形,棕色.\n染色体:2n＝14\n之前被分于景天属(Sedum)名下,但与一果植物P. pilosum ,P. sempervivoides有紧密的关系.\n上述三种品种可以进行杂交,但杂交种完全不育."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ae635a859ada.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_af6b961108c3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ray Stephenson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c85b0aa93764.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "©Marko.D"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7af036eccbc8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_53b66657004c.png"
