  "succ_0915": {
    "title": "Sedum hirsutum 春上和姬春上",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "来源:icn —— sedum属条目 —— Sedum hirsutum原始种条目翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nHIRSUTUM Allioni, 1785\n春上 由Allioni发表于1785年Synonyms :\n异名：\nLeucosedum hirsutum (Allioni) Fourreau (1868) / Oreosedum hirsutum (Allioni) Grulich (1984) / Rosularia hirsuta (Allioni) Eggli (1988)\nSedum hirsutum var. rubellum Merino\nSedum hirsutum var. maroccanum Font Quer (1928)\nSedum winkleri var. maroccanum Font Quer (1928)\nSedum hirsutum var. gattefossei Maire & al. ex Maire (1938)\nSedum hirsutum var. thermarum Maire & al. ex Maire (1938)Distribution : SW Europe (Spain, Portugal, France, Italy), N Africa (Morocco).\n分布：欧洲西南部（西班牙，葡萄牙，法国，意大利），北非（摩洛哥）Description (according to IHSP 2003) :\n形态描述（根据2003版IHSP）Densely glandular-pubescent rosulate perennial herbs, usually forming tufts and propagating through axillary propagules consisting of a simple leaf-less thin stolon to 6 cm long with a terminal rooting rosette.\n被有浓密腺状短柔毛的莲座状的多年生草本植物。通常成簇，通过细小、少叶的腋芽形成一个覆盖达6cm直径的群体的有根莲座。Leaves alternate, oblanceolate, obtuse, sessile, semiterete; flowering branches simple, erect, sparsely leafy, 5 – 12 (- 15) cm.\n叶互生，倒披针形，钝，无柄，半圆柱形；花序简单，直立，几乎无花序叶，5–12（－15）厘米高。Inflorescences cymes with (1-) 2 (-3) cincinni, bracts 1 per flower, small, oblong, pedicels 3 – 6 mm.\n花序：聚伞花序，有一到三个蝎尾状分支序，每花有一个苞片叶，小，长圆形，花梗3–6毫米长。Flowers 5-merous, sepals broadly sessile, slightly connate basally, oblong, acute, to 2.5 mm, petals basally slightly connate, spreading, white, anthers dark red.\n花5瓣，萼片宽，无柄，基部稍合生，长圆形，急尖，2.5毫米长，花瓣基部稍合生，平展，花瓣白色，花药深红色。Two subspecies are accepted :\n名下有两个被承认的亚种：Sedum hirsutum ssp. baeticum\n春上Sedum hirsutum ssp. hirsutum\n（无明确中文名，因植株体型小于春上，拟中文名\"姬春上\"）\n\nHIRSUTUM ssp. BAETICUM Rouy, 1887\n春上 由Rouy发表于1887年Synonyms :\n异名：\nSedum hirsutum var. baeticum (Rouy) Praeger (1918) / Oreosedum hirsutum ssp. baeticum (Rouy) Velayos (1989)\nUmbilicus winkleri Willkomm (1883) / Cotyledon winkleri (Willkomm) Pérez Lara (1891) / Sedum winkleri (Willkomm) Wolley-Dod (1914) / Sedum hirsutum ssp. winkleri (Willkomm) Font Quer (1928) / Oreosedum winkleri (Willkomm) Grulich (1984)\nSedum hirsutum var. winkleri Maire (1932)\nDiffers from ssp. hirsutum :\n和姬春上的区别：Plants larger and more robust with stout stolons and\n植株较大，有更加粗大的匍匐茎。Rosettes to 4 cm in diameter.\n莲座可达4厘米直径。Leaves to 12 (-15) mm, sticky,\n叶片12到15毫米长，有粘性。Flowers large, petals basally connate for 3 mm, broadly ovate, rounded with a short mucro, to 5 – 8 mm.\n花朵较大， 花瓣基部愈合可达3毫米，宽卵形，花瓣圆形有短尖，5–8毫米长。Cytology : 2n=60\n细胞学：二倍体染色体数=60"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f3b86c8cc873.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_92cd8ec550e3.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Dagmar Petrlikowa"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_edb73d2c7429.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b9a99708c015.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "植物来自南非的Weltevrede Succulent苗圃\nPhotos Jacquie Koutsoudis, SA"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3d553f96f137.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_39b958027046.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7df2795ddbc9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "flowers 1.5 cm diameter; rosette diameter 2 cm; inflorescence length 5 cm\n花1.5cm直径，莲座直径2厘米，花序高5厘米\nPhotos Noelene Tomlinson\nHIRSUTUM ssp. HIRSUTUM\n姬春上Synonymes :\n异名：\nSedum hirsutum var. jahandiezii Maire (1932)\nSedum hirsutum ssp. eu-hirsutum Maire (1932)Description :\n形态描述：Plants usually small with thin stolons.\n植物通常娇小，匍匐茎纤细。Rosettes 1 – 2 (-4) cm diameter.\n莲座1-2厘米（较大可到4厘米）直径。Leaves 3 – 8 mm, not very sticky.\n叶3 - 8毫米长，不是很粘。Inflorescences often lax and few-flowered.\n花序通常排列松懈，着花较少。Flowers : Petals basally slightly connate (<1 mm), lanceolate, acute or acuminate, 3 – 6 mm.\n花：花瓣基部稍愈合（<1毫米），花瓣披针形，急尖或渐尖，花瓣长度3 - 6毫米。Cytology : 2n=18, 20\n细胞学：2倍体染色体数=18或者20Observation à / at : La Suche (municipality of / commune de St. Jeure d'Andaure) France - Ardèche, 800 m alt. (31.7.2004),\n（这句不会翻译，法语英语混排……）between the roots of a chestnut tree / entre les racines d'un marronier.\n生长在栗子树的根之间Soil consisting of granitic decomposition / Sol de décomposition granitique.\n土壤由花岗岩风化而成"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ae59128d48a9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "原生地的姬春上"
      },
      {
