  "succ_0916": {
    "title": "Sedum versadense 春之奇迹薄毛万年草",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "来源:icn —— sedum属条目 Sedum versadense原始种条目翻译：种花小医杂家赵一切权利属于英文原作者，转载请注明原文链接和译者。欢迎勘误。\nVERSADENSE C. H. Thompson, 1911\n春之奇迹/薄毛万年草 由 C. H.汤普森发表于 1911年Synonym : Sedum chontalense Alexander (1947)\n异名：Sedum chontalense Alexander（ 1947年）Distribution : Mexico (Oaxaca)\n分布：墨西哥（哈瓦卡州）Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n形态描述（根据2003版本IHSP）：Perennial herbs or subshrubs with erect or decumbent hairy stems.\n多年生草本或半灌木，有直立或匍匐的多毛茎干。Leaves alternate, obovate or spatulate, truncate or rounded, apiculate to emarginate, basally cuneate, subterete, ± hairy, green with red at the tip and margins, often flushed reddish or reddish-brown, 7 - 32 x 4 - 15 mm, flowering branches pendulous.\n叶互生，倒卵形或匙形，截形或圆形，具细尖或叶尖部微凹陷，基部楔形，近圆柱状，有毛或者无毛，叶绿色，有红色的尖端和边缘，经常呈现微红或红褐色， 7 - 32毫米长， 4 - 16毫米宽，开花枝下垂。Inflorescences cymes, drooping in bud, bracts prominent, similar to the leaves of flowering branches, pedicels 2 - 3 mm.\n花序：顶生聚伞花序，花苞下垂，苞片叶突出，类似于开花枝条的叶片，花梗2 - 3毫米。Flowers 5- (rarely 4- or 6-) merous, sepals broadly sessile, basally connate, very unequal, oblanceolate-elliptic or oblong, acute or abruptly apiculate, green, 5 - 8.1 x 2.2 - 3.6 mm, erect, petals basally slightly connate, oblanceolate-elliptic or elliptic, apiculate, pinkish-white, ± 5.5 mm, suberect, anthers red.\n花：以5为 （稀见4 或6 ）基数，萼片阔无柄，基部合生，苞片大小差别很大，倒披针形，椭圆形或长圆形，急尖或突然收细的尖，绿色， 5 - 8.1长 ×2.2 - 3.6毫米宽，直立。花瓣基部稍合生，倒披针形，椭圆形或椭圆形，具细尖，粉白色花瓣， ±5.5毫米，近直立，花药红色。Cytology : 2n = 64, 128\n细胞学检查：2倍体染色体数=64,128Two varieties :\n名下有两个变种：Sedum versadense var. versadense\n原变种：春之奇迹/薄毛万年草Sedum versadense var. villadioides Kimnach, 1982\n和1982年发表的长叶薄毛万年草\nVERSADENSE var. VERSADENSE\n薄毛万年草/春之奇迹Distribution : Mexico (Oaxaca: Sierra Madre del Sur, Southern Trans-Mexican Volcanic Belt); ± 1800 m.\n分布：墨西哥（瓦哈卡州：马德雷德尔苏尔，南部横贯墨西哥火山带），±1800米海拔区域。Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n形态描述：（根据2003版IHSP）Leaves broadly cuneate-oblanceolate, 14 - 27 x 8.5 - 14.6 mm, 4 mm thick ,both faces shortly hairy with thin hairs, upper face reddish-cream, lower face dark brownish-red.\n叶宽楔形倒披针形，14-27毫米长 X 8.5 - 14.6毫米宽，约4毫米厚，叶片双面都密布短绒毛，叶正面浅红色，叶背面暗棕红色。Plant in habitat in Oaxaca :\n哈瓦卡州原生地植株："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d561fbfa5425.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_932e47ed57c8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b986f3bbadd8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7f30eb097af0.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos © Ralph Mangelsdorff"
      },
      {
