      {
        "t": "VERSADENSE var. VILLADIOIDES Kimnach, 1982\n长叶薄毛万年草 由Kimnach发表于1982年。Distribution : Mexico (Oaxaca)\n分布：墨西哥（哈瓦卡州）Differs from var. versadense :\n与薄毛万年草的区别：Leaves linear-oblanceolate, ± 10 x 3 mm, 2 mm thick, upper face glabrous, lower face shortly hairy with shorther and thicker hairs, both faces faintly reddish-yellow.\n叶长披针形，±10×3毫米，厚2毫米，叶的上表面无毛，下表面被毛，毛比薄毛万年草要粗短，叶的两面都呈现淡淡的红黄色。"
      },
