  "succ_0917": {
    "title": "Tacitus bellus美丽莲别露珠",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "一切权力属于原英文作者，译者不懂植物学，欢迎指正\n转载请注明原作者&译者。原文：ICN\n译者：柳下杜拉罕\nBELLUS Moran & Meyrán, 1974 (engl./ fr.)Distribution : Mexico (Chihuahua), east-exposed rocks, 1600 m.\n分布：墨西哥（奇瓦瓦州），东部裸露的岩石，海拔1600米。Description (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n描述（根据2003年IHSP）：Rosette plants, main root thickened, to 4 mm in diameter.\n莲座状植物，主根增粗，直径4毫米。Stems short.\n茎短。Rosette flat and densely leafy, 3 – 8 cm in diameter, with ± 25 – 30 leaves, solitary or forming groups.\n莲座平坦浓密，直径3-8厘米，有±25-30片叶片，单生或群生。Leaves obovate to cuneate, broadly obtuse to rounded, 2 – 3.5 x 1.5 – 2-8 cm, 4 – 5 mm thick, mostly dark or grayish-green, mucro 2 mm and somewhat papillose.\n叶片倒卵形的到楔形，宽钝到圆形，2-3.5 x 1.5-2.8厘米，4-5毫米厚，主要w为黑或灰绿色，2毫米，稍具小乳突尖。Inflorescences erect thyrses with 1 – 4 ascending scorpioid branches with up to 3 flowers each, scape 1.5 – 3.5 cm, green, pedicels 10 – 25 mm.\n花序直立聚伞圆锥花序具1–4上升分枝，每个分枝多达3朵花，花葶1.5-3.5厘米，绿色，花梗10-25毫米。Flowers (rarely 4- or) 5 merous, (almost) unscented, sepals elliptic to oblong, acute, almost equal, recurved towards the end of the anthesis, 6 – 11 x 2 – 4 mm, pale green, corolla (23-) 30 – 38 mm in diameter, petals elliptic-acute, ± deep rose-coloured, tube cup-shaped, 3 – 4 x 4 – 6 mm, lobes elliptic-ovate, acute, margins entire or finely denticulate in the middle, 11 – 18 x 6 – 10 mm, without pattern, basally with 2 rounded outgrowths that close the mouth of the tube and embrace the epipetal filaments,filaments 7 – 11 mm, basally fused with the corolla tube for 3 – 4 mm, rose-coloured.\n花（很少4或）5瓣，（几乎）无迹，萼片椭圆形到长圆形，急性，几乎相等，花期结束时下弯，6-11 x 2-4毫米，淡绿色，花冠直径（23-）30-38毫米，花瓣椭圆形急性，±深玫瑰色，管杯状，3–4 x 4–6毫米，裂片椭圆状卵形，急性，边缘全缘或具小齿在中间，11–18 x 6–10毫米，没有花纹，基部具2圆形突起，封闭管口， 包住花丝，花丝7–11毫米合生，基部与花冠筒3–4毫米，玫瑰色。Cytology : n = ± 204\n染色体：n =±204Discovery of Tacitus bellus by Alfred Lau\n艾尔弗雷德先生发现美丽莲\"This plant I discovered years ago and I brought it home thinking it might have been a Graptopetalum; potted it and put it to one side and temporarily forgot about it, until one day my son Alfred asked me to come to the greenhouse to see the lovely flower; when I got there I found that it was not a Graptopetalum but a new plant altogether.\n\"这是我多年前就发现的，我把它带回家并认为是风车草；盆栽放在一边，暂时忘记了它，直到有一天，我的儿子艾尔弗雷德要我到温室去看可爱的花；我到那儿时，我发现这不是一个风车草属，是一种全新的植物。A little later, I took it to Mexico City to Dr. Bravo at the University there. She was so excited about it that she immediately phoned Dr. Meyrán asking him to come as soon as possible with his best camera. Later it was published under its present name Tacitus bellus, and has been called the succulent of the seventies, and my first plant discovery.\n一段时间以后，我就去墨西哥市的大学找到布拉沃博士。她对此十分激动以至于她马上打电话给Meyrán博士并要他尽快带着他较好的相机来。后来它改名为Tacitus bellus发布，被称作是七十年代的多肉，我第一个发现的植物。It came out on several calendars and is used in Germany as a Mothers' Day plant. It is very easy to propagate and each leaf, when detached, produces 1-2 or even 3 new plants. When I found it in 1972 I brought back 3 plants and now there are millions in the world.\"\n它被印在几个日历上并在德国作为一种母亲节用花。它非常容易通过每一片叶子繁殖，当叶片与母体分离后会产生1-2个甚至3个新植株。\n我1972年发现并带回的3棵现在在全世界已经有数以百万计的种苗。\"This was a part of A. Lau's talk at the Convention CSS in Melbourne in June 1982,published in 'The Spine' Vol. 30 No. 3 June 1982.\n这是A. Lau与 1982年六月在墨尔本公约CSS讲话的一部分，于1982年六月发表在'The Spine'30卷3号。Note :A seedling from Tacitus bellus is wrongly called Tacitus bellus 'Superstar'. This name is not correct, because the plant is a hybrid, possibly with Graptopetalum rusbyi and therefore it has to be called xTacipetalum 'Superstar'.\n注：美丽莲被错误地称为Tacitus bellus 'Superstar'。这个名称是不正确的，因为植物是一种杂交，可能与银天女有亲缘关系，因此也被称为xTacipetalum 'Superstar'.。\nPhoto Paul Neut"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_eb6a2de7f64c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Noelene Tomlinson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ffc61f9aa83b.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1d857ba2741a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "来自ICN Tacitus条目"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0918": {
    "title": "c 卡罗拉杂交后代",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "资料来源ICN，由种花小医杂家赵收集整理翻译，转载请注明泛景主题站及译者。卡罗拉在自然界也存在类似七福神的光谱现象，各个分布地的种群存在渐变差异，从分类学角度上将两种极端的形态赋予变型地位。\n两个变型即：\n圆叶的卡罗拉（即林赛）Echeveria colorata f. colorata 泛景站内地址：http://funjing.com/forum.php?mod ... ;highlight=colorata\n尖叶的勃兰特 Echeveria colorata f. brandtiii 泛景站内地址：http://funjing.com/forum.php?mod ... ;highlight=colorata其中卡罗拉（林赛）作为亲本在园艺种培育中大放异彩，本文介绍几种常见的卡罗拉杂交后代。\n\nelegans 'Albicans' x colorata 'Lindsayana'\n未正式定名，亲本为：厚叶月影*卡罗拉\nE. albicans x lindsayana - the original name of this hybrid - has been created by Bob Grim, California.\nAs the hybrid is known world-wide it seems likely that other breeders have made the same crossing. The hybrid resembles much more E. elegans than E. colorata.\n亲本组合即它的原始名字，由加州的Bob Grim育成。这个杂交种世界知名，似乎其他的育种者也尝试了与之相同的杂交组合。这个杂交种更加像它的亲本厚叶月影多一些。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_61cb60025c9c.png"
      },
      {
