      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9625b3457c0a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Stefan NeuwirthMargaret Martin\n由 Margaret J. Martin 1999年育成亲本 : E. agavoides 东云x E. colorata 'Lindsayana' 卡罗拉"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0e351b4fdf07.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_de050ea5e78e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle AubéOpalina 奥普琳娜\n亲本 : Echeveria colorata fa. colorata 卡罗拉 x Graptopetalum amethystinum 桃之卵由 Robert Grim培育."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e2bd37c4102a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Noelene Tomlinson"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f854e601b0ac.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1c9f2dab75aa.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit BischofbergerBlush 羞红\n培育人： Robert Grim.Parentage : Echeveria colorata卡罗拉 x Graptopetalum amethystinum桃之卵\n奥普琳娜的姐妹品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e528ce372e8f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "xGraptoveria 'Blush' at Huntington Botanical Garden, photo Michael Wisnev"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2e6dc711a68c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "xG. 'Blush' at HBG, photo Stephen McCabeBeatrice 碧翠丝\nParentage : Echeveria chihuahuaensis 吉娃娃x E. colorata 'Lindsayana' 卡罗拉培育人不详.\nIn Korea this hybrid is called \"Chihuahualindsa\" - according to the Code not a valid name.\n在韩国这个杂交种被叫做 \"Chihuahualindsa\" ，不符合命名原则。In Europe this hybrid is distributed with the wrong name 'Tippy', but it can easily be told apart from the correct 'Tippy'- the rosette of the latter is much paler, the leaf shape is different and the flowers are by far not the same.\n在欧洲这个品种被误标为蒂比，其实很容易分辨出真正的蒂比，蒂比的植株显得更加苍白一些。叶形和花也有很大差别。Without flowers this hybrid is indistinguishable from E. chihuahuaensis and also the flowers are only little different from those of the species. It should better not have been created - it is only confusing.\n除了花以外，这个杂交种和吉娃娃几乎难以区分，且花也仅与吉娃娃有微小不同。这个品种只给人带来困惑，也许根本不该培育出来。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a8e78b33f183.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bf9c3ca22a08.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5feb4634a86a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "花 : 左吉娃娃 中间碧翠丝 右卡罗拉\nPhotos Margrit Bischofberger"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0b28320cd0bf.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Paul Neut\n比较：左为吉娃娃，右为碧翠丝，可以看出没有独特的区别"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fc4746e5068b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "一年后两个品种就可以轻松区分了"
      },
