      },
      {
        "t": "10. Series Paniculatae （拟译为：圆锥花序系，拉丁文意为圆锥花序）特征：不是块根，茎部短；叶子小且光洁；聚伞-圆锥花序，上有蝎尾状分支；花冠很小。包括：\namoena 花乃井 （详见：http://funjing.com/9061/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_97d66c982159.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "prolifica 子持白莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/5161/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dd6e4aca4302.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "11. Series Pruinosae （拟译为：白霜系，拉丁文意为被霜的）特征：短茎；叶子小或中等大小，被霜；花序上有1-3根蝎尾状花序，花瓣厚实。包括：\ngudelianalaui 雪莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/3921/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8d50dd1fd176.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "peacockii 皮氏 （详见：http://funjing.com/7151/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_17af706d137a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "runyonii 鲁氏 （详见：http://funjing.com/6581/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_71844f37f0e8.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "12. Series Racemosae（拟译为：总状花序系，拉丁文直译）特征：块根或须根，几乎无茎，很少会长太高；叶子通常光洁，偶尔有绒毛；总状花序.包括：\nandicola"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e4b6008c5073.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "atropurpurea"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_dc36e5f6e265.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "bakeriballsii（2006年的时候Uhl根据染色体和地理分布认为它应当属于Series Nudae蜡牡丹系）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_54d8e322d22c.png"
