      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c785f8badd85.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "subcorymbosa 蓝宝石 （详见：http://funjing.com/7311/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2efb9abe5a32.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "uhlii 青岫莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/8841/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2bcbba5275d6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "utcubambensis"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5b150af99e2c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "westiiwhiteiwurdackii"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_659686954566.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "13. Series Secundae（拟译为：七福神系）特征：非块茎；几乎无茎或短茎；叶子无毛。小，通常被霜；花序上有1-2根蝎尾状花序；花瓣上有圆润的脊线包括：\ncalderoniae"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c83fa56b4cdf.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "catorce（鱿鱼系或是七福神系）"
      },
      {
        "t": "minima 姬莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/7391/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_88f9518daab6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "secunda 七福神"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c0af2ac0e06f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3805f40a5757.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "subalpina 浮岳莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/10171/）tolucensis\n14. Series Spicatae（拟译为：穗状花序系，拉丁文直译）\n特征：长茎；叶子窄且光洁；花序为紧凑的穗状花序或总状花序；萼片通常比花冠长，花瓣圆钝且有脊线。包括：\npittieri"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9c82c23d202c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "rosea"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_963d03a89c5f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_eafcd2d1bf96.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "tencho 天珠莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/8831/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_37b482a48892.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "15. Series Thyrsiflorae（拟译为：聚伞圆锥花序系，拉丁文直译）\n特征：块根，几乎无茎；叶子光洁；聚伞圆锥花序或子总状花序，且为有限花序。包括：\npaniculata 龙田凤"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0795d8cd6890.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "platyphylla\n16. Series Urbiniae（拟译为：瓮花系，也是大家最熟悉的系，拉丁文意为瓮形的，指花）特征：非块根，几乎无茎；叶子小且无毛，通常被霜；花序是偏向一侧的总状花序，花冠瓮状。包括：\nagavoides 东云 （详见：http://funjing.com/7901/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_75e7d99d1297.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "angustifoliachihuahuaensis 吉娃娃 （详见：http://funjing.com/6151/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f7831e65a377.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "colorata 卡罗拉 （详见：http://funjing.com/6231/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ad07a5a4711b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "cuspidata 墨西哥女孩"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2f37e5d76d8d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "elegans 月影 （详见：http://funjing.com/10051.htm）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_6bce4caab0a7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "halbingeri 海冰格丽 （详见http://funjing.com/8771/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1e814cc88659.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "humilis"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8ebd4693a95b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "lilacina 丽娜莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/6301/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_47020bee05b7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "pulidonis 花月夜 （详见：http://funjing.com/8651/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_74bc3c52401e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "purpusorum 大和锦 （详见：http://funjing.com/4851/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7e2354a4499d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "simulans 镜莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/8901/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c88abda13679.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "tobarensis 拓跋莲（详见：http://funjing.com/10781/）tolimanensis 杜里万莲 （详见：http://funjing.com/8201/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d743360daf21.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "trianthinaturgida\n17. Series Valvatae（拟译为：镊合花系，拉丁文直译）特征：非块根，几乎无茎；叶子薄且边缘锐利；花序上有1-2根蝎尾状花序，苞叶覆瓦状排列；萼片几乎和花冠等长；花瓣镊合状，互不交叠。包括：\ncalycosa 金明灭 （详见：http://funjing.com/8701/）"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4943fc6fa0b1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "valvata\n没有找到系别划分的种：Echeveria juliana，为2012年新发现的物种\nEcheveria partriotica，为2007年新发现的物种就是这样了。请讨论。\n另外，大家喜欢转帖各种拟石莲名录什么的，但大都不可靠。截止2013年底，上文提到的这些是最全也是最权威的拟石莲属原始种名录了。\n参考资料：\nICN新站Echeveria目录，species子目录下每一篇文章\nICN旧站Echeveria目录，List species子目录下几乎每一篇文章所有图片也来自ICN"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0929": {
    "title": "皮氏蓝石莲杂交后代",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "现在的皮氏由早先的三个物种合并得来：\nEcheveria peacockii 皮氏\nEcheveria subsessilis 既国内卖的皱叶皮氏蓝石莲，与peacockii相比叶缘更皱、叶子更薄，现在特指的时候可以写作E. peacockii 'Subsessilis'\nEcheveria desmetiana 与peacockii很像，叶子更宽更厚些，现在特指的时候可以写作E. peacockii 'Desmetiana'\n由于这三种之间的差异小到可以忽略，因此合并为一种，既现在的Echeveria peacockii，详见http://funjing.com/7151/皮氏杂交后代：Echeveria 'Bruma'，\"布玛\"\n亲本：可能是 E. peacockii 皮氏 x E. shaviana 沙维娜\n和皮氏很像"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3241e050624a.jpg"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Maria OsmaEcheveria 'Costa Brava'\n亲本：E. peacockii 'Desmetiana' 皮氏 x E. sp. (E. runyonii ?) 某种拟石莲属植物，疑为鲁氏"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9da610a17473.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Echeveria 'Susetta'，\"苏珊塔\"\n亲本：E. subrigida 刚叶莲 x E. peacockii 皮氏"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e9cd863e03b9.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Gerhard KöhresEcheveria 'Etincelle'\n亲本：E. peacockii 皮氏 x E. sp."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5966e9b2a7e7.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_de46e92c8f46.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle AubéEcheveria 'Pearl'，\"宝珠\"\n亲本：E. peacockii 皮氏 x E. laui 雪莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3c16251431bc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Paul NeutEcheveria 'Blue Bird'，\"蓝鸟\"\n亲本：E. cante 广寒宫 x E. peacockii 'Subsessilis' 皱叶皮氏\n详见：http://funjing.com/3641.htm"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_3c48046fba50.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_99a76b7f424a.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e579bc8bde43.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Echeveria 'Blue Heron'，\"蓝色苍鹭\"\n亲本：E. shaviana 'Pink Frills' 祗园之舞 x E. peacockii 'Subsessilis' 皱叶皮氏"
      }
    ]
  },
  "succ_0930": {
    "title": "粉彩莲（E. gibbiflora）杂交后代",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "粉彩莲，E属许多紫色、褶边及疣子基因的来源，Dick Wright钟爱的亲本。\n以下按口味轻重分三档：正常向、褶边无疣、有疣，请适度观看，如有不良反应请就近就医。\n正常向：\nEcheveria 'Perle von Nuernberg'，紫珍珠/纽伦堡珍珠\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 'Metallica' x E. elegans 'Potosina' 星影"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_0e42432c3414.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Margrit Bischofberger"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_889a780f344a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé\n\nx Graptoveria 'Fred Ives'\n亲本：Graptopetalum paraguayense 胧月 x Echeveria gibbiflora hort. 某种粉彩莲杂交品种"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_19288742041d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Margrit Bischofberger"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d6abed6ac2fc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Noelene Tomlinson\n[图片因版权问题暂时删除]\n\nEcheveria 'Fred Wass'\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 'Metallica' x E. fulgens"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bfbd88bea35f.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4abfe0279ece.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Ed Dunin-Wasowicz\n\nEcheveria 'Gabrielle'，\"加百列\"\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 粉彩莲 x E. fulgens var. obtusifolia"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_12b2358af7cc.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Jean-Michel Moullec\n\nEcheveria 'Florence'，\"弗洛伦斯\"\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 粉彩莲 x E. fulgens var. obtusifolia"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bb45cdd9831a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Jean-Michel Moullec\n以上两个品种都是Jean-Michel Moullec培育的（奇怪的审美）， 其中弗洛伦斯是她女儿的名字。\n\nEcheveria 'Mexico City'，\"墨西哥城\"\n可能是粉彩莲的杂交或变形"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_fac2a9eb49d7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller\n\nEcheveria 'Stolonifera'\n亲本：E. secunda 七福神 x E. gibbiflora 'Grandifolia'"
      },
      {
