      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé\n\nEcheveria 'Sayulensis'\n亲本：E. secunda 七福神 x E. gibbiflora 粉彩莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_11730794289b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f22cf0555574.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Margrit Bischofberger\n看来七福神的基因比粉彩莲强势\n\nEcheveria 'Mr Small'\n粉彩莲杂交"
      },
