      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller\n\nE. gibbiflora 'Metallica' x E. diffractens\n亲本如上，尚未命名"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e9ab47a58fc7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé\n\n以下为褶边无疣品种：\nEcheveria 'Bittersweet'，\"苦乐参半\"\n粉彩莲杂交"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a1d5fb9512fe.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_03f5a6b6224e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé\n\nEcheveria 'Katella I'，\"凯特拉一世\"\n所有以Katella为名的品种都是以从Mrs. Gladdys Axcel和Butterfield教授那里得到的大型肉质粉彩莲的杂交后代。Kettla是培育者Dick Wright家门口马路的名字。\n暂无可靠图片\nEcheveria 'Katella II'，\"凯特拉二世\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5edf3744bc56.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Noelene Tomlinson\nEcheveria 'Katella IV'，\"凯特拉四世\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_230f9abc5915.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_836fea3e95c7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé\n不要问我三世去哪了\n\nEcheveria 'Ballerina'，\"芭蕾\"\n粉彩莲杂交"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_bcc844fda942.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller\n\nEcheveria 'Capri'\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 粉彩莲 x E. sp. 某种拟石莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4ab6fdf8e708.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ee56662c3c7f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Noelene Tomlinson\n\nEcheveria 'Gypsy'，\"吉普赛\"\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 粉彩莲 x E. 'Berkeley' 伯克利"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_cf775267f479.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "-------前方高能-----------疣子出没注意----------------先来张所有疣子的祖宗：E. gibbiflora 'Carunculata'，乙女梦"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c090f7e719fd.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo from Echeveria Cultivars"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_b7b0586a28b1.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo James Barry Slabert\n\nEcheveria 'Big Red'\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 粉彩莲 x E. sp. 某种拟石莲"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5bc94471faa5.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Jocelyn Ainsworth\n当然，这个品种通常没有疣子的，但偶尔会长出来，因此作为预热"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7249b58b069b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Christophe Camassel\n\nEcheveria 'Mauna Loa'，\"火山女神\"\n乙女梦和其他品种多次杂交选育的产物\n较佳状态："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_574f9592f69d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo from Echeveria Cultivars\n光照等其他条件不佳时的状况："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7cd318b5674d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Dick Wright"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_48e742a227f8.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bernie DeChant\n年幼的植株一般也不会有明显的疣子："
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_80ed21123498.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Plant James Barry Slabbert\n\nEcheveria 'Cameo'，\"浮雕\"\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 'Carunculata' 乙女梦 x E. 'Edna Spencer'\n其中E. 'Edna Spencer'也是一个带疣的品种，没有详细的亲本信息"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5f26db82603e.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Dick Wright"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4c4107763c49.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Plant James Barry Slabbert\n\nEcheveria 'Paul Bunyan'\n亲本：E. gibbiflora 'Carunculata' 乙女梦 x E. 'Edna Spencer'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_693b8f77f131.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Mateo Lichtenstein"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_172a8bcf818d.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Emmanuelle Aubé"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_93548d1e1da7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_aa4bb369bc8a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "有确切亲本资料可查的粉彩莲杂交后代就这些。但实际上，E属杂交品种中许多褶边基因都来自粉彩莲，而带疣的品种若追根溯祖100%会发现乙女梦的影子。\n要说起粉彩莲的杂交，不得不提到Dick Wright，他是狂热的褶边和疣子爱好者，主要通过非近亲繁殖（out-crossing）的方式培育粉彩莲的杂交子嗣，即从别的亲本产生的杂交品种上取花粉，而非近亲繁殖，再选较好的后代交叉授粉。关于他的小故事详见http://funjing.com/3061/。由于近些年Wright大神依旧作品不断，我大概会在近期增补这篇帖子或新开一贴。附赠Dick Wright更加重口味的品种（亲本均不详）：Echeveria 'Culibra'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_8736e5c72bac.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bev Spiller"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c1c8a2e798a6.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo from Echeveria Cultivars\nEcheveria 'Podaga'，\"宝塔\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_7703673b697c.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Jocelyn Ainsworth\n操我密恐犯了\nEcheveria 'Raindrops'，\"雨滴\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c922ee625e43.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo Bernie DeChant"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1c339b4a1181.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Bev Spiller\nEcheveria 'Baron Bold'，\"狂野男爵\""
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ab86629618c7.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo from Echeveria Cultivars\nEcheveria 'Barbillion'"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_5ab5a9b0b98b.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photo from Echeveria Cultivars"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_94d59d299630.png"
      }
    ]
