  "succ_0931": {
    "title": "酥皮鸭，花乃井，罗西马，狂野男爵，记忆",
    "segments": [
      {
        "t": "中文译名“酥皮鸭”（我认为就是音译，这货跟鸭子没有白毛钱关系），拉丁名：Echeveria Supia。关于他的名字在亚洲有很多不同叫法，较终统一为supia。声明：所有的图片资料来源于ICN，并非本人种植，仅作研究多肉科属用途，ICN给出了此种多肉的开花及日常图片，非常有参考意义。博主认为了解多肉以拉丁名较为准确。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1159fa24ea96.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_f00f2b4e6fc8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_4545db1483f1.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_01f002b4e16a.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Supia\n\nDescription by Margrit Bischofberger and Park Kwan-Jae\n\nShort description :\n\nA much branched subshrub, at first growing fast, later only slowly.\n\nRosettes terminal, up to 5 cm in diameter, rather loose; leaves up to 2,5 cm long and 1 cm wide, margins purple when grown in full sun; flowers red outside and bright yellow inside, pedicels missing or very short.\n\nE. ‘Supia’ resembles E. pringlei var. parva, but it is not this species. The leaves of E. pringlei var. parva are much smaller and the flower colour is orange – and most important – the pedicels are 4-6 mm long.\n\n中文译名“花乃井”，拉丁名：Echeveria AMOENA De Smet, 1875。起源于墨西哥的一种多肉植物。声明：所有的图片资料来源于ICN，并非本人种植，仅作研究多肉科属用途，ICN给出了此种多肉的开花及日常图片，非常有参考意义。博主认为了解多肉以拉丁名较为准确。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_aee68a72e807.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a4f0c303cd98.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "AMOENA De Smet, 1875\n\nSeries Paniculatae\n\nDistribution Mexico (Puebla, Veracruz)\n\nDescription (according to IHSP 2003) :\n\nStem to 5 cm or more, 3 – 5 mm in diameter, branching.\n\nRosette 2,5 – 5,5 cm in diameter.\n\nLeaves obovate-spatulate, cuspidate, 1 – 2 x 0,7 – 1,5 cm, ± 4 mm thick near tip, glaucous-green, often red-tipped.\n\nInflorescences laxly cymose-paniculate with cincinni, ± 10 – 20 cm long, bracts minute, 4 – 10 (-20) mm, easily detached, pedicel slender, 1 – 3 cm.\n\nFlowers : Sepals slightly spreading, < 3 mm, corolla cylindrical, 7 – 9 x ± 4 mm in diameter near the base, salmon-orange.\n\nCytology : n = 33,66."
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_a8197e3c3d35.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_d88ad9caa77f.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "分割线———————————————\n\n中文译名“罗西马”（直接音译），拉丁名：Echeveria LONGISSIMA var. LONGISSIMA Walther, 1938。起源于墨西哥的一种多肉植物。声明：所有的图片资料来源于ICN，并非本人种植，仅作研究多肉科属用途，ICN给出了此种多肉的开花及日常图片，非常有参考意义。博主认为了解多肉以拉丁名较为准确。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_06d03296d3f0.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_10c77ad88353.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "LONGISSIMA var. LONGISSIMA Walther, 1938\n\nSynonym : Echeveria harmsii var. multiflora Walther (1935)\n\nSeries Longistylae\n\nDistribution: Mexico (Oaxaca: Paraje San Bartolo, N of Conceptión de Buenavista; Puebla).\n\nDescription (according to IHSP, 2003) :\n\nStem < 5 cm long, ± 1,5 cm in diameter, almost always unbranched.\n\nRosette flat, 6 – 7 cm in diameter.\n\nLeaves broadly obovate-cuneate, cuspidate, 6 x 3 cm, dark green, glabrous, often red-margined.\n\nInflorescences to 30 cm tall with 1 – 3 cincinni, bracts conspicuous, nearly overlapping, pedicels 10 – 17 mm, without bracteoles.\n\nFlowers : 4 - 12, sepals ascending to widely spreading, ovate-deltoid to oblong-lanceolate, to 8 mm, corolla narrowly urceolate-cylindrical, to > 30 mm long, 10 mm in diameter near base, petals narrowly oblong, weakly keeled, green near tips, otherwise orange, stamens to 25 mm.\n\nCytology : n = 42"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_e724376fc2ad.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "分割线———————————————\n\n中文译名“狂野男爵”，拉丁名：Echeveria Baron Bold 。由Dick Wright 于1970繁殖。声明：所有的图片资料来源于ICN，并非本人种植，仅作研究多肉科属用途，ICN给出了此种多肉的开花及日常图片，非常有参考意义。博主认为了解多肉以拉丁名较为准确。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_2e46933d6e49.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_ffb7dc65f0fd.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_9436329245e8.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1019cb966305.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "分割线—————————————\n\n中文译名“记忆”，拉丁名：Echeveria Memory。由Bernie DeChant命名。为“E. agavoides x E. Pulidonis”的杂交。平均寿命4年左右。声明：所有的图片资料来源于ICN，并非本人种植，仅作研究多肉科属用途，ICN给出了此种多肉的开花及日常图片，非常有参考意义。博主认为了解多肉以拉丁名较为准确。"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_32d35dd260eb.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_60812a39a8ff.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_1bc37ddbe2f4.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c9b48b493b21.png"
      }
    ]
  },
