      {
        "t": "Photos Javier Conde\n\nEcheveria 'Morning Dew'，\"晨露\"\n亲本：: E. setosa var. ciliata 王妃锦司晃 x E. sp"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_c5d3f5b6b083.png"
      },
      {
        "i": "https://pub-8b26014aee2c44c18d82a5187d985187.r2.dev/images/succ_15e686495845.png"
      },
      {
        "t": "Photos Noelene Tomlinson\nEcheveria 'Set-Oliver'，\"红辉炎\"\n亲本： E. setosa 锦司晃 x E. harmsii 花司"
